{"parentUuid":"1029869f-3de7-4f01-b62e-37209296941b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF1F97ScQDs3FqC1XDgG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":104643,"output_tokens":1682,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":793},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1682,"cache_read_input_tokens":104643,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"unavailable"}},"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":17128,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9305f514-e7bb-401d-82f6-8c00140d4a74","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF1F7ELmKtQjrv7TBbqq","requestRef":"e4d07a3c-9342-43cb-a9c1-52c361e387ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"a0bbac32-0f1d-4707-8fab-f4ede0be03da","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:41:44.824Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"a0bbac32-0f1d-4707-8fab-f4ede0be03da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF1F97ScQDs3FqC1XDgG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"找到原因了：**扫码位用的是一组过期的关节角，换成立放末端以后没有更新。**\n\n**为什么只有第二盒出现：**\n- 第二盒（码 …9215）是这批里吸取位置最远的一盒，落点 x=−1.060，吸完后臂几乎伸直，肘关节 J3=−33°。\n- 扫码动作有一条规则：肘角浅于 −40° 时，不走直线，改用关节空间 movej，飞到 `config/scan_point.yaml` 里记的 `taught_joints_rad`，然后再直线移到扫码高度。\n- 其他三盒肘角在 −49° ~ −65° 之间，走的是直线，所以没问题。卡片上也能看出区别：第二盒的\"飞行方式\"写的是\"关节空间（接近伸直）\"，另外几盒写的是\"直线\"。\n\n**为什么会往下走：**\n我在本地用 URDF 和现在的 TCP 做了正运动学推算（没有碰设备）：\n- 这组关节角现在对应的吸盘高度是 **z=0.088**，而扫码位应该在 **z=0.156**，**低了约 68mm**。水平位置也偏了约 4cm。\n- movej 过程中吸盘一路往下降。到终点时，盒底高度约 0.066，桌面是 0.064，**正好贴到桌面**。\n- 接着\"降扫码高度\"这一步按正确坐标直线上升 68mm 到扫码位，所以你看到的是先下降碰桌，再上去扫码。和你描述的完全一致。\n\n**为什么之前没发现：**\n这组关节角是 8 月 31 日用旧工具示教的。9 月 15 日换成立放末端时，`drop_point.yaml` 的关节角按新 TCP 重算过（文件注释里有记录），但扫码点的关节角漏掉了。9 月 10 日那次仿真验证\"不低于扫码高度\"，是在换工具之前做的。另外，只有远端的盒才会触发这条分支，所以平时很少碰到。\n\n**建议的改法：**\n仿照 drop_point 的做法，以 `taught_tcp` 为目标、旧关节角为种子，用控制器 IK 重算一组关节角，写回 `scan_point.yaml` 并部署。这个文件只改一个值，不改代码。改完后，用控制器仿真模式从远端起点跑一次 movej，确认全程不低于扫码高度，然后切回真实模式。\n\n这一步要用控制器（IK 计算和仿真干跑）。你现在没在跑真机的话，我就开始做？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":104643,"output_tokens":1682,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":793},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1682,"cache_read_input_tokens":104643,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"unavailable"}},"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9305f514-e7bb-401d-82f6-8c00140d4a74","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF1F7ELmKtQjrv7TBbqq","requestRef":"e4d07a3c-9342-43cb-a9c1-52c361e387ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"30b37ed1-d608-4e12-bf58-860f5fa4a3c1","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:41:45.518Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
