{"parentUuid":"4c27fa34-15ef-41c0-a2fe-02004a26f9f4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF1JhSDbPUSyiQNFGBNA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，其他几盒都正常，因为它们走的是另一条路线。\n\n吸完盒去扫码器，程序里有两条走法：\n\n| 走法 | 什么时候用 | 目标怎么给 | 现在准不准 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **A：直线飞** | 平时，盒在桌面中间或近处 | 用扫码位的**坐标**（x, y, 高度） | ✅ 准 |\n| **B：关节飞** | 只有盒在**桌面最远端**、臂快伸直时（直线飞过去容易出奇异） | 用一组记下来的**关节角** | ❌ 过期了 |\n\n- 第 1、3、4 盒走的是 A，坐标是对的，所以正常。\n- 第二盒放在桌面最远处（x=−1.06，其他几盒在 −0.90 ~ −0.96），所以触发了 B。\n- B 用的那组关节角是 8 月份装旧工具时记的。换成现在的长杆末端后没有重算，按这组角度走，吸盘会落到比扫码位**低 68mm** 的地方，也就是贴到桌面。走到之后，下一步再按正确坐标升回扫码位，所以你看到的是先下降碰桌，再上去扫码。\n\n所以这个问题**只会出现在放在桌面最远端的盒子上**，平时很难碰到。\n\n改法就是把 B 那组关节角按现在的工具重算一遍。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1724,"cache_read_input_tokens":105513,"output_tokens":551,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":61},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1724,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":551,"cache_read_input_tokens":105513,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1724},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b6023d13-14b3-44fe-a2fd-4783ea891f16","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF1Jh8cpTTeVUreenvtz","requestRef":"6145bbcb-7e3e-4d1f-8d91-cf6c9790480f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"6a1a9c12-8735-4315-9acf-d7b4822e10f9","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:42:23.146Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D