{"parentUuid":"5c9574f5-5192-4171-88b5-58f77f9f1332","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF1M745tok1BzPF61X6D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不需要 AutoDL。\n\n- **重算关节角**：让机械臂控制器自己做 IK 计算，给它目标坐标 `taught_tcp`，用旧关节角当种子。这和 9 月 15 日重算 drop_point 的方法一样，只要连上 blue-space 就行。\n- **验证**：把控制器切到仿真模式，从远端起点用 movej 走一次，录下 TCP 高度，看全程有没有低于扫码位，然后切回真实模式。这一步也只用到控制器。\n\n整个过程只碰控制器和 blue-space，机械臂不会真的动。唯一的要求是这段时间你别跑真机。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":585,"cache_read_input_tokens":107237,"output_tokens":226,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":585,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":226,"cache_read_input_tokens":107237,"cache_creation_input_tokens":585,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":585},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"811918d2-51dd-4397-a0e9-36e15b2ba77d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF1M6fWwPPqrf2LahGPU","requestRef":"3425a148-c508-4f51-a055-77e2d5653bf4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2e76caf7-e3d5-4e36-b1c7-2ed8ce33847d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:42:48.100Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
