{"parentUuid":"203cae49-9f85-457b-9331-b8f8e634427e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF1Zo8Sakvi1k1HGmxjB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已经修好了。新的关节角已部署到设备，设备端已提交（b5a1abf），臂现在在真实模式。\n\n**改了什么：**\n1. **扫码位关节角重算**：用控制器 IK 按现在的工具重新算了一遍，写回 `config/scan_point.yaml`。旧值记在注释里，可以随时改回去。\n2. **补上同步漏洞**：`deploy_cell.sh` 以前根本不同步 `scan_point.yaml`，所以换工具后这个文件一直没跟着更新。现在已经加进同步列表了。\n\n**验证结果（控制器仿真模式，臂没真动）：**\n\n| 起点 | 肘角 J3 | movej 途中最低点 | 盒底离桌面 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 任务 80 第二盒那个位置 x=−1.06 | −33° | 就在扫码位 z=0.156 | 70mm |\n| 更远一点 x=−1.10 | −21° | 同上 | 70mm |\n\n现在从远端起飞，臂会直接平滑地降到扫码位，不会再先往下碰桌。改的只是配置文件，扫码时每次都会重新读，所以不用重启服务。\n\nMac 端提交：1a5aa88。\n\n下次你可以故意把一盒放在桌面最远端（靠臂的远侧），看它吸起来后是不是直接飞去扫码。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_read_input_tokens":123076,"output_tokens":479,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":479,"cache_read_input_tokens":123076,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"537345a6-4add-47bc-a570-24b7682e58f0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF1ZnpafTiY5eopzq4XG","requestRef":"3d316d71-d22e-42cc-a405-e670e1bbf985","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"ff2c8931-186c-4ce1-bac8-92233daebc53","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:45:42.999Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"externa