{"parentUuid":"c07b8d9a-e9c7-4657-a801-e03e83e1de2d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF1yQXJxZquX6WGVrY32","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4065,"cache_read_input_tokens":149186,"output_tokens":2932,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2101},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4065,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2932,"cache_read_input_tokens":149186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4065,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4065},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":35510,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"d3937a3e-6b63-4849-af31-e4376fc3bde1","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF1yLtY6E6Hd6B3qcNUa","requestRef":"b67d400a-be81-4f56-93a9-20d6c955f09f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"a9c1d2fa-a243-42b4-b105-c16348c8eed8","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:51:33.684Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"a9c1d2fa-a243-42b4-b105-c16348c8eed8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF1yQXJxZquX6WGVrY32","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"三个格口都查清楚了。下面是把被算成\"账外有物\"的点画到原图上的结果：**红点**是被判成 stray 的点，**蓝点**是正常的背板读数。\n\n**A-R2：误报，原因是层板反光**\n红点全都落在**上一层层板的不锈钢前沿**上。那里反光严重，深度相机把距离读近了，换算出来的位置刚好落在本层的取点窗口里（高出层板 13~18mm，推进 150~220mm），于是被当成了\"前面有东西\"。\n\n**A-R10：误报，原因是货架结构**\n红点只有一小撮，在**本层层板右端靠立柱的前沿**（横向 233~243mm，推进 30mm，几乎在架口）。这是货架结构，宽度只有 15mm，不可能是盒子。点数 348，刚过门槛 150，所以被报了出来。\n\n**A-L2：可能真有东西**\n你没提到这个格口，但它也报了 stray。红点落在**格口靠里的位置有几个真实的盒子**（图里能看到白色盒面，离背板约 115mm，高出层板 14~35mm）。麻烦你去现场看一下 A-L2 里面是不是放着盒子。如果有，说明报得没错，只是账上没登记。\n\n**为什么空格口会误报：**\nstray 的判据很简单，窗口内只要有 150 个点比背板近 30mm 以上就报。它不检查这些点**像不像一个盒子**。9 月份做空格口回归时只验证了\"每列数几盒\"，没覆盖 stray 这一项。\n\n**建议的改法**（改 `stocktake_core.py` 的 `stray_check`，设备和 Mac 共用这一份）：\n加两个\"像盒子\"的条件，两个都满足才报：\n1. **有高度**：同一横向位置上的点，要覆盖至少 15mm 的高度（盒子是一个立面）。反光点都挤在 13~18mm 这一薄条里，会被排除。\n2. **有宽度**：连续的横向宽度至少 30mm（最窄的盒子也有 60mm）。R10 那 15mm 的结构会被排除。\n\n按这个判据，R2 和 R10 都不会再报，L2 的真盒子还会照常报出来。改完后，我会用这次全部 22 个格口的原始帧跑一遍，再跑原来的回归测试，确认结果后再部署。\n\n要我改吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4065,"cache_read_input_tokens":149186,"output_tokens":2932,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2101},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4065,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2932,"cache_read_input_tokens":149186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4065,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4065},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d3937a3e-6b63-4849-af31-e4376fc3bde1","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF1yLtY6E6Hd6B3qcNUa","requestRef":"b67d400a-be81-4f56-93a9-20d6c955f09f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"c081efe9-02c4-44c6-98d5-899478ca893d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:51:33.890Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
