{"parentUuid":"19608c3f-344a-4772-9244-f8690606cad6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2KGpWry5AwWZ8exVyS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"知道，就是 **`GET /capability`（能力表）**。我刚查了一下，现在返回的内容有这些：\n\n- **`slots`（22 个格口）**：每个格口的几何参数，包括：\n  - 可用宽度范围 `left_lim_mm` ~ `right_lim_mm`，以及宽度 `width_mm`\n  - 深度 `depth_mm`\n  - 净高 `clear_h_mm` 和能放的最大盒高 `max_box_h_mm`\n  - 列间隙 `gap_side_mm`、前后间隙 `gap_deep_mm`\n  - 每盒平均耗时 `avg_box_s`\n- **`destinations`**：出库或退苗能去的地方（传送带口等），以及各自现在是否可用\n- **`pit_index`**：坑位编号规则的说明（x_mm 加列内序号）\n- **`dest_wait_s`**：等上位机给去处的超时，10 秒\n- **`skus`**：设备认得的药盒品种和尺寸\n\n你问这个，是想把它和盘点的事联系起来吗？比如让上位机在盘点前，先用能力表核对一下格口参数？还是有别的打算？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":904,"cache_read_input_tokens":157567,"output_tokens":405,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":904,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":405,"cache_read_input_tokens":157567,"cache_creation_input_tokens":904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":904},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c6e0287b-b3a9-42d2-bdc3-56c93358e6e3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF2KGRTguycSqC13rn6D","requestRef":"4c06d4ef-5328-45b0-b828-995c50846863","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"ba602648-3c19-4f6c-9a72-b7c39cbe55fa","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:55:31.610Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell"