{"parentUuid":"088c0083-bd04-4172-a746-c56b822d47fd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2NseMimLeWkUqhA6wY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":158471,"output_tokens":815,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":143},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":815,"cache_read_input_tokens":158471,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1720,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"ee5d590d-9070-4a6d-b8d8-6ad5dabdf7ca","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF2Ns7rZc19LSDQzsuVb","requestRef":"8a9ce7d8-1631-4861-a22f-3880e9d78ccb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"5f52c8c0-6053-417b-8050-bf304edc7120","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:56:18.264Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"5f52c8c0-6053-417b-8050-bf304edc7120","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2NseMimLeWkUqhA6wY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以做，但要先分清楚哪些参数能交给上位机改。能力表里的参数分两类，风险差别很大。\n\n**A 类：标定出来的物理参数，不建议开放**\n- 格口宽度范围 `left_lim` / `right_lim`、深度 `depth`、净高 `clear_h`、最大盒高 `max_box_h`\n- 这些不是\"设置\"，而是**实测结果**：通过示教把臂推到极限、量出层板高度、跑碰撞筛查得到的。臂放盒时就按这些数走。\n- 如果上位机把右边界改大 30mm，臂就会真的往外多伸 30mm，可能撞到立柱或者压到臂自身，这正是我们 9 月 18 日出过的那种事故。**改这些必须重新标定，不能靠一个接口改数字。**\n\n**B 类：业务参数，可以开放**\n- **药盒品种尺寸表 `skus`**：现在录入新品种要我这边跑 `sku_add.sh`。改成上位机通过接口录入是合理的，接口里加上范围校验即可（比如盒子放不进最矮的格口就拒绝）。\n- **去处的名称 `destinations.label`**，以及暂时停用某个去处。\n- **等去处的超时 `dest_wait_s`**。\n- **停用某个格口**：比如格口坏了，或者暂时不想用，只关不开，不改几何参数。这个很实用，也安全。\n- 列间隙 `gap_side`：放大是安全的，缩小有风险，可以只允许改大。\n\n**我的建议：**只开放 B 类。A 类在接口上明确拒绝，提示\"需要现场标定\"。\n\n为了不白做，想先问一下：**上位机具体想改哪几个参数？是为了解决什么问题？**你可以问问同事。如果他说的是 A 类里的某一项，往往背后有别的需求，比如\"想让某格口少放点\"，可以换一种安全的方式实现。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":158471,"output_tokens":815,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":143},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":815,"cache_read_input_tokens":158471,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ee5d590d-9070-4a6d-b8d8-6ad5dabdf7ca","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF2Ns7rZc19LSDQzsuVb","requestRef":"8a9ce7d8-1631-4861-a22f-3880e9d78ccb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"c06cc31c-28bf-4c95-842d-52f2527b1503","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:56:26.639Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
