{"parentUuid":"4c792fbb-32b9-4289-8496-968e4a83abbc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2fATbZaeFVULs6xLBB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":920,"cache_read_input_tokens":159868,"output_tokens":703,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":86},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":920,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":159868,"cache_creation_input_tokens":920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":920},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7901,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"dc54d571-8d55-44b3-b2e5-5f96bced8ddc","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF2fA1K8BpUBPYkHddvs","requestRef":"0d781d57-a8b2-43bd-a99c-b4644972523e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"0955aa4e-10b3-4aa4-a2bc-3d5f56babf4d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:00:05.479Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"0955aa4e-10b3-4aa4-a2bc-3d5f56babf4d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2fATbZaeFVULs6xLBB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"顺序是**上位机自己决定的**，设备这边没有\"全局盘点\"这个功能。\n\n**依据：**这次盘点在设备上是 **22 个独立任务（任务 82~103）**，每个任务只盘一个格口。我的接口一次只接受一个格口（`type: \"stocktake\", slot: \"A-L10\"`），所以先盘哪个、后盘哪个，完全取决于上位机按什么顺序一个个发过来。\n\n**这次的实际顺序：**\n```\nA-L10 → L11 → L12 → L2 → L3 → … → L9 → A-R10 → R11 → R12 → R2 → … → R9\n```\n这是**按格口名字符串排序**的典型结果：比较字符时 \"1\" 排在 \"2\" 前面，所以 L10、L11、L12 跑到了 L2 前面。大概率是同事的代码对格口列表做了一次字符串排序，或者数据库默认就是这么排的。\n\n**所以回答同事：**\n- **能不能设置？**能，而且只能在上位机那边设置。他想按什么顺序盘，就按什么顺序发任务。\n- **建议的顺序**：按\"列 + 层号的数字\"排，比如 `L2, L3 … L12, R2 … R12`。或者更省时间：按臂的走位，**同一列从上往下或从下往上连着盘**，换列只换一次，减少臂大幅移动。不过每个格口盘完臂都会回 home，所以顺序对总时间影响不大，主要影响的是人看结果时顺不顺。\n- 排序时要把层号**当数字**取出来，比如从 `A-L10` 里解析出 `L` 和 `10`，不要直接按字符串排。\n\n需要我把这段补进 `docs/盘点对接说明.md` 的\"批量盘点\"那一节吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":920,"cache_read_input_tokens":159868,"output_tokens":703,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":86},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":920,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":159868,"cache_creation_input_tokens":920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":920},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"dc54d571-8d55-44b3-b2e5-5f96bced8ddc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF2fA1K8BpUBPYkHddvs","requestRef":"0d781d57-a8b2-43bd-a99c-b4644972523e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8c68aca8-31de-426e-9b71-1a9cc68067c3","timestamp":"2026