{"parentUuid":"6575eed1-fe4c-4e82-bfc5-7e74019738e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2hZ2xnfgyqncwfu7sG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":160788,"output_tokens":732,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":69},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":732,"cache_read_input_tokens":160788,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":780,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"b879e5b4-3088-496b-a354-8febbad4db67","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF2hYRz85fyfVp87SsiK","requestRef":"d1f588b4-70b6-4930-886b-f6010196b644","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2e7a8104-4ff1-4868-babd-9bb13d07cfc5","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:00:30.638Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"2e7a8104-4ff1-4868-babd-9bb13d07cfc5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2hZ2xnfgyqncwfu7sG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"他只需要在**发任务之前，把格口列表按数字排好序**，然后照原来的方式逐个发送就行，设备这边什么都不用改。\n\n**1. 排序函数（JavaScript）**\n\n格口名格式是 `货架-列层号`，比如 `A-L10`。把三部分拆开，层号当数字比较：\n\n```js\n// \"A-L10\" → { shelf: \"A\", col: \"L\", layer: 10 }\nfunction parseSlot(name) {\n  const m = /^([A-Z]+)-([LR])(\\d+)$/.exec(name);\n  return { shelf: m[1], col: m[2], layer: Number(m[3]) };\n}\n\n// 先按货架，再按列(L 在前)，最后按层号(数字从小到大)\nfunction slotOrder(a, b) {\n  const x = parseSlot(a), y = parseSlot(b);\n  return x.shelf.localeCompare(y.shelf)\n      || x.col.localeCompare(y.col)\n      || x.layer - y.layer;\n}\n\nslots.sort(slotOrder);\n// 结果: A-L2, A-L3, … A-L12, A-R2, … A-R12\n```\n\n想从上往下盘，就把最后一行改成 `y.layer - x.layer`。\n\n**2. 格口列表从哪里来**\n\n建议用 `GET /capability` 返回的 `slots[].name`，这是设备当前实际可用的全部格口，以后加了格口也会自动包含。\n\n**3. 逐个发送（和现在一样）**\n\n```\n对排好序的每个格口:\n  POST /tasks {type: \"stocktake\", slot, columns: 账上该格口的全部列}\n  等这个任务的 task_end\n  再发下一个\n```\n\n上一个任务没结束就发下一个，会收到 409。\n\n如果他想做成可选的，可以在界面上放一个下拉框，提供\"从下往上 / 从上往下 / 只盘某一列\"几种排法，本质上都只是换一个排序函数。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":160788,"output_tokens":732,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":69},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":732,"cache_read_input_tokens":160788,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b879e5b4-3088-496b-a354-8febbad4db67","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF2hYRz85fyfVp87SsiK","requestRef":"d1f588b4-70b6-4930-886b-f6010196b644","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"53f3d3e2-8c8a-44ab-aa36-9c110d2a9f46","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:00:37.374Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
