{"parentUuid":"a0f02a4f-6932-4302-ac63-287b33693e6b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2j5U51HfCegXo6HrEY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33,"cache_read_input_tokens":162262,"output_tokens":469,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":469,"cache_read_input_tokens":162262,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":142,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"4dec6c85-43c9-4e6c-8f4e-9dee5f186496","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF2j4xJuYq2f1iLFhm4f","requestRef":"bdfdf58f-e720-4036-8c1a-615f428c17b0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"1a6dda4e-7308-42e2-8948-5a89eef05a31","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:00:50.720Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"1a6dda4e-7308-42e2-8948-5a89eef05a31","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2j5U51HfCegXo6HrEY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"换个说法，不看代码。\n\n**盘点顺序是怎么来的？**\n\n上位机手里有一张格口清单，它按清单从上到下一个个通知设备：\"盘这个\"，盘完再通知下一个。\n**清单怎么排，设备就怎么盘。**设备自己不决定顺序。\n\n**为什么这次顺序是乱的？**\n\n同事的清单是**按文字**排的，不是**按数字**排的。\n\n按文字排，就像查字典，逐个字比较：\n- `L10` 和 `L2` 比，第二个字符一个是 \"1\"，一个是 \"2\"，\"1\" 更小。\n- 所以 `L10` 排到了 `L2` 前面。\n\n结果就成了：`L10, L11, L12, L2, L3 …`，看起来像跳着盘。\n\n**同事要做的只有一件事：**\n\n把清单排序时的\"10、11、12\"**当成数字**比较，而不是当成文字。这样排出来就是：\n\n`L2, L3, L4 … L9, L10, L11, L12, R2, R3 … R12`\n\n**设备这边不需要改任何东西。**\n\n你可以直接这样转告他：\"盘点顺序就是你发任务的顺序。你现在是按文字排的格口名，所以 L10 跑到了 L2 前面，改成按层号数字排就好了。\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33,"cache_read_input_tokens":162262,"output_tokens":469,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":469,"cache_read_input_tokens":162262,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4dec6c85-43c9-4e6c-8f4e-9dee5f186496","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF2j4xJuYq2f1iLFhm4f","requestRef":"bdfdf58f-e720-4036-8c1a-615f428c17b0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2a892d61-8b30-4022-b07f-7e8e72ba9c09","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:00:56.098Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","