{"parentUuid":"62b4eb76-6f12-4d41-91dc-204474db3b12","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2sTRtJ3k9QMQhyBAKQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2860,"cache_read_input_tokens":166431,"output_tokens":934,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":200},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2860,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":934,"cache_read_input_tokens":166431,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2860,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2860},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10756,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"d7de5f82-d131-4bca-83fb-cbfa118635a2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF2sT4Zk6DrcuDUAN9Ke","requestRef":"23bfedf0-58a2-4d44-a50f-9a39450943b6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b9a165b-909e-4742-83c1-c6a62a51a7ef","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:02:54.976Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"3b9a165b-909e-4742-83c1-c6a62a51a7ef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF2sTRtJ3k9QMQhyBAKQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"规则也一样：**分配是上位机和设备一起完成的，但真正掌控的是上位机。**\n\n**过程（每扫到一盒药就走一遍）：**\n1. 设备扫到码，通知上位机：\"这盒是什么，尺寸多少\"。\n2. 上位机调用 `POST /plan/store`，交给设备两样东西：\n   - 这盒药的分组键（药名、批号等）\n   - **一张候选格口清单**，以及每个格口里现在有哪些列\n3. 设备按固定规则算出放哪里，把结果返回给上位机。\n4. 上位机把这个位置下发给设备，设备去放。\n\n**设备算位置的规则（按优先级）：**\n1. **先找能接上的列**：在所有候选格口里，找\"同一分组键、同样宽度、还没放满\"的列，放到这一列的队尾。也就是**同批号的药尽量排在同一列**。\n2. **找不到就开新列**：按候选清单的顺序，逐个格口找，在每个格口里**从左往右**找第一段放得下的空位，新开一列。\n3. **都放不下**：返回\"放不下\"，这盒会被丢回。\n\n**能不能控制？能，而且全在上位机那边，靠的就是那张候选清单：**\n- **清单里放哪些格口**：决定这盒**只能**去哪些格口。比如刚才他只传了 `A-R6`，这盒就只会去 A-R6。\n- **清单的排列顺序**：决定开新列时**优先**用哪个格口。排在前面的先填满，再轮到后面的。\n- **分组键怎么定**：决定哪些药算\"同一列\"。之前提醒过：他的分组键里带了日期 `2026-10-20`，同一批号的药如果不是同一天入库，就会分到两列。\n\n**设备这边固定、不能改的：**同一个格口内**从左往右**开新列，以及\"能接上就接上\"的优先顺序。\n\n所以同事想实现的分配策略，比如\"某种药只放某几层\"、\"先填低层\"、\"冷藏药放某个区域\"，都可以通过调整每次传过来的候选清单来实现，设备这边不需要改。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2860,"cache_read_input_tokens":166431,"output_tokens":934,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":200},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2860,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":934,"cache_read_input_tokens":166431,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2860,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2860},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d7de5f82-d131-4bca-83fb-cbfa118635a2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF2sT4Zk6DrcuDUAN9Ke","requestRef":"23bfedf0-58a2-4d44-a50f-9a39450943b6","requestedModel":"c