{"parentUuid":"32ca6ea2-9a94-446a-a1c2-2f98bd7c63a1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF3CeThKw9SFHCSE7AxL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2397,"cache_read_input_tokens":170282,"output_tokens":768,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":83},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2397,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":768,"cache_read_input_tokens":170282,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2397,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2397},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8627,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"7171631f-2367-4fb9-8ffd-885f7a3e85d5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF3Ce9qJ9FPcXoJQQFwq","requestRef":"c337976c-dfc1-4c43-b4bf-03f3d0d5b945","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"3096d766-ca6b-46a5-830c-ac57e31bc9a7","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:07:13.209Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"3096d766-ca6b-46a5-830c-ac57e31bc9a7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF3CeThKw9SFHCSE7AxL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"设备这边**没有\"纯自动选格口\"的模式**。不管怎么跑，每一盒放哪里都必须由上位机说了算。\n\n先把两个容易混的\"自动\"分开：\n\n| | 意思 | 和选格口有没有关系 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **自动上苗**（`feed: auto`） | 盒子由上苗机或传送带自动送到桌上，不用人手放 | **没有关系**，只管盒子怎么来 |\n| **问去处**（`destination: ask`） | 每盒扫完码，设备问上位机\"这盒放哪\" | 这才是选格口 |\n\n所以\"自动上苗\"只是送盒子自动化了，**放哪个格口照样要问上位机**。\n\n**上位机没指定格口会怎样？**\n- 扫完码，设备在扫码位等上位机答复，**最多等 10 秒**。\n- 上位机不答复，或者 `/plan/store` 的候选清单是空的、哪里都放不下，这盒就**丢回传送带**。\n- 设备不会自己挑一个格口放进去。\n\n**为什么这样设计：**库存账在上位机，设备不存账。设备不知道哪个格口放了什么、哪些格口是留给冷藏药或别的用途的。如果设备自己挑格口，就可能和上位机的账对不上。\n\n**所以同事说的\"纯自动\"，在他那边应该这样实现：**\n每扫到一盒，上位机自动调用 `/plan/store`，把**所有可用格口**按他想要的优先顺序放进候选清单，比如从低层往高层，或者从 L 列再到 R 列。拿到结果后自动回给设备，全程不用人点。刚才他只传了 `A-R6`，所以只会去 R6；把清单换成全部格口，就是全自动分配了。\n\n**格口全集**可以从 `GET /capability` 的 `slots` 里取，**顺序**就是他要的优先级。排序时同样要注意上一个问题：层号要按数字排，不能按文字排。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2397,"cache_read_input_tokens":170282,"output_tokens":768,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":83},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2397,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":768,"cache_read_input_tokens":170282,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2397,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2397},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7171631f-2367-4fb9-8ffd-885f7a3e85d5","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF3Ce9qJ9FPcXoJQQFwq","requestRef":"c337976c-dfc1-4c43-b4bf-03f3d0d5b945","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"a5ebcb5d-3ca6-4240-9196-3b22b9f17d2c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:07:13.224Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
