{"parentUuid":"80735487-8305-477d-a820-7566dd96981d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF3JFQHCfrXQurdKrrcm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1040,"cache_read_input_tokens":172679,"output_tokens":566,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":69},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1040,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":172679,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1040,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1040},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":927,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"89888443-e7cd-4d23-8d93-f9a8a883b169","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF3JF2U1TAHbKjkBF6Br","requestRef":"2d52ea25-768b-4a40-9d4e-ecf4ad7015cb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"69f99dcf-30a0-41fb-80d6-79c81baf2404","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:08:21.559Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"69f99dcf-30a0-41fb-80d6-79c81baf2404","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF3JFQHCfrXQurdKrrcm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，**位置是设备算的**，你理解得没错。我前面说\"上位机掌控\"不准确，应该这样拆开说：\n\n**设备负责：在给定的格口里，具体放到哪一列、哪个位置。**\n这一步按固定规则计算：同批号能接上就接上，接不上就从左往右开新列。上位机算不了这个，因为它不知道盒子多宽要留多少间隙、格口能用的宽度是多少，这些物理细节只有设备清楚。\n\n**上位机负责：允许放哪些格口，以及优先用哪个。**\n也就是那张候选清单。设备只会在清单里的格口中找位置，而且按清单顺序找。\n\n打个比方：\n- 上位机说：\"这盒可以放 R6、R7、L2，**优先 R6**。\"\n- 设备回答：\"R6 里有同批号的那一列还没满，接在它后面，放在 x=−250 第 3 个位置。\"\n\n所以同事问\"能不能控制分配\"，答案是：\n- **能控制的是哪个格口**：靠清单里放哪些格口、怎么排顺序。\n- **控制不了的是格口里的具体位置**：这一步由设备计算，规则固定。\n\n另外，上位机拿到设备的计算结果后，**也可以不采用**，直接下发自己想要的位置。设备只检查这个位置在物理上放不放得下，放得下就照放。不过这样一来，列的位置就得上位机自己算，一般没有必要。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1040,"cache_read_input_tokens":172679,"output_tokens":566,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":69},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1040,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":172679,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1040,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1040},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"89888443-e7cd-4d23-8d93-f9a8a883b169","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF3JF2U1TAHbKjkBF6Br","requestRef":"2d52ea25-768b-4a40-9d4e-ecf4ad7015cb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b804469d-45ba-4bf0-8792-da42b09c4322","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:08:28.060Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
