{"parentUuid":"26b80155-96dc-4f4a-8ce9-dcf76c169647","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"我们在和上位机联调货架机器人，刚把格口分配讲清楚：设备算格口里的具体位置，上位机通过候选清单决定用哪些格口、优先用哪个。下一步：请确认是否让我离线分析，修复 R2 和 R10 盘点误报。","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:12:23.639Z","uuid":"0c55b99b-6fd7-4302-b5d6-a95743b1965f","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
