{"parentUuid":"6383ceb9-8777-4e2b-941d-918baffd6e6e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF5DKp3HZJtK7Ms9SQc4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1908,"cache_read_input_tokens":186379,"output_tokens":1337,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":530},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1908,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1337,"cache_read_input_tokens":186379,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1908,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1908},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":15256,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"101c6b99-d085-4260-bae6-a48b77d1e59f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF5DKMFicAMd5CwADGpQ","requestRef":"cd407bd0-46f3-49c4-814c-4fdb4e42e043","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"abac3804-1220-46ad-a59f-526e77d36fba","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:33:42.753Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"abac3804-1220-46ad-a59f-526e77d36fba","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF5DKp3HZJtK7Ms9SQc4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"查清楚了：盒子放在桌面**最远的边缘**，臂伸到几乎笔直去吸，往上抬的时候控制器卡在奇异位置，动作被中断了。\n\n**经过（任务 105 第 43 盒，16:30:43）：**\n- 桌上只剩这一盒，位置 **x=−1.140**。这是这两天出现过的最远位置，第二盒那次是 −1.06。\n- 识别和吸取下探都正常。卡在第三步\"**抬升**\"：一边往上升 14cm，一边把手腕从 155° 转回 91°，**转了 64°**。\n- 现在臂停在离目标还差 7mm 的地方。肘关节 J3 是 **−6.9°**，几乎完全伸直（奇异位置），手腕转到一半（101°）。控制器状态正常，没有急停，也没有碰撞报警，是**控制器在奇异位置附近走不下去，自己把运动中止了**。\n- 程序看到\"手上可能有货\"，按规则不自动动臂，转为等人处理（needs_human）。\n\n**为什么没被拦住：**绿区判据只检查\"这个位置能不能**无碰撞**地吸\"，绿区最外到 x≈−1.13，再加 4.5cm 容差，所以 −1.14 也算\"过门\"。它没考虑**臂伸直时还要大幅度转手腕**的情况。\n\n**现场恢复**（你来操作，我不碰）：\n1. 先目视确认盒子还吸在吸盘上。\n2. 盒子还在，就丢回传送带：\n   ```\n   ./scripts/act.sh drop\n   ```\n   当前位姿满足丢回的入口条件（竖直、在走廊内、高度 0.228）。第一段是往臂内侧收，会离开伸直的位置，不会再卡。\n   盒子已经掉了，就用 `./scripts/act.sh reset`。\n3. 然后在上位机或网页上 resume 任务，或者结束任务。\n\n**之后的修复**（等你恢复好了再讨论）：大致有两个方向：\n- 把绿区最外缘往回收，比如超过 x=−1.10 就判\"出绿区\"，交给人挪盒。\n- 远端吸起后**先竖直抬升、不转手腕**，转手腕留到后面飞扫码的关节运动里再做。\n\n到时候我再细说。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1908,"cache_read_input_tokens":186379,"output_tokens":1337,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":530},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1908,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1337,"cache_read_input_tokens":186379,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1908,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1908},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"101c6b99-d085-4260-bae6-a48b77d1e59f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF5DKMFicAMd5CwADGpQ","requestRe