{"parentUuid":"d515121e-28e5-45a1-add4-baabc03e3652","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF5HSw2pFZovHZRazGob","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"按这三步来：\n\n**1. 把盒子丢回传送带**\n```\n./scripts/act.sh drop\n```\n看到确认提示就输入 `YES`。臂会先往内侧斜飞到 drop_mid，再探到传送带上方把盒子吹开，最后回到 home。\n\n**2. 确认臂在 home、手上是空的**\n```\ncurl -s http://192.168.100.190:8902/device\n```\n看返回里 `\"arm_at\":\"home\"`、`\"payload\":\"none\"` 这两项。\n\n**3. 让任务继续或者结束**\n- 想接着上苗：在上位机或网页上点**恢复（resume）**，或者执行\n  ```\n  curl -s -X POST http://192.168.100.190:8902/tasks/105/resume\n  ```\n- 不想继续了：\n  ```\n  curl -s -X POST http://192.168.100.190:8902/tasks/105/stop\n  ```\n\n刚才那盒被丢回传送带了，再放上桌时**别放在最远那一侧**，放在靠扫码器的那 2/3 区域里。\n\n如果第 1 步报错，把输出贴给我。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1384,"cache_read_input_tokens":188287,"output_tokens":542,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":162},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1384,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":542,"cache_read_input_tokens":188287,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1384,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1384},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5d7c221a-36f5-421d-83ee-df5da54f59dd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF5HRwzevKo3hNHtPUp7","requestRef":"f61d07e4-56ad-4e68-90c2-90839c05fedc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"d0cf551f-febb-4cd3-999a-659094c285b8","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:34:28.986Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239",