{"parentUuid":"2cd7b0e6-710a-404b-9cca-9e92d8742a70","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF5WNxGyz9HprezE6Gn5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2093,"cache_read_input_tokens":193455,"output_tokens":722,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":208},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2093,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":722,"cache_read_input_tokens":193455,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2093,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2093},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7565,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9df0a8d2-1d1f-4a33-954d-620874aabe0b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF5WNcgUGsJVZnoDzVcx","requestRef":"10ec72cf-ef18-49ec-8839-7491c0ad8e9a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"c04433c9-ff65-4050-9987-27d85bdf9862","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:37:26.381Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"c04433c9-ff65-4050-9987-27d85bdf9862","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF5WNxGyz9HprezE6Gn5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"设备这边的任务其实**还没结束**。任务 105 现在的状态还是 `needs_human`（等人处理），设备没有收到过\"结束\"的请求，所以也就没有给上位机发 `task_end`。上位机那边看到的是对的。\n\n**为什么会这样：**\n- 你执行的 `act.sh drop` 是**直接控制臂**的工具，不经过任务系统。所以盒子丢掉了、臂也回到了 home，但任务 105 不知道这件事，还在等人处理。\n- 处于 `needs_human` 时，任务只会等两种指令：**继续（resume）**或**结束（stop）**。\n\n**现在结束它：**\n```\ncurl -s -X POST http://192.168.100.190:8902/tasks/105/stop\n```\n设备会马上结束任务，并推送 `task_end` 给上位机（reason 为 `stopped`）。上位机收到后就会显示任务完成。\n\n**给同事的建议：**上位机收到 `needs_human` 事件后，界面上应该显示两个按钮：\"处理好了，继续\"调用 `/resume`，\"结束任务\"调用 `/stop`。这样以后遇到这种情况，在上位机上点一下就行，不用敲命令。\n\n另外，以后在任务进行中遇到这类情况，可以用接口里的调试恢复功能来丢盒（`/upper` 网页上也有）。这样丢盒的记录会写进任务的事件里，上位机也能看到。要我查一下这个接口的确切路径吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2093,"cache_read_input_tokens":193455,"output_tokens":722,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":208},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2093,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":722,"cache_read_input_tokens":193455,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2093,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2093},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9df0a8d2-1d1f-4a33-954d-620874aabe0b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF5WNcgUGsJVZnoDzVcx","requestRef":"10ec72cf-ef18-49ec-8839-7491c0ad8e9a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"7149e808-b344-4ab5-926a-76763e364d6c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:37:26.396Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort"