{"parentUuid":"66846743-e4c7-4788-b7b5-012c6a42e62c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF6kqxjLztSCyPLPeMGQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":922,"cache_read_input_tokens":249291,"output_tokens":773,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":17},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":922,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":773,"cache_read_input_tokens":249291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":922,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":922},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7756,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"59a1f145-ee45-47a1-94bf-ee0470407c42","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF6kqaRK8PXiwh12frSK","requestRef":"6428ab7a-0f22-4dbb-bbba-4b384431d3f3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"da6eb1c7-f207-4e2a-a55f-4ff4cd50ee3c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:53:49.593Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"da6eb1c7-f207-4e2a-a55f-4ff4cd50ee3c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF6kqxjLztSCyPLPeMGQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"动画已经加好，也验证过了，提交在 583408a。刚才那个后台任务显示\"失败\"，是因为截图拍完后我手动结束了卡住的测试浏览器，不影响结果。\n\n**动画效果**（照立放的真实动作做的：方管吸杆从格口前面水平伸进来，吸住盒子的前脸）：\n\n**上架：**\n1. 吸杆带着盒子出现在格口前方，略微抬高。\n2. 水平推进到这一列的队尾。\n3. 盒子落到层板上。\n4. 吸杆退出格口，同时淡出。\n\n**出库：**\n1. 吸杆伸进来，碰到这一列的队首（最外面那盒）。\n2. 吸住，稍微抬起来。\n3. 把盒子拉出格口，然后淡出。\n\n动画播放时，画面左上角会提示一行字，比如\"上架 · x −246.2 mm · 第 2 盒\"。\n\n**同事那边怎么用（不用改他的代码）：**\n- 他原来在收到 `stored` / `retrieved` 事件后会调用 `view.update(新库存)`。现在 `update` 会**自动比较新旧库存**：某一列多了一盒就播上架动画，少了一盒就播出库动画。如果一次变化了好几盒，就按顺序一盒一盒地播。\n- 如果事件来得很快，连续调用会**自动排队**，不会出现画面抢着播的情况。\n- 页面刚打开、第一次加载库存时，或者不想要动画时，可以调用 `update(新库存, {animate: false})`，直接显示结果。\n- 另外还提供了 `view.store(x_mm)` 和 `view.retrieve(x_mm)`，用来手动演示。\n\n**示例页面：**每个格口卡片下面加了两个按钮，\"上架一盒\"和\"出库一盒\"，点一下就能看到效果。直接用浏览器打开 `docs/货架三维渲染/slot3d.html` 即可（需要能联网加载 three.js）。\n\n**规则限制：**出库只取队首，这和设备的规定一致。格口放满时点\"上架\"不会有反应（比如示例里 A-L6 第一列已经放满了 17 盒）。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":922,"cache_read_input_tokens":249291,"output_tokens":773,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":17},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":922,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":773,"cache_read_input_tokens":249291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":922,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":922},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"59a1f145-ee45-47a1-94bf-ee0470407c42","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF6kqaRK8PXiwh12frSK","requestRef":"6428ab7a-0f22-4dbb-bbba-4b384431d3f3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"23471793-4778-4537-9fed-1431d255de7b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:53:49.609Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
