{"parentUuid":"c3c466a6-65cb-4857-9018-8d387ff7424e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14991524 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"330c4e2e-e1eb-428f-9fcc-41263af2979b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:57:29.167Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14991524 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"330c4e2e-e1eb-428f-9fcc-41263af2979b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF73ipM5hvD3W9acYRQG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"渐隐效果已经加上了，代码已提交（a998d49）。我在浏览器里截图看过：格口模型左边清楚，往右逐渐变淡，到最右边完全消失，融进了网页背景，不再像是贴上去的一块方框。\n\n**改了两处：**\n1. **画布背景改成透明**：原来画布自带一块白底（深色模式下是深色底），现在去掉了，直接透出网页本身的颜色。所以不管同事把它放在什么颜色的页面上，都能融进去。\n2. **从左到右渐隐**：默认从画面宽度 35% 处开始变淡，到 90% 处完全透明。格口框架、层板、药盒、上架出库动画都会一起按位置变淡。\n\n**同事可以按需调整（第 4 个参数，可以不传）：**\n```js\nrenderSlot(容器, 库存, 几何)                                   // 默认: 35% 开始淡, 90% 消失\nrenderSlot(容器, 库存, 几何, { fade: { from: 0.5, to: 1.0 } }) // 淡得更靠右、更柔\nrenderSlot(容器, 库存, 几何, { fade: false })                   // 不渐隐(背景仍透明)\n```\n\n有一点需要知道：渐隐是按**屏幕上的左右位置**做的，不是按格口里的横向坐标。所以用鼠标把模型转个角度以后，变淡的仍然是**画面右侧**。我理解这正是\"放在网页里不突兀\"想要的效果。如果你希望渐隐跟着模型一起转，告诉我，我再改。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":786,"cache_read_input_tokens":259349,"output_tokens":543,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":786,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":543,"cache_read_input_tokens":259349,"cache_creation_input_tokens":786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":786},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"aa849d13-c865-4bb1-9452-b589f4f4c72e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF73hrYf9GGjvNQLhcf8","requestRef":"67e3ce2c-f221-43e4-892b-f5538d40a2ac","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"843d3637-9e3b-4ce6-936f-5bca018cd90c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:57:36.387Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"me