{"parentUuid":"7ee32a3c-d779-4a18-b888-425f27e3988c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_012g2oRX94ZWAGukDqYiFfAF","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"d9753f02-123e-443f-92cb-1fb93b1710b9","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:00:03.209Z","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"d9753f02-123e-443f-92cb-1fb93b1710b9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF7EgocC8he8zHu6wpRS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"从低到高的渐变已经加上了，截图确认过，代码已提交（4a8c169）。\n\n**现在的效果：**\n- **从左到右**：画面宽度 35% 处开始变淡，到 90% 处完全透明（和原来一样）。\n- **从低到高**：从底边往上算，画面高度 55% 处开始变淡，到 95% 处完全透明。\n- 两个方向叠加起来，**越往右上角越淡**；左下角的层板和前沿最清楚。\n\n**调过一次参数：**第一版从 40% 高度就开始变淡，结果画面中部的药盒也被淡化得发白，看不清品种颜色。现在把起点挪到 55%，药盒基本保持原色，主要淡化的是格口的上层板和背板顶部。\n\n**可调参数**（第 4 个参数）：\n```js\nrenderSlot(容器, 库存, 几何, { fade: { from: 0.35, to: 0.9, vFrom: 0.55, vTo: 0.95 } })  // 默认值\nrenderSlot(容器, 库存, 几何, { fade: { vFrom: null } })   // 只要左右渐隐, 不要上下渐隐\n```\n`vFrom` 改小，往上淡得更早；改大，淡得更晚。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":330,"cache_read_input_tokens":268639,"output_tokens":432,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":330,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":432,"cache_read_input_tokens":268639,"cache_creation_input_tokens":330,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":330},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b446032a-c6f8-46e2-afd0-42c250d3f649","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF7EgSmXEHZuej7kGpSc","requestRef":"b8ed4fae-9b7c-4911-9a7d-1a9fd5a89b1e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"1c50ebdb-e7fa-4e9b-9014-db4885d616eb","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:00:03.207Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\rob