{"parentUuid":"bb7cf720-71f7-456b-bed7-722c3690a3c2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8MijFpT8pbSdB2TPFn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2214,"cache_read_input_tokens":272536,"output_tokens":1314,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":356},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2214,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1314,"cache_read_input_tokens":272536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2214,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2214},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12628,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"6dff6446-542f-47d5-9484-acc342c91638","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgF8MiMvs4GKnEPSEbdr3","requestRef":"16bdb8d0-8e4d-434e-b5d8-676e2a3cf10f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"d3c4c079-7d99-42b1-8d9a-bc936aa20995","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:14:54.296Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"d3c4c079-7d99-42b1-8d9a-bc936aa20995","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8MijFpT8pbSdB2TPFn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不用新做，**这类接口已经有了**，同事可能还不知道。一共三个，都在接口文档 `docs/设备接口文档_V1.md` 的\"调试/恢复\"一节里：\n\n| 接口 | 作用 | 什么时候用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `POST /device/home` | 回 home | 臂停在一个已知的安全位置（比如 mid、格口门口），手上没货 |\n| `POST /device/reset` | 复位：在格口里就先退出来；在飞行路径半路就沿原路倒退回 mid；最后回 home | 臂停在格口里或路径中途。手上有货会原样带回来，不会把货放进格口 |\n| `POST /device/drop` | 把手里的盒子丢回传送带，再回 home | 手上有货，臂在桌面上方，比如刚才那次吸起来就卡住的情况 |\n\n**使用规则：**\n- 只有在**设备空闲**，或者任务处于 **`needs_human`（等人处理）/ `paused`（暂停）** 状态时才能调用。任务正在跑的时候调用，会返回 409，防止和正在执行的动作抢臂。\n- 调用后会等动作做完才返回，返回内容是一张\"动作卡片\"：成功没有、手上还有没有货、臂现在在哪。\n- 如果有任务在等人处理，这次恢复操作会**写进该任务的事件记录**，上位机能看到全过程。今天下午那次你是在命令行用 `act.sh drop` 恢复的，任务那边就没有记录，所以上位机后来一直不知道。\n\n**上位机推荐的处理流程：**\n```\n收到 needs_human 事件\n  → 界面弹出提示, 显示事件里的 text(写明了卡在哪、手上有没有货)\n  → 人看现场后点按钮:\n       [丢回盒子]   → POST /device/drop\n       [复位回原点] → POST /device/reset\n       [回原点]     → POST /device/home\n  → 看返回卡片: 成功且 payload=none\n  → 再点 [继续任务] POST /tasks/{id}/resume 或 [结束任务] POST /tasks/{id}/stop\n```\n\n**关于\"回到其他位置\"：**我建议**不开放任意位置**。每个位置都是事先跑过碰撞检测的。如果让上位机随便指定一个坐标，臂从当前姿态直接过去，可能会撞货架。现在能去的安全位置只有 home，以及 reset 过程中经过的 mid，已经够用了。\n\n**可以考虑加的一个接口**：一键恢复 `POST /device/recover`，由设备自己判断该怎么恢复：手上有货就丢回，在格口里就退出，否则直接回 home。这样上位机界面只需要放一个按钮。要我加吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2214,"cache_read_input_tokens":272536,"output_tokens":1314,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":356},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2214,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1314,"cache_read_input_tokens":272536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2214,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2214},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6dff6446-542f-47d5-9484-acc342c91638","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgF8MiMvs4GKnEPSEbdr3","requestRef":"16bdb8d0-8e4d-434e-b5d8-676e2a3cf10f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"e79f1403-c87d-441d-9c42-a937e00829c4","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:14:55.937Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"99e4ce18-cae8-43c8-bfaf-0a8d19bb1239","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
