{"parentUuid":"5013a9a7-dbd3-4059-92d1-ff9750ad54d7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14995075 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"69333018-d91d-411f-a5fb-268246a9a809","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:49:21.871Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14995075 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"69333018-d91d-411f-a5fb-268246a9a809","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01SGJw4BYDsndi9XxoMvyMYc","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fbf0bc1f-89dc-4b04-ad9d-dac7663375c8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:49:31.336Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"fbf0bc1f-89dc-4b04-ad9d-dac7663375c8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGSD6v6s5mf3CCQzFULK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"找到了。今天上午上位机做了两次盘点，**结果都是\"全部相符\"**。日志文件也是完整的，刚才显示 0 字节只是 Windows 目录列表没有及时刷新，实际有 11 条事件。\n\n**任务 106：盘点 A-L10（09:43~09:44，用时约 53 秒）**\n\n| 列 x | 品种 | 账上盒数 | 账上队首 | 实测队首 | 差 | 结论 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| −246.2 | 麻腮风 | 17 | 171.1 | 161.7 | **−9.4** | 相符 |\n| −141.7 | 脊灰（大盒） | 7 | 371.6 | 365.1 | −6.5 | 相符 |\n| −37.2 | 麻腮风 | 11 | 308.0 | 303.9 | −4.1 | 相符 |\n| +30.8 | 麻腮风 | 6 | 422.0 | 418.5 | −3.5 | 相符 |\n\n没有报 stray（账外有物）。\n\n**任务 107：盘点 A-R6（09:44~09:45）**\n只有 1 列 1 盒，实测队首和账上**完全一致**（差 0.0），也没有 stray。\n\n**有一点值得注意：A-L10 的四列差值全是负数**，也就是实测队首都比账上更靠外。而且**盒子越多，差得越多**：17 盒的列差 9.4mm，6 盒的列差 3.5mm。这符合**纸盒回弹**的规律：放进去时被推压紧了，放了一晚上，每盒往回弹约 0.5mm，盒子越多累计越大。\n\n- 现在都还算\"相符\"，因为判定门槛是半盒厚，约 11.4mm。但 −246.2 那一列的 −9.4 **已经接近门槛了**。\n- **所以上位机一定要按文档做**：盘点结果为\"相符\"时，用实测的 `front_mm` 更新账上的值。这次更新后，下次就从 161.7 开始比较，回弹会被吸收掉。如果不更新，再回弹 2mm 左右，这一列就会被误判成\"整列被碰动\"。\n\n你可以问一下同事，他那边收到 `match` 后有没有更新 `front_mm`。我也可以等他下次盘点时，看传过来的 `front_mm` 是不是 161.7，以此来确认。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":965,"cache_read_input_tokens":280126,"output_tokens":827,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":965,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":827,"cache_read_input_tokens":280126,"cache_creation_input_tokens":965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":965},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c2a7fe72-d71e-4060-badf-47d7a9d7826