{"parentUuid":"2f17b610-8400-4486-a883-92f90a181121","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGSHVCQKRDmci3RtTsS6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69,"cache_read_input_tokens":281918,"output_tokens":949,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":267},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":949,"cache_read_input_tokens":281918,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":2684,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"b910164b-8b2f-47d4-9555-38ece7761c13","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGSHUXikHfe75K2n3XxH","requestRef":"0f081803-7241-4aa6-82eb-0e9bc2f23b17","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"390ef11b-8917-48b6-93d6-086b3656a3f4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:50:25.252Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"390ef11b-8917-48b6-93d6-086b3656a3f4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGSHVCQKRDmci3RtTsS6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不会。现在盘点事件里只有一个**设备本地的文件路径**，比如：\n```\n\"jpg\": \"data\\\\stocktake\\\\A-L10_20261022_094410.jpg\"\n```\n这是图片在设备电脑上的存放位置，同事那边拿到这个路径也打不开，因为设备没有提供任何下载这张图的接口。所以他只能看到一个文件名。\n\n**我的建议改法：**\n\n1. **新增一个取图接口**\n   ```\n   GET /stocktake/image/{文件名}\n   ```\n   直接返回这张 JPG 图片。接口只允许读盘点图片所在的那个目录，文件名里带 `..` 或斜杠的一律拒绝，防止被用来读设备上的其他文件。\n\n2. **盘点事件里加一个现成的地址**\n   ```json\n   \"jpg\": \"data\\\\stocktake\\\\A-L10_20261022_094410.jpg\",   ← 保留, 不影响他现有代码\n   \"image_url\": \"/stocktake/image/A-L10_20261022_094410.jpg\"   ← 新增\n   ```\n   同事拿 `设备地址 + image_url` 就能直接显示，或者下载存档，比如放在 `<img src=\"http://192.168.100.190:8902/stocktake/image/...\">` 里。\n\n**为什么不把图片直接放进事件里推送：**一张图约 100~200KB，转成文本还会再大三分之一。webhook 推送和事件补拉都会变慢，而且大多数时候不需要看图。给一个地址，需要的时候再取，更合适。\n\n**图片内容**就是设备现在保存的那张标注图：真实画面上，绿点表示判为盒面的点，蓝点表示背板，能直观看出盒子在哪、取点有没有取歪。\n\n要我按这个改吗？改动在 `cell_server.py`，加一个接口，再在盘点事件里加一个字段。改完要重启 cell 服务，所以会在设备空闲时进行。接口文档也会一起更新。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69,"cache_read_input_tokens":281918,"output_tokens":949,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":267},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":949,"cache_read_input_tokens":281918,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b910164b-8b2f-47d4-9555-38ece7761c13","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGSHUXik