{"parentUuid":"728fc973-446f-49f9-984c-0ae6d4a95551","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGSRmpFM23nztRnuinZk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018ZKThTtojmrRSkqkw4FxoF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/盘点对接说明.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns=s.replace('''    \"jpg\": \"data\\\\\\\\stocktake\\\\\\\\A-L10_20261021_140803.jpg\"\n  }''','''    \"jpg\": \"data\\\\\\\\stocktake\\\\\\\\A-L10_20261021_140803.jpg\",\n    \"image_url\": \"/stocktake/image/A-L10_20261021_140803.jpg\"\n  }''')\ns=s.replace('''### 4.3 不传 `columns` 时：`columns_found`''','''### 4.3 标注图：`image_url`\n\n每次盘点设备都会存一张**标注图**：真实画面上，绿点 = 判为盒面的点（用来算队首），蓝点 = 背板。用来人工核对\"盒子在哪、取点有没有取歪\"。\n\n```http\nGET http://192.168.100.190:8902/stocktake/image/A-L10_20261021_140803.jpg\n```\n\n- 地址 = 设备地址 + 事件里的 `image_url`，返回 JPG（约 300KB），可直接放进 `<img src=\"...\">` 显示，或下载存档。\n- 图片**不随事件推送**，需要看时再取。\n- `jpg` 字段是设备本地路径，上位机用不了，请用 `image_url`。\n- 设备会长期保留，但建议上位机自己存一份到盘点记录里。\n- 错误：文件名不对 → 404；文件名带路径或不是 .jpg → 400。\n\n### 4.4 不传 `columns` 时：`columns_found`''')\ns=s.replace('''- `jpg` 字段是设备上保存的标注图路径，排查时可以让设备这边的人去看。''','''- 每次盘点的标注图用 `image_url` 取（见 4.3），账实不符时建议在界面上直接把图显示出来给人看。''')\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nprint(s.count('image_url'))\nEOF\n/usr/bin/python3 scripts/api_doc_classic.py 2>&1 | tail -2; /usr/bin/python3 scripts/api_doc.py 2>&1 | tail -2; grep -c \"stocktake/image\" docs/设备接口文档_V1.md docs/设备接口文档.md","description":"更新盘点对接说明并重新生成接口文档","timeout":180000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1452,"cache_read_input_tokens":289001,"output_tokens":1050,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":75},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1452,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"