{"parentUuid":"be50d817-4a4f-48e1-b60c-41c533d3d108","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGSYf9raj3iWVX5WLB5t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"取图接口已经加好、部署上线了，服务重启后测试正常。\n\n**给同事的用法：**\n\n1. 盘点事件（`kind: \"stocktake\"`）里新增了一个字段：\n   ```json\n   \"image_url\": \"/stocktake/image/A-L10_20261022_094405.jpg\"\n   ```\n2. 用 **设备地址 + image_url** 取图：\n   ```\n   GET http://192.168.100.190:8902/stocktake/image/A-L10_20261022_094405.jpg\n   ```\n   返回的就是 JPG 图片，可以直接放进网页 `<img src=\"...\">` 里显示，也可以下载存进他的盘点记录。\n3. 原来的 `jpg` 字段还在，他现有的代码不受影响。但那是设备本地路径，让他以后改用 `image_url`。\n\n**图片内容：**我刚取了今天 09:44 A-L10 那张看过。是盘点时的真实画面，**绿点**表示判为盒面的位置（用来算队首），**蓝点**表示背板。账实不符的时候，一眼就能看出盒子实际在哪。\n\n**安全限制：**接口只能读盘点图片所在的那个目录。文件名带路径或者不是 `.jpg` 的返回 400，找不到的返回 404，读不到设备上的其他文件。\n\n**新字段从下一次盘点开始才会出现。**今天上午那两次盘点是改之前做的，事件里没有 `image_url`。不过图片已经能取了，让同事按文件名拼地址就行，比如 `A-L10_20261022_094405.jpg`。\n\n**文档已同步更新，可以直接发给同事：**\n- `docs/盘点对接说明.md`：新增\"4.3 标注图\"一节，返回示例里也加上了 `image_url`。\n- `docs/设备接口文档_V1.docx` / `.md`：新增\"盘点结果接口\"一章，包括地址、入参、出参（二进制图片）和请求示例。\n\n已提交：Mac 端 bf9b08c，设备端 a4711dc。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":911,"cache_read_input_tokens":303409,"output_tokens":702,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":911,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":702,"cache_read_input_tokens":303409,"cache_creation_input_tokens":911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":911},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5ef518fe-88cf-49d6-9ef2-aec5c6774754","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_01