{"parentUuid":"40a2e73b-e056-4cef-9295-4d7f29b9e6d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGTzGJGkEg2cSuwmFecW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1247,"cache_read_input_tokens":313152,"output_tokens":1090,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":130},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1247,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1090,"cache_read_input_tokens":313152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1247,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1247},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10564,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"3cc600e1-bd5a-47a7-9434-1ef34fc3061a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGTzFwSJMGnu7Db9Ezr1","requestRef":"7b66a041-5db6-480c-9339-ad029fde3f2a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"7b559e18-a8e7-4d35-a8c4-8ce9f81e8048","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:12:53.143Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"7b559e18-a8e7-4d35-a8c4-8ce9f81e8048","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGTzGJGkEg2cSuwmFecW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**不一定需要 AutoDL，要看退苗筐放在哪里。**另外我查代码时发现一个更要紧的问题，先说这个。\n\n**先说一个必须改的地方**\n\n现在出库流程最后那一步是**写死的**：不管 `dest` 传的是 `drop` 还是 `return`，臂都会去传送带口（drop_point）。`drop_point.yaml` 里的 `destinations` 只用于能力表展示，以及校验这个去处可不可用，**并没有真正决定臂往哪里飞**。\n\n所以就算标定好了退苗点，也要改一下出库流程，让它按 `dest` 找到对应的点去放。这个改动很小。\n\n**定义退苗口的步骤，以及哪一步需要 AutoDL**\n\n| 步骤 | 做什么 | 要 AutoDL 吗 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 把退苗筐**固定**在现场，位置以后不能再挪 | 不要 |\n| 2 | 用示教器把臂（持着一个盒子）移到筐口上方合适的投放位置 | 不要 |\n| 3 | `./scripts/arm/read_pose.sh` 读出关节角和 TCP，写进 `drop_point.yaml`，作为新的点，比如 `return_point`；同时把 `destinations.return.point` 指过去 | 不要 |\n| 4 | 控制器仿真模式空跑一遍\"桌面上方 → 中间点 → 退苗点 → 吹开 → 回 home\"，检查**能不能到、会不会卡在奇异位置** | 不要 |\n| 5 | **碰撞检查**：确认这条路线不会撞到货架、桌子、传送带、筐本身 | **要** |\n| 6 | 真机低速走一遍，你在旁边看着 | 不要 |\n\n**第 5 步什么情况下可以省掉：**\n- **可以省**：筐放在传送带口旁边的开阔区域，和现在 drop_point 是同一个方向，中间没有障碍。这时用第 6 步低速真机跑、人看着，就能代替碰撞检查。drop_point 原来的路线已经验证过，新点离它很近的话，风险很低。\n- **不能省**：筐靠近货架、桌腿、立柱，或者臂需要绕路过去。这种情况下必须在 AutoDL 上做碰撞检查，而且要先把筐的尺寸和位置加进场景模型（`scene_params.yaml`），否则检查时根本不知道那里有个筐，查了也没用。\n\n**所以想先问一下：退苗筐打算放在哪里？**是在传送带口旁边，还是别的位置？最好能拍张照片，或者说一下它离传送带口、桌子、货架大概多远。我根据位置判断要不要开 AutoDL。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1247,"cache_read_input_tokens":313152,"output_tokens":1090,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":130},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1247,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1090,"cache_read_input_tokens":313152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1247,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1247},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":