{"parentUuid":"a1e55e14-aea2-47df-87ce-4e2f9ee648c9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGUGaEiYj3TPxBzBK89V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1155,"cache_read_input_tokens":314399,"output_tokens":1747,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":787},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1155,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1747,"cache_read_input_tokens":314399,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1155,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1155},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9568,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"ecbd6484-c4f6-4e07-aa2a-38e581df5a8e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGUGZSM3SSRsxs74BPCP","requestRef":"546baabb-bd13-4592-9cc0-c3ce0c75c5ab","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"ffcd62bd-aee9-4f2b-b7d7-402a2b1a7736","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:16:33.436Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"ffcd62bd-aee9-4f2b-b7d7-402a2b1a7736","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGUGaEiYj3TPxBzBK89V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，就是这个思路，项目里本来就有现成的流程。不过有三点要提前注意，否则规划出来的路径也不可靠。\n\n**1. 先把退苗筐加进场景模型**\n路径规划和碰撞检查只认识场景模型里有的东西。模型里没有这个筐，规划器就可能让臂从筐边上擦过去。所以你示教完以后，我会根据示教的位置，在 `scene_params.yaml` 里加一个和筐一样大的障碍物，再部署到 AutoDL。为此需要你告诉我**筐的长、宽、高**（大概即可，我会留出余量）。\n\n**2. 示教的时候吸着一个盒子**\n实际退苗时，吸盘下面挂着一盒药，比空吸盘低 2~4cm。最好吸一个盒子来示教，让**盒底离筐口沿 5~8cm**。这样吹开时盒子能落进筐里，又不会被筐沿刮到。工具保持竖直朝下。\n\n**3. 起点是 home**\n出库流程走到这一步时，臂是拿着盒子回到 home 的，所以要规划的是 **home → 退苗点** 和 **退苗点 → home** 两条路线。回程要单独规划，不能直接把去程倒着放，以前吃过这个亏。\n\n**具体步骤：**\n\n| 步骤 | 谁做 | 做什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 你 | 固定好筐，量一下长宽高告诉我 |\n| 2 | 你 | 示教器把臂（吸着盒）移到筐口上方，按上面的要求摆好，**停住别动** |\n| 3 | 你 | 运行 `./scripts/arm/read_pose.sh`，把输出贴给我 |\n| 4 | 我 | 记入 `poses.yaml`，命名为 `return_point`；把筐加进场景模型，部署到 AutoDL |\n| 5 | 我 | 先试直接走：`check_motion.sh return_point`。撞了就用 MoveIt 规划：`plan_best.sh return_point 8 home`。回程同样处理。全部在仿真里实跑、录制、做碰撞检查 |\n| 6 | 你 | 真机低速走一遍：`run_real.sh`，你在旁边看着 |\n| 7 | 我 | 改出库流程，让 `dest: \"return\"` 真正去退苗点，然后把 `destinations.return` 改指过去 |\n\n**注意：**第 2、3 步你在用示教器（手动模式）的时候，我不会碰控制器。等你贴来位姿、告诉我\"示教完了\"，我再开始第 4、5 步，那时会切到仿真模式跑判卷，跑完我自己切回真实模式。\n\n可以开始了，先把筐的尺寸告诉我。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1155,"cache_read_input_tokens":314399,"output_tokens":1747,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":787},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1155,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1747,"cache_read_input_tokens":314399,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1155,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1155},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ecbd6484-c4f6-4e07-aa2a-38e581df5a8e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGUGZSM3SSRsxs74BPCP","requestRef":"546baabb-bd13-4592-9cc0-c3ce0c75c5ab","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"40aa1799-ec66-46fa-9bba-67911e756439","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:16:44.001Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
