{"parentUuid":"f5d35b59-bd31-435e-ba2e-77f66630c282","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGUXifQCD1n1owteg6NJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已经记进位姿库，命名为 `return_point`。\n\n**这个点的位置：**在基座**正后方偏一点**（方位约 −81°），水平离基座约 1.0m，吸盘离地约 0.64m。它和货架、桌子不在同一侧，J1 要从 home 转过去约 110°。\n\n**路线上需要重点关注的是上苗机：**上苗机在模型里的高度是 1.02m，而退苗点吸盘只有 0.64m 高。臂从 home 转过来的路上，如果经过上苗机上方，挂着的盒子可能会扫到它。碰撞检查就是要查这个。\n\n**开始判卷前，还需要你提供两样东西：**\n\n1. **筐的尺寸和位置**：长、宽、高，以及**筐口离地多高**，大概数就行。示教点就在筐口正中上方，所以我能根据它推出筐的水平位置，只缺大小和高度。\n2. **控制器现在是手动模式**（`op_mode=0`）。你示教完了吗？我这边要切到仿真模式跑判卷，跑完再切回真实模式。如果你还要继续用示教器，就先别让我开始。\n\n把筐的尺寸告诉我，并说一声\"可以开始\"，我就把筐加进场景模型，然后开始判卷。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":323099,"output_tokens":444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":323099,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fe5421b3-9b4d-441a-9ce3-d08b8f52f3a0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGUXiJKL6fUgvc6kob3g","requestRef":"5ee61c8d-4450-44ff-93a8-0a661e091ff4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b6c5f965-c43c-4079-869d-fcecefc657c8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:19:54.320Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4