{"parentUuid":"bdbfbcae-a50a-435c-b036-0de5be52cd6f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGUcXHRbH4wDzarAy2hS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_read_input_tokens":323766,"output_tokens":904,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":312},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":904,"cache_read_input_tokens":323766,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4121,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"7f4e3b42-603b-4a18-9c98-766991dbbef4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGUcWptSPPRE21xBpBqH","requestRef":"8374dc15-46fc-476a-b425-8a0eb1f186a1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"eac609f9-05ac-4691-a84c-7298f842166b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:20:58.489Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"eac609f9-05ac-4691-a84c-7298f842166b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGUcXHRbH4wDzarAy2hS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你说得有道理，可以不要筐的尺寸，只需要把**最后一段改成竖直下降**。\n\n**之前要尺寸，是担心最后一段的走法：**\n规划器只负责\"到达这个点\"，并不管从哪个方向进来。如果它让臂**斜着或横着**滑到筐口上方，而盒底只比筐沿高 5~8cm，盒子就可能刮到筐沿。场景模型里没有这个筐，碰撞检查也查不出来。\n\n**换一种走法就不需要了：**\n```\nhome → 退苗点正上方 20cm(悬停点) → 竖直降到退苗点 → 吹开 → 竖直升回悬停点 → home\n```\n- 最后一段是**竖直**下来的，水平方向不动。只要示教点在筐口正上方，盒子就碰不到筐沿，筐多大都没关系。\n- 悬停点比筐沿高出近 30cm，臂在这个高度以上转过来，筐也碍不着。\n- 现在传送带口的丢弃动作就是这么做的：先到一个中间点，再进入丢弃点。\n\n**所以接下来要判的是：**home ↔ 悬停点这两条路线，会不会撞上苗机、桌子、货架。这些都在场景模型里，可以查。竖直下降那 20cm 不用规划。\n\n这样可以吗？可以的话，你说一声控制器能用了（示教器放下、我可以切仿真模式），我就开始：\n1. 用控制器 IK 算出悬停点，写进位姿库。\n2. 判卷 home → 悬停点、悬停点 → home。先试直接走，撞了就用 MoveIt 规划。\n3. 结果给你看，再请你真机低速走一遍。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_read_input_tokens":323766,"output_tokens":904,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":312},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":904,"cache_read_input_tokens":323766,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7f4e3b42-603b-4a18-9c98-766991dbbef4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGUcWptSPPRE21xBpBqH","requestRef":"8374dc15-46fc-476a-b425-8a0eb1f186a1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"30cf72e6-598c-4e17-aa98-7db4bfd870ac","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:21:05.963Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id