{"parentUuid":"34d1f1e8-a784-4ee0-991a-36053b70c9d5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGVHnkvjL2JAkihYX1DS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_read_input_tokens":346127,"output_tokens":926,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":213},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":926,"cache_read_input_tokens":346127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8916,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"675807f0-1ec5-4516-9b54-0929e607bf50","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGVHnMNUpGaD4zy5HCSg","requestRef":"5417f679-afb0-43ea-8a6d-403e8129ab0c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"6f5515a4-2812-499b-acb3-4cda87b77ca1","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:29:55.984Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"6f5515a4-2812-499b-acb3-4cda87b77ca1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGVHnkvjL2JAkihYX1DS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"仿真部分已经全部完成，代码已提交（6050b69）。真机现在还停在退苗点。\n\n**最终路线**（往返都一样，倒过来走）：\n```\nhome → via_a(在 home 方向把臂收到离基座 0.5m)\n     → via_b(收着臂原地转身 110°, 只动 J1)\n     → 悬停点(往退苗方向伸出)\n     → 退苗点(竖直下降 20cm) → 吹开 → 竖直升回悬停点 → 原路回 home\n```\n**仿真判卷结果：**8 段全部零碰撞，判卷时已经按持货（最宽品种）的尺寸算了碰撞体。转身时，臂和上苗机之间至少隔着 15cm。\n\n**接下来请你真机低速走一遍**（空手就行，你在旁边看着）。\n\n先把控制器切到自动模式，你刚才示教时用的是手动模式：\n```\n./scripts/check_cell.sh opmode auto\n```\n\n**回程**（臂现在在退苗点），每条命令都会先在仿真里判卷，通过后切回真实模式，等你输入 `YES` 才会动：\n```\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh return_hover\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh return_via_b\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh return_via_a\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh home\n```\n**去程**：\n```\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh return_via_a\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh return_via_b\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh return_hover\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh return_point\n```\n主要看两处：**转身那一段**，臂离上苗机够不够远；**最后下降那一段**，吸盘离筐沿的距离是否合适。\n\n真机走通后，我再做最后一步：**修改出库流程**，让 `dest: \"return\"` 真正走这条路线，把盒子投进退苗筐，并把能力表里的退苗筐改成指向这个点。到时候 8 段会串成一条连贯的路线，中间不会停顿。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_read_input_tokens":346127,"output_tokens":926,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":213},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":926,"cache_read_input_tokens":346127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"675807f0-1ec5-4516-9b54-0929e