{"parentUuid":"8a3ad319-6ec7-4807-ab2b-3d475e4d4a0a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2c50eb5a-55a8-42b6-a203-acb925eea23c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CW1KiLBMJcxCdXF2hZUVHW","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/config/drop_point.yaml has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"81e092f0-39d4-481c-8bc9-32cce37efe87","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:35:19.316Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/config/drop_point.yaml","oldString":"  return:   {label: 退苗筐,   point: drop_point}   # ⚠ 2026-10-20 联调临时借用传送带口(用户定); 退苗筐定了示教新点改这里","newString":"  return:   {label: 退苗筐,   point: return_point}   # 2026-10-22 退苗筐示教+判卷(此前 10-20 起临时借用传送带口 drop_point)","originalFile":"# 丢弃点标定账本(单一来源; 2026-08-31示教+沙盘判卷; 传送带挪位后须重示教重判)\n# 语义: 丢弃流=巡航movel斜飞→drop_mid(竖直,走廊绿区上空)→movej→drop_point(斜29°,带面上方)\n#       →吹开→movej原路退回drop_mid。mid↔drop段沙盘判卷30/30零碰撞(2026-08-31, movej关节直连)。\n# 姿态斜29°是构型所迫(竖直在该点超臂展1.35m>1.3m, 示教实证); TCP z=带面顶+8.5cm。\ndrop_point:\n  tcp: [-1.2630, 0.1847, 0.3943, -2.6283, -0.0020, 1.5902]   # 2026-09-15 立放末端: 抬高20mm(旧z 0.3743=带面+8.5cm; 长杆时 drop_mid→drop_point 手腕翻转半路持货盒扫带边2.6mm)\n  joints: [-0.026337, -0.586337, -0.741926, 0.270257, 1.590605, -0.038530]   # 2026-09-15 立放末端: 上面tcp按新TCP控制器IK(种子=旧关节); 旧电机工具 [0.013963, -0.652753, -0.755728, 0.350811, 1.570796, -0.003491]\ndrop_mid:\n  tcp: [-0.90, 0.1856, 0.35, -3.141593, 0.0, 1.589]\n  joints: [-0.025424, -0.398395, -0.864369, -0.308153, 1.570393, -0.040810]   # 2026-09-15 立放末端同上; 旧 [0.018865, -0.388642, -0.998600, -0.183675, 1.570397, 0.003464]\n\n# 退苗筐投放点(2026-10-22 真机示教: 持货盒底离筐沿5~8cm, 筐口正中上方; 基座后方 J1=107.9°)\n# 走法(grasp/drop_box.deliver_sequence): 持货在 home → route 依次经过(poses.yaml 关节) → joints 投放点 → 吹开 → 原路倒序回 home\n#   route 末项 return_hover = 投放点正上方 20cm 同姿态, 最后一段等于竖直下降(筐多大都碰不到筐沿, 故场景模型不建筐)\n#   via_a/via_b = 收臂到半径 0.5 原地转 J1: 直连 home→悬停点会扫进上苗机包络 133mm(其内沿 x=-0.655)\n#   每段 movej 直连判卷零碰撞(含持货碰撞体); MoveIt 规划版 J5 回摆 83° 作废. 挪筐须重示教 joints 并重判\nreturn_point:\n  route: [return_via_a, return_via_b, return_hover]\n  joints: [1.88321, -0.476475, -1.132719, 0.085521, 1.569051, -0.055851]\n  tcp: [0.1523, -1.0009, 0.1435, -3.0948, -0.0038, -2.7703]\n\n# 命名去处(2026-09-10): 出库/退苗任务的 dest 可选值. 设备只认名字, 为什么去那是上位机的事.\n# point=本文件里的标定点名; point 为空=位置未定, GET /capability 报 available=false, 任务用它会被 400 拒绝.\ndestinations:\n  drop:     {label: 传送带口, point: drop_point}\n  outbound: {label: 出库筐,   point: null}     # 出库位定了: 示教一个点写进上面, 这里填点名\n  return:   {label: 退苗筐,   point: drop_point}   # ⚠ 2026-10-20 联调临时借用传送带口(用户定); 退苗筐定了示教新点改这里\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":24,"oldLines":4,"newStart":24,"newLines":4,"lines":[" destinations:","   drop:     {label: 传送带口, point: drop_point}","   outbound: {label: 出库筐,   point: null}     # 出库位定了: 示教一个点写进上面, 这里填点名","-  return:   {label: 退苗筐,   point: drop_point}   # ⚠ 2026-10-20 联调临时借用传送带口(用户定); 退苗筐定了示教新点改这里","+  return:   {label: 退苗筐,   point: return_point}   # 2026-10-22 退苗筐示教+判卷(此前 10-20 起临时借用传送带口 drop_point)"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8a3ad319-6ec7-4807-ab2b-3d475e4d4a0a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
