{"parentUuid":"92e11762-a7a6-425e-a9d7-148bc6abbc78","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGVydjaDa1vwWmsaixjD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_read_input_tokens":380163,"output_tokens":856,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":64},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":380163,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9126,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"3ce8a4b2-a80d-4ed1-b20a-b6c2de8fcea9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGVydL1yGbeR1MdLMjHG","requestRef":"da783396-df90-4bf6-84c2-8b4143c9b057","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"353466d3-ffe6-4fec-abe9-efe2687d038d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:38:56.816Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"353466d3-ffe6-4fec-abe9-efe2687d038d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGVydjaDa1vwWmsaixjD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"改好了，已部署上线，服务已重启。代码已提交（6001dde）。\n\n**改了什么：**\n- 出库流程现在**按 `dest` 去对应的地方**：`drop` 去传送带口（和原来一样），`return` 去退苗筐。之前不管写什么都去传送带口。\n- 能力表里退苗筐已经从\"临时借用传送带口\"改成了真正的退苗点，显示为可用。\n- 上位机那边**不用改**，`dest: \"return\"` 原来就是这么传的，现在会真的去退苗筐。\n\n**仿真验证（控制器空跑并录制，AutoDL 判碰撞）：**\n\n| | 时长 | 碰撞 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 去程 home → 退苗点 | 11.1 秒 | 441 个路点零碰撞 ✅ |\n| 回程 退苗点 → home | 10.9 秒 | 457 个路点零碰撞 ✅ |\n\n**有一点要知道：**路线在两个中转点会**明显减速**，各慢下来约 2 秒。这是\"收臂 → 转身 → 伸出\"这种走法本身造成的：每到一个拐点，一部分关节要停下、另一部分关节开始动，控制器只能先减速再拐弯。一趟退苗总共约 22 秒（丢回传送带约 10 秒）。退苗不是高频操作，我觉得可以接受。如果你嫌慢，以后可以把拐角做圆滑，但要重新判卷。\n\n**请你真机试一次完整的退苗出库。**挑一个有货的列队首，比如 A-L10 最外面那盒（具体的 x 和序号按同事账上的为准）：\n```\n./scripts/flow.sh retrieve A-L10 <x_mm> <序号> 0 --dest return\n```\n输入 `YES` 后会自动完成：飞去格口取货 → 回 home → 去退苗筐投放 → 回 home。\n\n**重点看三处：**\n1. 转身时离上苗机够不够远。这是去程第一次上真机。\n2. 竖直下降时，盒子离筐沿的距离。\n3. 吹开后，**盒子是不是准确落进筐里**。\n\n或者也可以让同事从上位机下一个 `dest: \"return\"` 的出库任务，这样连接口一起验证了。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_read_input_tokens":380163,"output_tokens":856,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":64},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":380163,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3ce8a4b2-a80d-4ed1-b20a-b6c2de8fcea9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGVydL1yGbeR1MdLMj