{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","id":"8203985a-2972-4136-a969-d5df6401517e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:39:49.227Z","version":"2.1.306","querySource":"repl_main_thread","shapeHash":"35938f60d5e9719b49f0de4f7c55c8490afa7798961197a2092ae6d7720ef651","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","context-1m-2025-08-07","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"da783396-df90-4bf6-84c2-8b4143c9b057","keep":637,"tail":["62a71d09fd13b13e4bd0351f0634c42cfe995b24d8b05b0ab4a40a8ac5436245","02e4792b04539f51f6079264cf8f44a8853944febe4edd17261a86042831561b","4b8bd9022e1f1d78333fcd370681ee79d1655b97a52c14e0e30360c64fe2dca4"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",639,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"2c8a6ce326e2ede8b507dd1e0be7be1bd0907893acc97f4b48a1d8530a3ee7a7"}
{"parentUuid":"dd54bddd-a464-42d9-8112-8322d7900e9f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGW4G6UBLDiwosrrtpe7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以了，**现在就能选**，接口已经上线。\n\n| `dest` | 去哪 | 现在能不能用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `\"drop\"` | 传送带口 | ✅ 可用 |\n| `\"return\"` | 退苗筐 | ✅ 可用（今天刚启用） |\n| `\"outbound\"` | 出库筐 | ❌ 还没标定，传了会返回 400 `dest_unavailable` |\n\n**同事的写法：**\n```json\nPOST /tasks\n{ \"type\": \"retrieve\",\n  \"items\": [ {\"slot\": \"A-L10\", \"x_mm\": -246.2, \"index\": 16, \"box_mm\": [60, 38.5, 22.4]} ],\n  \"dest\": \"return\",\n  \"reason\": \"退苗 批号202504034\" }\n```\n- 可选值以 `GET /capability` 的 `destinations` 为准，`available: true` 的才能用。我刚查过，现在 `drop` 和 `return` 都是 true。\n- 出库完成后推送的 `retrieved` 事件里也会带上 `dest`，上位机可以据此确认这盒去了哪里。\n\n**有一点要提醒同事：**退苗筐这条路线**还没有在真机上跑过完整的一趟**。仿真判卷已经通过，回程你也在真机上走过了，但从取货到投放进筐，这整个过程还没真跑过。建议第一次下 `dest: \"return\"` 任务时，**只下一盒**，你在现场看着，确认盒子准确落进筐里，再正常使用。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":895,"cache_read_input_tokens":381022,"output_tokens":524,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":895,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":524,"cache_read_input_tokens":381022,"cache_creation_input_tokens":895,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":895},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9d8e7da1-3992-405f-b8b6-d97f84a08dfe","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGW4FMpCFxts64zuaHjX","requestRef":"8203985a-2972-4136-a969-d5df6401517e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"f043db85-4bd5-4871-8e95