{"parentUuid":"44b8f81f-7184-485a-8ca1-8f10f389d492","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGWiZ1FwVTsH4WrE7kUx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3048,"cache_read_input_tokens":382543,"output_tokens":2885,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1549},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3048,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2885,"cache_read_input_tokens":382543,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3048,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3048},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":26604,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"0a275cd3-b39e-4b80-b2ca-7fe2820f340a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGWiYcwUZM95Pr1Jci74","requestRef":"ca01ca62-782c-44c4-afed-9a897c186101","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"60e3c414-3c9f-4834-8e22-d9a5fc643764","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:48:56.642Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"60e3c414-3c9f-4834-8e22-d9a5fc643764","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGWiZ1FwVTsH4WrE7kUx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先说结论：**能做，而且大部分零件都是现成的。**扫码动作、扫码位、四面轮询都在上架流程里跑熟了，出库这边只需要把它们接进来。但有三个业务问题需要你来定。\n\n**1. 现在的出库流程，和改动后的样子**\n```\n现在:   飞到格口 → 取货 → 回 mid → 回 home → 投放(传送带口/退苗筐)\n改后:   飞到格口 → 取货 → 回 mid → 回 home → 【去扫码口扫码 → 推送给上位机】 → 投放\n```\n- **技术上可行**：出库取出盒子时，吸住的是上架时吸的同一个大面，取完后电机归零，盒子的朝向和上架时吸起来一样。所以扫码动作可以原样复用：手腕依次转四个面，直到读到条码。\n- **每盒多花约 5~9 秒**：home → 扫码口约 1~2 秒，扫码 3~6 秒（看条码在第几面）。\n- **已经有现成的比对依据**：出库任务的每一项本来就有一个 `code` 字段，即上位机账上记的追溯码，现在只是原样回报。加上扫码后，设备可以直接比较\"**账上说是这盒**\"和\"**实际扫到的是这盒**\"。\n\n**2. 需要你定的三件事**\n\n**① 推送后要不要等上位机回复？**\n- **不等（推荐）**：扫到码 → 推送 → 直接去投放。上位机只是收到记录，用于追溯，以及确认出去的是哪一盒。简单，也不会拖慢节奏。\n- **等**：和上架的\"问去处\"一样，在扫码口停下来，等上位机确认（比如 10 秒），超时怎么处理还得另外定。只有上位机需要根据条码**临时改变去处**时才需要这样做。\n\n**② 扫到的码和账上的对不上，怎么办？**这是加扫码的核心价值：防止出错苗。\n- **改送传送带口（推荐）**：不送去出库或退苗的地方，送回上苗传送带，等人处理或重新上架。同时推送\"不符\"给上位机，让账上标记异常。\n- 照常送到目的地，只做标记：最省事，但错的苗还是出去了。\n- 停下来等人：手上拿着盒子停在扫码口，人来处理。最保守，但会卡住整个任务。\n\n**③ 四个面都没扫到码，怎么办？**比如条码被遮住或者磨损了。\n- 可以按\"对不上\"同样处理，也可以照常投放，只标记\"未读到\"。\n\n**3. 推送给上位机的内容**（我的建议）\n新增一种事件，比如叫 `retrieve_scanned`：\n```json\n{ \"kind\": \"retrieve_scanned\", \"slot\": \"A-L10\", \"x_mm\": -246.2, \"index\": 16,\n  \"code_expected\": \"81002713760075609215\",   ← 账上的(任务里给的)\n  \"code_scanned\":  \"81002713760075609215\",   ← 实际扫到的\n  \"match\": true,                              ← 一致/不一致/没读到(null)\n  \"dest\": \"return\",                           ← 最终送去了哪(不符时改成 drop)\n}\n```\n原来的 `retrieved`（取出成功、账上减一）**不变**，上位机现有的代码不受影响。还要把新事件加进 webhook 的推送白名单。\n\n**另外有个小坑需要顺手处理：**现在工作站服务里有一条规则：看到扫码卡片就自动推送 `code_scanned`。这条规则原本是给上架用的，如果出库也扫码，会被误发出去。上位机会以为在问它\"这盒放哪\"。改的时候要把它限定在上架任务里。\n\n你定一下 ①②③，我就按你的选择来改。我的推荐是：**不等；对不上改送传送带口；没读到也按对不上处理**。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3048,"cache_read_input_tokens":382543,"output_tokens":2885,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1549},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3048,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2885,"cache_read_input_tokens":382543,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3048,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3048},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0a275cd3-b39e-4b80-b2ca-7fe2820f340a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGWiYcwUZM95Pr1Jci74","requestRef":"ca01ca62-782c-44c4-afed-9a897c186101","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"439fb7de-26d3-4e0f-8666-029245c4be83","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:49:03.565Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
