{"parentUuid":"d73e7a7f-9b24-4485-ad4a-08426acf7eef","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7390db56-b3a0-4386-8d65-dc1b62399aaa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DrSyqQRyjiUvwFiNvy3ESr","type":"tool_result","content":"4:价值不在动作本身(一条movej), 在于只放行【判过卷的起点】: movej走关节直线, 起点没验过就可能扫过货架。\n5:  → home: 从 mid / drop_mid / home(已在) / 桌面上空走廊区竖直姿态(近拍位·落点上方等)   (G0/G5 每天在走)\n29:def goto(arm, name, payload=P.NONE):\n37:    _dp = load_drop_config(); drop_mid = _dp[\"drop_mid\"][\"joints\"]; drop_point = _dp[\"drop_point\"][\"joints\"]\n40:    at_scan = False\n42:        scx, scy, _ = yaml.safe_load(open(os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"scan_point.yaml\"), encoding=\"utf-8\"))[\"box_center_point\"]\n43:        at_scan = tcp is not None and math.hypot(tcp.x - scx, tcp.y - scy) < 0.05 and tcp.z < 0.22\n46:    starts = {\"home\": {\"mid\": poses[\"mid\"], \"drop_mid\": drop_mid, \"drop_point\": drop_point, \"home\": poses[\"home\"]},   # +桌面上空(走廊)见下; drop_point→先退到drop_mid(丢回的出口路, 2026-09-10: 丢回中途被切手动模式卡在丢弃点)\n49:    if frm is None and name == \"mid\" and at_scan:\n52:        # 桌面上空(走廊区, 工具朝下±15°)任意点→home: 近拍位/落点上方/drop_mid 都属此类, 空中开阔, 与G0天天走的同类movej\n257:    from services.scan_client import ScanClient\n258:    res[\"vision\"] = VisionClient.try_connect(); res[\"scanner\"] = ScanClient.try_connect()\n301:    suck = rot = vision = scanner = None\n4:  goto home → detect → pick → ◇判大面 → scan(不解绕) → ◇有码? → ◇认脸 → [转≥2原地解绕] goto mid → fly mid→格口 → ◇排坑位 → place → fly 格口→mid → goto home\n186:        r = self.card(scan(self.arm, self.scanner, H, dry=self.dry, unwind=False))   # 不原地解绕(2026-09-03用户定): 去mid的movej走关节直线, J6顺路回零不缠绕; 丢回线另行解绕","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"33fbbd21-86ed-4159-aa48-633f401eb38b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:54:22.136Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"4:价值不在动作本身(一条movej), 在于只放行【判过卷的起点】: movej走关节直线, 起点没验过就可能扫过货架。\n5:  → home: 从 mid / drop_mid / home(已在) / 桌面上空走廊区竖直姿态(近拍位·落点上方等)   (G0/G5 每天在走)\n29:def goto(arm, name, payload=P.NONE):\n37:    _dp = load_drop_config(); drop_mid = _dp[\"drop_mid\"][\"joints\"]; drop_point = _dp[\"drop_point\"][\"joints\"]\n40:    at_scan = False\n42:        scx, scy, _ = yaml.safe_load(open(os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"scan_point.yaml\"), encoding=\"utf-8\"))[\"box_center_point\"]\n43:        at_scan = tcp is not None and math.hypot(tcp.x - scx, tcp.y - scy) < 0.05 and tcp.z < 0.22\n46:    starts = {\"home\": {\"mid\": poses[\"mid\"], \"drop_mid\": drop_mid, \"drop_point\": drop_point, \"home\": poses[\"home\"]},   # +桌面上空(走廊)见下; drop_point→先退到drop_mid(丢回的出口路, 2026-09-10: 丢回中途被切手动模式卡在丢弃点)\n49:    if frm is None and name == \"mid\" and at_scan:\n52:        # 桌面上空(走廊区, 工具朝下±15°)任意点→home: 近拍位/落点上方/drop_mid 都属此类, 空中开阔, 与G0天天走的同类movej\n257:    from services.scan_client import ScanClient\n258:    res[\"vision\"] = VisionClient.try_connect(); res[\"scanner\"] = ScanClient.try_connect()\n301:    suck = rot = vision = scanner = None\n4:  goto home → detect → pick → ◇判大面 → scan(不解绕) → ◇有码? → ◇认脸 → [转≥2原地解绕] goto mid → fly mid→格口 → ◇排坑位 → place → fly 格口→mid → goto home\n186:        r = self.card(scan(self.arm, self.scanner, H, dry=self.dry, unwind=False))   # 不原地解绕(2026-09-03用户定): 去mid的movej走关节直线, J6顺路回零不缠绕; 丢回线另行解绕","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"6b6a5b33-991c-41a6-be56-844965a6d65a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":11},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d73e7a7f-9b24-4485-ad4a-08426acf7eef","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userTyp