{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"4ecb2d9c1d3007e29ea958ec3e8bc99430ad38081f0b0bd57a1151896ad871ca","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"明白了：**不论扫没扫到、对不对得上，都照常投放**，设备只负责把扫到的结果推送出去，判断留给上位机。我按这个来改。\n\n先确认几个衔接细节：命令行跑出库时扫码器怎么接，以及扫完码后臂停在扫码口，要怎么回到 home 再去退苗筐："},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DrSyqQRyjiUvwFiNvy3ESr","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && sed -n 1,60p scripts/bluespace/actions/goto.py | grep -n \"放行\\|ALLOW\\|allow\\|scan\\|drop_mid\\|def goto\" | head -20; grep -n \"scanner\\s*=\\|ScanClient\\|scan_client\" scripts/bluespace/flows/store_one_box.py | head -5; grep -n \"scan(\" scripts/bluespace/flows/store_one_box.py | head -5","description":"查回home放行规则与扫码器接法"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
