{"parentUuid":"8858c196-b4c1-46d6-b0cd-762efb6bc588","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXCoqWYmvQFvLFqT5mF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3139,"cache_read_input_tokens":390844,"output_tokens":1119,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":470},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3139,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1119,"cache_read_input_tokens":390844,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3139,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3139},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12244,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9a1edfe5-ca42-4be3-8973-7b51b38c11dd","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGXCZUKGHEwQPQJwoeRY","requestRef":"d5ee2caf-7f40-413d-b95a-62757cb9e436","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"08526758-cb5a-4171-a478-23260558798d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:55:05.480Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"08526758-cb5a-4171-a478-23260558798d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXCoqWYmvQFvLFqT5mF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白了，**只有出库要扫码，退苗不扫。**那设备怎么区分一个任务是出库还是退苗？对设备来说两者是同一种任务（`type: \"retrieve\"`），区别只在 `dest` 和 `reason`。而 `reason` 是给人看的文字，设备不解析。所以可以有两种做法：\n\n**做法 A：按去处决定（推荐）**\n在去处配置里给每个去处标一下\"投放前要不要扫码\"：\n```yaml\ndestinations:\n  drop:     {label: 传送带口, point: drop_point}\n  outbound: {label: 出库筐,   point: ...,          scan: true}   ← 出库扫码\n  return:   {label: 退苗筐,   point: return_point}               ← 退苗不扫\n```\n上位机照常传 `dest`，不用加新字段。扫不扫码由设备这边配置决定，以后哪个去处需要扫码，改一行配置就行。\n\n**做法 B：上位机每次下任务时指定**\n在任务里加一个字段，比如 `\"scan\": true`，上位机下出库任务时带上，下退苗任务时不带。更灵活，但同事要改代码。\n\n**不过还有一个前提要先确认：**出库筐现在**还没有标定**（`outbound` 显示不可用）。你说的\"现在直接取出后丢到指定位置\"，出库时同事传的是哪个 `dest`？是 `drop`（传送带口）吗？\n- 如果出库现在暂时也用传送带口，按做法 A 的话，就得让 `drop` 也扫码。但上架流程里丢回不合格的盒子用的也是传送带口，不过那条路线不走这个配置，所以互不影响。\n- 或者出库筐很快就会定下来，那就等标定好后在 `outbound` 上开扫码。\n\n你确认一下：**出库现在走哪个去处？以及选 A 还是 B？**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3139,"cache_read_input_tokens":390844,"output_tokens":1119,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":470},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3139,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1119,"cache_read_input_tokens":390844,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3139,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3139},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9a1edfe5-ca42-4be3-8973-7b51b38c11dd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGXCZUKGHEwQPQJwoeRY","requestRef":"d5ee2caf-7f40-413d-b95a-62757cb9e436","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"0b36e680-7da4-427d-a40c-13cccbeae643","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:55:05.497Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
