{"parentUuid":"5a222d6a-f1b1-4b69-9c3f-6e384cf33c4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXKmy6ym6rtk93AQvhF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46,"cache_read_input_tokens":395102,"output_tokens":1065,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":314},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1065,"cache_read_input_tokens":395102,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4007,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9530aa24-0a96-48ea-9045-d13edf526d58","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGXKmCiC2nwDJsbpb9it","requestRef":"cad9b006-9de9-4710-aaed-486acd877520","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"827f4f93-c4d2-4900-a836-3f51e6e95c54","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:56:31.742Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"827f4f93-c4d2-4900-a836-3f51e6e95c54","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXKmy6ym6rtk93AQvhF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，而且这比前两种都清楚。\n\n**做法 C：新增任务类型**\n```\ntype: \"retrieve\"  → 取出后直接投放(退苗等, 现有行为不变)\ntype: \"outbound\"  → 出库: 取出 → 扫码 → 推送 → 投放\n```\n\n**和前面两种比：**\n\n| | 上位机怎么写 | 好处 | 代价 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| A 按去处配置 | 不变 | 不用改上位机 | 出库筐没标定前不好用，而且\"扫不扫\"藏在设备配置里，上位机看不到 |\n| B 任务里加开关 | 加 `\"scan\": true` | 灵活 | 每次都要记得带，容易漏 |\n| **C 新任务类型** | 出库写 `\"type\": \"outbound\"` | **语义最明确**：上位机一看就知道这是出库，事件、日志、快照里也都能区分出库和退苗 | 接口多一个类型值 |\n\n**我推荐 C。**设备内部和退苗共用同一套取货代码，只是在投放前多插一步扫码。所以实际改动量和 A、B 差不多。\n\n**具体设计：**\n- `outbound` 的参数和 `retrieve` **完全一样**：`items`、`dest`、`reason`、`on_empty`。同事复制一份退苗的代码，改个 `type` 就能用。\n- **`dest` 照常指定**：出库筐标定之前，可以先用 `drop`（传送带口）。标定好以后改成 `outbound` 即可，流程不用变。\n- **事件**：\n  - `retrieved`：取出成功，账上减一。和退苗一样，不变。\n  - **新增 `outbound_scanned`**：扫码结果，包含账上的码、扫到的码、是否一致（扫不到时为 null）。加入 webhook 推送白名单。\n  - 不管码对不对、扫没扫到，**都照常投放**。判断交给上位机。\n- **退苗**照旧用 `retrieve`，不扫码，同事现有的代码完全不用改。\n\n确认一下：**出库现在先用 `dest: \"drop\"`（传送带口）**，对吗？确认后我就开始改。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46,"cache_read_input_tokens":395102,"output_tokens":1065,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":314},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1065,"cache_read_input_tokens":395102,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9530aa24-0a96-48ea-9045-d13edf526d58","apiBlockInd