{"parentUuid":"5a0de398-7131-4668-ae4b-fa3a39501276","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXPsrg9qUdQFQS9cwGN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以。**任务类型和去处是两回事，可以任意组合：**\n\n| | `dest: \"drop\"` 传送带口 | `dest: \"return\"` 退苗筐 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `type: \"retrieve\"`（直接投放） | ✅ | ✅ |\n| `type: \"outbound\"`（先扫码再投放） | ✅ | ✅ |\n\n设备不限制哪种任务能去哪个口，`dest` 可以选能力表里任何可用的去处。以后出库筐标定好了，再多一个选项。\n\n**技术上的衔接我会处理好：**扫完码后臂停在扫码口，两个去处的接法不同：\n- **去传送带口**：丢回动作本来就支持从扫码口直接出发，不用绕。\n- **去退苗筐**：退苗路线要从 home 出发。扫码口在桌面上方的安全区内，到 home 的这段路本来就在放行范围里，所以先解开手腕的缠绕，回到 home，再走退苗路线。这两段都是已经验证过的路线，不需要新判卷。\n\n所以我按 C 来做：新增 `type: \"outbound\"`，`dest` 可以选 `drop` 或 `return`，都支持。可以开始改了吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1104,"cache_read_input_tokens":395148,"output_tokens":750,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":326},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1104,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":750,"cache_read_input_tokens":395148,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1104,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1104},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7b081c5c-6ad0-421b-b722-dc62659915d0","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGXPsWLYDq6fsMGo1ghR","requestRef":"c6cbda2f-2add-43d2-b8da-66eaf5a93954","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"0a8d84d1-143e-456c-8ee0-fa3d588d95cf","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:57:31.742Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd"