escription\": \"outbound_scanned 事件: 扫码口实际扫到的码(四面都没读到=null)\"","+     },","+     \"match\": {","+      \"anyOf\": [","+       {","+        \"type\": \"boolean\"","+       },","+       {","+        \"type\": \"null\"","+       }","+      ],","+      \"title\": \"Match\",","+      \"description\": \"outbound_scanned 事件: 扫到的码与账上是否一致(没读到或任务没给码=null). 设备不据此改变去处\"","+     },","      \"waited_s\": {","       \"anyOf\": [","        {"]},{"oldStart":1626,"oldLines":7,"newStart":1684,"newLines":7,"lines":["      \"kind\"","     ],","     \"title\": \"Event\",","-    \"description\": \"事件流的一条. 通用: seq/t/ts/kind/box_seq. 各 kind 附带字段:\\ntask_start: feed, destination, slot, pits, stop, dest, reason(retrieve) | box_start: slot, x_mm, index | box_end: result(ok/stop), text, elapsed_s\\ncard(动作卡片): action, ok, code, category(none/retryable/need_reset/manual/fatal), message, payload(none/holding/holding_assumed/placed/unknown), where, elapsed_s, data\\ntext: text(判断行 ◇/■) | code_scanned: code, size_mm, awaiting_destination(true=设备停着等 POST destination)\\ndestination(上位机答复回显): action, slot, x_mm, index, box_mm, reason | stored: code, slot, x_mm, index | discarded: code, reason\\nwaiting_box: reason, waited_s | fault: code, category, message, payload, where | needs_human: text\\npaused/resumed/pause_requested/stop_requested/abort_requested | aborted: text, payload\\nstocktake: slot, stocktake(盘点结果 dict, 见 stocktake 字段说明), text\\nlost: 货物丢失(吸住→吹开之间 DI4 变 0): code, slot, x_mm/index(若已定去处), di4=0, after(最后确认持货的动作), during(发现时的动作), arm_at, text(人读); 账不记, 臂回 home, 任务继续\\ntask_end: state, reason, stored, discarded, boxes, elapsed_s\"","+    \"description\": \"事件流的一条. 通用: seq/t/ts/kind/box_seq. 各 kind 附带字段:\\ntask_start: feed, destination, slot, pits, stop, dest, reason(retrieve) | box_start: slot, x_mm, index | box_end: result(ok/stop), text, elapsed_s\\ncard(动作卡片): action, ok, code, category(none/retryable/need_reset/manual/fatal), message, payload(none/holding/holding_assumed/placed/unknown), where, elapsed_s, data\\ntext: text(判断行 ◇/■) | code_scanned: code, size_mm, awaiting_destination(true=设备停着等 POST destination)\\ndestination(上位机答复回显): action, slot, x_mm, index, box_mm, reason | stored: code, slot, x_mm, index | discarded: code, reason\\nwaiting_box: reason, waited_s | fault: code, category, message, payload, where | needs_human: text\\npaused/resumed/pause_requested/stop_requested/abort_requested | aborted: text, payload\\nstocktake: slot, stocktake(盘点结果 dict, 见 stocktake 字段说明), text\\noutbound_scanned(出库扫码, 2026-10-22): slot, x_mm, index, dest, code_expected(任务 items 里给的码), code_scanned(扫到的; 四面没读到=null), match(true/false; 没读到或没给账上码=null). 不论结果都照常投放\\nlost: 货物丢失(吸住→吹开之间 DI4 变 0): code, slot, x_mm/index(若已定去处), di4=0, after(最后确认持货的动作), during(发现时的动作), arm_at, text(人读); 账不记, 臂回 home, 任务继续\\ntask_end: state, reason, stored, discarded, boxes, elapsed_s\"","    },","    \"EventsPage\": {","     \"properties\": {"]},{"oldStart":2366,"oldLines":9,"newStart":2424,"newLines":9,"lines":["     \"properties\": {","      \"type\": {","       \"type\": \"string\",","-      \"pattern\": \"^(store|retrieve|stocktake)$\",","+      \"pattern\": \"^(store|retrieve|outbound|stocktake)$\",","       \"title\": \"Type\",","-      \"description\": \"任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=出库或退苗(把货架上指定的盒取出来送到去处); stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home)\",","+      \"description\": \"任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=取出直接送到去处(退苗等); outbound=出库: 取出→到扫码口扫码→推 outbound_scanned 事件→送到去处(不等上位机回复, 码对不上也照送; 2026-10-22); retrieve 与 outbound 参数完全相同(items/dest/reason/on_empty), dest 均可选能力表里任一可用去处; stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home)\",","       \"default\": \"store\"","      },","      \"columns\": {"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备接口文档.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":99,"oldLines":7,"newStart":99,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," | 字段 | 类型 | 说明 | 约束 |"," |---|---|---|---|","-| `type` | string | 任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=出库或退苗(把货架上指定的盒取出来送到去处); stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home) | 默认 \"store\"，取值 store / retrieve / stocktake |","+| `type` | string | 任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=取出直接送到去处(退苗等); outbound=出库: 取出→到扫码口扫码→推 outbound_scanned 事件→送到去处(不等上位机回复, 码对不上也照送; 2026-10-22); retrieve 与 outbound 参数完全相同(items/dest/reason/on_empty), dest 均可选能力表里任一可用去处; stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home) | 默认 \"store\"，取值 store / retrieve / outbound / stocktake |"," | `columns` | array<StockColumn>（可空） | 盘点用: 上位机账上这个格口的列表(与 /plan/store 的 columns 同形, 多一个 count). 给了就逐列比对报差异; 不给只报自动分列结果 |  |"," | `items` | array<RetrieveItem>（可空） | 出库/退苗用: 要取的盒的列表, 设备按顺序逐盒取。哪些盒能取(立放: 列队首=该列最大序号)由上位机按库存账保证 |  |"," | `on_empty` | string | 出库/退苗用: 到坑位发现没吸到盒(账上有、架上没有)怎么办: skip=报一个pit_empty事件后继续下一盒; stop=报事件后结束任务(reason=pit_empty; 臂已空手回home, 不锁设备) | 默认 \"skip\"，取值 skip / stop |"]},{"oldStart":196,"oldLines":6,"newStart":196,"newLines":26,"lines":[" }"," ```"," ","+示例「出库(先扫码)」（出库 1 盒: 取出后先到扫码口扫码, 推 outbound_scanned(账上码 vs 扫到的码), 再送到传送带口; 不等回复）：","+","+```json","+{","+ \"type\": \"outbound\",","+ \"items\": [","+  {","+   \"slot\": \"A-L10\",","+   \"x_mm\": -246.2,","+   \"index\": 16,","+   \"box_mm\": [60, 38.5, 22.4],","+   \"code\": \"81002713760075609215\"","+  }","+ ],","+ \"on_empty\": \"skip\",","+ \"dest\": \"drop\",","+ \"reason\": \"出库 门诊领用\"","+}","+```","+"," 示例「退苗一个批号」（按批号退苗: 该批号占 x=-170.7 一整列(序号 1→0, 队首先), 设备照单取; 去处将来换退苗筐）："," "," ```json"]},{"oldStart":396,"oldLines":7,"newStart":416,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," | 字段 | 类型 | 说明 | 约束 |"," |---|---|---|---|","-| `type` | string | 任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=出库或退苗(把货架上指定的盒取出来送到去处); stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home) | 默认 \"store\"，取值 store / retrieve / stocktake |","+| `type` | string | 任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=取出直接送到去处(退苗等); outbound=出库: 