ieve=出库或退苗(把货架上指定的盒取出来送到去处); stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home)。取值：store / retrieve / stocktake |","+| type | String | 否，默认 \"store\" | 任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=取出直接送到去处(退苗等); outbound=出库: 取出→到扫码口扫码→推 outbound_scanned 事件→送到去处(不等上位机回复, 码对不上也照送; 2026-10-22); retrieve 与 outbound 参数完全相同(items/dest/reason/on_empty), dest 均可选能力表里任一可用去处; stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home)。取值：store / retrieve / outbound / stocktake |"," | columns | List<StockColumn> | 否 | 盘点用: 上位机账上这个格口的列表(与 /plan/store 的 columns 同形, 多一个 count). 给了就逐列比对报差异; 不给只报自动分列结果 |"," | items | List<RetrieveItem> | 否 | 出库/退苗用: 要取的盒的列表, 设备按顺序逐盒取。哪些盒能取(立放: 列队首=该列最大序号)由上位机按库存账保证 |"," | on_empty | String | 否，默认 \"skip\" | 出库/退苗用: 到坑位发现没吸到盒(账上有、架上没有)怎么办: skip=报一个pit_empty事件后继续下一盒; stop=报事件后结束任务(reason=pit_empty; 臂已空手回home, 不锁设备)。取值：skip / stop |"]},{"oldStart":559,"oldLines":6,"newStart":559,"newLines":29,"lines":[" }"," ```"," ","+出库(先扫码)（出库 1 盒: 取出后先到扫码口扫码, 推 outbound_scanned(账上码 vs 扫到的码), 再送到传送带口; 不等回复）：","+","+```","+POST /tasks HTTP/1.1","+Content-Type: application/json","+","+{","+  \"type\": \"outbound\",","+  \"items\": [","+    {","+      \"slot\": \"A-L10\",","+      \"x_mm\": -246.2,","+      \"index\": 16,","+      \"box_mm\": [60, 38.5, 22.4],","+      \"code\": \"81002713760075609215\"","+    }","+  ],","+  \"on_empty\": \"skip\",","+  \"dest\": \"drop\",","+  \"reason\": \"出库 门诊领用\"","+}","+```","+"," 退苗一个批号（按批号退苗: 该批号占 x=-170.7 一整列(序号 1→0, 队首先), 设备照单取; 去处将来换退苗筐）："," "," ```"]},{"oldStart":861,"oldLines":7,"newStart":884,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | seq | Integer | 是 | 事件序号, 任务内从1递增。上位机记住最后一个, 下次拉取带 since=它, 只拿新的 |"," | t | String | 是 | 发生时刻 HH:MM:SS |"," | ts | Number | 是 | 发生时刻的 Unix 时间戳(秒) |","-| kind | String | 是 | task_start/box_start/card/text/code_scanned/destination/stored/discarded/lost/retrieved/pit_empty/stocktake/waiting_box/fault/needs_human/paused/resumed/pause_requested/stop_requested/abort_requested/aborted/box_end/task_end |","+| kind | String | 是 | task_start/box_start/card/text/code_scanned/destination/stored/discarded/lost/retrieved/outbound_scanned/pit_empty/stocktake/waiting_box/fault/needs_human/paused/resumed/pause_requested/stop_requested/abort_requested/aborted/box_end/task_end |"," | box_seq | Integer | 否 | 第几盒(从1起; 任务级事件为0) |"," | code | String | 否 | 追溯码(扫码/上架/丢回/取出类事件) 或 错误码(动作卡片/故障事件) |"," | action | String | 否 |  |"]},{"oldStart":884,"oldLines":6,"newStart":907,"newLines":9,"lines":[" | awaiting_destination | Boolean | 否 |  |"," | reason | String | 否 |  |"," | dest | String | 否 | 出库/退苗的去处名(任务开始与取出事件带) |","+| code_expected | String | 否 | outbound_scanned 事件: 上位机在任务 items 里给的这盒追溯码 |","+| code_scanned | String | 否 | outbound_scanned 事件: 扫码口实际扫到的码(四面都没读到=null) |","+| match | Boolean | 否 | outbound_scanned 事件: 扫到的码与账上是否一致(没读到或任务没给码=null). 设备不据此改变去处 |"," | waited_s | Integer | 否 |  |"," | result | String | 否 |  |"," | di4 | Integer | 否 | lost 事件: 判定时真空开关读数(0=无货) |"]},{"oldStart":1509,"oldLines":7,"newStart":1535,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," ```"," {","-  \"t\": \"09:53:27\",","+  \"t\": \"11:01:23\",","   \"services\": [","     {","       \"name\": \"vision\","]},{"oldStart":1532,"oldLines":7,"newStart":1558,"newLines":7,"lines":["       \"port\": 8902,","       \"role\": \"工作站(本服务)\",","       \"listening\": true,","-      \"pid\": 31908,","+      \"pid\": 30648,","       \"hold\": false","     },","     {"]},{"oldStart":1660,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1686,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | stored | 已上架（必处理，记账） | code, slot, pit。放置吹开成功即发 |"," | discarded | 已丢回传送带 | code, reason(流程判断原因或上位机指示) |"," | retrieved | 已取出（必处理） | code, slot, pit, dest。真空实测吸住才发 |","+| outbound_scanned | 出库扫码结果（type=outbound 才有） | slot, x_mm, index, dest, code_expected（任务里给的码）, code_scanned（扫到的码，没读到为 null）, match（是否一致，没读到或没给码为 null）。只报不等，不论结果都照常投放 |"," | pit_empty | 吸空（必处理，账实不符） | code, slot, pit, detail |"," | waiting_box | 等人放盒（手动模式） | reason, waited_s |"," | fault | 动作失败 | code, category, message, payload, where |"]}]}],"moreFiles":1,"changedFiles":["/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/openapi.json","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备接口文档.md","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备接口文档_V1.docx","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备接口文档_V1.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e7ed16a2-654d-4629-948a-9874b81d9786","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":6,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":11},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e403d9df-0f4d-4bf8-a748-2c20c322e66a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
