{"parentUuid":"8dd9c35b-8a43-48d3-b611-f2fd211d06f6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXjoWY3zyCCXHNU7qGW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"出库任务已经改好、部署上线了。Mac 端提交 42ec9df，设备端 81d9547。\n\n**上位机怎么用：**\n```json\nPOST /tasks\n{ \"type\": \"outbound\",                  ← 出库: 会先扫码\n  \"items\": [ {\"slot\":\"A-L10\", \"x_mm\":-246.2, \"index\":16,\n              \"box_mm\":[60,38.5,22.4], \"code\":\"81002713760075609215\"} ],   ← code 填账上的码, 用来比对\n  \"dest\": \"drop\",                       ← 或 \"return\", 都支持\n  \"reason\": \"出库 门诊领用\" }\n```\n- **退苗**照旧用 `\"type\": \"retrieve\"`，不扫码，同事现有的代码不用改。\n- 两种类型的参数**完全一样**，只是 `type` 不同。\n\n**出库时设备的动作：**\n```\n飞到格口取货 → 回 home → 到扫码口扫码(四面轮询) → 推送 outbound_scanned\n   → 去传送带口: 从扫码口直接过去\n   → 去退苗筐:   先回 home, 再走退苗路线\n```\n\n**新推送的事件**（已加进 webhook 白名单）：\n```json\n{ \"kind\": \"outbound_scanned\", \"slot\": \"A-L10\", \"x_mm\": -246.2, \"index\": 16, \"dest\": \"drop\",\n  \"code_expected\": \"81002713760075609215\",   ← 任务里给的\n  \"code_scanned\":  \"81002713760075609215\",   ← 实际扫到的, 没读到为 null\n  \"match\": true }                             ← 没读到或任务没给 code 时为 null\n```\n按你的要求，**不论对不对得上、扫没扫到，都照常投放**。判断交给上位机，上位机看到 `match=false` 或 `null` 时标记异常就行。原来的 `retrieved`（取出成功、账上减一）不变。\n\n**验证：**\n- 控制器仿真空跑完整出库（去退苗筐）：取货 → 扫码 → 回 home → 投放 → 回 home，9 个动作全部成功，共 54 秒。\n- 接口：`outbound` 被接受；未标定的去处会被拒绝；推送白名单加载成功，webhook 自检通过。\n\n**顺手修了一个旧问题：**命令行跑出库时，坑位的横向位置 x 被当成整数解析，填 −246.2 这种小数会直接报错。之前给你的那条真机退苗命令其实跑不起来，现在可以了。\n\n**文档已更新：**接口文档 V1（docx/md）、`webhook对接说明.md`，都可以直接发给同事。\n\n**还没在真机上跑过。**建议找一盒有码的，你在现场跑一次，重点看**取出后能不能扫到码**。取货吸住的面和上架时一样，理论上没问题，但没有实测过：\n```\n./scripts/flow.sh retrieve A-L10 <x_mm> <序号> 0 --scan --dest drop\n```\n或者让同事直接从上位机下一个 `type: \"outbound\"` 的单盒任务，这样连推送一起验证了。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":710,"cache_read_input_tokens":418603,"output_tokens":1173,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":113},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":710,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1173,"cache_read_input_tokens":418603,"cache_creation_input_tokens":710,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":710},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f4c564d1-69d1-4f65-af0d-58a5b77f1598","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGXjo9TckaDS7TGUbbNT","requestRef":"4a6774cd-9545-4a44-a207-673bd29af722","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"dbd76c6d-6ffa-45c9-a083-d64d35767f5a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:02:05.177Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
