{"parentUuid":"37181592-2ddf-4394-8e55-81d7fb2a6c2a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01RfH5avXoeQBTAZzgXnhAKB","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f8fe6cf5-412f-45e6-9343-98335681749b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:03:33.429Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"f8fe6cf5-412f-45e6-9343-98335681749b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXrhTr5BaF2MQRRCogM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我写好了给同事的对接说明：**`docs/出库扫码对接说明.md`**，已提交 git（ce6e3e1）。整份文件可以直接发给他，让他交给 AI 改代码。\n\n**示例用的是他自己昨天下过的发苗任务**（`reason` 是\"工作台发苗 1号工作台\"），改前改后的请求并排放着，他一眼就能看出**只需要把 `\"type\": \"retrieve\"` 改成 `\"type\": \"outbound\"`**，其他参数都不用动。\n\n**文档内容：**\n1. **改了什么**：新增出库类型，和退苗的区别。退苗继续用 `retrieve`，不用改。\n2. **改前 / 改后的请求对比**，并提醒两点：`items[].code` 一定要填账上的码（否则没法比对），`box_mm` 要填（用来算扫码高度）。\n3. **`dest` 能选什么**：传送带口、退苗筐都可以，出库筐还没标定。\n4. **每盒会收到的事件顺序**：`box_start` → `retrieved`（不变，照常销账）→ **`outbound_scanned`（新增）** → `box_end`。吸空的盒子不扫码。\n5. **`outbound_scanned` 的字段说明**，以及三种情况的建议处理：一致 → 正常；不一致 → 标\"出库异常\"，人工核对、按扫到的码改账；没扫到 → 标\"未核验\"。\n6. 其他：每盒多 5~9 秒、webhook 和补拉都能拿到、可以用快照里的 `type` 区分出库和退苗。\n\n**有一点要提前告诉同事：**第 5 节里那条 `outbound_scanned` 是我按代码构造的**示例**，不是真机记录。真机还没跑过出库扫码。等第一次实跑后，我可以用真实记录替换掉，再给他一份。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":425362,"output_tokens":643,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":643,"cache_read_input_tokens":425362,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a1b63b46-9e8f-4f9e-99d8-3cc30a83dd4d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGXrgzouUGs3Q6bYSzsZ","requestRef":"ad34e299-de4d-41e6-a2b8-3cc0a4b7c844","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant"