{"parentUuid":"1971edc8-741d-4b31-9b1f-a11d6b8726e3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGY2S7eT7kbQfaqmKUvj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,"cache_read_input_tokens":425854,"output_tokens":856,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":84},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":707,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":425854,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":707},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1063,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"21b2a9db-68c1-439a-87e1-cf597dc5d38c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGY2RDoyNdvoipX2z7JC","requestRef":"9fb6828a-3cbd-4795-afd6-fe58e6e78a43","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"57a9d30a-ca02-4996-9a26-f22f488c25b9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:05:40.339Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"57a9d30a-ca02-4996-9a26-f22f488c25b9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGY2S7eT7kbQfaqmKUvj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不是把原来的改了，而是**原来的保持不变，另外加了一种新的**。\n\n**改动前：**设备只有一种\"从货架取东西\"的任务。\n```\nretrieve: 取出 → 送到去处\n```\n出库、退苗、发苗都用它，设备分不出是哪种业务。\n\n**改动后：**有两种。\n```\nretrieve(原来的, 一点没变): 取出 → 送到去处\noutbound(新加的):           取出 → 扫码 → 推送扫码结果 → 送到去处\n```\n- 同事以前写的退苗代码，继续发 `retrieve`，行为和昨天完全一样。\n- 想出库时扫码，就发 `outbound`。参数和 `retrieve` 一模一样，只有 `type` 这个词不同。\n- 设备不关心这是\"出库\"还是\"退苗\"这样的业务名称，只看要不要扫码。叫 `outbound` 只是为了好认。\n\n**今天围绕出库这块，一共改了两件事：**\n\n**① 让 `dest`（去处）真正生效（上午）**\n以前不管 `dest` 填什么，臂都去传送带口。现在：\n- `dest: \"drop\"` → 传送带口\n- `dest: \"return\"` → 退苗筐（今天示教、规划好的那条收臂绕过上苗机的路线）\n\n**② 新增 `outbound` 任务类型（刚才）**\n取出后先到扫码口扫码，推送一条新事件 `outbound_scanned`，内容是\"账上的码 / 扫到的码 / 是否一致\"，然后照常投放，不等上位机回复。\n\n这两件事互不影响，可以自由组合：\n\n| | 去传送带口 | 去退苗筐 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `retrieve`（不扫码） | ✅ | ✅ |\n| `outbound`（先扫码） | ✅ | ✅ |\n\n**另外顺手修的两个小问题**（不影响同事）：\n- 原来上架时\"扫到码就推送 `code_scanned`\"的规则，限定为只在上架时生效，免得出库扫码时误发，让上位机以为设备在问\"这盒放哪\"。\n- 命令行跑出库时，坑位横向位置是小数（比如 −246.2）会报错，修好了。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,"cache_read_input_tokens":425854,"output_tokens":856,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":84},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":707,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":425854,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":707},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"21b2a9db-68c1-439a-87e1-cf597dc5d38c","apiBlockInde