{"parentUuid":"4ce9a4ab-f46b-464b-9400-0658641e308d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGYXZE6CS61Z9geH1Mba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":400,"cache_read_input_tokens":428018,"output_tokens":1678,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":928},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":400,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1678,"cache_read_input_tokens":428018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":400,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":400},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12323,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"34bcc1df-ad56-4408-82d5-31619fbb3082","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGYXYL1dPdvJ1t1yF4KN","requestRef":"88a94206-2317-4432-a71f-cb020a8203c6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"6721f7be-0340-4427-b5ae-ffe45e0fde55","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:12:26.854Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"6721f7be-0340-4427-b5ae-ffe45e0fde55","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGYXZE6CS61Z9geH1Mba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以做成一条完整、连贯的路径，但要先说清楚两点。\n\n**为什么现在一卡一卡：**\n现在的路线是我手动设计的折线：收臂 → 原地转身 → 伸出 → 竖直下降，一共有 3 个拐角。每到一个拐角，一些关节要停下，另一些关节才开始动，控制器只能先减速再拐弯，所以会顿一下。每个拐角大约慢 2 秒。\n\n**为什么不能直接走直线过去：**\n从 home 直接转到示教点，最短的路线正好从**上苗机上方扫过**。刚才判卷时，吸盘会扎进上苗机的包络里 13cm。所以这条路必须\"弯\"一下才能绕过去，只是可以弯得很顺，不需要在中途停下来。\n\n**改法：从 home 一条平滑曲线直接到示教点**\n用 MoveIt 一次性规划 home → 示教点（不经过中转点、不上升下降），再用项目里生产格口路径的那套流程层层筛选：\n1. 多次规划，比较哪条最顺、最短；\n2. 去掉关节来回摆的部分（今天上午第一版就是因为手腕摆了 83° 才放弃的）；\n3. 控制器仿真实跑，判碰撞；\n4. **按生产速度试飞，检查中途有没有停顿**，有停顿就换一条重新来，直到找到全程不停的。\n回程（示教点 → home）同样单独做一条。\n\n**唯一要注意的是最后一段：**去掉竖直下降以后，盒子可能会**斜着**进入筐口上方。场景模型里没有这个筐，规划器不知道筐沿在哪，所以有可能从侧面低空擦过筐沿。我的处理办法是：路径做出来后，我检查最后一段的走向，确认盒子是从上方或斜上方进来的，不是贴着筐沿平着滑进去的。不满足就换一条。\n\n**预期效果：**单程从现在的 11 秒左右缩短到 6~7 秒，中途不停。\n\n需要用 AutoDL 和控制器仿真模式，你不跑真机的时候我就可以开始。要做吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":400,"cache_read_input_tokens":428018,"output_tokens":1678,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":928},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":400,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1678,"cache_read_input_tokens":428018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":400,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":400},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"34bcc1df-ad56-4408-82d5-31619fbb3082","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGYXYL1dPdvJ1t1yF4KN","requestRef":"88a94206-2317-4432-a71f-cb020a8203c6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"3f49c2a4-27c0-4e83-9624-8f6b6bc921d7","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:12:35.558Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
