{"parentUuid":"67e9bbb7-6f19-4be8-9fb7-71fb9ab5b71b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGhKtzvpvPouEtv2rANx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1780,"cache_read_input_tokens":110973,"output_tokens":841,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":72},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1780,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":841,"cache_read_input_tokens":110973,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1780,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1780},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9695,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"feea5834-9bbc-4e94-9321-644340db6c91","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGhKtfqdkVd41f91q7G4","requestRef":"dd70b7ba-e15d-442a-b6a3-565cdf31a0cb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"1acdd6ac-8a0b-4d2b-bac3-c68c1715ae00","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:07:47.704Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"1acdd6ac-8a0b-4d2b-bac3-c68c1715ae00","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGhKtzvpvPouEtv2rANx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"查清楚了，结论分两部分。\n\n**1. 传输正常，是扫码本身没读到**\n- 任务 111 在 11:13:26 推送了 `outbound_scanned`，上位机返回 200 签收了。\n- 推送内容是 `code_scanned: null`，`match: null`。这个字段是如实写的\"没扫到\"，不是漏传。\n- 扫码卡片：盒子到了扫码位，四个面都转过了（转 3 次，9.2 秒），一个码都没读到。\n- 扫码器自己的落库记录里，最后一条是**昨天 16:30**，今天一条也没有。说明 11:13 那次扫码器根本没解码出任何东西，问题不在设备没把码传出去。\n\n**2. 为什么没读到，目前还分不清是哪种**\n- 这盒（81904120453705303468）之前入库扫过 4 次，每次都扫到了，一般在第 2 面，有一次在第 4 面。条码本身没问题。\n- 和入库时相比，出库这次有两处不同：\n  - 扫码高度：入库按实测盒厚 27mm，这次按上位机给的 25mm，差 1mm。这个差距应该不至于读不到。\n  - 抓法：出库是从货架上把立着的盒子重新吸起来。我核对了代码，吸的还是同一个大面的中心附近，几何上应该和入库时一致。\n- 还剩一种可能：**扫码器或键盘钩子当时没在工作**。今天在 111 之前没有任何入库任务，所以没法证明今天扫码器是好的。以前桌面锁屏就出现过钩子失效。扫码服务现在显示在运行，但只说明进程活着，不说明扫码能读进来。\n\n**建议先做一个 10 秒的测试来区分**（不动机械臂）：你手拿一盒有码的盒子，在扫码器前过一下。\n\n```\n./scripts/check_cell.sh scanner\n```\n\n- 读到了：扫码器是好的，问题出在出库时盒子摆到扫码器前的位置，我再接着查抓取和扫码位的几何。\n- 读不到：问题在扫码器或钩子（锁屏、USB），和出库流程无关。\n\n你方便时跑一下，告诉我结果。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1780,"cache_read_input_tokens":110973,"output_tokens":841,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":72},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1780,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":841,"cache_read_input_tokens":110973,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1780,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1780},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"feea5834-9bbc-4e94-9321-644340db6c91","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGhKtfqdkVd41f91q7G4","requestRef":"dd70b7ba-e15d-442a-b