{"parentUuid":"beeb0121-b1d3-4876-b427-6c25f7b790b1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"57fd2e9c-e4a7-42ef-84db-89912f3bce12","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"好像是扫码不起作用了是吗\n\n<pasted_content id=\"0aa3\">\n扫码服务在线 (uptime 189116s, 已收97码)\n请在 30 秒内手拿药盒(码朝下)在扫码口上方过一下...\n[FAIL] [FAIL] 超时未扫到码. 排查: ①码面朝向扫码口? ②是20位追溯码? ③扫码服务窗口有无报错\nShared connection to 100.106.76.91 closed.\n(base) chen@chendeMacBook-Air robocenter %\n</pasted_content id=\"0aa3\">\n"},"uuid":"d3b81563-7e3a-4cfe-8c08-fc82e1119574","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:08:48.882Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
