{"parentUuid":"3bc62ef4-3c39-4684-9482-46b01ac06186","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"031bcdeb-3110-4a3b-beb2-2aa1d7988512","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PmTHCqZ9bp9G5b7MuARYoA","type":"tool_result","content":"8:| 扫码 scan_service.py | 127.0.0.1:8901 | 计划任务 scan_service(桌面会话) | 键盘钩子须住桌面会话, 锁屏即失效 |\n14:- `services\\ensure_services.bat`(看门狗): 四个端口哪个没在听就拉起。vision/cell/upper 用 PowerShell `Start-Process run_service.bat <name>` 脱离计划任务进程树; scan 走 `schtasks /run /tn scan_service`。\n23:| blue-space 命令行 | `services\\svc.bat status` / `svc.bat start\\|stop\\|restart [vision\\|scan\\|cell\\|upper\\|all]` |\n27:语义: **stop** = 放 `logs\\hold_<name>.flag` + 杀监听进程(看门狗与循环都不再拉起); **start** = 清旗 + `schtasks /run` 看门狗(桌面会话拉起, ssh 里跑也活得住); **restart** = 清旗 + 杀进程, run_service.bat 循环 5 秒内拉回(scan 走 `schtasks /run scan_service`)。工作站服务自己只受理 restart(自退出由循环拉回, 网页轮询 /health 等它回来, 实测几秒); 要停它用命令行。\n50:- 看门狗 `ensure_services.bat` 不再只看端口：端口在听时再用 `services/probe.py <name>` 按协议 ping（vision/scan TCP ping, cell GET /openapi.json, upper GET /health，超时 20 s），5 s 后再探一次，两次都不通才 taskkill 该端口的进程；有循环启动器的服务 5 s 自己回来，等 12 s 仍没回来才拉。计划任务间隔 5 分钟 → **1 分钟**（导出 XML 改 PT1M 重新导入，Interactive/Highest 不变）。\n53:- 手动操作：blue-space `cd /d D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services` 后 `svc.bat status|start|stop|restart <vision|scan|cell|upper|all>`；扫码例外走计划任务（等于双击 start_scan_service.bat）。","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"189feea9-0030-4f6e-a654-ef4fca4d9052","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:11:13.574Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"8:| 扫码 scan_service.py | 127.0.0.1:8901 | 计划任务 scan_service(桌面会话) | 键盘钩子须住桌面会话, 锁屏即失效 |\n14:- `services\\ensure_services.bat`(看门狗): 四个端口哪个没在听就拉起。vision/cell/upper 用 PowerShell `Start-Process run_service.bat <name>` 脱离计划任务进程树; scan 走 `schtasks /run /tn scan_service`。\n23:| blue-space 命令行 | `services\\svc.bat status` / `svc.bat start\\|stop\\|restart [vision\\|scan\\|cell\\|upper\\|all]` |\n27:语义: **stop** = 放 `logs\\hold_<name>.flag` + 杀监听进程(看门狗与循环都不再拉起); **start** = 清旗 + `schtasks /run` 看门狗(桌面会话拉起, ssh 里跑也活得住); **restart** = 清旗 + 杀进程, run_service.bat 循环 5 秒内拉回(scan 走 `schtasks /run scan_service`)。工作站服务自己只受理 restart(自退出由循环拉回, 网页轮询 /health 等它回来, 实测几秒); 要停它用命令行。\n50:- 看门狗 `ensure_services.bat` 不再只看端口：端口在听时再用 `services/probe.py <name>` 按协议 ping（vision/scan TCP ping, cell GET /openapi.json, upper GET /health，超时 20 s），5 s 后再探一次，两次都不通才 taskkill 该端口的进程；有循环启动器的服务 5 s 自己回来，等 12 s 仍没回来才拉。计划任务间隔 5 分钟 → **1 分钟**（导出 XML 改 PT1M 重新导入，Interactive/Highest 不变）。\n53:- 手动操作：blue-space `cd /d D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services` 后 `svc.bat status|start|stop|restart <vision|scan|cell|upper|all>`；扫码例外走计划任务（等于双击 start_scan_service.bat）。","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"56ac5e75-b8ae-4398-90ad-274f8aef6ab7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":11},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3bc62ef4-3c39-4684-9482-46b01ac06186","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
