{"parentUuid":"7abc2fcf-b25e-419a-9d99-de79030fda76","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGhgwZoEMofnVVe9K5So","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_read_input_tokens":119083,"output_tokens":1100,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":263},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1100,"cache_read_input_tokens":119083,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12013,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"95e0b89e-4d3b-4898-b7a2-e263e6f39fbd","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGhgwExbbXtmsrLMgUtu","requestRef":"b37f97f5-4a21-4b15-b7aa-1f55637b9882","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"3e610716-9a9a-481e-8c65-ef5ad7dc67a4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:12:35.402Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"3e610716-9a9a-481e-8c65-ef5ad7dc67a4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGhgwZoEMofnVVe9K5So","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扫码服务已经重新起来了，现在是 UP 状态。先回答你的两个问题。\n\n**有没有日志：没有。**\n扫码服务的输出只显示在 blue-space 桌面的那个黑窗口里，不写文件。刚才重启时窗口被关掉，当时的输出也一起没了。这是个缺口，下面一并提改法。\n\n**是什么原因：** 扫码器响了，说明码已经读到，问题出在扫码服务没收到这串输入。从代码看只有两种可能：\n\n1. **键盘钩子被 Windows 悄悄摘掉了**（我认为最可能）\n   - 扫码服务靠全局键盘钩子收扫码器\"打字\"的内容。\n   - Windows 有个规定：钩子某次处理按键太慢（系统卡顿、弹 UAC 窗口、切到安全桌面等），就直接把它摘掉，不报错，也不通知程序。\n   - 结果就是你看到的情况：服务进程活着，ping 也正常，但再也收不到按键。\n   - 服务从 19 日起连续运行了 52 小时，中途某次卡顿就可能触发。昨天 16:30 之后一个码都没进来，和这个情况吻合。\n\n2. 按键到得太慢，被\"不像扫码枪\"的速度检查过滤掉了。这种情况会在黑窗口里打印一行\"[弃-速度]\"，现在已经看不到了。\n\n**另外发现一个托管 bug：** `svc.sh restart scan` 拉不起扫码服务。原因是 `start_scan_service.bat` 末尾有一句 `pause`，进程被杀后窗口停在\"按任意键继续\"，计划任务一直显示\"正在运行\"，看门狗再拉也不生效。刚才我是先结束这个计划任务，再手动启动才拉起来的。\n\n**请你现在再测一次：**\n```\n./scripts/check_cell.sh scanner\n```\n能读到，就说明是原因 1 或 2，重启已经解决了。\n\n之后我建议做三处改动，等你同意再动手：\n1. 扫码服务的输出同时写进 `logs/scan_service.log`，下次能查。\n2. 去掉 bat 里的 `pause`，让 restart 正常生效。\n3. 看门狗加一项检查：每次扫码任务没读到码时，在日志里记下\"钩子最后一次收到按键的时间\"。超过一定时间没收到，就自动重挂钩子。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_read_input_tokens":119083,"output_tokens":1100,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":263},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1100,"cache_read_input_tokens":119083,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"95e0b89e-4d3b-4898-b7a2-e263e6f39fbd",