{"parentUuid":"279cd0ef-7870-4bed-9f2a-be9912c66289","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGhsa5YHwFc5cfox2VzD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"IP 没变，设备这边是好的，**而且同事的电脑此刻就连着设备**：\n\n- 设备 IP 还是 **192.168.100.190**，四个服务都在线，8902 对外监听正常。\n- 我在设备上看到 **192.168.100.212（同事那台）正和 8902 保持着连接**。日志显示每 2 秒有一次 `GET /health` 加 `GET /device`，都返回 200。\n- 设备 ping 同事电脑也通，延迟 3ms。\n- 设备往同事那边推 webhook，最后一次是 11:13 任务 111 的事件，全部签收成功。\n\n所以网络和 IP 都没问题。可能的原因有两个：\n\n1. **超时设得太短**：`GET /device` 每次要 **1.04 秒左右**（里面要连一次机械臂控制器读状态）。如果上位机的请求超时设成 1 秒，就会时好时坏，报\"连接不上\"。\n2. **说的是别的连接**：比如上位机自己的 8080 服务，或者它连的是另一个地址或端口。\n\n建议问同事两件事：**报错的是哪个地址，原文是什么？** 有了这两条我就能定位。如果是超时问题，让他把超时调到 5 秒就行。\n\n扫码那边，你方便时再跑一次 `./scripts/check_cell.sh scanner`，确认重启后能读到码。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1017,"cache_read_input_tokens":123998,"output_tokens":619,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":142},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1017,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":123998,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1017,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1017},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"774c54d8-f6f0-4cbe-90b5-0c8a19f75350","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGhsZdFVotorJD9uikPD","requestRef":"55175af2-2a97-4619-8ce4-6b59b7481d0a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2cc361c0-8867-497c-aa58-6b9279b6a728","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:14:55.284Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e