{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"4c5ce85e726b927b8451243d05488c1d9b2a06acc5ab167381d0f90898398077","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"已经部署上去，日志开始写了。SSH 里中文显示成乱码，只是终端编码的问题，文件本身是 UTF-8。下面在 Mac 端提交："},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011meDLjZYZERE6wAdGMdGYg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && git add scripts/bluespace/services/scan_service.py && git commit -q -m \"feat: 扫码服务输出双写 logs/scan_service.log + 记录钩子最后收到按键时刻\n\n起因: 任务111 出库扫码四面全空, 扫码器嘀了但服务没收到, 窗口输出随重启丢失无从查证.\nscan 超时写一行'钩子最后收到按键 N 秒前', 区分钩子被 Windows 摘除 / 被速度格式检查滤掉; ping 回 n_keys/last_key_age_s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"提交扫码服务日志改动"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
