{"parentUuid":"5dee0ccf-b636-4008-b11c-8cd07e8878d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGiCDzL284EnZhyx91ND","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扫码恢复了，读到了 81904120453819360886，用时 6.2 秒。\n\n这也印证了之前的判断：扫码器本身是好的，是**键盘钩子失效了**，重启扫码服务后就恢复了。任务 111 出库时没扫到码，原因就在这里，出库流程和推送都没问题。\n\n我觉得钩子失效以后还可能再出现。现在日志已经加上，下次再遇到，看 `scan_service.log` 里超时那一行，就能确认是不是钩子被摘了。\n\n还剩两件事，等你定：\n1. **去掉 bat 里的 `pause`**，这样 `svc.sh restart scan` 才能真正重启扫码服务。\n2. **钩子失效后自动恢复**：在看门狗里加一个判断，钩子长时间没收到任何按键、又正好遇到扫码超时，就自动重挂钩子。根治的办法是把扫码器切到 USB-COM 串口模式（之前记过），这样就不用依赖键盘钩子了，但需要改扫码器的设置。\n\n第 1 件改动很小，你同意的话我就改。第 2 件可以先观察几天日志再定。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":178,"cache_read_input_tokens":134723,"output_tokens":472,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":71},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":178,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":472,"cache_read_input_tokens":134723,"cache_creation_input_tokens":178,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":178},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"be476b85-31d2-4411-aa38-315963c8270b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGiCDHAKLtmxfJ27pN18","requestRef":"f049d94f-35f0-440f-82ac-ab01a72b770c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"c9035d2a-976b-400e-9dec-f65c19f53270","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:19:05.721Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","versi