{"parentUuid":"066a690e-9973-40c8-a7ba-46ecfaa03695","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGiKWaAXmRtNcofUyDSi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"改动 1 做完了。现在 `./scripts/svc.sh restart scan` 能真正把扫码服务重启起来，我连续实测了两次都成功：pid 依次换成 33152 和 33764，每次几秒内就恢复 UP。\n\n改了两处：\n- `start_scan_service.bat`：去掉末尾的 `pause`。原来进程被杀后窗口停在\"按任意键\"，计划任务一直显示\"正在运行\"，重启和看门狗都拉不起服务。\n- `svc.bat`：重启扫码服务时，先 `schtasks /end` 结束任务，再 `/run`。这样即使碰上带 `pause` 的旧窗口，也能拉起来。\n\n`docs/服务托管.md` 里补了这次的原因和改法。设备端已部署并提交（2f4c967），Mac 端提交是 30d38a7。\n\n扫码这边目前的状态：服务在线，日志写入 `logs\\scan_service.log`，重启正常。钩子失效后自动恢复（第 2 件）先观察几天日志再定。\n\n你什么时候方便，我们回到退苗路径平顺化的事。AutoDL 仿真栈还没拉起来，需要先跑 `restore_autodl.sh`。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":691,"cache_read_input_tokens":139199,"output_tokens":424,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":691,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":424,"cache_read_input_tokens":139199,"cache_creation_input_tokens":691,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":691},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6aa6daa0-d9b8-49b3-8264-8775c5d34000","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGiKWELcF6Tabrar8pD1","requestRef":"a0dda271-a24d-4813-b4ab-6aad1f6eb574","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"dadfd70a-c735-4ecb-a4fa-d8e7b9690eae","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:20:43.526Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\ro