{"parentUuid":"c98bac9e-5b36-44dc-aaaa-3a9711f03dc8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGik5raiwAPN6tzJkpyZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1618,"cache_read_input_tokens":154834,"output_tokens":1210,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":177},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1618,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":154834,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1618,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1618},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10822,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"a1f27031-ca1c-4dc8-bb77-261d97b30fbf","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGik5XVHVctuXGHtx855","requestRef":"856d3a3c-5201-47cd-95ae-52ca393ed12a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ca2d8b3-8cc0-4d3a-9f1a-f247563b205b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:26:23.823Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"0ca2d8b3-8cc0-4d3a-9f1a-f247563b205b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGik5raiwAPN6tzJkpyZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不清楚很正常，这些文字散落在代码各处，从来没有汇总过。我从源码里全部翻了一遍，**上位机能收到的文字一共只有 3 类来源**：\n\n## 1. 下任务时，设备拒绝的回复（接口直接返回）\n\n上位机调用接口不合规时，设备返回 `{\"error\": \"代码\", \"detail\": \"说明\"}`。一共 **29 种**，常见的有：\n\n| 代码 | 意思 |\n|---|---|\n| `busy` | 设备正在执行别的任务 |\n| `dest_unavailable` | 去处还没标定（比如出库筐） |\n| `box_mm_required` | 没给盒子尺寸 |\n| `pit_out_of_range` | 坑位超出格口范围 |\n| `no_such_slot` | 没有这个格口 |\n| `already_ended` | 任务已经结束了 |\n| `arm_offline` / `not_ready` | 机械臂没连上 / 没准备好 |\n\n这一类问题不大：代码固定，上位机可以按代码处理。\n\n## 2. 任务执行中推送的事件（webhook）\n\n一共 11 种事件，其中**带文字说明的有 6 种**，是\"看不懂\"的主要来源：\n\n| 事件 | 什么时候发 | 文字在哪个字段 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `discarded` | 盒子被丢回传送带 | `reason` |\n| `fault` | 出故障 | `code` 加 `message` |\n| `needs_human` | 需要人来处理 | `text` |\n| `pit_empty` | 去取货，格子是空的 | `detail` |\n| `lost` | 盒子在半路掉了 | `text` |\n| `stocktake` | 盘点结果 | `text` 加每列一堆数字 |\n\n另外 5 种（`stored` 入库、`retrieved` 取出、`outbound_scanned` 出库扫码、`code_scanned` 扫到码、`task_end` 结束）基本只有数据，`task_end` 只多一个固定的结束原因代码。\n\n## 3. 故障代码（藏在 fault 和 needs_human 里）\n\n代码里一共定义了 **33 个错误码**（E_NO_BOX、E_PLACE_MOTION 等），每个错误码配一段说明文字。说明是写代码时随手写的，用的是工程师的话。实际出现最多的是：\n- **E_NO_BOX \"视野无盒, 请上料\"**，出现 58 次，算是好懂的。\n- 其他大多像\"放置运动中断于: ⑦ 升回巡航\"这样。\n\n---\n\n**所以真正要整理的，主要是第 2 类的 6 种事件和第 3 类的 33 个错误码。**\n\n下一步建议：我把这两部分做成一张完整的清单，每一条写清楚 4 列：**原文 / 白话意思 / 货在哪 / 该怎么处理**。你和同事看着清单就知道都有哪些，也能标出哪些最需要改。这一步只整理，不改代码。要我做吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1618,"cache_read_input_tokens":154834,"output_tokens":1210,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":177},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1618,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":154834,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1618,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1618},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a1f27031-ca1c-4dc8-bb77-261d97b30fbf","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGik5XVHVctuXGHtx855","requestRef":"856d3a3c-5201-47cd-95ae-52ca393ed12a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"95132c91-cff1-4e7f-a40b-a96ca4127131","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:26:25.737Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
