{"parentUuid":"30c02b89-106f-40d6-918a-2413f8fe8bef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGj2S8fBxQUjEVQsRyo8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"清单做好了，已经提交（4af4d00）：\n\n**`docs/上位机提示文字清单.md`**\n\n按你说的，把状态也加进去了。上位机能拿到的文字一共分 4 类：\n\n| 节 | 内容 | 条目 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 接口拒绝回复 | 29 种代码 |\n| 2 | 推送事件里的文字 | 丢回原因、故障、需人工、吸空、掉货、盘点、任务结束 |\n| 3 | **状态** | 设备状态 `GET /device`（`state`/`payload`/`arm_at`/`detail`/服务/推送状态）；任务快照 `GET /tasks/{id}`（`state` 6 种、`stage` 20 种、进度）；不推送、只能拉取的过程事件（每个动作的回执卡、判断行、暂停/停止、每盒结束） |\n| 4 | 故障码 | 33 个，按\"料/视觉、位置不对、运动中断、取放结果、配置/设备\"分组 |\n| 5 | 问题汇总 | 10 类问题 |\n\n每条都写了原文、白话意思和怎么处理；看不懂或不该给操作员看的，标了 ⚠。\n\n补状态时新发现了 3 个问题：\n- **`arm_at` 会报出 11 种内部位姿名**，比如 `scan_hover`、`return_via_a`，接口文档里只写了 4 种。\n- **`stage` 直接用中文当状态码**。哪天改个字，上位机的判断就对不上了。\n- **结束状态有歧义**：出错结束也报 `finished`；每盒结束的 `result` 只有 ok/stop 两种，丢回的盒子也报 ok。\n\n这次只做了整理，没改代码。你和同事看完，标出最想先改的几条，我再按那几条改。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":203029,"output_tokens":700,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":69},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":619,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":700,"cache_read_input_tokens":203029,"cache_creation_input_tokens":619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":619},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8341d5c9-930f-4dd9-82d3-fa2a549c1921","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGj2RmbHEtE61uwQwjx9","requestRef":"228ad2a4-dc94-42b7-937d-e19baebce198","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"d96ce46c-4b8c-430d-b5ea-284ee