{"parentUuid":"7b82e56d-7a1e-4e51-9c80-8850b66bae78","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGj8HSCuYwukS4dVtWUv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":203648,"output_tokens":959,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":339},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":959,"cache_read_input_tokens":203648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3730,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"4e375bc8-6919-4193-a0d6-49f4649fc30f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGj8GjYF6nXQ4xa7SH45","requestRef":"c2347c04-f40b-4df4-8039-5d5f413af46f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"6355dece-d561-4290-872b-03aaa095133a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:31:17.911Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"6355dece-d561-4290-872b-03aaa095133a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGj8HSCuYwukS4dVtWUv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大部分列了，但还有几处没列全，说实话如下。\n\n**已经列出原文的：**\n- 丢回原因、需人工处理、吸空、掉货、盘点、任务结束：都是从日志里取的真实原文，还标了出现次数。\n- 故障码：大多数写了原文，带格式的写成\"XX运动中断于: …\"这种样子。\n- 设备状态 `detail`、任务 `stage` 的全部取值。\n\n**没列全的：**\n1. **接口拒绝回复（第 1 节）**：只列了代码，没列 `detail` 原文。比如 `box_mm_required` 实际返回的是\"立放每盒要带 box_mm=[宽,高,厚](算推进量/落板高/校验范围)\"，括号里也是工程师的话。\n2. **3 个故障码没写原文**：`E_FLY_INCOMPLETE`、`E_LOST`、`E_NOT_READY` 只写了\"（按情况）\"之类的占位。\n3. **过程事件（3.3 节）只举了几个例子**：\n   - 回执卡 `action` 的全部名称没列，比如\"去 home\"\"飞路径 mid→A-L10\"\"丢回传送带\"。\n   - 回执卡 `data` 里有哪些中文键没列，比如\"真空DI4\"\"录制\"\"末段峰速\"。\n   - \"◇ 判断\"行的全部写法没列。\n   - 每盒结束 `box_end.text` 的各种写法没列。\n4. **成功时的说明文字完全没列**。比如\"已从(x=-141.7,序号6)取出(立放), 臂回悬停点\"。这些虽然不是错误，但上位机如果把事件流显示出来，也会看到。\n\n要我把这 4 处补全吗？补全以后，这份清单就是\"上位机能看到的每一句原话\"的完整版。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":203648,"output_tokens":959,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":339},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":959,"cache_read_input_tokens":203648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4e375bc8-6919-4193-a0d6-49f4649fc30f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGj8GjYF6nXQ4xa7SH45","requestRef":"c2347c04-f40b-4df4-8039-5d5f413af46f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"27f945aa-fbbe-49ab-b915-da9a77b3503a