{"parentUuid":"b0cf1851-774f-4fbc-8be6-0c8a395c987d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14973653 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2634ee64-08fc-4d96-9593-f47a468824d6","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:42:14.502Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14973653 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"2634ee64-08fc-4d96-9593-f47a468824d6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_017ZGLpBBJZWKkz7AwKsta1C","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6033f867-f007-46a7-866c-765ceb9e4f51","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:42:24.067Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"6033f867-f007-46a7-866c-765ceb9e4f51","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGjy6SXftMUWVNx6PXRX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"首页效果图做好了，已经在浏览器里打开：\n\n**`docs/首页效果图/首页.html`**\n\n这是一个单文件，整机图已经嵌在里面，拷到哪台电脑上都能直接打开。我用无头浏览器按 1920×1080 截图检查过，画面显示正常。\n\n**按参考图的风格做了这些：**\n- **中间**：你的整机图放在白色地面上，地面有网格，四周有蓝色光圈托底，机身上有一道蓝色扫描光来回扫。\n- **热点标注**：有 8 个蓝色脉冲圆点，分别在左货架、机械臂、上苗机、扫码口、出库口、退苗口、操作屏上。鼠标移上去会弹出说明卡，点一下可以让说明卡一直显示。另外，右货架上有一个**红色告警点**，演示\"A-R10 待核对\"，对应参考图里那个红色异常区。\n- **左侧面板**：格口库存排行（A-R10 用红色高亮）、出入库趋势（入库是蓝色柱，往上；出库是灰色柱，往下，仿照参考图的上下对称柱图）、单盒节拍。\n- **右侧面板**：设备 ID 加两个小仪表、运行状态、今日四项计数、实时动态（每 3.5 秒滚动一条，按颜色区分成功、告警、丢回）、货架 A 左右两列 13 层的占用图、开始/暂停/停止/复位按钮。\n- **顶栏**：logo、导航、接口地址、推送状态、温度、实时时钟。\n- **底部流程条**：出库流程\"取货 → 回 home → 扫码 → 核验 → 投放 → 完成\"，会自动逐步推进。\n\n**说明：**\n- 页面里的数据**全是演示数据**，按钮也只是样子，点了没有功能。如果要接真实设备，可以像之前的设备状态看板那样轮询 `/device` 和 `/tasks`，你确认样式之后我再接。\n- 字体用的是 Google Fonts。如果打开的电脑上不了外网，会自动换成系统字体，数字的样子会稍有差别。\n- 源文件是 `home_src.html`，改完之后要重新内嵌图片，才能生成 `首页.html`。\n\n已提交 500cd0b。看看效果，哪里要调整（颜色、面板内容、热点位置、文案）告诉我。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1216,"cache_read_input_tokens":230749,"output_tokens":829,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1216,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":829,"cache_read_input_tokens":230749,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1216,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1216},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"20bfeec2-06b3-45b5-9464-b83812916d74","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGjy67ReQdrGfhN5BJyV","requestRe