{"parentUuid":"4fbc779c-56bd-4ca0-87fd-ab381803c066","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14946204 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"dc42aa98-f032-409c-b5ba-38d265428637","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:51:47.732Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14946204 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"dc42aa98-f032-409c-b5ba-38d265428637","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGkhMTb8UxdT32yoB9LL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"中间已经换成 3D 白模了，浏览器里打开的就是新版：\n\n**`docs/首页效果图/首页.html`**（单文件，three.js 已经内嵌，不联网也能打开）\n\n**现在的效果：**\n- **白模场景**：所有部件都是白色哑光材质，带浅灰描边，有软阴影。摆放位置按真实工作站来：\n  - 机械臂在中间的立柱上。\n  - 后面是货架 A，左右两列各 13 层。\n  - 左边是上苗机和取料台，取料台上有扫码口。\n  - 前面是退苗筐。\n- **货架**：有货的格口里画的是蓝色货列，一列盒子画成一整条，顶上刻着盒缝。A-R10 用红色货列加半透明红色罩子，会呼吸闪烁，对应参考图里那个红色异常区。\n- **和背景无缝衔接**：画布是透明的。地台四周有一圈蓝色光边，地面网格和光晕从中心往外渐渐变透明，最后融进页面背景，看不到模型或画布的边界。\n- **会动**：\n  - 机械臂跟着底部流程条转动：取货伸向货架，回 home，去扫码口，再到退苗筐投放。手里吸着的蓝盒子会跟着出现或消失。\n  - 镜头在一定角度范围内来回慢慢摆动。\n  - 鼠标可以拖动旋转、用滚轮缩放；松手 4 秒后恢复自动摆动。\n- **热点**：标注点挂在 3D 坐标上，转动镜头时会跟着模型移动。机械臂的标注点会跟着手臂走。\n\n**说明：**\n- 这是示意白模，尺寸按真实布局估算，不是精确模型；数据仍是演示数据。\n- 我是用无头浏览器软件渲染截图检查的。你电脑上用显卡渲染，阴影和描边会更细腻一些。\n- 改源文件（`home_src.html`、`scene3d.js`）之后，运行 `python3 docs/首页效果图/build.py` 重新生成单文件。\n\n已提交 1ac977d。看看效果，比如镜头角度、货架颜色、哪些部件要加或要去掉，告诉我再调。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":286112,"output_tokens":775,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":775,"cache_read_input_tokens":286112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"865b4078-4421-4ea9-9564-1c0027ad0a10","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGkhM61js1ANnNvEVBjN","requestRef":"4f30b82a-5d94-4c42-b7cf-97cd7ab5cbe1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]"