{"parentUuid":"42f3e76c-18bd-486f-bd2b-f6de35aca0f1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGmLHDP5FrL9Axkc3sYV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2289,"cache_read_input_tokens":299348,"output_tokens":1222,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":300},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2289,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1222,"cache_read_input_tokens":299348,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2289},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11570,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"8bce54a2-0ab0-45bb-9c4c-e73c6b704886","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGmLGp4soH7s2JdpegpS","requestRef":"4a9a13a6-4fb0-4161-b4ca-ad612ff7f8ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"26c35519-121c-4410-910b-272f61306a72","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:00:21.095Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"26c35519-121c-4410-910b-272f61306a72","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGmLHDP5FrL9Axkc3sYV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"记得，就是\"停止任务不能马上生效\"那个问题。我翻了最近一次任务 115 和历史上所有停止记录，情况是这样的。\n\n**任务 115（刚才这次）：从按停止到结束用了 20.6 秒**\n```\n13:51:39  上一盒丢回完成，开始第 4 盒\n13:51:40  回 home（空手）\n13:51:40  ← 上位机发了 stop\n13:51:42  识别        ← 已经收到停止，但还在继续\n13:51:45  吸取        ← 继续把盒子吸起来\n13:51:51  扫码 → 问上位机 → 上位机说丢回\n13:51:59  丢回传送带\n13:52:00  任务结束\n```\n停止请求到达时，机械臂**空手停在 home**，这一盒还没开始吸，本来马上停下最安全。但设备的规则是\"停止要等当前这盒做完\"，所以又完整走了一遍识别、吸取、扫码、丢回，多花了 20 秒，还白吸了一盒又丢回去。\n\n**你说的\"等 30 秒\"是另一种情况**（任务 60 有记录，分别等了 22 秒和 26 秒）：设备在**等人往桌上放盒**的时候收到停止。等盒的循环里只检查\"立即停止\"，不检查\"停止\"，要一直等到等盒超时（30 秒）才结束。送料等待也有同样的问题。\n\n**两种情况的根源相同**：停止只在\"一盒做完、下一盒开始前\"检查一次，而空手等待和空手识别的阶段不检查。\n\n**改法建议**：\n- 把\"停止\"的检查加到**所有空手的环节**：\n  - 等人放盒时，每秒检查一次。\n  - 等上苗机送料时，每秒检查一次。\n  - 识别完、吸取之前，再检查一次。\n- 在这些环节收到停止，就**立即干净结束**：臂空手在 home，结果记为 `stopped`，和正常停止一样，不会变成\"需人工处理\"。\n- **已经吸着货的时候不变**：还是要把这一盒做完（放进货架或丢回），不能让货悬在半空就停。\n\n**改完的效果**：在空手阶段按停止，1 秒内结束；吸着货时按停止，做完这一盒再结束（和现在一样）。\n\n涉及两个文件，`flows/store_one_box.py` 和 `services/cell_server.py`。改完我先在控制器仿真模式里空跑验证：手动放盒模式下等盒时发停止，看能不能 1 秒内结束；验证完我会自己切回真实模式。之后需要重启工作站服务（这时候你不能在跑任务）。要改吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2289,"cache_read_input_tokens":299348,"output_tokens":1222,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":300},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2289,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1222,"cache_read_input_tokens":299348,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2289},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8bce54a2-0ab0-45bb-9c4c-e73c6b704886","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGmLGp4soH7s2JdpegpS","requestRef":"4a9a13a6-4fb0-4161-b4ca-ad612ff7f8ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"a7e061cb-53ae-4f9d-a65d-e72682b775da","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:00:22.399Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
