{"parentUuid":"bcc4b5b8-ba56-462c-ac9c-fc24b1a64368","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14973501 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ab7a426b-0d57-44e1-9b86-289ddffb76dd","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:10:04.707Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14973501 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"ab7a426b-0d57-44e1-9b86-289ddffb76dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGn6DCWUtrRDZmi8BD6f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"盘点选格口页做好了，已经在浏览器里打开：\n\n**`docs/盘点货架选择/盘点选格口.html`**（单文件，不联网也能打开）\n\n我用无头浏览器截图检查了默认状态和\"选中 4 个格口加高亮疫苗\"两种状态，显示和联动都正常。\n\n**页面内容：**\n- **中间**：整个货架的正面白模，左右两列各 13 层，左边标层号，顶上标\"左列 L / 右列 R\"。地面有蓝色光边和网格，向外渐隐融进背景。可以拖动小幅旋转。\n- **格口状态**：\n  - 有货：白色盒列。\n  - 空：空的格子。\n  - 待核对：红色闪烁，右上角有红色\"!\"，示例里是 A-R10 和 A-L2。\n  - 未启用：灰色挡板，写着\"未启用\"，点不了。\n- **选格口**：点一下选中，再点一下取消。选中的格口变成蓝框，中间标出盘点顺序号。鼠标悬停时显示账上盒数、列数、品种、上次盘点的时间和结果。\n- **顶部**：货架切换标签（A 可用，B 显示\"未部署\"），疫苗高亮下拉框。\n- **右侧**：\n  - 统计：启用格口、待核对、已选。\n  - 快捷选择：全选有货、只选待核对、未盘或超过 7 天、清空。\n  - 盘点顺序清单：可以单个移除。\n  - 预计耗时：按每格口约 50 秒估算。\n  - **开始盘点**：列出要按顺序发给设备的请求。设备一次只盘一个格口，所以要逐个下单，上一单收到 `task_end` 后再下一单。\n\n**说明：**\n- 页面里的数据是演示数据。只有 A-L10 用的是真实库存，启用的格口按现在实际标定的 15 个来设置。\n- 给上位机开发用的话，`ShelfPicker` 可以单独嵌进他们自己的页面，用法写在文件开头的注释里。接入时把货架数据换成他们账上的库存和盘点记录就行。\n- \"开始盘点\"现在只展示请求，没有真的发给设备。\n\n已提交 36172c2。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":352477,"output_tokens":771,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":771,"cache_read_input_tokens":352477,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c95860c4-51ea-473b-9a97-5ee398b48ad1","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGn6CpS51ExVhHQScdr7","requestRef":"2190634a-a4d4-420a-a441-8858cede6268","requ