{"parentUuid":"7604dbd2-4199-442c-abc4-90299d51f014","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_017ADhtDyUaMtQWPEbyLV5ff","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6e3848a1-8ece-4a75-b6bb-52173224376a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:34:37.309Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"6e3848a1-8ece-4a75-b6bb-52173224376a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGoxG6tFr7egjKLnA2bH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"新增上苗弹窗做好了，浏览器里已经打开：\n\n**`docs/上苗弹窗/新增上苗.html`**（单文件，不联网也能打开）\n\n整个弹窗按你的截图还原：标题、右上角关闭、手动/自动切换、货位分配、底部两个按钮。左侧插画换成了实时渲染的 3D 动画，风格和原图一致：白色机械臂、浅蓝关节环、浅灰蓝平台、白蓝两色疫苗盒、蓝色虚线框和向上箭头。\n\n**动画（约 7 秒循环一次）：**\n- **手动上苗**：一只手从左边把疫苗盒推到平台上，然后收回；虚线框和向上箭头闪烁提示；机械臂下降，吸盘吸住时发蓝光；抬起盒子转走，盒子淡出；机械臂回到原位，重新开始。\n- **自动上苗**：左边的皮带转动，把盒子送上平台，后面的流程和手动一样。下方文字会换成\"上苗机将自动送入疫苗盒\"。\n\n点右侧的\"手动上苗 / 自动上苗\"，动画会立刻切换。\n\n**我检查过的：** 用无头浏览器分别定格在推盒、提示、下降吸取、抬起带走、皮带送盒这几个时刻截图，每个阶段都显示正常。\n\n**给上位机开发嵌入用：**\n```js\nconst anim = FeedAnim(容器div, { mode: \"manual\" });\nanim.setMode(\"auto\");     // 切换模式\nanim.dispose();           // 关闭弹窗时释放\n```\n容器多大，画面就多大，背景是透明的，直接放在白色弹窗里就行。另外，网址后面加 `?t=秒` 可以把动画定格在某一帧，比如 `?t=4`，方便截图或检查。\n\n已提交 e581ae2。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":505,"cache_read_input_tokens":379616,"output_tokens":648,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":505,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":648,"cache_read_input_tokens":379616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":505},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2f4f2248-a9a4-465c-830b-5eb9893e2f7a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGoxFg5m4S6eDHKHmuhk","requestRef":"c837bd82-ee02-4402-8169-65ee2465b932","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"e6376752-5347-4590-8f78-ee5f10d73ce9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:34:37