{"parentUuid":"55912b1e-f6c8-4ef7-bd6d-4f7521b5d42e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14966845 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4eff3e17-859a-4a51-bf14-e12901bd590b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:58:15.889Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14966845 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"4eff3e17-859a-4a51-bf14-e12901bd590b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01FNakXphbHMiWYrFVDS1YBz","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9c0d4e2c-a241-4029-9347-489f8663e770","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:58:25.996Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"9c0d4e2c-a241-4029-9347-489f8663e770","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGqmMn82jHvbX8oQQKbM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"统计报表页做好了，浏览器里已经打开：\n\n**`docs/首页改版/统计报表.html`**（单文件，不依赖任何外部库，不联网也能打开）\n\n风格和首页改版一致，顶部导航里\"统计报表\"是选中状态。从上到下：\n\n**筛选行**：时间范围（今日 / 近 7 天 / 近 30 天 / 本月）、品种、货架，右侧是打印和导出 Excel。切换任意一项，下面所有图表、数字和明细表都会一起更新。\n\n**6 个核心指标**，都写了\"比上期\"（和前一个同样长度的周期比）：上苗、发苗、退苗、入库一次成功率、平均单盒用时、作业时长。变好显示绿色 ▲，变差显示红色 ▼。注意单盒用时是**变少才算好**，已经按这个方向处理。\n\n**图表：**\n\n| 图 | 回答的问题 |\n|---|---|\n| 出入库趋势 | 每天上苗、发苗、退苗各多少（三色柱并排，共用一根纵轴） |\n| 在库品种构成 | 现在库里哪种疫苗最多 |\n| 入库丢回原因 | 为什么有盒子没入成功，哪个原因最多（数据来自设备的丢回事件） |\n| 单盒用时 | 设备效率有没有变慢，红色虚线是 45 秒警戒线 |\n| 库存效期结构 | 已过期 / 30 天内 / 90 天内 / 正常各多少支，每档都配了图标和文字，不只靠颜色区分 |\n| 作业时段分布 | 一周里哪几天、几点最忙（热力图，颜色越深越忙） |\n| 品种发苗排名 | 哪种疫苗发得最多 |\n\n所有图都有鼠标悬停提示；单盒用时那张折线图悬停时还会出现跟随的竖线。\n\n**每日明细表**：和上面图表用的是同一份数据，带合计行，可以直接导出 CSV（Excel 能打开，中文不会乱码）。\n\n**说明：**\n- 数据是演示数据，前后都对得上，比如上苗指标 192 和明细表合计 192 一致。\n- 配色用脚本做过色盲校验。发苗的青色在白底上对比度略低，所以柱顶直接标了数值，明细表也能兜底。\n- 打印时会自动隐藏导航和按钮。\n\n已提交 f45a69c。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":597,"cache_read_input_tokens":452297,"output_tokens":840,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":597,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":840,"cache_read_input_tokens":452297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":597},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"353c9bef-d55b-484d-a39b-8cbab52538c3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGqmML6KJWhZwixF5Zzb","requestRef":"8b6