{"parentUuid":"d1137edf-cc34-4171-8d80-5826138839eb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGsrRr5VHGoEqo8xYt3f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2692,"cache_read_input_tokens":466023,"output_tokens":1448,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":509},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2692,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1448,"cache_read_input_tokens":466023,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2692,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2692},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":14018,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"96d8729e-e950-45fa-8729-cf5d672d1978","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGsrRSGBT5tXtGD2EexW","requestRef":"f03b3983-1eac-4710-8654-c4563b4b2a54","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"11a79534-0fb9-4354-a6e0-7a75e1f38686","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:25:53.615Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"11a79534-0fb9-4354-a6e0-7a75e1f38686","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGsrRr5VHGoEqo8xYt3f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"记得。之前的结论是：第 14 条是 🟡。已有的第三方报告满足\"100% 负载\"和\"CMA/CNAS\"，但测的是**位置**准确度和重复性（国标第 7.2 条），**缺少**招标点名的**距离**准确度和重复性（第 7.3 条）。\n\n你新放进来的 `GCR10-1300性能测试报告(含距离）.pdf` 我刚读完，结论是：**内容补上了，但报告本身不符合要求**。\n\n**内容上：满足**\n第五项\"距离准确度与重复性\"在 100% 负载、三档速度下各测 30 次，全部合格：\n\n| 速度 | 距离准确度 | 距离重复性 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 10% | 0.997 mm | 0.030 mm |\n| 50% | 0.794 mm | 0.050 mm |\n| 100% | 0.749 mm | 0.046 mm |\n| 验收指标 | ≤ 1.5 mm | ≤ 0.1 mm |\n\n**形式上：不符合第 14 条的硬性要求**\n招标原文要求\"**第三方**具有 **CMA 或 CNAS 标识**的负载测试报告\"。这份报告是**中科新松（DUCO）内部的研发技术文件**：\n- 封面写着\"研发技术文件\"，密级是\"G1-Internal Use Only 内部公开\"，是厂家自测，不是第三方出具的。\n- 没有 CMA、CNAS 标识，也没有检测机构的公章。\n- 校对、审核、批准栏都是空的；日期只写了\"4 月 16 日\"，没有年份。\n- 仪器清单里激光跟踪仪的\"校准有效截止日期\"写的是\"/\"。\n\n第 14 条带 ★，属于实质性条款，**不满足可能直接废标**。拿这份当第三方报告交上去，风险很大。\n\n**建议**（按优先顺序）：\n1. **请 DUCO 送第三方补测**：按这份报告第五项的方法，在 CMA/CNAS 实验室做一次，或者请之前出具 7.2 报告的上海电器设备检测所补做第 7.3 条。DUCO 内部已经测过、结果合格，送检的风险很小，主要是时间和费用。\n2. **答疑期书面确认**：问招标方\"第三方 CMA 报告（位置准确度和重复性）加上厂家自测报告（距离准确度和重复性）\"能否满足第 14 条。\n3. 这份内部报告可以作为**补充材料**附上，证明设备性能确实达标，但不能代替第三方报告。\n\n要我把这个结论更新到 `docs/招标参数对照_疫苗仓储机器人.md` 的第 14 条说明里吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2692,"cache_read_input_tokens":466023,"output_tokens":1448,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":509},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2692,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1448,"cache_read_input_tokens":466023,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2692,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2692},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"96d8729e-e950-45fa-8729-cf5d672d1978","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGsrRSGBT5tXtGD2EexW","requestRef":"f03b3983-1eac-4710-8654-c4563b4b2a54","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8a9f1371-6f67-4b1f-989c-ba561c64218b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:25:54.135Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
