{"parentUuid":"9f776ede-8f6f-414a-9e2c-67b42a9c5d53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGssjgf6AkD1fSQEUdgm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2161,"cache_read_input_tokens":468715,"output_tokens":1282,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":411},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1282,"cache_read_input_tokens":468715,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2161},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4392,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"7164ba00-9382-4d89-934b-c673ab3aac94","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGssii77pkzqe4uM6haQ","requestRef":"f4b1cea5-be05-4978-8ce0-46f4b737a070","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"4baa694d-2589-4624-9f6b-6feb0e36555c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:26:01.750Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"4baa694d-2589-4624-9f6b-6feb0e36555c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGssjgf6AkD1fSQEUdgm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这个要谨慎。对方说的是\"去盖 CNAS 的章\"，也就是在这份**厂家内部报告上补盖章**，不是送第三方实验室重新出具报告。这样做有两个问题，建议回复他们之前先问清楚。\n\n**1. CNAS 标识不是随便能盖的章**\nCNAS 标识只能由**获得 CNAS 认可的实验室**，用在**自己出具的、在认可范围内的检测报告**上。报告还要有实验室名称、认可编号、报告编号、检测人和批准人签字，仪器要在校准有效期内。在一份已经写好的\"研发技术文件 · 内部公开\"上补盖 CNAS 章，不是正规做法。被查出来就是**材料造假**，后果不只是废标，还可能被列入投标黑名单。\n\n**2. 即使 DUCO 自己的实验室有 CNAS 认可，也不是\"第三方\"**\n招标原文是\"**第三方**具有 CMA 或 CNAS 标识的报告\"。DUCO 是设备制造商，它自己实验室出的报告属于厂家自测，不是第三方。之前那份 7.2 报告是上海电器设备检测所出的，那才是第三方。\n\n**建议回复 DUCO 时确认三件事：**\n1. 出具报告的是哪家机构？是不是独立于 DUCO 的第三方？\n2. 这家机构的 CNAS 认可编号是多少？认可范围里有没有 GB/T 12642 的\"距离准确度和重复性\"这一项？\n3. 是由这家机构**正式重新出具**一份报告（有报告编号、签字、日期），还是只在现有文件上盖章？\n\n可以直接发这段：\n> 收到，内容我们看过了，100% 负载下的距离准确度和重复性都合格。不过招标要求的是\"第三方具有 CMA 或 CNAS 标识的报告\"，想确认一下：这次是由哪家第三方检测机构正式出具报告？能否提供机构的 CNAS 认可编号，以及认可范围里包含 GB/T 12642 距离准确度这一项？如果只是在内部报告上盖章，评审时可能会被认定为不符合，风险比较大。之前那份 7.2 报告是上海电器设备检测所出的，能不能请他们按第 7.3 条补测一份？\n\n如果对方答复后确认是第三方机构正式出具的报告，那第 14 条就能改成 ✅。到时候把新报告发我，我核对一下报告编号、认可编号、检测项和签章。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2161,"cache_read_input_tokens":468715,"output_tokens":1282,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":411},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1282,"cache_read_input_tokens":468715,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2161},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7164ba00-9382-4d89-934b-c673ab3aac94","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGssii77pkzqe4uM6haQ","requestRef":"f4b1cea5-be05-4978-8ce0-46f4b737a070","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2162a0b3-b22d-4404-b771-d3cd7f6ab417","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:26:11.374Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
