{"parentUuid":"d8aae27f-77e6-41d2-af64-1c48a17e760d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGsxbY9grmcrC57D7Fxo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**不满足。** 光加一个 CNAS 章不够，原因有两条。\n\n1. **不是第三方**：这份报告的出具方是 DUCO 自己，封面写的是\"研发技术文件\"。招标要求\"**第三方**\"出具，厂家自己出的报告，不管盖什么章，都不算第三方。\n2. **章和报告对不上**：CNAS 标识必须由获认可的检测机构用在**它自己出具的报告**上，报告上要有机构名称、认可编号、报告编号、签字。现在这份是内部文件，校对、审核、批准栏都是空的，日期也没有年份。直接加章，评审一看就会发现报告格式和章对不上。\n\n**要满足，需要的是**：由一家**独立第三方 CNAS 或 CMA 机构**按这份报告第五项的方法测试（100% 负载，距离准确度和重复性），并以**该机构的名义正式出具报告**。比如请之前出 7.2 报告的上海电器设备检测所补做一份。\n\nDUCO 内部已经测过，结果合格，送第三方检测通过的把握很大，主要是时间问题。建议马上问 DUCO 送检要多久，看能不能赶在投标截止前拿到。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1339,"cache_read_input_tokens":470876,"output_tokens":506,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":87},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1339,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":506,"cache_read_input_tokens":470876,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1339},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"89a3e053-ed89-4424-95de-c39334fcedfb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGsxbBZPjanAq5u99L6v","requestRef":"a9b8b28c-14df-4295-8169-be23dcb4d79c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"d386c5ac-0c88-406c-b6c1-7c749e543f88","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:27:08.898Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-41