{"parentUuid":"cd91bfb1-b1b8-44e4-8f34-0d740416a361","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGtcvkrfRfQ6nGw4reKw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你说得有道理，这里分两层看。\n\n**括号里的形式要求，外发报告满足。**\n\"第三方、有 CMA 或 CNAS 标识、负载测试报告\"这三点，之前那份上海电器设备检测所的报告都符合，而且测的就是 100% 负载。\n\n**正文点名的测试项目，外发报告严格来说没有覆盖。**\n正文写的是\"通过 100% 负载测试，**包括但不限于距离准确度、距离重复性测试**\"。外发报告测的是\"**位置**准确度和重复性\"，报告里没有出现\"距离\"这两个字。评审如果拿着条款逐字对照，就可能认定缺项。\n\n**所以结论是：**\n- 评审只看\"有没有第三方负载测试报告\"：外发报告就够了。\n- 评审逐项核对\"距离准确度、距离重复性\"：外发报告会被扣。\n\n**建议的提交方式**（不用等送检）：\n1. **主证明**：外发的第三方报告，满足第三方、CMA/CNAS、100% 负载。\n2. **补充证明**：DUCO 这份内部报告**原样附上，不加 CNAS 章**，作为\"厂家距离准确度和重复性测试数据\"，证明这两项同样合格。\n3. 答疑期如果还来得及，书面问一句：\"位置准确度和重复性的第三方报告，是否满足第 14 条？\"拿到肯定答复，就完全没有风险了。\n\n这样提交既真实，又把能拿出来的证据都摆上了。要不要我按这个结论更新招标对照文档里的第 14 条？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":565,"cache_read_input_tokens":472215,"output_tokens":1051,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":506},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":565,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1051,"cache_read_input_tokens":472215,"cache_creation_input_tokens":565,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":565},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b8841d5c-ce02-4b3f-a3ed-ea790a8ab72f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGtcbrJXJgRmKShWwdFy","requestRef":"0fba2b82-fe55-4ae2-a26f-324bc11366e9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"7a46fc2b-ab47-4f2e-aab5-5e06cff1ef16","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:35