{"parentUuid":"02316655-e96f-40f6-a443-f737d4b32ebc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGuyMLsqiLjxdkcT2961","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"cache_read_input_tokens":509656,"output_tokens":17627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1154},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4245,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":17627,"cache_read_input_tokens":509656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4245},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12967,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"3887ec39-a727-42e6-9864-a5dc7910de42","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGuyJPHjiz9RCKGvvnXj","requestRef":"3ef10fe1-7ac3-423e-87a1-05b4aef6e602","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"084d6fb1-7a6a-4244-881f-12301c507817","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:53:40.331Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"084d6fb1-7a6a-4244-881f-12301c507817","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGuyMLsqiLjxdkcT2961","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先说这页的问题和改法，HTML 一起给。\n\n**现在的问题**\n- **最要紧的事不显眼**：3 个批次**全部过期**，但只在状态列里各有一个小红标签。顶部\"临期/过期 3\"也只是 6 个数字中的一个。\n- **数字重复**：库存总量 33 和可用 33、容量占比 1.1% 和预估容量约 2787，是两两相关的数，却各占一格。\n- **按钮太多**：6 个按钮用了 3 种颜色，看不出哪个是主要操作。\n- **看不到货在哪**：货位只写了\"A-L10\"，看不出在格口里的哪一列；同一批货分在两列时也看不出来。\n- **\"调试\"标签含义不清**，规格文字被截断，下半屏空着。\n\n**改法**\n1. **按钮**：只留\"新增库存\"和\"盘点\"两个主按钮，其他收进\"⋯\"菜单。\n2. **数字合成 4 张卡片，点卡片就能筛选**：在库（可用 / 锁定）、容量（33 / 2787 带进度条）、已过期（红）、临期（橙）。\n3. **过期提醒条**：列表上方一条红色提示\"3 批已过期，共 33 支\"，右侧放\"一键退苗\"按钮。\n4. **按品种分组**：每个品种一个标题行，下面列出批次。每个批次显示有效期倒计时（\"已过期 84 天\"），以及具体位置标签，比如\"A-L10 · 第 2 列 · 4 支\"。锁定和退苗按钮直接放在行内。\n5. **新增\"货架视图\"**：用货架正面图显示货在哪。点一个格口，就能看到格口内从左到右每一列放的是什么。这也对应标书第 18 条的\"可视化定位\"。\n\n数据用的是设备上 A-L10 的真实库存。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"cache_read_input_tokens":509656,"output_tokens":17627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1154},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4245,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":17627,"cache_read_input_tokens":509656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4245},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3887ec39-a727-42e6-9864-a5dc7910de42","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGuyJPHjiz9RCKGvvnXj","requestRef":"3ef10fe1-7ac3-423e-87a1-05b4aef6e602","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b3fe72c6-1d37-49e6-9cdc-60437327cfea","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:53:48.275Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"b3fe72c6-1d37-49e6-9cdc-60437327cfea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGuyMLsqiLjxdkcT2961","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FiLSetvirYs7rJGKw1CPbw","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/首页改版/库存管理.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>库存管理</title>\n<!--\n  库存管理页优化(数据取自 2026-10-22 设备 A-L10 实际库存, 无外部依赖)\n  ① 两个主按钮 + ⋯ 菜单  ② 4 张可点筛选的指标卡  ③ 过期提醒条(一键退苗)\n  ④ 列表: 按品种分组 → 批次行(有效期倒计时 / 具体到列的货位 / 行内锁定·退苗)\n  ⑤ 货架视图: 正面格口图, 点格口看格内从左到右各列(俯视)\n  触控: 可点区域 ≥44px, 整行点开详情抽屉\n-->\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f1f4f9;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f2633;--ink2:#5d6b7e;--ink3:#98a3b3;--line:#e6eaf0;\n  --blue:#1f6fff;--blue2:#e8f0ff;--green:#16a34a;--green2:#e8f7ee;--orange:#f08a24;--orange2:#fff3e6;--red:#e5484d;--red2:#fdecec;--gray2:#f1f4f8;\n  --num:\"DIN Alternate\",\"Bahnschrift\",\"Roboto Condensed\",\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.45 -apple-system,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\nbutton{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;touch-action:manipulation}\n\n.top{flex:none;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 20px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}\n.logo svg{width:26px;height:26px}\n.logo sup{font-size:10px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;margin-left:2px}\n.top .sp{flex:1}\n.top .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);font-family:var(--num)}\n.chip{font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--green2);color:var(--green);font-weight:600}\n.ibtn{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ink2);position:relative}\n.ibtn:active{background:#eef2f7}\n.ibtn svg{width:21px;height:21px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n.ibtn b{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px;min-width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font:700 10px/16px var(--num);text-align:center}\n.me{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px}\n.me span{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center}\n\nmain{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:12px 20px 0;gap:10px}\n.head{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.head h1{font-size:21px}\n.tabs{display:flex;background:#e6ebf2;border-radius:12px;padding:3px}\n.tabs button{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.tabs button svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n.tabs button.on{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,40,80,.1)}\n.head .sp{flex:1}\n.btn{height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;white-space:nowrap}\n.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.2}\n.btn.pri{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n.btn.danger{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);color:#fff}\n.btn.ghost{border-color:#c9dbff;color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue2)}\n.btn.sm{height:36px;padding:0 12px;font-size:13.5px;border-radius:10px}\n.btn:active{transform:scale(.98)}\n.more{position:relative}\n.menu{position:absolute;right:0;top:50px;z-index:30;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(20,40,80,.18);padding:6px;min-width:200px;display:none}\n.menu.on{display:block}\n.menu button{width:100%;height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px}\n.menu button:active{background:#f1f4f9}\n.menu svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:var(--ink2);fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n\n/* 指标卡(可点 = 筛选) */\n.stats{flex:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n.st{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 16px;text-align:left;border:2px solid transparent;min-height:70px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.st.on{border-color:var(--blue)}\n.st .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.st .v{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}\n.st .v b{font:700 28px/1.05 var(--num)}\n.st .v span{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.st .bar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e9eef5;margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden}\n.st .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--blue);border-radius:3px;min-width:4px}\n.st.red .v b{color:var(--red)}.st.red.on{border-color:var(--red)}\n.st.orange .v b{color:var(--orange)}.st.orange.on{border-color:var(--orange)}\n\n.alert{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 10px 8px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--red2);color:#b4252a;border:1px solid #f6c9ca}\n.alert svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2;flex:none}\n.alert .t{flex:1;font-size:14.5px}\n.alert b{font-family:var(--num);font-size:16px}\n\n.filters{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}\n.filters::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.search{flex:0 0 280px;height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.search input{border:0;outline:0;font:inherit;font-size:14.5px;flex:1;min-width:0;background:none;color:var(--ink)}\n.search svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n.fc{flex:none;height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap}\n.fc.on{background:var(--blue2);border-color:#bcd2ff;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}\n.fc svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n\n/* 列表 */\n.panel{flex:1;min-height:0;background:#fff;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}\n.scroll{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain}\n.thead,.brow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,1.2fr) 150px minmax(200px,1.8fr) 96px 156px 22px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:0 18px}\n.thead{flex:none;height:40px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fafbfd}\n.grp{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 18px;background:rgba(247,249,252,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.grp .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}\n.grp b{font-size:15.5px}\n.grp .s{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;min-width:0;flex:1}\n.grp .tot{font:700 17px var(--num);white-space:nowrap}\n.grp .tot span{font:400 12px inherit;color:var(--ink3);margin-left:2px}\n.brow{min-height:64px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f4f8;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n.brow:active{background:#f3f7ff}\n.brow.sel{background:#eef4ff}\n.b1{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;font-family:var(--num);letter-spacing:.02em}\n.b2{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.exp b{font:600 15px var(--num)}\n.exp .cd{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.exp .cd.red{color:var(--red)}.exp .cd.orange{color:var(--orange)}.exp .cd.ok{color:var(--ink3);font-weight:400}\n.dbg{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:0 5px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--orange2);color:#c46a0c;margin-left:4px;vertical-align:1px}\n.locs{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.loc{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:30px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--gray2);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);white-space:nowrap}\n.loc b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n.loc svg{width:13px;height:13px;stroke:var(--blue);fill:none;stroke-width:2.2}\n.loc:active{background:var(--blue2)}\n.qty b{font:700 20px var(--num)}\n.qty span{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.qty .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.ops{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:flex-end}\n.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:24px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.pill i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}\n.pill.red{background:var(--red2);color:var(--red)}.pill.orange{background:var(--orange2);color:#c46a0c}.pill.ok{background:var(--green2);color:var(--green)}.pill.lock{background:#eef1f6;color:var(--ink2)}\n.chev{color:#c4cbd6;font-size:22px;text-align:center}\n.foot{height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}\n\n/* 货架视图 */\n.shelfwrap{flex:1;min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(300px,420px) 1fr;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;overflow:auto}\n.sh{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr 1fr;gap:5px 8px;align-content:start}\n.sh .h{text-align:center;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);padding-bottom:4px}\n.sh .l{font:600 12px/38px var(--num);color:var(--ink3);text-align:right}\n.cell{height:38px;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e7ee;background:#fafbfd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;padding:0 6px;position:relative}\n.cell i{height:20px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}\n.cell .n{margin-left:auto;font:700 13px var(--num);color:var(--ink2)}\n.cell.off{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f5f8 0 5px,#eaedf2 5px 10px);border-color:transparent;cursor:default}\n.cell.has{cursor:pointer}\n.cell.has:active{border-color:var(--blue)}\n.cell.sel{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(31,111,255,.15)}\n.cell.bad::after{content:\"!\";position:absolute;right:-6px;top:-6px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font:700 11px/16px var(--num);text-align:center}\n.slotd h3{font-size:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.slotd .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3);margin:2px 0 12px}\n.topv{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:#fafbfd;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.cols{margin-top:12px;display:grid;gap:8px}\n.col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:14px 1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;background:#f7f9fc}\n.col i{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px}\n.col .c1{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\n.col .c2{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.col b{font:700 18px var(--num)}\n.legend{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:10px}\n.legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}\n\n.nav{flex:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 10px calc(4px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}\n.nav button{flex:1;max-width:120px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2)}\n.nav button svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n.nav button.on{color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue2);font-weight:600}\n\n.mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,30,50,.25);z-index:40;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.2s}\n.mask.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n.drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:min(460px,92vw);background:#fff;z-index:41;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:-12px 0 40px rgba(20,40,80,.15)}\n.drawer.on{transform:none}\n.dh{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px 10px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.dh h3{font-size:18px;flex:1}\n.db{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:16px 22px}\n.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:10px 12px;font-size:14px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.kv dt{color:var(--ink3)}\n.df{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 22px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.df .btn{flex:1;justify-content:center}\n\n@media (max-width:1100px){.thead,.brow{grid-template-columns:minmax(130px,1fr) 128px minmax(150px,1.4fr) 76px 120px 18px}.ops .btn.sm span{display:none}.nav button span{font-size:11px}}\n@media (max-width:860px){.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.shelfwrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .thead{display:none}.brow{grid-template-columns:1fr auto 18px;grid-template-areas:\"a q c\" \"e e c\" \"l l c\" \"o o c\";padding:10px 16px;row-gap:6px}\n  .brow>:nth-child(1){grid-area:a}.brow>:nth-child(2){grid-area:e}.brow>:nth-child(3){grid-area:l}.brow>:nth-child(4){grid-area:q}.brow>:nth-child(5){grid-area:o}.brow>:nth-child(6){grid-area:c}\n  .ops{justify-content:flex-start}}\n@media (max-width:640px){.top .meta,.chip,.me b{display:none}main{padding:10px 12px 0}.head .btn .lbl{display:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"logo\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><path d=\"M6 26l14-16 4 4-14 16z\" fill=\"#f5a623\"/><path d=\"M16 30L32 8l3 3-16 22z\" fill=\"#1f6fff\"/><path d=\"M12 32h22\" stroke=\"#1f6fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>冷链自动发苗机器人<sup>1.0</sup></div>\n  <div class=\"sp\"></div>\n  <span class=\"meta\" id=\"clock\">2026-10-22 15:52:56</span><span class=\"chip\">本地业务</span>\n  <button class=\"ibtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 9V4h5M20 9V4h-5M4 15v5h5M20 15v5h-5\"/></svg></button>\n  <button class=\"ibtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 8a6 6 0 1 1 12 0c0 7 3 8 3 8H3s3-1 3-8M10 20a2 2 0 0 0 4 0\"/></svg><b>1</b></button>\n  <div class=\"me\"><span>若</span><b>若依</b></div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>库存管理</h1>\n    <div class=\"tabs\" id=\"view\">\n      <button class=\"on\" data-v=\"list\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 6h12M8 12h12M8 18h12M4 6h.01M4 12h.01M4 18h.01\"/></svg>批次列表</button>\n      <button data-v=\"shelf\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 3h16v18H4zM4 9h16M4 15h16M12 3v18\"/></svg>货架视图</button>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"sp\"></span>\n    <button class=\"btn pri\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg><span class=\"lbl\">新增库存</span></button>\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 4h6v3H9zM6 6h12v15H6zM9 13l2 2 4-4\"/></svg><span class=\"lbl\">盘点</span></button>\n    <div class=\"more\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"moreBtn\" aria-label=\"更多\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/></svg></button>\n      <div class=\"menu\" id=\"menu\">\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 2M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7M3 4v4h4\"/></svg>历史库存变更</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg>锁苗管理</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5\"/></svg>库存预警设置</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3v12M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 21h14\"/></svg>导出数据</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\"></div>\n  <div class=\"alert\" id=\"alert\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"filters\" id=\"filters\">\n    <label class=\"search\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"M20 20l-4-4\"/></svg><input id=\"q\" placeholder=\"搜索疫苗 / 批号 / 厂家 / 货位\"></label>\n    <button class=\"fc on\" data-f=\"all\">全部</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"exp\">已过期</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"soon\">临期 90 天内</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"ok\">正常</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"lock\">已锁定</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M7 12h10M10 18h4\"/></svg>更多筛选</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"listPanel\">\n    <div class=\"thead\"><span>批号</span><span>有效期</span><span>货位（格口 · 列）</span><span>数量</span><span>操作</span><span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"scroll\" id=\"scroll\"></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"shelfPanel\" style=\"display:none\">\n    <div class=\"shelfwrap\"><div><div class=\"sh\" id=\"sh\"></div>\n      <div class=\"legend\" id=\"lg\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"slotd\" id=\"slotd\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\"></nav>\n<div class=\"mask\" id=\"mask\"></div>\n<aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\">\n  <div class=\"dh\"><h3 id=\"dt\">批次详情</h3><button class=\"ibtn\" id=\"close\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg></button></div>\n  <div class=\"db\" id=\"dbody\"></div>\n  <div class=\"df\" id=\"dfoot\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id), p2 = n => String(n).padStart(2, \"0\");\n  const TODAY = new Date(2026, 9, 22), CAP = 2787;\n  // 设备 A-L10 实际库存(2026-10-22): 列 = 格口内横向位置 x_mm 上的一队同规格盒\n  const VAC = {\n    ipv: { name: \"Sabin株脊髓灰质炎灭活疫苗(Vero细胞)\", short: \"脊灰(Sabin)\", maker: \"北京生物制品研究所\", spec: \"0.5mL/支。每1次人用剂量0.5mL，含脊髓灰质炎病毒抗原量为Ⅰ型15DU，Ⅱ型45DU，Ⅲ型45DU。\", color: \"#8b5cf6\", box: [133, 38, 25] },\n    mmr: { name: \"麻腮风联合减毒活疫苗\", short: \"麻腮风\", maker: \"上海生物制品研究所\", spec: \"0.5ml（1人份）\", color: \"#1f6fff\", box: [60, 38.5, 22.4] },\n  };\n  const LOTS = [\n    { v: \"ipv\", lot: \"C202407009\", exp: \"2026-07-30\", dbg: true, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -141.7, n: 4 }] },\n    { v: \"mmr\", lot: \"202503015\", exp: \"2026-09-03\", dbg: true, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -37.2, n: 7 }] },\n    { v: \"mmr\", lot: \"202504034\", exp: \"2026-10-20\", dbg: false, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -246.2, n: 16 }, { slot: \"A-L10\", x: 30.8, n: 6 }] },\n  ];\n  const SLOT_GEOM = { \"A-L10\": { l: -276.2, r: 291.8, depth: 389.6 } };\n  const EN = new Set([\"L2\", \"L6\", \"R2\", \"R4\", \"R6\", ...[8, 9, 10, 11, 12].flatMap(l => [\"L\" + l, \"R\" + l])]);\n  const days = s => Math.round((new Date(s) - TODAY) / 864e5);\n  const qty = l => l.cols.reduce((a, c) => a + c.n, 0);\n  const state = l => { const d = days(l.exp); return d < 0 ? \"exp\" : d <= 90 ? \"soon\" : \"ok\"; };\n  // 格口内列序号(从左往右 1,2,3...)\n  const colNo = (slot, x) => { const xs = LOTS.flatMap(l => l.cols).filter(c => c.slot === slot).map(c => c.x).sort((a, b) => a - b); return xs.indexOf(x) + 1; };\n\n  // ── 指标卡 ──\n  let filter = \"all\", q = \"\", selLot = null;\n  function stats() {\n    const tot = LOTS.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0), lk = LOTS.reduce((a, l) => a + l.locked, 0);\n    const ex = LOTS.filter(l => state(l) === \"exp\"), sn = LOTS.filter(l => state(l) === \"soon\");\n    $(\"stats\").innerHTML = `\n      <button class=\"st${filter === \"all\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"all\"><div class=\"k\">在库</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${tot}</b><span>支 · 可用 ${tot - lk} · 锁定 ${lk}</span></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st\" data-f=\"cap\"><div class=\"k\">库位容量</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${(tot / CAP * 100).toFixed(1)}%</b><span>${tot} / 约 ${CAP.toLocaleString()} 支</span></div><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:${tot / CAP * 100}%\"></i></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st red${filter === \"exp\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"exp\"><div class=\"k\">已过期</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${ex.length}</b><span>批 · ${ex.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</span></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st orange${filter === \"soon\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"soon\"><div class=\"k\">临期 90 天内</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${sn.length}</b><span>批 · ${sn.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</span></div></button>`;\n    $(\"alert\").style.display = ex.length ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    $(\"alert\").innerHTML = `<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"t\"><b>${ex.length}</b> 批已过期，共 <b>${ex.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)}</b> 支，都在 A-L10，过期疫苗不会被发出，请尽快退苗</span>\n      <button class=\"btn danger sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 14L4 9l5-5M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3\"/></svg>一键退苗</button>`;\n  }\n  const setFilter = f => { if (f === \"cap\") return; filter = f; document.querySelectorAll(\".fc[data-f]\").forEach(b => b.classList.toggle(\"on\", b.dataset.f === f)); stats(); list(); };\n  $(\"stats\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\".st\"); if (b) setFilter(b.dataset.f === filter ? \"all\" : b.dataset.f); };\n  $(\"filters\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\".fc[data-f]\"); if (b) setFilter(b.dataset.f); };\n  $(\"q\").oninput = e => { q = e.target.value.trim().toLowerCase(); list(); };\n\n  // ── 列表: 品种分组 → 批次 ──\n  function expHtml(l) {\n    const d = days(l.exp), s = state(l);\n    const cd = s === \"exp\" ? `<span class=\"cd red\">已过期 ${-d} 天</span>` : s === \"soon\" ? `<span class=\"cd orange\">剩 ${d} 天</span>` : `<span class=\"cd ok\">剩 ${d} 天</span>`;\n    return `<div class=\"exp\"><b>${l.exp}</b>${l.dbg ? `<span class=\"dbg\" title=\"调试模式录入的有效期\">调试</span>` : \"\"}<br>${cd}</div>`;\n  }\n  function list() {\n    const rows = LOTS.map((l, i) => ({ ...l, i })).filter(l => {\n      if (filter === \"lock\" && !l.locked) return false;\n      if ([\"exp\", \"soon\", \"ok\"].includes(filter) && state(l) !== filter) return false;\n      const V = VAC[l.v];\n      return !q || (V.name + V.maker + l.lot + l.cols.map(c => c.slot).join()).toLowerCase().includes(q);\n    });\n    let h = \"\";\n    for (const k of Object.keys(VAC)) {\n      const g = rows.filter(r => r.v === k); if (!g.length) continue;\n      const V = VAC[k];\n      h += `<div class=\"grp\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:${V.color}\"></span><b>${V.name}</b><span class=\"s\">${V.maker} · ${V.spec}</span><span class=\"tot\">${g.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)}<span>支 · ${g.length} 批</span></span></div>`;\n      for (const l of g) {\n        const s = state(l);\n        h += `<div class=\"brow${selLot === l.i ? \" sel\" : \"\"}\" data-i=\"${l.i}\">\n          <div><div class=\"b1\">${l.lot}</div><div class=\"b2\">${s === \"exp\" ? `<span class=\"pill red\"><i></i>过期</span>` : s === \"soon\" ? `<span class=\"pill orange\"><i></i>临期</span>` : `<span class=\"pill ok\"><i></i>正常</span>`}${l.locked ? ` <span class=\"pill lock\">锁定 ${l.locked}</span>` : \"\"}</div></div>\n          ${expHtml(l)}\n          <div class=\"locs\">${l.cols.map(c => `<span class=\"loc\" data-slot=\"${c.slot}\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s7-6 7-11a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 5 7 11 7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg><b>${c.slot}</b>第 ${colNo(c.slot, c.x)} 列 · ${c.n} 支</span>`).join(\"\")}</div>\n          <div class=\"qty\"><b>${qty(l)}</b><span>支</span><div class=\"sub\">可用 ${qty(l) - l.locked}</div></div>\n          <div class=\"ops\">${s === \"exp\" ? `<button class=\"btn sm danger\" data-act=\"ret\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 14L4 9l5-5M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3\"/></svg><span>退苗</span></button>` : \"\"}\n            <button class=\"btn sm\" data-act=\"lock\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg><span>锁定</span></button></div>\n          <div class=\"chev\">›</div></div>`;\n      }\n    }\n    $(\"scroll\").innerHTML = (h || `<div class=\"foot\">没有符合条件的批次</div>`) + (h ? `<div class=\"foot\">共 ${rows.length} 个批次 · ${rows.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</div>` : \"\");\n  }\n  $(\"scroll\").onclick = e => {\n    const loc = e.target.closest(\".loc\"); if (loc) { showShelf(loc.dataset.slot); return; }\n    const act = e.target.closest(\"[data-act]\"); if (act) { e.stopPropagation(); act.textContent = act.dataset.act === \"ret\" ? \"已加入退苗\" : \"已锁定\"; return; }\n    const r = e.target.closest(\".brow\"); if (r) openLot(+r.dataset.i);\n  };\n\n  // ── 货架视图 ──\n  let selSlot = \"A-L10\";\n  function shelf() {\n    let h = `<span></span><span class=\"h\">左列 L</span><span class=\"h\">右列 R</span>`;\n    for (let l = 13; l >= 1; l--) {\n      h += `<span class=\"l\">${l}</span>`;\n      for (const c of [\"L\", \"R\"]) {\n        const name = `A-${c}${l}`, en = EN.has(c + l), cols = LOTS.flatMap(x => x.cols.map(cc => ({ ...cc, lot: x }))).filter(cc => cc.slot === name);\n        const n = cols.reduce((a, cc) => a + cc.n, 0), bad = cols.some(cc => state(cc.lot) === \"exp\");\n        h += en ? `<div class=\"cell${n ? \" has\" : \"\"}${selSlot === name ? \" sel\" : \"\"}${bad ? \" bad\" : \"\"}\" data-s=\"${name}\">${cols.sort((a, b) => a.x - b.x).map(cc => `<i style=\"width:${Math.max(6, cc.n * 2)}px;background:${VAC[cc.lot.v].color};opacity:${state(cc.lot) === \"exp\" ? .45 : 1}\"></i>`).join(\"\")}<span class=\"n\">${n || \"\"}</span></div>`\n          : `<div class=\"cell off\" title=\"${name} 未启用\"></div>`;\n      }\n    }\n    $(\"sh\").innerHTML = h;\n    $(\"lg\").innerHTML = Object.values(VAC).map(V => `<span><i style=\"background:${V.color}\"></i>${V.short}</span>`).join(\"\") + `<span><i style=\"background:#cfd6e0\"></i>浅色 = 已过期</span><span><i style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f5f8 0 3px,#dfe3ea 3px 6px)\"></i>未启用</span>`;\n    slotDetail(selSlot);\n  }\n  function slotDetail(name) {\n    const g = SLOT_GEOM[name] || { l: -280, r: 290, depth: 400 };\n    const cols = LOTS.flatMap(x => x.cols.map(cc => ({ ...cc, lot: x }))).filter(cc => cc.slot === name).sort((a, b) => a.x - b.x);\n    if (!cols.length) { $(\"slotd\").innerHTML = `<h3>${name}</h3><div class=\"k\">这个格口是空的</div>`; return; }\n    // 俯视图: 横向 = 格口左右, 纵向 = 深度(上=背板, 下=格口门口)\n    const W = 600, H = 300, pad = 30, sx = (W - 2 * pad) / (g.r - g.l + 60), X = x => pad + (x - g.l + 30) * sx, sy = (H - 2 * pad) / g.depth;\n    let s = `<rect x=\"${pad}\" y=\"${pad}\" width=\"${W - 2 * pad}\" height=\"${H - 2 * pad}\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e0ea\"/>\n      <text x=\"${W / 2}\" y=\"${pad - 10}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#98a3b3\">背板</text><text x=\"${W / 2}\" y=\"${H - 8}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#98a3b3\">格口门口（机械臂这一侧）</text>`;\n    cols.forEach((cc, k) => {\n      const [w, , t] = VAC[cc.lot.v].box, x0 = X(cc.x - w / 2), bw = w * sx, ex = state(cc.lot) === \"exp\";\n      for (let j = 0; j < cc.n; j++) s += `<rect x=\"${x0}\" y=\"${pad + 4 + j * t * sy}\" width=\"${bw}\" height=\"${t * sy - 1.5}\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"${VAC[cc.lot.v].color}\" opacity=\"${ex ? .45 : .9}\"/>`;\n      s += `<text x=\"${x0 + bw / 2}\" y=\"${pad + 4 + cc.n * t * sy + 16}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1f2633\">第 ${k + 1} 列</text>`;\n    });\n    $(\"slotd\").innerHTML = `<h3>${name}<span class=\"pill ${cols.some(c => state(c.lot) === \"exp\") ? \"red\" : \"ok\"}\"><i></i>${cols.some(c => state(c.lot) === \"exp\") ? \"有过期批次\" : \"正常\"}</span></h3>\n      <div class=\"k\">${cols.reduce((a, c) => a + c.n, 0)} 支 · ${cols.length} 列 · 俯视图（从左到右第 1、2… 列；每列从背板往外排）</div>\n      <svg class=\"topv\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${W} ${H}\">${s}</svg>\n      <div class=\"cols\">${cols.map((cc, k) => `<div class=\"col\"><i style=\"background:${VAC[cc.lot.v].color}\"></i><div><div class=\"c1\">第 ${k + 1} 列 · ${VAC[cc.lot.v].short} ${cc.lot.lot}</div><div class=\"c2\">横向 ${cc.x} mm · 有效期 ${cc.lot.exp}${state(cc.lot) === \"exp\" ? ` · <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">已过期</span>` : \"\"}</div></div><b>${cc.n}<span style=\"font:400 12px sans-serif;color:var(--ink3)\"> 支</span></b></div>`).join(\"\")}</div>`;\n  }\n  $(\"sh\").onclick = e => { const c = e.target.closest(\".cell.has\"); if (c) { selSlot = c.dataset.s; shelf(); } };\n  function showShelf(slot) { selSlot = slot; setView(\"shelf\"); }\n  function setView(v) {\n    document.querySelectorAll(\"#view button\").forEach(b => b.classList.toggle(\"on\", b.dataset.v === v));\n    $(\"listPanel\").style.display = v === \"list\" ? \"\" : \"none\"; $(\"shelfPanel\").style.display = v === \"shelf\" ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    $(\"filters\").style.display = v === \"list\" ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    if (v === \"shelf\") shelf();\n  }\n  $(\"view\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\"button\"); if (b) setView(b.dataset.v); };\n\n  // ── 批次详情抽屉 ──\n  function openLot(i) {\n    selLot = i; list(); const l = LOTS[i], V = VAC[l.v], s = state(l);\n    $(\"dt\").textContent = \"批次详情\";\n    $(\"dbody\").innerHTML = `<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">${V.name}</div><div style=\"color:var(--ink3);font-size:13px;margin:2px 0 10px\">${V.maker}</div>\n      ${expHtml(l)}\n      <dl class=\"kv\"><dt>批号</dt><dd>${l.lot}</dd><dt>规格</dt><dd>${V.spec}</dd><dt>盒尺寸</dt><dd>${V.box.join(\" × \")} mm</dd>\n        <dt>数量</dt><dd>${qty(l)} 支 · 可用 ${qty(l) - l.locked} · 锁定 ${l.locked}</dd>\n        <dt>货位</dt><dd>${l.cols.map(c => `${c.slot} 第 ${colNo(c.slot, c.x)} 列（横向 ${c.x} mm）${c.n} 支`).join(\"<br>\")}</dd>\n        <dt>有效期来源</dt><dd>${l.dbg ? \"调试模式录入（非追溯码平台）\" : \"追溯码平台\"}</dd></dl>`;\n    $(\"dfoot\").innerHTML = `<button class=\"btn\">库存变更记录</button>${s === \"exp\" ? `<button class=\"btn danger\">退苗 ${qty(l)} 支</button>` : `<button class=\"btn pri\">发苗</button>`}`;\n    $(\"drawer\").classList.add(\"on\"); $(\"mask\").classList.add(\"on\");\n  }\n  const close = () => { $(\"drawer\").classList.remove(\"on\"); $(\"mask\").classList.remove(\"on\"); };\n  $(\"mask\").onclick = close; $(\"close\").onclick = close;\n  let sx = null; $(\"drawer\").addEventListener(\"touchstart\", e => sx = e.touches[0].clientX, { passive: true });\n  $(\"drawer\").addEventListener(\"touchend\", e => { if (sx != null && e.changedTouches[0].clientX - sx > 80) close(); sx = null; });\n\n  $(\"moreBtn\").onclick = e => { e.stopPropagation(); $(\"menu\").classList.toggle(\"on\"); };\n  document.addEventListener(\"click\", () => $(\"menu\").classList.remove(\"on\"));\n  setInterval(() => { const d = new Date(); $(\"clock\").textContent = `${d.getFullYear()}-${p2(d.getMonth() + 1)}-${p2(d.getDate())} ${p2(d.getHours())}:${p2(d.getMinutes())}:${p2(d.getSeconds())}`; }, 1000);\n  const NAV = [[\"工作台\", \"M3 11l9-7 9 7v9H3z\"], [\"上苗管理\", \"M4 4h16v16H4zM9 4v8l3-2 3 2V4\"], [\"发苗管理\", \"M4 12l16-8-6 16-2-6z\"], [\"报损管理\", \"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v4\"],\n    [\"库存管理\", \"M4 5h16v4H4zM4 11h16v4H4zM4 17h16v3H4z\"], [\"设备管理\", \"M14 6l4 4-8 8H6v-4z\"], [\"货架管理\", \"M4 4h7v7H4zM13 4h7v7h-7zM4 13h7v7H4zM13 13h7v7h-7z\"],\n    [\"疫苗包装信息\", \"M5 8h14v12H5zM9 8V5h6v3M12 11v6M9 14h6\"], [\"追溯码对照\", \"M4 5v14M7 5v14M11 5v14M14 5v14M18 5v14M20 5v14\"], [\"统计报表\", \"M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 9 9h-9z\"], [\"系统管理\", \"M12 9a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zM12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3\"]];\n  $(\"nav\").innerHTML = NAV.map((n, i) => `<button class=\"${i === 4 ? \"on\" : \"\"}\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"${n[1]}\"/></svg><span>${n[0]}</span></button>`).join(\"\");\n  stats(); list();\n  if (location.hash === \"#shelf\") setView(\"shelf\");\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"cache_read_input_tokens":509656,"output_tokens":17627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1154},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4245,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":17627,"cache_read_input_tokens":509656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4245},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FiLSetvirYs7rJGKw1CPbw":{"file_path":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/首页改版/库存管理.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>库存管理</title>\n<!--\n  库存管理页优化(数据取自 2026-10-22 设备 A-L10 实际库存, 无外部依赖)\n  ① 两个主按钮 + ⋯ 菜单  ② 4 张可点筛选的指标卡  ③ 过期提醒条(一键退苗)\n  ④ 列表: 按品种分组 → 批次行(有效期倒计时 / 具体到列的货位 / 行内锁定·退苗)\n  ⑤ 货架视图: 正面格口图, 点格口看格内从左到右各列(俯视)\n  触控: 可点区域 ≥44px, 整行点开详情抽屉\n-->\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f1f4f9;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f2633;--ink2:#5d6b7e;--ink3:#98a3b3;--line:#e6eaf0;\n  --blue:#1f6fff;--blue2:#e8f0ff;--green:#16a34a;--green2:#e8f7ee;--orange:#f08a24;--orange2:#fff3e6;--red:#e5484d;--red2:#fdecec;--gray2:#f1f4f8;\n  --num:\"DIN Alternate\",\"Bahnschrift\",\"Roboto Condensed\",\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.45 -apple-system,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\nbutton{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;touch-action:manipulation}\n\n.top{flex:none;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 20px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}\n.logo svg{width:26px;height:26px}\n.logo sup{font-size:10px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;margin-left:2px}\n.top .sp{flex:1}\n.top .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);font-family:var(--num)}\n.chip{font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--green2);color:var(--green);font-weight:600}\n.ibtn{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ink2);position:relative}\n.ibtn:active{background:#eef2f7}\n.ibtn svg{width:21px;height:21px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n.ibtn b{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px;min-width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font:700 10px/16px var(--num);text-align:center}\n.me{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px}\n.me span{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center}\n\nmain{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:12px 20px 0;gap:10px}\n.head{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.head h1{font-size:21px}\n.tabs{display:flex;background:#e6ebf2;border-radius:12px;padding:3px}\n.tabs button{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.tabs button svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n.tabs button.on{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,40,80,.1)}\n.head .sp{flex:1}\n.btn{height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;white-space:nowrap}\n.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.2}\n.btn.pri{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n.btn.danger{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);color:#fff}\n.btn.ghost{border-color:#c9dbff;color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue2)}\n.btn.sm{height:36px;padding:0 12px;font-size:13.5px;border-radius:10px}\n.btn:active{transform:scale(.98)}\n.more{position:relative}\n.menu{position:absolute;right:0;top:50px;z-index:30;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(20,40,80,.18);padding:6px;min-width:200px;display:none}\n.menu.on{display:block}\n.menu button{width:100%;height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px}\n.menu button:active{background:#f1f4f9}\n.menu svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:var(--ink2);fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n\n/* 指标卡(可点 = 筛选) */\n.stats{flex:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n.st{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 16px;text-align:left;border:2px solid transparent;min-height:70px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.st.on{border-color:var(--blue)}\n.st .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.st .v{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}\n.st .v b{font:700 28px/1.05 var(--num)}\n.st .v span{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.st .bar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e9eef5;margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden}\n.st .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--blue);border-radius:3px;min-width:4px}\n.st.red .v b{color:var(--red)}.st.red.on{border-color:var(--red)}\n.st.orange .v b{color:var(--orange)}.st.orange.on{border-color:var(--orange)}\n\n.alert{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 10px 8px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--red2);color:#b4252a;border:1px solid #f6c9ca}\n.alert svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2;flex:none}\n.alert .t{flex:1;font-size:14.5px}\n.alert b{font-family:var(--num);font-size:16px}\n\n.filters{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}\n.filters::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.search{flex:0 0 280px;height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.search input{border:0;outline:0;font:inherit;font-size:14.5px;flex:1;min-width:0;background:none;color:var(--ink)}\n.search svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n.fc{flex:none;height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap}\n.fc.on{background:var(--blue2);border-color:#bcd2ff;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}\n.fc svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n\n/* 列表 */\n.panel{flex:1;min-height:0;background:#fff;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}\n.scroll{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain}\n.thead,.brow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,1.2fr) 150px minmax(200px,1.8fr) 96px 156px 22px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:0 18px}\n.thead{flex:none;height:40px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fafbfd}\n.grp{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 18px;background:rgba(247,249,252,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.grp .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}\n.grp b{font-size:15.5px}\n.grp .s{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;min-width:0;flex:1}\n.grp .tot{font:700 17px var(--num);white-space:nowrap}\n.grp .tot span{font:400 12px inherit;color:var(--ink3);margin-left:2px}\n.brow{min-height:64px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f4f8;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n.brow:active{background:#f3f7ff}\n.brow.sel{background:#eef4ff}\n.b1{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;font-family:var(--num);letter-spacing:.02em}\n.b2{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.exp b{font:600 15px var(--num)}\n.exp .cd{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.exp .cd.red{color:var(--red)}.exp .cd.orange{color:var(--orange)}.exp .cd.ok{color:var(--ink3);font-weight:400}\n.dbg{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:0 5px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--orange2);color:#c46a0c;margin-left:4px;vertical-align:1px}\n.locs{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.loc{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:30px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--gray2);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);white-space:nowrap}\n.loc b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n.loc svg{width:13px;height:13px;stroke:var(--blue);fill:none;stroke-width:2.2}\n.loc:active{background:var(--blue2)}\n.qty b{font:700 20px var(--num)}\n.qty span{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.qty .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.ops{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:flex-end}\n.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:24px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.pill i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}\n.pill.red{background:var(--red2);color:var(--red)}.pill.orange{background:var(--orange2);color:#c46a0c}.pill.ok{background:var(--green2);color:var(--green)}.pill.lock{background:#eef1f6;color:var(--ink2)}\n.chev{color:#c4cbd6;font-size:22px;text-align:center}\n.foot{height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}\n\n/* 货架视图 */\n.shelfwrap{flex:1;min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(300px,420px) 1fr;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;overflow:auto}\n.sh{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr 1fr;gap:5px 8px;align-content:start}\n.sh .h{text-align:center;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);padding-bottom:4px}\n.sh .l{font:600 12px/38px var(--num);color:var(--ink3);text-align:right}\n.cell{height:38px;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e7ee;background:#fafbfd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;padding:0 6px;position:relative}\n.cell i{height:20px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}\n.cell .n{margin-left:auto;font:700 13px var(--num);color:var(--ink2)}\n.cell.off{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f5f8 0 5px,#eaedf2 5px 10px);border-color:transparent;cursor:default}\n.cell.has{cursor:pointer}\n.cell.has:active{border-color:var(--blue)}\n.cell.sel{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(31,111,255,.15)}\n.cell.bad::after{content:\"!\";position:absolute;right:-6px;top:-6px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font:700 11px/16px var(--num);text-align:center}\n.slotd h3{font-size:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.slotd .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3);margin:2px 0 12px}\n.topv{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:#fafbfd;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.cols{margin-top:12px;display:grid;gap:8px}\n.col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:14px 1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;background:#f7f9fc}\n.col i{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px}\n.col .c1{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\n.col .c2{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.col b{font:700 18px var(--num)}\n.legend{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:10px}\n.legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}\n\n.nav{flex:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 10px calc(4px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}\n.nav button{flex:1;max-width:120px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2)}\n.nav button svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n.nav button.on{color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue2);font-weight:600}\n\n.mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,30,50,.25);z-index:40;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.2s}\n.mask.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n.drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:min(460px,92vw);background:#fff;z-index:41;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:-12px 0 40px rgba(20,40,80,.15)}\n.drawer.on{transform:none}\n.dh{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px 10px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.dh h3{font-size:18px;flex:1}\n.db{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:16px 22px}\n.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:10px 12px;font-size:14px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.kv dt{color:var(--ink3)}\n.df{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 22px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.df .btn{flex:1;justify-content:center}\n\n@media (max-width:1100px){.thead,.brow{grid-template-columns:minmax(130px,1fr) 128px minmax(150px,1.4fr) 76px 120px 18px}.ops .btn.sm span{display:none}.nav button span{font-size:11px}}\n@media (max-width:860px){.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.shelfwrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .thead{display:none}.brow{grid-template-columns:1fr auto 18px;grid-template-areas:\"a q c\" \"e e c\" \"l l c\" \"o o c\";padding:10px 16px;row-gap:6px}\n  .brow>:nth-child(1){grid-area:a}.brow>:nth-child(2){grid-area:e}.brow>:nth-child(3){grid-area:l}.brow>:nth-child(4){grid-area:q}.brow>:nth-child(5){grid-area:o}.brow>:nth-child(6){grid-area:c}\n  .ops{justify-content:flex-start}}\n@media (max-width:640px){.top .meta,.chip,.me b{display:none}main{padding:10px 12px 0}.head .btn .lbl{display:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"logo\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><path d=\"M6 26l14-16 4 4-14 16z\" fill=\"#f5a623\"/><path d=\"M16 30L32 8l3 3-16 22z\" fill=\"#1f6fff\"/><path d=\"M12 32h22\" stroke=\"#1f6fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>冷链自动发苗机器人<sup>1.0</sup></div>\n  <div class=\"sp\"></div>\n  <span class=\"meta\" id=\"clock\">2026-10-22 15:52:56</span><span class=\"chip\">本地业务</span>\n  <button class=\"ibtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 9V4h5M20 9V4h-5M4 15v5h5M20 15v5h-5\"/></svg></button>\n  <button class=\"ibtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 8a6 6 0 1 1 12 0c0 7 3 8 3 8H3s3-1 3-8M10 20a2 2 0 0 0 4 0\"/></svg><b>1</b></button>\n  <div class=\"me\"><span>若</span><b>若依</b></div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>库存管理</h1>\n    <div class=\"tabs\" id=\"view\">\n      <button class=\"on\" data-v=\"list\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 6h12M8 12h12M8 18h12M4 6h.01M4 12h.01M4 18h.01\"/></svg>批次列表</button>\n      <button data-v=\"shelf\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 3h16v18H4zM4 9h16M4 15h16M12 3v18\"/></svg>货架视图</button>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"sp\"></span>\n    <button class=\"btn pri\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg><span class=\"lbl\">新增库存</span></button>\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 4h6v3H9zM6 6h12v15H6zM9 13l2 2 4-4\"/></svg><span class=\"lbl\">盘点</span></button>\n    <div class=\"more\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"moreBtn\" aria-label=\"更多\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/></svg></button>\n      <div class=\"menu\" id=\"menu\">\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 2M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7M3 4v4h4\"/></svg>历史库存变更</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg>锁苗管理</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5\"/></svg>库存预警设置</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3v12M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 21h14\"/></svg>导出数据</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\"></div>\n  <div class=\"alert\" id=\"alert\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"filters\" id=\"filters\">\n    <label class=\"search\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"M20 20l-4-4\"/></svg><input id=\"q\" placeholder=\"搜索疫苗 / 批号 / 厂家 / 货位\"></label>\n    <button class=\"fc on\" data-f=\"all\">全部</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"exp\">已过期</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"soon\">临期 90 天内</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"ok\">正常</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"lock\">已锁定</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M7 12h10M10 18h4\"/></svg>更多筛选</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"listPanel\">\n    <div class=\"thead\"><span>批号</span><span>有效期</span><span>货位（格口 · 列）</span><span>数量</span><span>操作</span><span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"scroll\" id=\"scroll\"></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"shelfPanel\" style=\"display:none\">\n    <div class=\"shelfwrap\"><div><div class=\"sh\" id=\"sh\"></div>\n      <div class=\"legend\" id=\"lg\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"slotd\" id=\"slotd\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\"></nav>\n<div class=\"mask\" id=\"mask\"></div>\n<aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\">\n  <div class=\"dh\"><h3 id=\"dt\">批次详情</h3><button class=\"ibtn\" id=\"close\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg></button></div>\n  <div class=\"db\" id=\"dbody\"></div>\n  <div class=\"df\" id=\"dfoot\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id), p2 = n => String(n).padStart(2, \"0\");\n  const TODAY = new Date(2026, 9, 22), CAP = 2787;\n  // 设备 A-L10 实际库存(2026-10-22): 列 = 格口内横向位置 x_mm 上的一队同规格盒\n  const VAC = {\n    ipv: { name: \"Sabin株脊髓灰质炎灭活疫苗(Vero细胞)\", short: \"脊灰(Sabin)\", maker: \"北京生物制品研究所\", spec: \"0.5mL/支。每1次人用剂量0.5mL，含脊髓灰质炎病毒抗原量为Ⅰ型15DU，Ⅱ型45DU，Ⅲ型45DU。\", color: \"#8b5cf6\", box: [133, 38, 25] },\n    mmr: { name: \"麻腮风联合减毒活疫苗\", short: \"麻腮风\", maker: \"上海生物制品研究所\", spec: \"0.5ml（1人份）\", color: \"#1f6fff\", box: [60, 38.5, 22.4] },\n  };\n  const LOTS = [\n    { v: \"ipv\", lot: \"C202407009\", exp: \"2026-07-30\", dbg: true, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -141.7, n: 4 }] },\n    { v: \"mmr\", lot: \"202503015\", exp: \"2026-09-03\", dbg: true, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -37.2, n: 7 }] },\n    { v: \"mmr\", lot: \"202504034\", exp: \"2026-10-20\", dbg: false, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -246.2, n: 16 }, { slot: \"A-L10\", x: 30.8, n: 6 }] },\n  ];\n  const SLOT_GEOM = { \"A-L10\": { l: -276.2, r: 291.8, depth: 389.6 } };\n  const EN = new Set([\"L2\", \"L6\", \"R2\", \"R4\", \"R6\", ...[8, 9, 10, 11, 12].flatMap(l => [\"L\" + l, \"R\" + l])]);\n  const days = s => Math.round((new Date(s) - TODAY) / 864e5);\n  const qty = l => l.cols.reduce((a, c) => a + c.n, 0);\n  const state = l => { const d = days(l.exp); return d < 0 ? \"exp\" : d <= 90 ? \"soon\" : \"ok\"; };\n  // 格口内列序号(从左往右 1,2,3...)\n  const colNo = (slot, x) => { const xs = LOTS.flatMap(l => l.cols).filter(c => c.slot === slot).map(c => c.x).sort((a, b) => a - b); return xs.indexOf(x) + 1; };\n\n  // ── 指标卡 ──\n  let filter = \"all\", q = \"\", selLot = null;\n  function stats() {\n    const tot = LOTS.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0), lk = LOTS.reduce((a, l) => a + l.locked, 0);\n    const ex = LOTS.filter(l => state(l) === \"exp\"), sn = LOTS.filter(l => state(l) === \"soon\");\n    $(\"stats\").innerHTML = `\n      <button class=\"st${filter === \"all\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"all\"><div class=\"k\">在库</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${tot}</b><span>支 · 可用 ${tot - lk} · 锁定 ${lk}</span></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st\" data-f=\"cap\"><div class=\"k\">库位容量</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${(tot / CAP * 100).toFixed(1)}%</b><span>${tot} / 约 ${CAP.toLocaleString()} 支</span></div><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:${tot / CAP * 100}%\"></i></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st red${filter === \"exp\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"exp\"><div class=\"k\">已过期</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${ex.length}</b><span>批 · ${ex.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</span></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st orange${filter === \"soon\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"soon\"><div class=\"k\">临期 90 天内</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${sn.length}</b><span>批 · ${sn.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</span></div></button>`;\n    $(\"alert\").style.display = ex.length ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    $(\"alert\").innerHTML = `<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"t\"><b>${ex.length}</b> 批已过期，共 <b>${ex.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)}</b> 支，都在 A-L10，过期疫苗不会被发出，请尽快退苗</span>\n      <button class=\"btn danger sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 14L4 9l5-5M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3\"/></svg>一键退苗</button>`;\n  }\n  const setFilter = f => { if (f === \"cap\") return; filter = f; document.querySelectorAll(\".fc[data-f]\").forEach(b => b.classList.toggle(\"on\", b.dataset.f === f)); stats(); list(); };\n  $(\"stats\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\".st\"); if (b) setFilter(b.dataset.f === filter ? \"all\" : b.dataset.f); };\n  $(\"filters\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\".fc[data-f]\"); if (b) setFilter(b.dataset.f); };\n  $(\"q\").oninput = e => { q = e.target.value.trim().toLowerCase(); list(); };\n\n  // ── 列表: 品种分组 → 批次 ──\n  function expHtml(l) {\n    const d = days(l.exp), s = state(l);\n    const cd = s === \"exp\" ? `<span class=\"cd red\">已过期 ${-d} 天</span>` : s === \"soon\" ? `<span class=\"cd orange\">剩 ${d} 天</span>` : `<span class=\"cd ok\">剩 ${d} 天</span>`;\n    return `<div class=\"exp\"><b>${l.exp}</b>${l.dbg ? `<span class=\"dbg\" title=\"调试模式录入的有效期\">调试</span>` : \"\"}<br>${cd}</div>`;\n  }\n  function list() {\n    const rows = LOTS.map((l, i) => ({ ...l, i })).filter(l => {\n      if (filter === \"lock\" && !l.locked) return false;\n      if ([\"exp\", \"soon\", \"ok\"].includes(filter) && state(l) !== filter) return false;\n      const V = VAC[l.v];\n      return !q || (V.name + V.maker + l.lot + l.cols.map(c => c.slot).join()).toLowerCase().includes(q);\n    });\n    let h = \"\";\n    for (const k of Object.keys(VAC)) {\n      const g = rows.filter(r => r.v === k); if (!g.length) continue;\n      const V = VAC[k];\n      h += `<div class=\"grp\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:${V.color}\"></span><b>${V.name}</b><span class=\"s\">${V.maker} · ${V.spec}</span><span class=\"tot\">${g.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)}<span>支 · ${g.length} 批</span></span></div>`;\n      for (const l of g) {\n        const s = state(l);\n        h += `<div class=\"brow${selLot === l.i ? \" sel\" : \"\"}\" data-i=\"${l.i}\">\n          <div><div class=\"b1\">${l.lot}</div><div class=\"b2\">${s === \"exp\" ? `<span class=\"pill red\"><i></i>过期</span>` : s === \"soon\" ? `<span class=\"pill orange\"><i></i>临期</span>` : `<span class=\"pill ok\"><i></i>正常</span>`}${l.locked ? ` <span class=\"pill lock\">锁定 ${l.locked}</span>` : \"\"}</div></div>\n          ${expHtml(l)}\n          <div class=\"locs\">${l.cols.map(c => `<span class=\"loc\" data-slot=\"${c.slot}\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s7-6 7-11a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 5 7 11 7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg><b>${c.slot}</b>第 ${colNo(c.slot, c.x)} 列 · ${c.n} 支</span>`).join(\"\")}</div>\n          <div class=\"qty\"><b>${qty(l)}</b><span>支</span><div class=\"sub\">可用 ${qty(l) - l.locked}</div></div>\n          <div class=\"ops\">${s === \"exp\" ? `<button class=\"btn sm danger\" data-act=\"ret\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 14L4 9l5-5M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3\"/></svg><span>退苗</span></button>` : \"\"}\n            <button class=\"btn sm\" data-act=\"lock\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg><span>锁定</span></button></div>\n          <div class=\"chev\">›</div></div>`;\n      }\n    }\n    $(\"scroll\").innerHTML = (h || `<div class=\"foot\">没有符合条件的批次</div>`) + (h ? `<div class=\"foot\">共 ${rows.length} 个批次 · ${rows.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</div>` : \"\");\n  }\n  $(\"scroll\").onclick = e => {\n    const loc = e.target.closest(\".loc\"); if (loc) { showShelf(loc.dataset.slot); return; }\n    const act = e.target.closest(\"[data-act]\"); if (act) { e.stopPropagation(); act.textContent = act.dataset.act === \"ret\" ? \"已加入退苗\" : \"已锁定\"; return; }\n    const r = e.target.closest(\".brow\"); if (r) openLot(+r.dataset.i);\n  };\n\n  // ── 货架视图 ──\n  let selSlot = \"A-L10\";\n  function shelf() {\n    let h = `<span></span><span class=\"h\">左列 L</span><span class=\"h\">右列 R</span>`;\n    for (let l = 13; l >= 1; l--) {\n      h += `<span class=\"l\">${l}</span>`;\n      for (const c of [\"L\", \"R\"]) {\n        const name = `A-${c}${l}`, en = EN.has(c + l), cols = LOTS.flatMap(x => x.cols.map(cc => ({ ...cc, lot: x }))).filter(cc => cc.slot === name);\n        const n = cols.reduce((a, cc) => a + cc.n, 0), bad = cols.some(cc => state(cc.lot) === \"exp\");\n        h += en ? `<div class=\"cell${n ? \" has\" : \"\"}${selSlot === name ? \" sel\" : \"\"}${bad ? \" bad\" : \"\"}\" data-s=\"${name}\">${cols.sort((a, b) => a.x - b.x).map(cc => `<i style=\"width:${Math.max(6, cc.n * 2)}px;background:${VAC[cc.lot.v].color};opacity:${state(cc.lot) === \"exp\" ? .45 : 1}\"></i>`).join(\"\")}<span class=\"n\">${n || \"\"}</span></div>`\n          : `<div class=\"cell off\" title=\"${name} 未启用\"></div>`;\n      }\n    }\n    $(\"sh\").innerHTML = h;\n    $(\"lg\").innerHTML = Object.values(VAC).map(V => `<span><i style=\"background:${V.color}\"></i>${V.short}</span>`).join(\"\") + `<span><i style=\"background:#cfd6e0\"></i>浅色 = 已过期</span><span><i style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f5f8 0 3px,#dfe3ea 3px 6px)\"></i>未启用</span>`;\n    slotDetail(selSlot);\n  }\n  function slotDetail(name) {\n    const g = SLOT_GEOM[name] || { l: -280, r: 290, depth: 400 };\n    const cols = LOTS.flatMap(x => x.cols.map(cc => ({ ...cc, lot: x }))).filter(cc => cc.slot === name).sort((a, b) => a.x - b.x);\n    if (!cols.length) { $(\"slotd\").innerHTML = `<h3>${name}</h3><div class=\"k\">这个格口是空的</div>`; return; }\n    // 俯视图: 横向 = 格口左右, 纵向 = 深度(上=背板, 下=格口门口)\n    const W = 600, H = 300, pad = 30, sx = (W - 2 * pad) / (g.r - g.l + 60), X = x => pad + (x - g.l + 30) * sx, sy = (H - 2 * pad) / g.depth;\n    let s = `<rect x=\"${pad}\" y=\"${pad}\" width=\"${W - 2 * pad}\" height=\"${H - 2 * pad}\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e0ea\"/>\n      <text x=\"${W / 2}\" y=\"${pad - 10}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#98a3b3\">背板</text><text x=\"${W / 2}\" y=\"${H - 8}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#98a3b3\">格口门口（机械臂这一侧）</text>`;\n    cols.forEach((cc, k) => {\n      const [w, , t] = VAC[cc.lot.v].box, x0 = X(cc.x - w / 2), bw = w * sx, ex = state(cc.lot) === \"exp\";\n      for (let j = 0; j < cc.n; j++) s += `<rect x=\"${x0}\" y=\"${pad + 4 + j * t * sy}\" width=\"${bw}\" height=\"${t * sy - 1.5}\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"${VAC[cc.lot.v].color}\" opacity=\"${ex ? .45 : .9}\"/>`;\n      s += `<text x=\"${x0 + bw / 2}\" y=\"${pad + 4 + cc.n * t * sy + 16}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1f2633\">第 ${k + 1} 列</text>`;\n    });\n    $(\"slotd\").innerHTML = `<h3>${name}<span class=\"pill ${cols.some(c => state(c.lot) === \"exp\") ? \"red\" : \"ok\"}\"><i></i>${cols.some(c => state(c.lot) === \"exp\") ? \"有过期批次\" : \"正常\"}</span></h3>\n      <div class=\"k\">${cols.reduce((a, c) => a + c.n, 0)} 支 · ${cols.length} 列 · 俯视图（从左到右第 1、2… 列；每列从背板往外排）</div>\n      <svg class=\"topv\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${W} ${H}\">${s}</svg>\n      <div class=\"cols\">${cols.map((cc, k) => `<div class=\"col\"><i style=\"background:${VAC[cc.lot.v].color}\"></i><div><div class=\"c1\">第 ${k + 1} 列 · ${VAC[cc.lot.v].short} ${cc.lot.lot}</div><div class=\"c2\">横向 ${cc.x} mm · 有效期 ${cc.lot.exp}${state(cc.lot) === \"exp\" ? ` · <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">已过期</span>` : \"\"}</div></div><b>${cc.n}<span style=\"font:400 12px sans-serif;color:var(--ink3)\"> 支</span></b></div>`).join(\"\")}</div>`;\n  }\n  $(\"sh\").onclick = e => { const c = e.target.closest(\".cell.has\"); if (c) { selSlot = c.dataset.s; shelf(); } };\n  function showShelf(slot) { selSlot = slot; setView(\"shelf\"); }\n  function setView(v) {\n    document.querySelectorAll(\"#view button\").forEach(b => b.classList.toggle(\"on\", b.dataset.v === v));\n    $(\"listPanel\").style.display = v === \"list\" ? \"\" : \"none\"; $(\"shelfPanel\").style.display = v === \"shelf\" ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    $(\"filters\").style.display = v === \"list\" ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    if (v === \"shelf\") shelf();\n  }\n  $(\"view\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\"button\"); if (b) setView(b.dataset.v); };\n\n  // ── 批次详情抽屉 ──\n  function openLot(i) {\n    selLot = i; list(); const l = LOTS[i], V = VAC[l.v], s = state(l);\n    $(\"dt\").textContent = \"批次详情\";\n    $(\"dbody\").innerHTML = `<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">${V.name}</div><div style=\"color:var(--ink3);font-size:13px;margin:2px 0 10px\">${V.maker}</div>\n      ${expHtml(l)}\n      <dl class=\"kv\"><dt>批号</dt><dd>${l.lot}</dd><dt>规格</dt><dd>${V.spec}</dd><dt>盒尺寸</dt><dd>${V.box.join(\" × \")} mm</dd>\n        <dt>数量</dt><dd>${qty(l)} 支 · 可用 ${qty(l) - l.locked} · 锁定 ${l.locked}</dd>\n        <dt>货位</dt><dd>${l.cols.map(c => `${c.slot} 第 ${colNo(c.slot, c.x)} 列（横向 ${c.x} mm）${c.n} 支`).join(\"<br>\")}</dd>\n        <dt>有效期来源</dt><dd>${l.dbg ? \"调试模式录入（非追溯码平台）\" : \"追溯码平台\"}</dd></dl>`;\n    $(\"dfoot\").innerHTML = `<button class=\"btn\">库存变更记录</button>${s === \"exp\" ? `<button class=\"btn danger\">退苗 ${qty(l)} 支</button>` : `<button class=\"btn pri\">发苗</button>`}`;\n    $(\"drawer\").classList.add(\"on\"); $(\"mask\").classList.add(\"on\");\n  }\n  const close = () => { $(\"drawer\").classList.remove(\"on\"); $(\"mask\").classList.remove(\"on\"); };\n  $(\"mask\").onclick = close; $(\"close\").onclick = close;\n  let sx = null; $(\"drawer\").addEventListener(\"touchstart\", e => sx = e.touches[0].clientX, { passive: true });\n  $(\"drawer\").addEventListener(\"touchend\", e => { if (sx != null && e.changedTouches[0].clientX - sx > 80) close(); sx = null; });\n\n  $(\"moreBtn\").onclick = e => { e.stopPropagation(); $(\"menu\").classList.toggle(\"on\"); };\n  document.addEventListener(\"click\", () => $(\"menu\").classList.remove(\"on\"));\n  setInterval(() => { const d = new Date(); $(\"clock\").textContent = `${d.getFullYear()}-${p2(d.getMonth() + 1)}-${p2(d.getDate())} ${p2(d.getHours())}:${p2(d.getMinutes())}:${p2(d.getSeconds())}`; }, 1000);\n  const NAV = [[\"工作台\", \"M3 11l9-7 9 7v9H3z\"], [\"上苗管理\", \"M4 4h16v16H4zM9 4v8l3-2 3 2V4\"], [\"发苗管理\", \"M4 12l16-8-6 16-2-6z\"], [\"报损管理\", \"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v4\"],\n    [\"库存管理\", \"M4 5h16v4H4zM4 11h16v4H4zM4 17h16v3H4z\"], [\"设备管理\", \"M14 6l4 4-8 8H6v-4z\"], [\"货架管理\", \"M4 4h7v7H4zM13 4h7v7h-7zM4 13h7v7H4zM13 13h7v7h-7z\"],\n    [\"疫苗包装信息\", \"M5 8h14v12H5zM9 8V5h6v3M12 11v6M9 14h6\"], [\"追溯码对照\", \"M4 5v14M7 5v14M11 5v14M14 5v14M18 5v14M20 5v14\"], [\"统计报表\", \"M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 9 9h-9z\"], [\"系统管理\", \"M12 9a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zM12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3\"]];\n  $(\"nav\").innerHTML = NAV.map((n, i) => `<button class=\"${i === 4 ? \"on\" : \"\"}\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"${n[1]}\"/></svg><span>${n[0]}</span></button>`).join(\"\");\n  stats(); list();\n  if (location.hash === \"#shelf\") setView(\"shelf\");\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"3887ec39-a727-42e6-9864-a5dc7910de42","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgGuyJPHjiz9RCKGvvnXj","requestRef":"3ef10fe1-7ac3-423e-87a1-05b4aef6e602","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"98d0252d-0347-4177-8288-56f94aaf11a4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:55:42.467Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"98d0252d-0347-4177-8288-56f94aaf11a4","snapshotMessageId":"9c6cf60c-eb04-4428-832a-75e8338bf580","trackingPath":"docs/首页改版/库存管理.html","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-10-22T07:55:42.502Z","realParentDir":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/首页改版"},"timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:55:42.514Z"}
{"parentUuid":"98d0252d-0347-4177-8288-56f94aaf11a4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9486496e-c08d-442e-b090-594e2d8267c5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FiLSetvirYs7rJGKw1CPbw","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/首页改版/库存管理.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"b184e544-97e3-4fae-bfc8-0d16edcd9d67","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:55:42.571Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/首页改版/库存管理.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>库存管理</title>\n<!--\n  库存管理页优化(数据取自 2026-10-22 设备 A-L10 实际库存, 无外部依赖)\n  ① 两个主按钮 + ⋯ 菜单  ② 4 张可点筛选的指标卡  ③ 过期提醒条(一键退苗)\n  ④ 列表: 按品种分组 → 批次行(有效期倒计时 / 具体到列的货位 / 行内锁定·退苗)\n  ⑤ 货架视图: 正面格口图, 点格口看格内从左到右各列(俯视)\n  触控: 可点区域 ≥44px, 整行点开详情抽屉\n-->\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f1f4f9;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f2633;--ink2:#5d6b7e;--ink3:#98a3b3;--line:#e6eaf0;\n  --blue:#1f6fff;--blue2:#e8f0ff;--green:#16a34a;--green2:#e8f7ee;--orange:#f08a24;--orange2:#fff3e6;--red:#e5484d;--red2:#fdecec;--gray2:#f1f4f8;\n  --num:\"DIN Alternate\",\"Bahnschrift\",\"Roboto Condensed\",\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.45 -apple-system,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\nbutton{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;touch-action:manipulation}\n\n.top{flex:none;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 20px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}\n.logo svg{width:26px;height:26px}\n.logo sup{font-size:10px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;margin-left:2px}\n.top .sp{flex:1}\n.top .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);font-family:var(--num)}\n.chip{font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--green2);color:var(--green);font-weight:600}\n.ibtn{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ink2);position:relative}\n.ibtn:active{background:#eef2f7}\n.ibtn svg{width:21px;height:21px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n.ibtn b{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px;min-width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font:700 10px/16px var(--num);text-align:center}\n.me{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px}\n.me span{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center}\n\nmain{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:12px 20px 0;gap:10px}\n.head{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.head h1{font-size:21px}\n.tabs{display:flex;background:#e6ebf2;border-radius:12px;padding:3px}\n.tabs button{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.tabs button svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n.tabs button.on{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,40,80,.1)}\n.head .sp{flex:1}\n.btn{height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;white-space:nowrap}\n.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.2}\n.btn.pri{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n.btn.danger{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);color:#fff}\n.btn.ghost{border-color:#c9dbff;color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue2)}\n.btn.sm{height:36px;padding:0 12px;font-size:13.5px;border-radius:10px}\n.btn:active{transform:scale(.98)}\n.more{position:relative}\n.menu{position:absolute;right:0;top:50px;z-index:30;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(20,40,80,.18);padding:6px;min-width:200px;display:none}\n.menu.on{display:block}\n.menu button{width:100%;height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px}\n.menu button:active{background:#f1f4f9}\n.menu svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:var(--ink2);fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n\n/* 指标卡(可点 = 筛选) */\n.stats{flex:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n.st{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 16px;text-align:left;border:2px solid transparent;min-height:70px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.st.on{border-color:var(--blue)}\n.st .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.st .v{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}\n.st .v b{font:700 28px/1.05 var(--num)}\n.st .v span{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.st .bar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e9eef5;margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden}\n.st .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--blue);border-radius:3px;min-width:4px}\n.st.red .v b{color:var(--red)}.st.red.on{border-color:var(--red)}\n.st.orange .v b{color:var(--orange)}.st.orange.on{border-color:var(--orange)}\n\n.alert{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 10px 8px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--red2);color:#b4252a;border:1px solid #f6c9ca}\n.alert svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2;flex:none}\n.alert .t{flex:1;font-size:14.5px}\n.alert b{font-family:var(--num);font-size:16px}\n\n.filters{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}\n.filters::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.search{flex:0 0 280px;height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.search input{border:0;outline:0;font:inherit;font-size:14.5px;flex:1;min-width:0;background:none;color:var(--ink)}\n.search svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n.fc{flex:none;height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap}\n.fc.on{background:var(--blue2);border-color:#bcd2ff;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}\n.fc svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n\n/* 列表 */\n.panel{flex:1;min-height:0;background:#fff;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}\n.scroll{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain}\n.thead,.brow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,1.2fr) 150px minmax(200px,1.8fr) 96px 156px 22px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:0 18px}\n.thead{flex:none;height:40px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fafbfd}\n.grp{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 18px;background:rgba(247,249,252,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.grp .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}\n.grp b{font-size:15.5px}\n.grp .s{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;min-width:0;flex:1}\n.grp .tot{font:700 17px var(--num);white-space:nowrap}\n.grp .tot span{font:400 12px inherit;color:var(--ink3);margin-left:2px}\n.brow{min-height:64px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f4f8;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n.brow:active{background:#f3f7ff}\n.brow.sel{background:#eef4ff}\n.b1{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;font-family:var(--num);letter-spacing:.02em}\n.b2{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.exp b{font:600 15px var(--num)}\n.exp .cd{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.exp .cd.red{color:var(--red)}.exp .cd.orange{color:var(--orange)}.exp .cd.ok{color:var(--ink3);font-weight:400}\n.dbg{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:0 5px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--orange2);color:#c46a0c;margin-left:4px;vertical-align:1px}\n.locs{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.loc{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:30px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--gray2);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);white-space:nowrap}\n.loc b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n.loc svg{width:13px;height:13px;stroke:var(--blue);fill:none;stroke-width:2.2}\n.loc:active{background:var(--blue2)}\n.qty b{font:700 20px var(--num)}\n.qty span{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.qty .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.ops{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:flex-end}\n.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:24px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.pill i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}\n.pill.red{background:var(--red2);color:var(--red)}.pill.orange{background:var(--orange2);color:#c46a0c}.pill.ok{background:var(--green2);color:var(--green)}.pill.lock{background:#eef1f6;color:var(--ink2)}\n.chev{color:#c4cbd6;font-size:22px;text-align:center}\n.foot{height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}\n\n/* 货架视图 */\n.shelfwrap{flex:1;min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(300px,420px) 1fr;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;overflow:auto}\n.sh{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr 1fr;gap:5px 8px;align-content:start}\n.sh .h{text-align:center;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);padding-bottom:4px}\n.sh .l{font:600 12px/38px var(--num);color:var(--ink3);text-align:right}\n.cell{height:38px;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e7ee;background:#fafbfd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;padding:0 6px;position:relative}\n.cell i{height:20px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}\n.cell .n{margin-left:auto;font:700 13px var(--num);color:var(--ink2)}\n.cell.off{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f5f8 0 5px,#eaedf2 5px 10px);border-color:transparent;cursor:default}\n.cell.has{cursor:pointer}\n.cell.has:active{border-color:var(--blue)}\n.cell.sel{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(31,111,255,.15)}\n.cell.bad::after{content:\"!\";position:absolute;right:-6px;top:-6px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font:700 11px/16px var(--num);text-align:center}\n.slotd h3{font-size:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.slotd .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3);margin:2px 0 12px}\n.topv{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:#fafbfd;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.cols{margin-top:12px;display:grid;gap:8px}\n.col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:14px 1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;background:#f7f9fc}\n.col i{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px}\n.col .c1{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\n.col .c2{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3)}\n.col b{font:700 18px var(--num)}\n.legend{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:10px}\n.legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}\n\n.nav{flex:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 10px calc(4px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}\n.nav button{flex:1;max-width:120px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2)}\n.nav button svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}\n.nav button.on{color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue2);font-weight:600}\n\n.mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,30,50,.25);z-index:40;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.2s}\n.mask.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n.drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:min(460px,92vw);background:#fff;z-index:41;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:-12px 0 40px rgba(20,40,80,.15)}\n.drawer.on{transform:none}\n.dh{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px 10px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.dh h3{font-size:18px;flex:1}\n.db{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:16px 22px}\n.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:10px 12px;font-size:14px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.kv dt{color:var(--ink3)}\n.df{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 22px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.df .btn{flex:1;justify-content:center}\n\n@media (max-width:1100px){.thead,.brow{grid-template-columns:minmax(130px,1fr) 128px minmax(150px,1.4fr) 76px 120px 18px}.ops .btn.sm span{display:none}.nav button span{font-size:11px}}\n@media (max-width:860px){.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.shelfwrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .thead{display:none}.brow{grid-template-columns:1fr auto 18px;grid-template-areas:\"a q c\" \"e e c\" \"l l c\" \"o o c\";padding:10px 16px;row-gap:6px}\n  .brow>:nth-child(1){grid-area:a}.brow>:nth-child(2){grid-area:e}.brow>:nth-child(3){grid-area:l}.brow>:nth-child(4){grid-area:q}.brow>:nth-child(5){grid-area:o}.brow>:nth-child(6){grid-area:c}\n  .ops{justify-content:flex-start}}\n@media (max-width:640px){.top .meta,.chip,.me b{display:none}main{padding:10px 12px 0}.head .btn .lbl{display:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"logo\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><path d=\"M6 26l14-16 4 4-14 16z\" fill=\"#f5a623\"/><path d=\"M16 30L32 8l3 3-16 22z\" fill=\"#1f6fff\"/><path d=\"M12 32h22\" stroke=\"#1f6fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>冷链自动发苗机器人<sup>1.0</sup></div>\n  <div class=\"sp\"></div>\n  <span class=\"meta\" id=\"clock\">2026-10-22 15:52:56</span><span class=\"chip\">本地业务</span>\n  <button class=\"ibtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 9V4h5M20 9V4h-5M4 15v5h5M20 15v5h-5\"/></svg></button>\n  <button class=\"ibtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 8a6 6 0 1 1 12 0c0 7 3 8 3 8H3s3-1 3-8M10 20a2 2 0 0 0 4 0\"/></svg><b>1</b></button>\n  <div class=\"me\"><span>若</span><b>若依</b></div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>库存管理</h1>\n    <div class=\"tabs\" id=\"view\">\n      <button class=\"on\" data-v=\"list\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 6h12M8 12h12M8 18h12M4 6h.01M4 12h.01M4 18h.01\"/></svg>批次列表</button>\n      <button data-v=\"shelf\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 3h16v18H4zM4 9h16M4 15h16M12 3v18\"/></svg>货架视图</button>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"sp\"></span>\n    <button class=\"btn pri\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg><span class=\"lbl\">新增库存</span></button>\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 4h6v3H9zM6 6h12v15H6zM9 13l2 2 4-4\"/></svg><span class=\"lbl\">盘点</span></button>\n    <div class=\"more\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"moreBtn\" aria-label=\"更多\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\"/></svg></button>\n      <div class=\"menu\" id=\"menu\">\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 2M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7M3 4v4h4\"/></svg>历史库存变更</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg>锁苗管理</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5\"/></svg>库存预警设置</button>\n        <button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3v12M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 21h14\"/></svg>导出数据</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\"></div>\n  <div class=\"alert\" id=\"alert\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"filters\" id=\"filters\">\n    <label class=\"search\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"M20 20l-4-4\"/></svg><input id=\"q\" placeholder=\"搜索疫苗 / 批号 / 厂家 / 货位\"></label>\n    <button class=\"fc on\" data-f=\"all\">全部</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"exp\">已过期</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"soon\">临期 90 天内</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"ok\">正常</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\" data-f=\"lock\">已锁定</button>\n    <button class=\"fc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M7 12h10M10 18h4\"/></svg>更多筛选</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"listPanel\">\n    <div class=\"thead\"><span>批号</span><span>有效期</span><span>货位（格口 · 列）</span><span>数量</span><span>操作</span><span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"scroll\" id=\"scroll\"></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"shelfPanel\" style=\"display:none\">\n    <div class=\"shelfwrap\"><div><div class=\"sh\" id=\"sh\"></div>\n      <div class=\"legend\" id=\"lg\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"slotd\" id=\"slotd\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\"></nav>\n<div class=\"mask\" id=\"mask\"></div>\n<aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\">\n  <div class=\"dh\"><h3 id=\"dt\">批次详情</h3><button class=\"ibtn\" id=\"close\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg></button></div>\n  <div class=\"db\" id=\"dbody\"></div>\n  <div class=\"df\" id=\"dfoot\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id), p2 = n => String(n).padStart(2, \"0\");\n  const TODAY = new Date(2026, 9, 22), CAP = 2787;\n  // 设备 A-L10 实际库存(2026-10-22): 列 = 格口内横向位置 x_mm 上的一队同规格盒\n  const VAC = {\n    ipv: { name: \"Sabin株脊髓灰质炎灭活疫苗(Vero细胞)\", short: \"脊灰(Sabin)\", maker: \"北京生物制品研究所\", spec: \"0.5mL/支。每1次人用剂量0.5mL，含脊髓灰质炎病毒抗原量为Ⅰ型15DU，Ⅱ型45DU，Ⅲ型45DU。\", color: \"#8b5cf6\", box: [133, 38, 25] },\n    mmr: { name: \"麻腮风联合减毒活疫苗\", short: \"麻腮风\", maker: \"上海生物制品研究所\", spec: \"0.5ml（1人份）\", color: \"#1f6fff\", box: [60, 38.5, 22.4] },\n  };\n  const LOTS = [\n    { v: \"ipv\", lot: \"C202407009\", exp: \"2026-07-30\", dbg: true, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -141.7, n: 4 }] },\n    { v: \"mmr\", lot: \"202503015\", exp: \"2026-09-03\", dbg: true, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -37.2, n: 7 }] },\n    { v: \"mmr\", lot: \"202504034\", exp: \"2026-10-20\", dbg: false, locked: 0, cols: [{ slot: \"A-L10\", x: -246.2, n: 16 }, { slot: \"A-L10\", x: 30.8, n: 6 }] },\n  ];\n  const SLOT_GEOM = { \"A-L10\": { l: -276.2, r: 291.8, depth: 389.6 } };\n  const EN = new Set([\"L2\", \"L6\", \"R2\", \"R4\", \"R6\", ...[8, 9, 10, 11, 12].flatMap(l => [\"L\" + l, \"R\" + l])]);\n  const days = s => Math.round((new Date(s) - TODAY) / 864e5);\n  const qty = l => l.cols.reduce((a, c) => a + c.n, 0);\n  const state = l => { const d = days(l.exp); return d < 0 ? \"exp\" : d <= 90 ? \"soon\" : \"ok\"; };\n  // 格口内列序号(从左往右 1,2,3...)\n  const colNo = (slot, x) => { const xs = LOTS.flatMap(l => l.cols).filter(c => c.slot === slot).map(c => c.x).sort((a, b) => a - b); return xs.indexOf(x) + 1; };\n\n  // ── 指标卡 ──\n  let filter = \"all\", q = \"\", selLot = null;\n  function stats() {\n    const tot = LOTS.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0), lk = LOTS.reduce((a, l) => a + l.locked, 0);\n    const ex = LOTS.filter(l => state(l) === \"exp\"), sn = LOTS.filter(l => state(l) === \"soon\");\n    $(\"stats\").innerHTML = `\n      <button class=\"st${filter === \"all\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"all\"><div class=\"k\">在库</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${tot}</b><span>支 · 可用 ${tot - lk} · 锁定 ${lk}</span></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st\" data-f=\"cap\"><div class=\"k\">库位容量</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${(tot / CAP * 100).toFixed(1)}%</b><span>${tot} / 约 ${CAP.toLocaleString()} 支</span></div><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:${tot / CAP * 100}%\"></i></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st red${filter === \"exp\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"exp\"><div class=\"k\">已过期</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${ex.length}</b><span>批 · ${ex.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</span></div></button>\n      <button class=\"st orange${filter === \"soon\" ? \" on\" : \"\"}\" data-f=\"soon\"><div class=\"k\">临期 90 天内</div><div class=\"v\"><b>${sn.length}</b><span>批 · ${sn.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</span></div></button>`;\n    $(\"alert\").style.display = ex.length ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    $(\"alert\").innerHTML = `<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"t\"><b>${ex.length}</b> 批已过期，共 <b>${ex.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)}</b> 支，都在 A-L10，过期疫苗不会被发出，请尽快退苗</span>\n      <button class=\"btn danger sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 14L4 9l5-5M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3\"/></svg>一键退苗</button>`;\n  }\n  const setFilter = f => { if (f === \"cap\") return; filter = f; document.querySelectorAll(\".fc[data-f]\").forEach(b => b.classList.toggle(\"on\", b.dataset.f === f)); stats(); list(); };\n  $(\"stats\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\".st\"); if (b) setFilter(b.dataset.f === filter ? \"all\" : b.dataset.f); };\n  $(\"filters\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\".fc[data-f]\"); if (b) setFilter(b.dataset.f); };\n  $(\"q\").oninput = e => { q = e.target.value.trim().toLowerCase(); list(); };\n\n  // ── 列表: 品种分组 → 批次 ──\n  function expHtml(l) {\n    const d = days(l.exp), s = state(l);\n    const cd = s === \"exp\" ? `<span class=\"cd red\">已过期 ${-d} 天</span>` : s === \"soon\" ? `<span class=\"cd orange\">剩 ${d} 天</span>` : `<span class=\"cd ok\">剩 ${d} 天</span>`;\n    return `<div class=\"exp\"><b>${l.exp}</b>${l.dbg ? `<span class=\"dbg\" title=\"调试模式录入的有效期\">调试</span>` : \"\"}<br>${cd}</div>`;\n  }\n  function list() {\n    const rows = LOTS.map((l, i) => ({ ...l, i })).filter(l => {\n      if (filter === \"lock\" && !l.locked) return false;\n      if ([\"exp\", \"soon\", \"ok\"].includes(filter) && state(l) !== filter) return false;\n      const V = VAC[l.v];\n      return !q || (V.name + V.maker + l.lot + l.cols.map(c => c.slot).join()).toLowerCase().includes(q);\n    });\n    let h = \"\";\n    for (const k of Object.keys(VAC)) {\n      const g = rows.filter(r => r.v === k); if (!g.length) continue;\n      const V = VAC[k];\n      h += `<div class=\"grp\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:${V.color}\"></span><b>${V.name}</b><span class=\"s\">${V.maker} · ${V.spec}</span><span class=\"tot\">${g.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)}<span>支 · ${g.length} 批</span></span></div>`;\n      for (const l of g) {\n        const s = state(l);\n        h += `<div class=\"brow${selLot === l.i ? \" sel\" : \"\"}\" data-i=\"${l.i}\">\n          <div><div class=\"b1\">${l.lot}</div><div class=\"b2\">${s === \"exp\" ? `<span class=\"pill red\"><i></i>过期</span>` : s === \"soon\" ? `<span class=\"pill orange\"><i></i>临期</span>` : `<span class=\"pill ok\"><i></i>正常</span>`}${l.locked ? ` <span class=\"pill lock\">锁定 ${l.locked}</span>` : \"\"}</div></div>\n          ${expHtml(l)}\n          <div class=\"locs\">${l.cols.map(c => `<span class=\"loc\" data-slot=\"${c.slot}\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s7-6 7-11a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 5 7 11 7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg><b>${c.slot}</b>第 ${colNo(c.slot, c.x)} 列 · ${c.n} 支</span>`).join(\"\")}</div>\n          <div class=\"qty\"><b>${qty(l)}</b><span>支</span><div class=\"sub\">可用 ${qty(l) - l.locked}</div></div>\n          <div class=\"ops\">${s === \"exp\" ? `<button class=\"btn sm danger\" data-act=\"ret\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 14L4 9l5-5M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3\"/></svg><span>退苗</span></button>` : \"\"}\n            <button class=\"btn sm\" data-act=\"lock\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg><span>锁定</span></button></div>\n          <div class=\"chev\">›</div></div>`;\n      }\n    }\n    $(\"scroll\").innerHTML = (h || `<div class=\"foot\">没有符合条件的批次</div>`) + (h ? `<div class=\"foot\">共 ${rows.length} 个批次 · ${rows.reduce((a, l) => a + qty(l), 0)} 支</div>` : \"\");\n  }\n  $(\"scroll\").onclick = e => {\n    const loc = e.target.closest(\".loc\"); if (loc) { showShelf(loc.dataset.slot); return; }\n    const act = e.target.closest(\"[data-act]\"); if (act) { e.stopPropagation(); act.textContent = act.dataset.act === \"ret\" ? \"已加入退苗\" : \"已锁定\"; return; }\n    const r = e.target.closest(\".brow\"); if (r) openLot(+r.dataset.i);\n  };\n\n  // ── 货架视图 ──\n  let selSlot = \"A-L10\";\n  function shelf() {\n    let h = `<span></span><span class=\"h\">左列 L</span><span class=\"h\">右列 R</span>`;\n    for (let l = 13; l >= 1; l--) {\n      h += `<span class=\"l\">${l}</span>`;\n      for (const c of [\"L\", \"R\"]) {\n        const name = `A-${c}${l}`, en = EN.has(c + l), cols = LOTS.flatMap(x => x.cols.map(cc => ({ ...cc, lot: x }))).filter(cc => cc.slot === name);\n        const n = cols.reduce((a, cc) => a + cc.n, 0), bad = cols.some(cc => state(cc.lot) === \"exp\");\n        h += en ? `<div class=\"cell${n ? \" has\" : \"\"}${selSlot === name ? \" sel\" : \"\"}${bad ? \" bad\" : \"\"}\" data-s=\"${name}\">${cols.sort((a, b) => a.x - b.x).map(cc => `<i style=\"width:${Math.max(6, cc.n * 2)}px;background:${VAC[cc.lot.v].color};opacity:${state(cc.lot) === \"exp\" ? .45 : 1}\"></i>`).join(\"\")}<span class=\"n\">${n || \"\"}</span></div>`\n          : `<div class=\"cell off\" title=\"${name} 未启用\"></div>`;\n      }\n    }\n    $(\"sh\").innerHTML = h;\n    $(\"lg\").innerHTML = Object.values(VAC).map(V => `<span><i style=\"background:${V.color}\"></i>${V.short}</span>`).join(\"\") + `<span><i style=\"background:#cfd6e0\"></i>浅色 = 已过期</span><span><i style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f5f8 0 3px,#dfe3ea 3px 6px)\"></i>未启用</span>`;\n    slotDetail(selSlot);\n  }\n  function slotDetail(name) {\n    const g = SLOT_GEOM[name] || { l: -280, r: 290, depth: 400 };\n    const cols = LOTS.flatMap(x => x.cols.map(cc => ({ ...cc, lot: x }))).filter(cc => cc.slot === name).sort((a, b) => a.x - b.x);\n    if (!cols.length) { $(\"slotd\").innerHTML = `<h3>${name}</h3><div class=\"k\">这个格口是空的</div>`; return; }\n    // 俯视图: 横向 = 格口左右, 纵向 = 深度(上=背板, 下=格口门口)\n    const W = 600, H = 300, pad = 30, sx = (W - 2 * pad) / (g.r - g.l + 60), X = x => pad + (x - g.l + 30) * sx, sy = (H - 2 * pad) / g.depth;\n    let s = `<rect x=\"${pad}\" y=\"${pad}\" width=\"${W - 2 * pad}\" height=\"${H - 2 * pad}\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e0ea\"/>\n      <text x=\"${W / 2}\" y=\"${pad - 10}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#98a3b3\">背板</text><text x=\"${W / 2}\" y=\"${H - 8}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#98a3b3\">格口门口（机械臂这一侧）</text>`;\n    cols.forEach((cc, k) => {\n      const [w, , t] = VAC[cc.lot.v].box, x0 = X(cc.x - w / 2), bw = w * sx, ex = state(cc.lot) === \"exp\";\n      for (let j = 0; j < cc.n; j++) s += `<rect x=\"${x0}\" y=\"${pad + 4 + j * t * sy}\" width=\"${bw}\" height=\"${t * sy - 1.5}\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"${VAC[cc.lot.v].color}\" opacity=\"${ex ? .45 : .9}\"/>`;\n      s += `<text x=\"${x0 + bw / 2}\" y=\"${pad + 4 + cc.n * t * sy + 16}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1f2633\">第 ${k + 1} 列</text>`;\n    });\n    $(\"slotd\").innerHTML = `<h3>${name}<span class=\"pill ${cols.some(c => state(c.lot) === \"exp\") ? \"red\" : \"ok\"}\"><i></i>${cols.some(c => state(c.lot) === \"exp\") ? \"有过期批次\" : \"正常\"}</span></h3>\n      <div class=\"k\">${cols.reduce((a, c) => a + c.n, 0)} 支 · ${cols.length} 列 · 俯视图（从左到右第 1、2… 列；每列从背板往外排）</div>\n      <svg class=\"topv\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${W} ${H}\">${s}</svg>\n      <div class=\"cols\">${cols.map((cc, k) => `<div class=\"col\"><i style=\"background:${VAC[cc.lot.v].color}\"></i><div><div class=\"c1\">第 ${k + 1} 列 · ${VAC[cc.lot.v].short} ${cc.lot.lot}</div><div class=\"c2\">横向 ${cc.x} mm · 有效期 ${cc.lot.exp}${state(cc.lot) === \"exp\" ? ` · <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">已过期</span>` : \"\"}</div></div><b>${cc.n}<span style=\"font:400 12px sans-serif;color:var(--ink3)\"> 支</span></b></div>`).join(\"\")}</div>`;\n  }\n  $(\"sh\").onclick = e => { const c = e.target.closest(\".cell.has\"); if (c) { selSlot = c.dataset.s; shelf(); } };\n  function showShelf(slot) { selSlot = slot; setView(\"shelf\"); }\n  function setView(v) {\n    document.querySelectorAll(\"#view button\").forEach(b => b.classList.toggle(\"on\", b.dataset.v === v));\n    $(\"listPanel\").style.display = v === \"list\" ? \"\" : \"none\"; $(\"shelfPanel\").style.display = v === \"shelf\" ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    $(\"filters\").style.display = v === \"list\" ? \"\" : \"none\";\n    if (v === \"shelf\") shelf();\n  }\n  $(\"view\").onclick = e => { const b = e.target.closest(\"button\"); if (b) setView(b.dataset.v); };\n\n  // ── 批次详情抽屉 ──\n  function openLot(i) {\n    selLot = i; list(); const l = LOTS[i], V = VAC[l.v], s = state(l);\n    $(\"dt\").textContent = \"批次详情\";\n    $(\"dbody\").innerHTML = `<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">${V.name}</div><div style=\"color:var(--ink3);font-size:13px;margin:2px 0 10px\">${V.maker}</div>\n      ${expHtml(l)}\n      <dl class=\"kv\"><dt>批号</dt><dd>${l.lot}</dd><dt>规格</dt><dd>${V.spec}</dd><dt>盒尺寸</dt><dd>${V.box.join(\" × \")} mm</dd>\n        <dt>数量</dt><dd>${qty(l)} 支 · 可用 ${qty(l) - l.locked} · 锁定 ${l.locked}</dd>\n        <dt>货位</dt><dd>${l.cols.map(c => `${c.slot} 第 ${colNo(c.slot, c.x)} 列（横向 ${c.x} mm）${c.n} 支`).join(\"<br>\")}</dd>\n        <dt>有效期来源</dt><dd>${l.dbg ? \"调试模式录入（非追溯码平台）\" : \"追溯码平台\"}</dd></dl>`;\n    $(\"dfoot\").innerHTML = `<button class=\"btn\">库存变更记录</button>${s === \"exp\" ? `<button class=\"btn danger\">退苗 ${qty(l)} 支</button>` : `<button class=\"btn pri\">发苗</button>`}`;\n    $(\"drawer\").classList.add(\"on\"); $(\"mask\").classList.add(\"on\");\n  }\n  const close = () => { $(\"drawer\").classList.remove(\"on\"); $(\"mask\").classList.remove(\"on\"); };\n  $(\"mask\").onclick = close; $(\"close\").onclick = close;\n  let sx = null; $(\"drawer\").addEventListener(\"touchstart\", e => sx = e.touches[0].clientX, { passive: true });\n  $(\"drawer\").addEventListener(\"touchend\", e => { if (sx != null && e.changedTouches[0].clientX - sx > 80) close(); sx = null; });\n\n  $(\"moreBtn\").onclick = e => { e.stopPropagation(); $(\"menu\").classList.toggle(\"on\"); };\n  document.addEventListener(\"click\", () => $(\"menu\").classList.remove(\"on\"));\n  setInterval(() => { const d = new Date(); $(\"clock\").textContent = `${d.getFullYear()}-${p2(d.getMonth() + 1)}-${p2(d.getDate())} ${p2(d.getHours())}:${p2(d.getMinutes())}:${p2(d.getSeconds())}`; }, 1000);\n  const NAV = [[\"工作台\", \"M3 11l9-7 9 7v9H3z\"], [\"上苗管理\", \"M4 4h16v16H4zM9 4v8l3-2 3 2V4\"], [\"发苗管理\", \"M4 12l16-8-6 16-2-6z\"], [\"报损管理\", \"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v4\"],\n    [\"库存管理\", \"M4 5h16v4H4zM4 11h16v4H4zM4 17h16v3H4z\"], [\"设备管理\", \"M14 6l4 4-8 8H6v-4z\"], [\"货架管理\", \"M4 4h7v7H4zM13 4h7v7h-7zM4 13h7v7H4zM13 13h7v7h-7z\"],\n    [\"疫苗包装信息\", \"M5 8h14v12H5zM9 8V5h6v3M12 11v6M9 14h6\"], [\"追溯码对照\", \"M4 5v14M7 5v14M11 5v14M14 5v14M18 5v14M20 5v14\"], [\"统计报表\", \"M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 9 9h-9z\"], [\"系统管理\", \"M12 9a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zM12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3\"]];\n  $(\"nav\").innerHTML = NAV.map((n, i) => `<button class=\"${i === 4 ? \"on\" : \"\"}\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"${n[1]}\"/></svg><span>${n[0]}</span></button>`).join(\"\");\n  stats(); list();\n  if (location.hash === \"#shelf\") setView(\"shelf\");\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"98d0252d-0347-4177-8288-56f94aaf11a4","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0