{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"e5deebd5449659081df1b23fccbe2384dcee5cb9d8dc8107e32e904f31ddb97a","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在这个尺寸能显示5个任务，紧凑模式还能更多，但目前紧凑模式只对明细页生效。我来补上任务行的样式规则（隐藏第二行次要信息），然后提交。\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018fDLYPqvuu8pSKFd4xBiPU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/首页改版 && sed -i '' 's|^body.compact .trow{min-height:46px}|body.compact .trow{min-height:46px}\\nbody.compact .trow .v2,body.compact .trow .t2{display:none}|' 发苗记录.html && grep -c \"body.compact .trow .v2\" 发苗记录.html && cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && git add docs/首页改版/发苗记录.html && git commit -q -m \"feat: 发苗记录页加出库任务历史(进行中置顶实时进度+按日期分组+说明写清发出/吸空/未执行+任务详情逐盒取出扫码投放+补发剩余); 调试模式改为标题行小开关; 两页共用紧凑模式\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git log --oneline -1 && open \"docs/首页改版/发苗记录.html#task\"","description":"补紧凑规则、提交并打开任务历史页"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
