{"parentUuid":"77b6b01c-32f8-4e92-b587-6fdb9ebef17e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14979225 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"50d95f87-dcc7-4bc6-bc38-006014b62113","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:22:57.328Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14979225 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"50d95f87-dcc7-4bc6-bc38-006014b62113","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01XcGEwEhx28dh3oZTPAsPYz","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9e12b6ea-590f-45a5-b909-e64b32f0e729","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:23:05.583Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"9e12b6ea-590f-45a5-b909-e64b32f0e729","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGxDubypooqENpC2FQN8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"退苗路径的优化做完了。仿真里空跑两盒全部通过，**真机还没有跑过**。控制器已经切回真实模式，工作站服务也已重启并加载了新代码，现在可以真机验证。\n\n**新路线**\n```\n格口 → mid → 退苗筐 → mid → 下一个格口 …… 最后一盒 → home\n```\n- **mid ↔ 退苗筐是两条新的库路径**，单程各约 2.8 秒（生产速度），带持货碰撞体判卷零碰撞。原来从 home 出发的折线路线，去程 11.1 秒、回程 10.9 秒。\n- **连续退苗时停在 mid**，下一盒直接从 mid 飞格口。最后一盒、上位机发了停止或暂停、或者这一盒吸空时，才回 home。\n- 仿真空跑实测**每盒从约 41 秒降到约 24 秒**。\n- 进筐方式：最后 30cm 约 30° 斜着往下进，全程最低点就是投放点本身，不会贴着筐沿横扫。\n\n**还有两点要说明**\n- **回程路径体检没过门槛**：平顺分 76%（门槛 85%），在中途有一次约 0.08 秒的轻微减速，没有关节来回摆。去程是 84%。两条都入库了，标记为\"待优化\"，不影响使用。\n- **需要扫码的出库（outbound）不变**，照旧走 home，因为扫码口在 home 那一侧。\n\n**真机验证建议**：先下一单**只退 1 盒**的退苗任务（`type: retrieve`、`dest: return`），盯一下 mid → 退苗筐这一段的实际轨迹，特别是经过上苗机旁边时的余量。没问题再试连续退 2 盒，看中间是不是停在 mid、直接飞下一个格口。也可以在设备上直接用命令行跑：\n```\npython flows\\retrieve_one_box.py A-L10 <x_mm> <序号> 0 --dest return\n```\n\n提交记录：Mac 端 0752317，设备端 30fd86f。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":627563,"output_tokens":719,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":430,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":719,"cache_read_input_tokens":627563,"cache_creation_input_tokens":430,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":430},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0cbdd3a7-003e-434c-82de-b72f028d1574","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGxDuABjmdmc5rurteHk","requestRef":"536f045f-1288-42e0-953e-ff522c177484","requestedMo