{"parentUuid":"caf2d04c-2b0e-4ab8-941c-ab3035a1ea9d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14994779 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fef1cd27-4813-43e2-8075-b1dd4b8cbc5a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:29:17.121Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14994779 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"fef1cd27-4813-43e2-8075-b1dd4b8cbc5a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01KwX4ZhVDrJyGEZbv3tajf5","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"60448069-9935-4a5a-af9b-f7d2e1d0df5c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:29:25.155Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"60448069-9935-4a5a-af9b-f7d2e1d0df5c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGxhureD3nY9GMdNtT5C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"仿真结果：**直接 movej 不行，两个方向都会撞上苗机**。我已经切回真实模式，真机在 home 没动过。\n\n| 走法 | 最危险的位置 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| mid → 退苗点，movej 直连 | TCP (-0.66, -0.21, 0.37) | 盒子**扎进上苗机包络 88mm**，盒底比上苗机顶低约 20cm |\n| 退苗点 → mid，movej 直连 | TCP (-0.66, -0.22, 0.37) | 同样**扎进 88mm** |\n| 刚入库的规划路径（对照） | TCP (-0.54, -0.73, 0.58) | 水平离开 33mm，盒底**高出上苗机顶 12mm**，不碰 |\n\n接触对是\"上苗机包络 ↔ 吸盘和持货盒\"。\n\n**为什么 movej 会撞**\nmovej 是所有关节**同时、按比例**转到目标：J1 要转 110°，J2、J3 同时把手臂从 0.55m 伸到 1.01m。J1 转到大约 30°～50°、手臂正指向上苗机那一侧时，手臂已经伸出去一截，盒子就扫进了上苗机。你的直觉\"中间是空旷的\"在高处是对的，但 movej 走的是低处，手臂边转边伸。\n\n**规划路径是怎么绕开的**：经过上苗机那一侧时**先把手抬高**（TCP 抬到 0.58m，盒底刚好高过上苗机顶），转过去以后再伸出、斜着下降到筐口。所以单程也只要 2.8 秒，和直连差不多快。\n\n结论：现在入库的规划路径是对的，不需要改。你之前看到的\"一卡一卡\"，是老折线路线在拐角处减速造成的，新路径从 mid 出发是一条连续的曲线。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":563,"cache_read_input_tokens":633495,"output_tokens":656,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":563,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":656,"cache_read_input_tokens":633495,"cache_creation_input_tokens":563,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":563},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c95e308a-d97a-460b-8afd-55ebdfef102f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGxhu1Y6iDseiYm2SEK4","requestRef":"5673c0d5-b12f-4efe-bd0b-a64d7dc138a8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2a670cb5-afd1-41ae-9c0c-e24bf2a1dd82","timestamp":"