{"parentUuid":"06e8d5c3-ac1b-4480-9d83-a0c786a4f301","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"20ce8bd4-98bb-4dd6-9b7e-1ec0ec23e70b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J3UJnZ2XjZ6YsfqoufJmeG","type":"tool_result","content":"国药准字S20070026|1瓶/盒 [60.0, 38.5, 22.4] pitch 22.81 \n国药准字S20225001|1支/盒 [133.0, 38.0, 25.0] pitch 26.99 \n国药准字S20153004|1瓶/盒 [63, 50, 23] pitch 27.67 \nscripts/bluespace/calib/stocktake_core.py:14:盒数 = (背板 − 队首) ÷ 节距, 再按高斯给置信度; 节距来自尺寸表(--learn 学的含缝值), 不按量出的列宽猜品种\nscripts/stocktake.sh:4:#   用法: ./scripts/stocktake.sh <格口> [期望列表.json] [帧数=5] [格宽mm=5] [下降mm=auto] [--learn]     # 探测模式: 臂须已在格口悬停点\nscripts/stocktake.sh:8:#     --learn: 节距标定(录入新品种后, 设备往空列放≥4盒, 你确认盒数, 用期望列表的盒数把 叠厚/盒数 写进尺寸表 pitch_mm; 盘点本身从不自动改)\nscripts/stocktake.sh:15:LEARN=\"\"; API=\"\"; FLIP=\"\"; ARGS=(); for a in \"$@\"; do case \"$a\" in --learn) LEARN=\"--learn\";; --api) API=1;; --allow-flip) FLIP=\"--allow-flip\";; *) ARGS+=(\"$a\");; esac; done; set -- \"${ARGS[@]}\"   # --allow-flip: 工具翻转格口(第2~6层)盘点位未真机验证前默认拒绝, 现场验证时加它(2026-09-19)\nscripts/stocktake.sh:58:[ -n \"$LEARN\" ] && { scp -q \"$BS:$CELL/config/sku_dims.yaml\" \"$ROOT/config/sku_dims.yaml\" && cd \"$ROOT\" && git add config/sku_dims.yaml && git commit -q -m \"sku: 节距标定(stocktake --learn $SLOT)\" && echo \"节距已写回 config/sku_dims.yaml 并提交\"; }\n69:  gap_deep_mm: 0             # 队列内盒间缝(推进靠上前一盒, 贴着放)\n71:  pre_gap_mm: 10             # 放: 先推到离目标(前一盒/背板)这么远, 降到层板, 再在板上推完最后一段(2026-09-16 用户定: 顶着背板下滑摩擦大, 盒卡半空吹开才落)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8e8a5dd5-1941-4cab-bdd9-6619ac90a85e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:33:28.415Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"国药准字S20070026|1瓶/盒 [60.0, 38.5, 22.4] pitch 22.81 \n国药准字S20225001|1支/盒 [133.0, 38.0, 25.0] pitch 26.99 \n国药准字S20153004|1瓶/盒 [63, 50, 23] pitch 27.67 \nscripts/bluespace/calib/stocktake_core.py:14:盒数 = (背板 − 队首) ÷ 节距, 再按高斯给置信度; 节距来自尺寸表(--learn 学的含缝值), 不按量出的列宽猜品种\nscripts/stocktake.sh:4:#   用法: ./scripts/stocktake.sh <格口> [期望列表.json] [帧数=5] [格宽mm=5] [下降mm=auto] [--learn]     # 探测模式: 臂须已在格口悬停点\nscripts/stocktake.sh:8:#     --learn: 节距标定(录入新品种后, 设备往空列放≥4盒, 你确认盒数, 用期望列表的盒数把 叠厚/盒数 写进尺寸表 pitch_mm; 盘点本身从不自动改)\nscripts/stocktake.sh:15:LEARN=\"\"; API=\"\"; FLIP=\"\"; ARGS=(); for a in \"$@\"; do case \"$a\" in --learn) LEARN=\"--learn\";; --api) API=1;; --allow-flip) FLIP=\"--allow-flip\";; *) ARGS+=(\"$a\");; esac; done; set -- \"${ARGS[@]}\"   # --allow-flip: 工具翻转格口(第2~6层)盘点位未真机验证前默认拒绝, 现场验证时加它(2026-09-19)\nscripts/stocktake.sh:58:[ -n \"$LEARN\" ] && { scp -q \"$BS:$CELL/config/sku_dims.yaml\" \"$ROOT/config/sku_dims.yaml\" && cd \"$ROOT\" && git add config/sku_dims.yaml && git commit -q -m \"sku: 节距标定(stocktake --learn $SLOT)\" && echo \"节距已写回 config/sku_dims.yaml 并提交\"; }\n69:  gap_deep_mm: 0             # 队列内盒间缝(推进靠上前一盒, 贴着放)\n71:  pre_gap_mm: 10             # 放: 先推到离目标(前一盒/背板)这么远, 降到层板, 再在板上推完最后一段(2026-09-16 用户定: 顶着背板下滑摩擦大, 盒卡半空吹开才落)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9a0892b2-96f7-4c81-a1ca-0b118520eb1a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":12},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/bluespace","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"06e8d5c3-ac1b-4480-9d83-a0c786a4f301","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
