{"parentUuid":"c3dcc3bb-c9ea-40ee-84d0-711f8b8ab301","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGy2S9nt8o3kyEsqa6AD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3150,"cache_read_input_tokens":640797,"output_tokens":2537,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1139},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3150,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2537,"cache_read_input_tokens":640797,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3150},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":24546,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"3567215e-19df-4623-889a-7f1230a9d1b2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGy2RT8C4EP3X2LqPRF2","requestRef":"eed10543-c321-44f3-8fa0-0818ebfc4df3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"cd4292de-a8ff-47f0-b5b0-deba35dd3148","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:33:54.147Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"cd4292de-a8ff-47f0-b5b0-deba35dd3148","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGy2S9nt8o3kyEsqa6AD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"原因基本找到了，而且有数据支撑。\n\n## 放置位置是怎么算的\n\n设备放第 idx 盒（从背板往外数，第一盒是 0）时，推进量这样算：\n\n```\n推进量 = 背板位置 − 盒厚 − idx × 节距  +  2mm 过盈\n```\n\n这是一个**开环公式**：设备不看前一盒实际在哪，只按\"第几盒 × 节距\"算出一个位置推过去。所以**节距只要比实际每盒占的厚度大一点，误差就会随序号线性累积**。\n\n## 问题出在节距上：学习值比盒子实际厚度大\n\n| 品种 | 卡尺盒厚 | 现在用的节距（盘点学的） | 每盒多出 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 麻腮风 | 22.4 mm | 22.81 mm | 0.41 mm |\n| 脊灰（Sabin） | 25.0 mm | 26.99 mm | **1.99 mm** |\n| 甲肝 | 23.0 mm | 27.67 mm | **4.67 mm** |\n\n按公式，第 idx 盒和前一盒之间的间隙大约是 `idx × 每盒多出 − 2mm 过盈`（2mm 过盈只在第一次就被吃掉了，所以间隙其实是每盒都在往外多退一点）：\n\n| 品种 | 第 1 盒（贴背板） | 第 5 盒 | 第 10 盒 | 第 15 盒 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 麻腮风 | 压紧 2mm | 压紧约 0.4mm | 松约 2mm | 松约 4mm |\n| 脊灰 | 压紧 2mm | 松约 8mm | 松约 18mm | — |\n| 甲肝 | 压紧 2mm | 松约 21mm | — | — |\n\n*（这里是相对\"所有盒子都刚好贴紧\"的累计偏差，每一盒相对前一盒的间隙等于 每盒多出 − 实际压缩量。）*\n\n这和你看到的现象完全吻合：**最里面那盒顶着背板，是最紧的；越往外，计划位置离前一盒越远，最后就靠不上了。**\n\n## 节距为什么会偏大：自我强化的循环\n\n节距是用 `stocktake --learn` 学的：数出一列有几盒，用\"叠厚 ÷ 盒数\"算出来。问题是：\n1. 量叠厚时，量到的是**已经放松了的队列**，里面包括盒间缝、纸盒回弹、盒子立着微微前倾。\n2. 学出来的节距偏大，下次放置就按偏大的节距排，队列更松。\n3. 再盘点学习，节距又会偏大……\n\n甲肝多出 4.67mm，就是这个循环的结果。\n\n## 改法建议\n\n**把\"放置用的节距\"和\"盘点用的节距\"分开：**\n- **放置**：按**卡尺盒厚**排，再减去一点纸盒压缩量，目标是每盒都轻轻顶住前一盒。\n- **盘点 / 容量计算**：继续用学到的节距，因为它反映的是货架里实际占的空间，数盒数时更准。\n\n**风险和保护**：按盒厚排时，如果前面的队列实际比计划长（回弹、前倾），新盒的目标位置会比队首更深，就会顶着整列往里推。所以要**给顶推量设上限**，比如最多比计划多推 3mm。\n\n**更彻底的做法**（以后可以考虑）：放置时以**这一列实际的队首位置**为准，而不是按\"第几盒\"算。账上已经记了每列的队首位置（`front_mm`），盘点时还会用实测值修正。按它定位就不会累积误差。\n\n**动手前建议先做一个小验证**：找一个空列，按现在的方式连放 5 盒甲肝，用尺子或盘点量一下每盒之间的缝。如果缝大约是 4～5mm，就能确认是节距的问题。\n\n你想先做验证，还是直接改成\"放置按盒厚排\"？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3150,"cache_read_input_tokens":640797,"output_tokens":2537,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1139},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3150,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2537,"cache_read_input_tokens":640797,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3150},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3567215e-19df-4623-889a-7f1230a9d1b2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGy2RT8C4EP3X2LqPRF2","requestRef":"eed10543-c321-44f3-8fa0-0818ebfc4df3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"620196fe-9335-4d1f-af19-deaf9b3cde97","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:33:59.621Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
