{"parentUuid":"446d1946-1ee9-4a75-852d-e7ebb9312d7b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGy6K5jzF6WjnRWzeYQ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8361,"cache_read_input_tokens":646541,"output_tokens":4884,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3818},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8361,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4884,"cache_read_input_tokens":646541,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8361,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8361},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":54149,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"63976abc-975b-41b2-bebe-2a6185d68ece","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGy6JNab1LzsVMKnG6Hr","requestRef":"cf19f0b3-a1ea-4815-845f-ba4607d1e051","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2431fdb4-e27c-464e-a65a-7f6dc574d57d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:35:16.228Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"2431fdb4-e27c-464e-a65a-7f6dc574d57d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGy6K5jzF6WjnRWzeYQ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看完上位机的真实指令，计算方式很清楚了。\n\n## 上位机给了什么\n\n上位机回复每一盒去处时只给 4 样东西：**格口、横向位置 x、序号 index、盒子尺寸**。深度方向放在哪，完全由设备按序号算：\n\n```\n推进量 = 背板位置 + 2mm 过盈 − 盒厚 − 序号 × 节距\n```\n\n## 实际算出来的推进量\n\n同一列里，相邻两盒的推进量差值**恰好就是节距**，每一盒都一样，没有累积漂移。以今天的 A-L10 为例：\n\n| 列 | 品种 | 相邻两盒推进量之差 | 盒厚 | **两盒之间预留的缝** |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| x=30.8（17 盒） | 麻腮风 | 22.8 mm | 22.4 mm | **0.4 mm** |\n| x=-141.7 | 脊灰 | 27.0 mm | 25.0 mm | **2.0 mm** |\n| R10 x=-2.0 | 甲肝 | 27.7 mm | 23.0 mm | **4.7 mm** |\n\n另外从历史记录还能看到：**9 月 16 日以前**，相邻差值就等于盒厚（22.4 / 25.0 / 23.0），那时没有缝。9 月 17 日盘点学了节距以后，才变成现在的 22.8 / 27.0 / 27.7。\n\n## 结论\n\n1. **最里面那盒紧**：它顶的是硬的背板，而且公式里专门多推了 2mm 过盈，所以一定压得紧。\n2. **之后每一盒，设备都主动留了\"节距 − 盒厚\"这么大的缝**：麻腮风 0.4mm，基本贴着；**脊灰 2mm、甲肝 4.7mm，明显靠不上前一盒**。这就是你看到的\"后面松、靠不到\"。\n3. 这个缝是**节距学习值偏大**造成的。节距是盘点时用\"叠厚 ÷ 盒数\"学出来的，量的是已经有缝、有回弹、盒子微微前倾的队列，所以比盒子本身厚。用它来定放置位置，就把这些缝\"复制\"到了每一盒之间。\n\n## 建议的改法\n\n**放置时按盒厚排，盘点时继续用学到的节距**，两件事分开：\n- 放置：相邻两盒间距 = 盒厚，再加一点点过盈（比如每盒 0.5mm），让每一盒都轻轻顶住前一盒。\n- 盘点和容量计算：继续用学到的节距，它反映的是货架里实际占的空间，数盒数更准。\n\n这样改，上位机那边**完全不用动**，还是只发序号。\n\n**想先跟你确认一点**：你看到\"越往外越松\"的，主要是哪个品种？如果是脊灰或甲肝，基本就是上面这个原因。如果是麻腮风（缝只有 0.4mm），那还有别的因素，比如纸盒回弹或者放下时盒子微微前倾，我再接着查。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8361,"cache_read_input_tokens":646541,"output_tokens":4884,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3818},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8361,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4884,"cache_read_input_tokens":646541,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8361,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8361},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"63976abc-975b-41b2-bebe-2a6185d68ece","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGy6JNab1LzsVMKnG6Hr","requestRef":"cf19f0b3-a1ea-4815-845f-ba4607d1e051","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"5e08ca83-1c2b-4331-9221-81add060df8c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:35:18.159Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
