{"parentUuid":"94abb42e-2811-4514-b847-3c366add4f80","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyAbWaGWGoTLdX7Bgbz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4918,"cache_read_input_tokens":654902,"output_tokens":739,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":21},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4918,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":739,"cache_read_input_tokens":654902,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4918,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4918},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":214,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"fc32b435-48b5-4dad-82d6-d2badd2b1a7d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGyAb1p3HT5cHb4PVhkJ","requestRef":"3ba9888f-17f9-4adb-80d4-51a317f1a35c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"646addce-dc69-4163-aa3b-9d2359390f6d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:35:20.382Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"646addce-dc69-4163-aa3b-9d2359390f6d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyAbWaGWGoTLdX7Bgbz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"换个直观的说法，用甲肝举例（盒子 23mm 厚）。\n\n**设备放盒子，是\"按尺子量好位置放\"，不是\"推到碰到前一盒为止\"。**\n\n它心里有一把尺子，从背板往外量：\n- 第 1 盒：贴着背板放\n- 第 2 盒：比第 1 盒往外 **27.7mm** 放\n- 第 3 盒：再往外 **27.7mm** 放\n- ……\n\n**问题就在这个 27.7mm。** 盒子本身只有 23mm 厚，设备却每次往外挪 27.7mm，所以每两盒之间就会**空出 4.7mm 的缝**：\n\n```\n背板 |[盒1]    [盒2]    [盒3]    [盒4] ...\n      ↑紧贴  ↑缝4.7 ↑缝4.7 ↑缝4.7\n```\n\n第 1 盒顶着背板，所以紧；后面每一盒都和前一盒隔着一条缝，所以松、靠不上。\n\n**27.7mm 是怎么来的？** 之前盘点时，设备量了一列的总长度，再除以盒数，算出\"每盒占 27.7mm\"。可当时量的那一列本来就有缝，所以算出来的数比盒子实际厚度大。现在又用这个数来放盒子，于是缝就一直保留下来了。\n\n**改法很简单：放盒子时每次只往外挪\"盒子本身的厚度\"**（甲肝就是 23mm），再稍微多推一点点，让它顶住前一盒。这样就紧贴了。\n\n各品种现在每两盒之间的缝：\n\n| 品种 | 盒厚 | 设备每次挪 | 每两盒之间的缝 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 麻腮风 | 22.4mm | 22.8mm | 0.4mm（几乎贴着） |\n| 脊灰 | 25.0mm | 27.0mm | 2.0mm |\n| 甲肝 | 23.0mm | 27.7mm | 4.7mm |\n\n你看到松的，是脊灰和甲肝吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4918,"cache_read_input_tokens":654902,"output_tokens":739,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":21},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4918,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":739,"cache_read_input_tokens":654902,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4918,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4918},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fc32b435-48b5-4dad-82d6-d2badd2b1a7d","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGyAb1p3HT5cHb4PVhkJ","requestRef":"3ba9888f-17f9-4adb-80d4-51a317f1a35c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"acaf7edc-06c0-4aff-85a3-e892457b5be4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:35:27.675Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
