{"parentUuid":"bb5e2641-0414-45c8-bbac-4eec1a691fdf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyeMcw5CbuhoYkZvzRq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3298,"cache_read_input_tokens":664193,"output_tokens":3401,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2325},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3298,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3401,"cache_read_input_tokens":664193,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3298},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":35005,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"2d942905-9ddf-4e00-8944-7f24a6c80c8a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGyeM9QvKuLbuAZcdb3w","requestRef":"594ff0b0-ec2d-4d5c-87c9-47b8bac88595","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b6cc1e3-41ce-4fd9-96b9-100da8b48570","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:42:14.015Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"1b6cc1e3-41ce-4fd9-96b9-100da8b48570","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyeMcw5CbuhoYkZvzRq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"找到了，而且和你刚才问的\"越放越松\"是**同一个问题**的两面。\n\n## 任务 121 发生了什么\n\n这一单连续取了 x=30.8 这一列的 3 盒（从外往里取）：\n\n| 第几盒 | 序号 | 设备按公式推到 | 实际情况 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 18 | 16（最外面） | 137.9 mm | 吸住了 |\n| 19 | 15 | 160.8 mm | 第一次没吸住，**又往里多推了 3 次（共多推约 7mm）才吸住** |\n| 20 | 14 | 183.6 mm | 多推了 4 次（**共 9mm，已到上限**），还是没吸住 → 判\"吸空\" |\n\n**我判断这一盒其实是在的，并不是真的空了。**\n\n## 原因：一个连锁反应\n\n1. **放的时候留了缝**：设备按 22.8mm 的节距往外排，盒子本身 22.4mm 厚，每两盒之间有缝，整列是松的。\n2. **取的时候推不实**：设备按公式推到\"盒子应该在的位置\"，可盒子实际位置和公式有偏差，吸盘贴不上，只能一点点往里多推。\n3. **多推会把整列往里挤**：因为列是松的，吸盘一推，后面的盒子会跟着往里滑。第 19 盒多推了 7mm，把第 20 盒（序号 14）也推得更靠里了。\n4. **下一盒偏得更远**：第 20 盒比公式位置深了 9mm 以上，超出了重试上限（最多多推 8mm），设备就判成\"吸空\"，上报 `pit_empty`。\n\n代码里 10 月 21 日已经有一条注释记过同样的现象：\"10 盒一列松 6mm，吸盘一推整列往里滑，压不实吸空\"。\n\n## 连带后果\n\n吸空上报给上位机，上位机认为\"账上有、架上没有\"，就把库存标成**账实不符**。这很可能就是你之前上苗时，上位机一直拒收、提示\"**库存账目需要核实，请在盘点结果中确认差异并人工修正**\"的原因（任务 115 就在任务 121 之后不久）。\n\n## 改法（按优先级）\n\n1. **放置时排紧**（根本解决）：放置间距改用盒子本身的厚度，不用学到的节距。列是紧的，取货时就不会一推整列往里滑。\n2. **取货时继承上一盒的偏差**（很便宜、立刻见效）：比如上一盒多推了 7mm 才吸住，说明这一列整体偏深，下一盒就直接从\"公式位置 + 7mm\"开始推，不用再从头试。\n3. **给误判留余地**：吸空时，先多试一次更大的深度再判空；或者上报时注明\"重试到上限仍未吸住，可能是盒子偏深\"，让上位机不要直接判成账实不符。\n\n建议先做 1 和 2。另外，这一列 A-L10 x=30.8 的账和实物现在可能已经对不上了，最好先盘点一次这个格口确认。要我开始改吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3298,"cache_read_input_tokens":664193,"output_tokens":3401,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2325},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3298,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3401,"cache_read_input_tokens":664193,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3298},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2d942905-9ddf-4e00-8944-7f24a6c80c8a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGyeM9QvKuLbuAZcdb3w","requestRef":"594ff0b0-ec2d-4d5c-87c9-47b8bac88595","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"721f0cab-a042-485f-bd6d-3492102d1603","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:42:17.176Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
