{"parentUuid":"91a86d83-ad13-45a8-b2ef-c96fb65a5c06","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyqHB74f1TyUygSQf9z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_read_input_tokens":671819,"output_tokens":1072,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":350},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1072,"cache_read_input_tokens":671819,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11271,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"62db5d94-1049-4c80-ac25-03439df932ef","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGyqGia7PyURT8Rwu5vH","requestRef":"2cda8107-6a7b-4483-843b-4213b909c834","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"916b0ee3-60b4-49c1-b86b-1468dae22ecf","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:44:16.220Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"916b0ee3-60b4-49c1-b86b-1468dae22ecf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyqHB74f1TyUygSQf9z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，是**盘点时学的**，而且只学过一次。\n\n**时间和地点**：9 月 17 日上午 9:55 和 10:13，用 `stocktake.sh --learn` 在 L7_left（就是现在的 **A-L10**）学的。之后再也没更新过。\n\n**做法**：设备在格口里放几盒，相机量出这一列的总长度（背板到最外面那盒的前脸），除以盒数，得到\"每盒占多少\"，写进尺寸表 `sku_dims.yaml` 的 `pitch_mm`。\n\n**问题在于样本太少：**\n\n| 品种 | 学的时候这一列有几盒 | 样本数 | 学到的节距 | 盒厚 | 多出 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 麻腮风 | 约 9 盒 | 2 次 | 22.81 | 22.4 | 0.4 |\n| 脊灰 | **3 盒** | **1 次** | 26.99 | 25.0 | 2.0 |\n| 甲肝 | **3 盒** | **1 次** | 27.67 | 23.0 | 4.7 |\n\n当时放这几盒用的节距**就是盒厚**（那时还没学过），但量出来每盒多了 2～4.7mm。原因可能是：\n- 盒子没有完全贴紧，或者放下后回弹、微微前倾；\n- 相机量前脸本身有几毫米误差，**只有 3 盒时，这几毫米除以 3，每盒就差出 1～2mm**。\n\n这个操作的说明里本来写着\"往空列放 ≥4 盒\"，脊灰和甲肝都只放了 3 盒，所以结果偏差很大。\n\n**更关键的是**，节距学出来以后，用途从\"盘点时数盒数\"扩大到了\"放置时决定每盒放多远\"（9 月 17 日改的）。一个含了缝和测量误差的数，被拿来当放置间距，缝就被固定下来了，接着引出了后面的吸空。\n\n所以我建议的改法不变：**放置按盒厚排，学到的节距只用来盘点数盒数。**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_read_input_tokens":671819,"output_tokens":1072,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":350},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1072,"cache_read_input_tokens":671819,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"62db5d94-1049-4c80-ac25-03439df932ef","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGyqGia7PyURT8Rwu5vH","requestRef":"2cda8107-6a7b-4483-843b-4213b909c834","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8f295058-594e-4716-86ab-382c1b0707b7","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:44:16.237Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
