{"parentUuid":"011bec36-fd1b-402a-a1e5-2aa42954bbd1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGz78RCP4QXhXJDPwbrr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_read_input_tokens":677085,"output_tokens":1109,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":296},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":677085,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11586,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"11ca2cee-d14e-43a5-a06c-7df52448e5cc","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGz77wudZZTisz24GRdy","requestRef":"bee2b57c-ef74-4761-ba00-20581bea52ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"16947f32-2d7a-4901-b549-ecbe2aab35d2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:47:51.537Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"16947f32-2d7a-4901-b549-ecbe2aab35d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGz78RCP4QXhXJDPwbrr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是 **9 月 16～17 日我做的改动**（提交 7723558），翻当时的对话可以看到原因：\n\n**当时的想法**\n- 9 月 16 日盘点麻腮风时，按实测反推，每盒大约占 22.8mm，比卡尺量的 22.4mm 厚。我当时的判断是：**盒子在货架里本来就要占 22.8mm**，挤不到 22.4mm。\n- 如果放置还按 22.4mm 排，每放一盒，目标位置都会比实际队首深 0.4mm；放到第 15 盒时，就要硬顶整列 6mm。甲肝更夸张，每盒要硬顶 4.7mm。\n- 所以我认为改用学到的节距，可以\"不再硬顶\"，还能\"解决越往外越松\"。当时的原话是：\"甲肝那种缝大的品种不再被硬顶\"。\n\n**这个判断错在哪**\n1. **把\"量出来的缝\"当成了\"盒子必须占的厚度\"**。学节距时量到的那一列，里面本来就有缝、回弹、前倾，还有相机几毫米的测量误差。脊灰和甲肝**只放了 3 盒、只量了一次**，误差被放大，学出来的 27.67mm 根本不是甲肝真实需要的厚度。\n2. **低估了纸盒能被压紧**。实际上，按盒厚放时只是轻轻顶一下，纸盒会被压实，不会出现\"硬顶整列\"。\n3. **没想到松的列会在取货时被推着滑**。列一松，取货多推几毫米，后面的盒子就跟着往里滑，误差越滚越大，最后就出现了任务 121 那样的误判吸空。\n\n结果就是：本来想避免\"顶太紧\"，却把缝固定进了每一次放置里，反而造成了\"越往外越松\"和\"取货吸空\"。\n\n**结论**：放置和盘点要用不同的数。\n- **放置**：按卡尺盒厚排，再加一点点过盈，保证每盒都顶住前一盒。纸盒可以被压实。\n- **盘点**：用学到的节距来数盒数，反映的是实际占用的空间。\n\n要我按这个改吗？改完之后，A-L10 这几列已经放松了的盒子不会自己变紧，最好由人工把它们往里推紧一次，或者盘点一次，重新对账。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_read_input_tokens":677085,"output_tokens":1109,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":296},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":677085,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"11ca2cee-d14e-43a5-a06c-7df52448e5cc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGz77wudZZTisz24GRdy","requestRef":"bee2b57c-ef74-4761-ba00-20581bea52ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"4f7c5643-bf32-450c-8493-75b35b24ce0a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:47:51.557Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
