{"parentUuid":"d3ffb7c5-57ac-42a2-a2ae-1f4d48288bf3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzB7ZxdFzsHPvuaWc5t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好，开始改。改之前先说清一个过渡期的风险：A-L10 现在格口里的盒子，是**按旧节距（22.8 / 27.0 / 27.7）放的**。如果取货也立刻改成按盒厚算位置，越靠外的旧盒子，算出来的位置会比它实际所在**更深**，最多深十几毫米（甲肝序号 3 就差 14mm），吸盘会一下子顶进去。\n\n所以取货这边要一起改：\n1. **放置**：间距改成盒厚，学到的节距只给盘点数盒数用。\n2. **取货**：不再只认一个位置，而是从\"新算法和旧算法里较浅的那个位置\"开始，慢慢往里推，**吸住就停**，最多推到较深位置再加 8mm。新旧放法的盒子都能取到，也不会一上来就猛顶。\n3. **同一列连续取货时继承偏差**：上一盒是多推了几毫米才吸住的，下一盒就从这个偏差开始找，避免像任务 121 那样越推越深、最后误判吸空。\n\n先看取货动作的完整代码："}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1141,"cache_read_input_tokens":678319,"output_tokens":2039,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1428},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1141,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2039,"cache_read_input_tokens":678319,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1141,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1141},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"58f8bd41-a5c0-41a0-85be-db8ea5d122c9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGzAnL4uBbE1JHhCQY3s","requestRef":"7b537b44-c507-49f6-bb27-a7d1eff4d772","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"6c9d52e4-21de-4d9f-9160-ad044ee605b4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:48:55.858Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","session