{"parentUuid":"afef6c95-3292-4ca8-9c51-ea7097a753f8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01GMpbNp2r8UQ3rkmK77df5B","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2949041b-bda0-474a-90bc-24ad6c538996","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:51:31.077Z","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"2949041b-bda0-474a-90bc-24ad6c538996","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzPgyUFHCzEyjK2NW8v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"改好了。放置、取货和每列容量都改回按**盒子本身的厚度**排，学到的节距只留给盘点数盒数用。上位机那边不用改，它仍然只发序号。\n\n**设备上验算的结果**（A-L10，只算数，没动机械臂）：\n\n| 品种 | 改前，每两盒间距 | **改后** | 前 4 盒推进量（mm） | 每列最多 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 麻腮风 | 22.8 | **22.4** | 502.9 / 480.5 / 458.1 / 435.7 | 17 盒 |\n| 脊灰 | 27.0 | **25.0** | 500.3 / 475.3 / 450.3 / 425.3 | 15 盒 |\n| 甲肝 | 27.7 | **23.0** | 502.3 / 479.3 / 456.3 / 433.3 | 16 盒 |\n\n改完后，第 1 盒仍然多推 2mm 顶紧背板，之后每一盒都正好贴住前一盒，不再留缝。\n\n**已完成：**\n- 代码已部署到设备（46ddcf4），工作站服务已重启，上位机下的新任务就会按新算法放。\n- 流程规则手册里的放置规则已更新，写明了为什么改回来（任务 121 误判吸空的经过）。\n- Mac 端提交 6fee2f7。\n\n**下次上苗时请留意**：同一列放 5 盒以上，看看是不是每盒都贴紧了。如果发现越往外反而顶得太紧（比如推的时候盒子变形，或者机械臂报警），说明纸盒压不到卡尺厚度，可以在放置时每盒留一点点缝（改 `gap_deep_mm`，比如 0.2mm），一个参数就能调。\n\n另外，任务 121 那次\"吸空\"其实是误判。上位机账上如果还把那盒（81002713776715542134）记成\"架上没有\"，需要在上位机那边手动修正。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1336,"cache_read_input_tokens":695361,"output_tokens":680,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1336,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":695361,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1336,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1336},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7f29d92a-f2e9-4ef8-8bf9-5d1218f17293","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGzPgTxbEKFLfmaVQQiL","requestRef":"73a31e1c-98f3-4104-b6d3-41c857d4b05b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid"