{"parentUuid":"6217cb6d-5920-4893-81ea-90f347cc9bcd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzSWLbPqXEeoCxPBuE8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":696697,"output_tokens":867,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":38},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":741,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":867,"cache_read_input_tokens":696697,"cache_creation_input_tokens":741,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":741},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":369,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"96df9010-0e72-47d0-b3b2-9b9d5a65ab63","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGzSVK5DSacQADETRp7g","requestRef":"7568a0dd-2cfc-4d3b-8f59-d8fbc3da5aaf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b0bdc387-cb10-4c63-8344-1bf74aad2f4a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:52:03.237Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"b0bdc387-cb10-4c63-8344-1bf74aad2f4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzSWLbPqXEeoCxPBuE8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用甲肝举例，盒子厚 **23mm**，从背板往外放 4 盒。\n\n设备不是\"推到碰到前一盒就停\"，而是**事先算好每一盒放在离背板多远的地方**，推到那个位置就松手。\n\n## 原来：每盒比前一盒往外挪 27.7mm\n\n| 盒 | 盒背离背板 | 盒前脸离背板 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第 1 盒 | 0 | 23.0 |\n| 第 2 盒 | **27.7** | 50.7 |\n| 第 3 盒 | **55.4** | 78.4 |\n| 第 4 盒 | **83.1** | 106.1 |\n\n第 1 盒的前脸在 23.0，第 2 盒的盒背却在 27.7，中间空了 4.7mm。后面每两盒之间都空 4.7mm：\n\n```\n背板|[ 盒1 ]    [ 盒2 ]    [ 盒3 ]    [ 盒4 ]\n    0     23  27.7   50.7 55.4   78.4 83.1  106.1\n            ↑缝4.7      ↑缝4.7      ↑缝4.7\n```\n\n## 现在：每盒比前一盒往外挪 23mm（正好一个盒厚）\n\n| 盒 | 盒背离背板 | 盒前脸离背板 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第 1 盒 | 0 | 23 |\n| 第 2 盒 | **23** | 46 |\n| 第 3 盒 | **46** | 69 |\n| 第 4 盒 | **69** | 92 |\n\n每一盒的盒背正好落在前一盒的前脸上，紧贴：\n\n```\n背板|[ 盒1 ][ 盒2 ][ 盒3 ][ 盒4 ]\n    0     23     46     69     92\n```\n\n## 一句话\n\n**差别只在\"每次往外挪多少\"**：原来挪 27.7mm（比盒子厚 4.7mm，所以留缝），现在挪 23mm（正好一个盒厚，所以贴紧）。\n\n原来那个 27.7mm 是 9 月盘点时用相机量出来的，量的那一列本身就有缝，所以偏大。现在直接用卡尺量的盒厚，就不会留缝了。\n\n其他品种同理，只是缝的大小不同：脊灰原来每盒留缝 2mm，麻腮风 0.4mm，现在都是 0。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":696697,"output_tokens":867,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":38},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":741,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":867,"cache_read_input_tokens":696697,"cache_creation_input_tokens":741,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":741},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"96df9010-0e72-47d0-b3b2-9b9d5a65ab63","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGzSVK5DSacQADETRp7g","requestRef":"7568a0dd-2cfc-4d3b-8f59-d8fbc3da5aaf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"964b413a-93ed-4436-9a9a-9d0b133caa50","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:52:10.432Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
