{"parentUuid":"0c27357c-288a-42c8-9d91-3c48a2b95453","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzVtThccGLwcS2bgUrf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":697438,"output_tokens":669,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":47},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":697438,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":700,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"8d39ce4c-20c8-48b7-8ef3-a845f0795fe8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGzVsgKTvsvF4c8SGKeF","requestRef":"35e2468a-303d-40ed-839d-40c3604e6967","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"290b1c5a-477f-413e-9b6f-fdee6eab4ed6","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:52:49.505Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"290b1c5a-477f-413e-9b6f-fdee6eab4ed6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzVtThccGLwcS2bgUrf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"原来这样设计，是我 9 月 16～17 日的一个判断，后来证明是错的。\n\n**当时的想法**\n那时盘点麻腮风，相机量出来一列 10 盒的总长度，除以 10，算出每盒占 23.0mm，比卡尺量的 22.4mm 厚。我就以为：**盒子放进货架以后，\"实际\"就要占这么厚**，可能是纸盒有弹性、挤不实。\n\n于是我担心：如果还按卡尺厚度（22.4mm）一盒一盒往外排，每盒都比\"实际需要\"少 0.6mm，放到第 15 盒时，就要硬把整列往里顶 9mm，可能顶坏盒子，或者让机械臂报警。\n\n所以我改成：**先用相机量出每盒\"实际占多厚\"，放的时候就按这个数往外挪**，以为这样每盒都刚好贴上，不顶也不松。\n\n**错在哪**\n1. **量出来的\"厚度\"其实包含了缝**：相机量的那一列，盒子之间本来就没贴紧，有缝、有回弹，盒子还微微前倾。我把这些缝当成了盒子本身的厚度。\n2. **甲肝和脊灰只量了 3 盒、量了一次**：相机本身有几毫米误差，3 盒一分摊，每盒就多算出 2～4.7mm。\n3. **担心的\"硬顶\"其实不会发生**：纸盒是能被压实的，按卡尺厚度放，只是轻轻顶一下。\n\n结果正好反过来：本来想避免\"顶太紧\"，却让每两盒之间都主动留了缝。缝让整列变松，取货时一推整列就往里滑，最后造成了误判吸空。\n\n所以现在改回最简单的做法：**按卡尺量的盒厚放**。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":697438,"output_tokens":669,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":47},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":697438,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8d39ce4c-20c8-48b7-8ef3-a845f0795fe8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGzVsgKTvsvF4c8SGKeF","requestRef":"35e2468a-303d-40ed-839d-40c3604e6967","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b831fbae-7f6e-45b3-b06a-cbe2ca867b2a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:52:56.161Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","s