{"parentUuid":"9d87fd6e-0a78-4720-8e81-10e10e10a618","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzYjCvFsyGJqSGpxBN1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以测，设备这边都准备好了：\n- 机械臂在 home，**真实模式**、已使能、无急停、手上空着、没有任务在跑。\n- 视觉、扫码、工作站、上位机后端四个服务都在线。工作站已经加载了今天的新代码：上苗按盒厚贴紧放，退苗走 mid 路线。\n- 仿真相关的进程都已经结束，控制器我不会再动。\n\n**有一个问题需要先处理：设备推不到上位机。**\n推送地址 `192.168.100.212:8080` 现在连不上。最后一次成功是任务 129 之前，16:28 任务 129 的结束事件重试 4 次都失败了，刚才重启服务后的自检也失败了。上苗时设备要先把扫到的码推给上位机，等上位机告诉它放哪；推不过去的话，上位机可能收不到码，10 秒超时后设备会把盒子丢回传送带。\n\n请让同事确认一下上位机的接收服务（8080 端口）有没有在跑。恢复以后我这边不用做任何事，设备会自动重新推送。\n\n**测试时重点看：**\n1. 同一列连续放 5 盒以上，每一盒是不是都贴紧了前一盒，最里面那盒顶住背板。\n2. 有没有出现推的时候盒子变形，或者机械臂报警的情况（这说明顶得太紧了）。\n\n放完以后，想验证取货，可以再下一单从这一列取几盒，看看还会不会误判吸空。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":460,"cache_read_input_tokens":699626,"output_tokens":519,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":460,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":519,"cache_read_input_tokens":699626,"cache_creation_input_tokens":460,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":460},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"47b11eed-e742-4d4c-84fa-7adb99ebd2f0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGzYiWjxLw7GFAYDms34","requestRef":"06712963-a3d5-4460-81d1-cdba9a567146","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"5a50afb8-ce68-4f10-ab45-cd261286763d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:53:33.447Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","en