{"parentUuid":"8ba9f062-d897-4604-ac42-cff027d86731","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgH1MhKrpv4BZq1hzgZUA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1230,"cache_read_input_tokens":709611,"output_tokens":2440,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1387},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1230,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2440,"cache_read_input_tokens":709611,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1230},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":25173,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"ddc60123-7144-420f-bd9f-367aa68683a3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgH1Mgn7vakuFC9VTPLhN","requestRef":"137ee6a9-c1e4-4c66-af16-76fa55d0d3ba","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"af2f6105-7ddc-4b31-a566-19a8cee80959","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:04:29.680Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"af2f6105-7ddc-4b31-a566-19a8cee80959","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgH1MhKrpv4BZq1hzgZUA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"查到了。出错的是任务 131 的**第 2 盒**（第 1 盒已经正常上架）。\n\n## 发生了什么\n\n| 时间 | 步骤 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 17:02:16 | 识别 | 桌上 1 盒（麻腮风），落点 **(-1.107, 0.268)**，手腕要转 99° |\n| 17:02:18 | 吸盘打开、下探到盒面 | 到位 |\n| 17:02:19 | **抬升**（同时把手腕从 99° 转正到 91°） | **控制器拒绝执行，返回码 6** |\n\n设备上报 `E_PICK_MOTION`（吸取运动中断于\"抬升\"），任务现在停在\"需人工处理\"。**机械臂停在桌面盒子上方，吸盘是开着的，很可能正吸着这盒。**\n\n## 原因\n\n和 10 月 21 日任务 105 是**同一个老问题**：盒子落在**桌子最远的边上**。\n- 这次落点 x=-1.107，离机械臂底座约 1.14m；任务 105 是 x=-1.140。\n- 机械臂臂展 1.3m，在这个位置手臂几乎伸直，接近奇异姿态。\n- 这时候让它一边直线抬升、一边转手腕，控制器算不出可行的关节运动，就直接拒绝（返回码 6 就是\"直线运动无法执行\"）。\n\n这和今天改的放置间距、退苗路线都无关。这是之前记下来、一直还没改的\"桌面远端吸取\"问题。\n\n## 现在怎么恢复（请你在现场操作）\n\n1. **先看一眼**：盒子是不是被吸在吸盘上、离桌面多高。\n2. **把盒子放回桌上**：盒子就在桌面正上方，直接吹开吸盘让它落回去即可：\n   ```\n   ./scripts/check_cell.sh suction\n   ```\n3. **让机械臂回 home**（会先在仿真里判卷当前位置 → home 的路径，判过了才动真机，要你输入 YES）：\n   ```\n   ./scripts/arm/go_real.sh home\n   ```\n4. **结束这个任务**：\n   ```\n   curl -X POST http://192.168.100.190:8902/tasks/131/stop\n   ```\n\n## 根治办法（等你确认再改）\n\n- **抬升时先竖直往上提几厘米，再转手腕**，不要两个动作同时做。离开奇异区以后再转腕，控制器就能算出来。\n- 或者在视觉选落点时，**把桌面最远那一条（离底座 1.1m 以外）划为不可吸区**，让上苗机送的盒子不停在那里。\n\n另外有一点想确认：第 1 盒放进了 A-L10 x=-178.2 的**序号 4**，也就是上位机账上认为这一列前面已经有 4 盒。你之前说格口已经清空了，如果这一列实际是空的，这盒就会孤零零立在离背板约 9cm 的地方，可能会倒。麻烦也看一眼。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1230,"cache_read_input_tokens":709611,"output_tokens":2440,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1387},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1230,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2440,"cache_read_input_tokens":709611,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1230},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ddc60123-7144-420f-bd9f-367aa68683a3","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgH1Mgn7vakuFC9VTPLhN","requestRef":"137ee6a9-c1e4-4c66-af16-76fa55d0d3ba","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"77c8f1f5-7804-46e1-b832-8f002470ff9b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:04:31.324Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
