{"parentUuid":"90362586-f4c9-43db-bae0-7c117548dcf7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgH1f6qhufit8DYjJztEF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":727095,"output_tokens":1134,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":443},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1134,"cache_read_input_tokens":727095,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12188,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"2695a471-87b3-4194-85d3-099934d970ab","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgH1f6QA2Ev3hLaFtesgC","requestRef":"b10d97c7-064b-48ec-8a6b-605b46143218","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"02ddc7e2-120b-4d42-9a43-00889671b360","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:08:12.817Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"02ddc7e2-120b-4d42-9a43-00889671b360","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgH1f6qhufit8DYjJztEF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已经切回真实模式。真机现在的姿态是 J2 = -55°、J3 = -7°，手臂几乎伸直，伸在桌子远端上方，吸盘上没有盒子（刚才已经吹开了）。\n\n**为什么回不去**：AutoDL 服务器关机了，`go_real.sh` 没法先在仿真里判卷，按设计就不动真机。这是保护在起作用，不是路径真的有问题。我单独重判那条回 home 的录制，也一样连不上 AutoDL。\n\n**两种恢复办法，你选一个：**\n\n**办法 1（推荐）：重新开 AutoDL，再走一遍**\n在 AutoDL 控制台开机（无卡模式就行），然后：\n```\n./scripts/restore_autodl.sh\n./scripts/arm/go_real.sh home\n```\nAutoDL 重启后 SSH 端口可能会变，变了要先改 `~/.ssh/config` 里 autodl 的端口。\n\n**办法 2：不开 AutoDL，用示教器手动收回**\n1. 示教器切到**关节点动**，慢慢把 **J2 往正方向**点（大臂抬起），抬到大约 -25° 左右，手臂就离开桌面、往上收了。\n2. 再把 **J3 往负方向**点到大约 -60°（小臂折回来）。\n3. 这时已经接近 home 了，用示教器把机械臂移回 home 位姿：`[-1.9, -7.6, -62.6, -18.0, 89.9, -3.2]`（度）。\n4. 示教完记得切回**自动模式**：`./scripts/check_cell.sh opmode auto`\n\n**最后**，任务 131 还挂着，结束它：\n```\ncurl -X POST http://192.168.100.190:8902/tasks/131/stop\n```\n任务结束后告诉我，我再重启工作站服务，把\"太远的盒不抓\"加载进去。代码已经部署到设备上了，但现在重启会把任务 131 直接中断，所以先等着。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":727095,"output_tokens":1134,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":443},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1134,"cache_read_input_tokens":727095,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2695a471-87b3-4194-85d3-099934d970ab","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgH1f6QA2Ev3hLaFtesgC","requestRef":"b10d97c7-064b-48ec-8a6b