{"parentUuid":"ae59479b-40d4-4352-aa68-d6fdf277ef3a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgH1j4yBw2q4Z4sj5SKAM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，而且这条路线我算过了，是安全的：\n\n- 刚才仿真录下的这条 movej，起点和真机现在的姿态**最大只差 0.05°**，就是从真机当前位置出发的。\n- 真机现在**吸盘离桌面其实还有 17cm**（抬升动作已经做了一部分才被拒）。\n- 整条 movej 上，吸盘**一路往上、往里走**：从 (-1.11, 0.27, 0.24) 升到 home (-0.75, 0.19, 0.41)。**全程最低点就是起点**，离桌面 168mm，没有往下或往外的段，周围也没有别的东西。\n\n用现成的真机播放脚本，按这条录制轨迹慢速走回去就行。它会比对起点，还要你输入 YES 确认：\n```\n./scripts/arm/run_real.sh /tmp/check_home.json 0.3 0.3\n```\n（两个 0.3 分别是速度和加速度，慢一点更稳妥。）\n\n注意：这条路线是靠离线正解检查的，没有经过 AutoDL 的完整碰撞判卷。依据是轨迹全程在桌面上方、单调往上往里走，风险很小。执行时请人站在急停旁边。\n\n回到 home 以后，结束任务 131：\n```\ncurl -X POST http://192.168.100.190:8902/tasks/131/stop\n```\n然后告诉我，我重启工作站服务，把\"太远的盒不抓\"加载进去。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2405,"cache_read_input_tokens":729286,"output_tokens":895,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":388},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2405,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":895,"cache_read_input_tokens":729286,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2405},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b013dd0c-029a-43bd-9dea-da1be9c5d068","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgH1j4Nytv9f81VjXGzYU","requestRef":"82ca2e2a-0ce0-4f40-bfd7-8a36a3a769a3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa33ccac-f49c-455b-86f2-28e445b64a09","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:09:03.853Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session