{"parentUuid":"d48d3b4b-f9b4-44c8-852d-63702711ef5b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgH1vtBPhXog4zfC4WQJA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"工作站服务已重启，新代码都加载进去了。设备空闲，机械臂在 home，真实模式。\n\n现在生效的改动：\n1. **上苗贴紧放**：每盒往外挪一个盒厚，不再留缝。\n2. **太远的盒不抓**：落点离底座超过 1.13m 的盒子直接跳过，不会再出现吸住后抬不起来的情况。\n3. **不可吸时等人处理**：自动送料模式下，桌上有盒但吸不了（太远、太斜、太窄）时，机械臂停在 home 等人把盒子往近处推，看到盒子放好了就自动继续，最多等 30 秒，不用重新下单。\n4. **退苗走 mid 路线**：连续退苗时停在 mid，不回 home。\n\n**还有一个问题没解决**：推送地址 `192.168.100.212:8080` 仍然连不上（webhook 状态是 `unreachable`）。上苗时设备要把扫到的码推给上位机、等它回复放哪；如果上位机是靠轮询事件拿到码的，就不受影响，否则可能等不到回复，10 秒后把盒子丢回。测之前请同事确认一下上位机的 8080 接收服务。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":452,"cache_read_input_tokens":733190,"output_tokens":421,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":452,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":421,"cache_read_input_tokens":733190,"cache_creation_input_tokens":452,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":452},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1f53a496-1d8c-4ad4-bce7-2b729ec63a77","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgH1vshsSXrqDjqhbiQBr","requestRef":"e2ecf24f-cd7e-47e0-9153-5116f0ea709e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"21b0c217-5cdb-487d-a403-baa670d74b4b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:11:38.622Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9522f059-708e-4e8b-be90-04411bc0aa04","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe