{"parentUuid":"ee4253f5-5f0d-499e-8476-b57ea63439dd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"33316254-4f9e-4248-900d-9181fdfbff34","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017XSqwEYRjpS4fiTSqHB5bK","type":"tool_result","content":"7b75834 docs: 桌面可吸取范围可视化(原绿区 vs 绿区∩离底座≤1.13m, 叠加 436 次历史吸取落点与失败位置)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"65424fba-9d5e-4e96-9c84-9bc095a193e0","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:37:24.280Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"7b75834 docs: 桌面可吸取范围可视化(原绿区 vs 绿区∩离底座≤1.13m, 叠加 436 次历史吸取落点与失败位置)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/桌面可吸取范围/桌面可吸取范围.html","hunks":[{"oldStart":36,"oldLines":7,"newStart":36,"newLines":7,"lines":[" </div>"," <div class=\"lg\">","   <span><i style=\"background:#bfe8cc\"></i>可吸取</span>","-  <span><i style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#fbd0d1 0 3px,#fff 3px 6px);border:1px solid #f3a5a7\"></i>现在去掉的一条（太远）</span>","+  <span><i style=\"background:#fbd0d1;border:1px solid #f3a5a7\"></i>现在去掉的部分（太远）</span>","   <span><i style=\"background:#7f8ea3;border-radius:50%\"></i>吸取成功</span>","   <span><i style=\"background:none;color:var(--cut);font-style:normal;width:auto\">✕</i>吸取失败</span>","   <span><i style=\"background:#e8edf4;border:1px dashed #b5c0cf\"></i>桌面</span>"]},{"oldStart":111,"oldLines":7,"newStart":111,"newLines":8,"lines":["   g.fillStyle = \"#98a3b3\"; g.font = \"12px sans-serif\";","   g.fillText(\"↑ 桌子远端（回流传送带一侧）\", 40, 14);","   g.fillText(\"↓ 机械臂底座方向\", 40, H - 6);","-  g.fillText(\"← 货架另一侧\", W - 150, H - 6);","+  g.fillText(\"货架一侧 →\", W - 110, H - 6);","+  g.fillText(\"← 上苗机一侧\", 170, H - 6);","   cv.onmousemove = e => {","     const r = cv.getBoundingClientRect(), mx = e.clientX - r.left, my = e.clientY - r.top, tip = document.getElementById(\"tip\");","     let best = null; for (const h of hits) { const d = Math.hypot(h[0] - mx, h[1] - my); if (d < 7 && (!best || d < best[0])) best = [d, h[2]]; }"]},{"oldStart":132,"oldLines":8,"newStart":133,"newLines":8,"lines":[" document.getElementById(\"tbl\").innerHTML = `","   <tr><th></th><th>原来</th><th>现在</th><th>变化</th></tr>","   <tr><td>可吸取面积</td><td><b>${cm2(aOld)}</b> cm²</td><td><b>${cm2(aNew)}</b> cm²</td><td class=\"red\">−${cm2(aOld - aNew)} cm²（−${((aOld - aNew) / aOld * 100).toFixed(1)}%）</td></tr>","-  <tr><td>历史落点在可吸区内</td><td><b>${D.pts.length}</b> 次</td><td><b>${near_.length}</b> 次</td><td>${far.length} 次落在被去掉的一条里</td></tr>","-  <tr><td>其中因\"够不着\"失败（悬停/抬升被拒）</td><td class=\"red\"><b>${mfail(D.pts)}</b> 次</td><td class=\"green\"><b>${mfail(near_)}</b> 次</td><td class=\"green\">全部在被去掉的一条里</td></tr>","-  <tr><td>被去掉那一条的成功率</td><td colspan=\"2\">${far.length - failN(far)} / ${far.length} 成功（${((far.length - failN(far)) / far.length * 100).toFixed(0)}%）</td><td>剩下区域的成功率 ${((near_.length - failN(near_)) / near_.length * 100).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr>`;","-document.getElementById(\"note\").innerHTML = `被去掉的是<b>桌子远端靠回流传送带的一条窄带</b>（绿区原本就只到离远端约 3cm 处）。落在这里的盒子，现在会被识别跳过，机械臂停在 home 等人把盒子往近处推一推，看到摆好了就自动继续。<br>另外 2 次失败（任务 11、12，\"不在落点上空\"）是入口检查，和距离无关，所以仍在可吸区内。`;","+  <tr><td>历史落点在可吸区内</td><td><b>${D.pts.length}</b> 次</td><td><b>${near_.length}</b> 次</td><td>${far.length} 次落在被去掉的部分</td></tr>","+  <tr><td>其中因\"够不着\"失败（悬停/抬升被拒）</td><td class=\"red\"><b>${mfail(D.pts)}</b> 次</td><td class=\"green\"><b>${mfail(near_)}</b> 次</td><td class=\"green\">全部在被去掉的部分</td></tr>","+  <tr><td>被去掉部分的成功率</td><td colspan=\"2\">${far.length - failN(far)} / ${far.length} 成功（${((far.length - failN(far)) / far.length * 100).toFixed(0)}%）</td><td>剩下区域的成功率 ${((near_.length - failN(near_)) / near_.length * 100).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr>`;","+document.getElementById(\"note\").innerHTML = `被去掉的是<b>红色弧线以外、桌子远端靠货架一侧的一块</b>（离机械臂底座超过 1.13 m，手臂在这里几乎伸直）。落在这里的盒子，现在会被识别跳过，机械臂停在 home 等人把盒子往近处推一推，看到摆好了就自动继续。<br>另外 2 次失败（任务 11、12，\"不在落点上空\"）是入口检查，和距离无关，所以仍在可吸区内。`;"," </script></body></html>"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/桌面可吸取范围/桌面可吸取范围.html"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5ab357b3-c056-489c-8d02-d97608b0e4ee","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":13},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ee4253f5-5f0d-499e-8476-b57ea63439dd","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"01656c70-06ad-4742-8aef-0c797b0cbfe1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"2a58454dd2b520c34935901da552484fdce928b69138642d8398f4d9fb7572fa","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"图已生成，数据无误，但发现两处文字描述有误：被移除的区域其实是桌子远端靠货架一侧的弧形区域（占原绿区16.7%），而非窄带；方向标注也需修正为右边靠货架、左边靠上苗机。我现在去修正这两处备注。\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017XSqwEYRjpS4fiTSqHB5bK","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && F=\"docs/桌面可吸取范围/桌面可吸取范围.html\" && /usr/bin/python3 - \"$F\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p,encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\nR=[('  g.fillText(\"← 货架另一侧\", W - 150, H - 6);','  g.fillText(\"货架一侧 →\", W - 110, H - 6);\\n  g.fillText(\"← 上苗机一侧\", 170, H - 6);'),\n   ('被去掉的是<b>桌子远端靠回流传送带的一条窄带</b>（绿区原本就只到离远端约 3cm 处）。落在这里的盒子，',\n    '被去掉的是<b>红色弧线以外、桌子远端靠货架一侧的一块</b>（离机械臂底座超过 1.13 m，手臂在这里几乎伸直）。落在这里的盒子，'),\n   ('<span><i style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#fbd0d1 0 3px,#fff 3px 6px);border:1px solid #f3a5a7\"></i>现在去掉的一条（太远）</span>',\n    '<span><i style=\"background:#fbd0d1;border:1px solid #f3a5a7\"></i>现在去掉的部分（太远）</span>'),\n   ('<td>${far.length} 次落在被去掉的一条里</td>','<td>${far.length} 次落在被去掉的部分</td>'),\n   ('<td class=\"green\">全部在被去掉的一条里</td>','<td class=\"green\">全部在被去掉的部分</td>'),\n   ('<tr><td>被去掉那一条的成功率</td>','<tr><td>被去掉部分的成功率</td>'),\n]\nfor a,b in R:\n    assert a in s, a[:40]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,\"w\",encoding=\"utf-8\").write(s)\nEOF\ngit add \"$F\" && git commit -q -m \"docs: 桌面可吸取范围可视化(原绿区 vs 绿区∩离底座≤1.13m, 叠加 436 次历史吸取落点与失败位置)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git log --oneline -1 && open \"$F\"","description":"修正标注文字、提交并打开对比页"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
