{"parentUuid":"bb628880-34a9-4622-a829-881c05222d4f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJEXkBopgF1gdw73dfJw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对比图做好了，已经在浏览器里打开：**`docs/桌面可吸取范围/桌面可吸取范围.html`**\n\n左右两张是同一张桌面的俯视图，左边是原来的可吸范围，右边是现在的。机械臂底座在画面下方，上方是桌子远端，左边靠上苗机，右边靠货架。\n\n**两张图怎么看：**\n- **绿色**：允许吸取的区域。原来就是走廊绿区，也就是仿真里验证过能下探到盒面的范围。\n- **右图里的红色区域**：现在新去掉的部分，在红色弧线（离底座 1.13m）以外，是**桌子远端、靠货架一侧的一块**。\n- **灰点**：历史上 436 次真机吸取的落点。**红叉**是失败的，旁边标了任务号。鼠标移到点上能看到时间、坐标和离底座的距离。\n\n**对比结果：**\n\n| | 原来 | 现在 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 可吸面积 | 1661 cm² | 1384 cm²（少 16.7%） |\n| 历史落点在可吸区内 | 436 次 | 431 次，有 5 次落在被去掉的部分 |\n| 因\"够不着\"失败（悬停或抬升被拒） | **3 次**（任务 14、105、131） | **0 次**，3 次全在被去掉的部分 |\n| 被去掉部分的成功率 | 5 次里只成功 2 次（40%） | — |\n| 剩下区域的成功率 | — | 99.5% |\n\n**结论**：被去掉的面积虽然有 16.7%，但盒子很少落到那里（436 次里只有 5 次），而且落到那里时有六成会失败。现在这种盒子会被跳过，机械臂停在 home 等人把盒子往近处推一推，看到摆好了就自动继续。\n\n剩下的 2 个红叉（任务 11、12）在可吸区中间。它们的失败原因是\"不在落点上空\"，属于入口检查没通过，和距离无关。\n\n已提交 7b75834。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1653,"cache_read_input_tokens":748520,"output_tokens":710,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1653,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":710,"cache_read_input_tokens":748520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1653,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1653},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f72b4476-77f6-457f-9948-f53378cc30f7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJEXjcpa8DsURUD1Rw2a","requestRef":"eaab07bb-cbfe-49a1-9afe-719a2c977d78","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ded88f4-080c-4721-b1d3-ca67b0dbf26b","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:37:31.725Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"01656c70-06ad-4742-8aef-0c797b0cbfe1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
