{"parentUuid":"df20b498-7dbf-498e-a257-e6fa41c75ffd","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14993064 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9f652acb-f672-4e5f-8a74-e2f3d0f8083c","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:39:44.357Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14993064 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"01656c70-06ad-4742-8aef-0c797b0cbfe1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"9f652acb-f672-4e5f-8a74-e2f3d0f8083c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJEi5bsxF6mfBBmBeuA9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"修好了，已经部署（设备端提交 0848d62），工作站服务已重启，可以测了。\n\n**怎么摆**：把盒子放在**桌子远端、靠货架那一侧的角上**，也就是对比图右上角的红色区域。只靠远端边缘还不够，越靠货架一侧越远，最容易超过 1.13m。\n\n**预期现象：**\n\n1. 机械臂在 home 拍照，**飞到盒子上方的近拍位**看一眼。这一步离得还远，够得着。\n2. 发现太远，**不往下吸，直接回 home**。\n3. 机械臂**停在 home 不动**，等你处理。上位机这时会收到：\n   - `fault`：`E_NO_PICKABLE`，\"有盒但无可吸的脸，请人工摆正\"\n   - 每 5 秒一条 `waiting_box`（等人放盒）\n   - 回执里的候选一栏写着\"**淘汰：太远（离底座 1.1x m）**\"\n4. **你不动盒子**：机械臂一直安静地等着，不会来回飞。等满 30 秒仍然没动，任务就结束，结束原因是 `table_empty`。\n5. **你把盒子往桌子中间推一推**：设备看到盒子位置变了，并且 2 秒内没再动，就自动重新识别，然后正常吸取、扫码、上架，任务继续，不用重新下单。\n\n**如果和预期不一样**，比如机械臂往下去吸了、报了别的错，或者停单了，告诉我任务号，我直接查记录。另外，摆的位置如果离底座还不到 1.13m，它会正常吸取，这也是正确的行为。到时候看回执里的\"离底座\"距离就知道了。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1125,"cache_read_input_tokens":757999,"output_tokens":590,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1125,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":590,"cache_read_input_tokens":757999,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1125,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1125},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fd3e814a-2e99-47a3-8253-81617b11defe","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJEi4X9ruzmjzQQQkFDU","requestRef":"97f5f664-9029-4cdf-bbb5-1fb3d113ee70","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b88cc1a-b2e2-4ad2-a468-7a59901a5eb1","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:39:51.930Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"01656c70-06ad-4742-8aef-0c797b0cbfe1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
