{"parentUuid":"6e2b0713-23cf-4852-a2da-f60899e68418","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJH9YQsFhAztrXdBMLfb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看清楚了。上位机现在的取状态方式是这样的：\n\n**请求方式：轮询**\n- 来源是 **192.168.100.212**（同事那台电脑），一直用同一条 TCP 长连接。\n- **每 3 秒一轮，每轮发两个请求**：先 `GET /health`，紧接着 `GET /device`。\n- 最近 400 条请求里，`/device` 192 次、`/health` 189 次，占了绝大多数。任务相关的请求很少：下任务 2 次、回复去处 5 次、`/plan/store` 4 次、停止 1 次。\n- 没有看到上位机调 `GET /tasks/{id}` 和 `GET /tasks/{id}/events`，说明任务进度主要靠 webhook 推送来拿。可推送地址 8080 现在一直连不上，所以上位机这段时间**很可能没收到任何任务事件**。\n\n**耗时**\n\n| 请求 | 中位耗时 | 最长 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET /health` | 1 ms | 3 ms |\n| `GET /device` | **1186 ms** | **4584 ms** |\n\n`/device` 慢，是因为**每次请求都要现连一次机械臂控制器**：连接 → 读状态、关节、真空开关 → 断开，再顺带探一下视觉和扫码服务。所以每次至少要 1 秒，任务进行中控制器忙的时候，最长到了 4.6 秒。\n\n**带来的问题**\n1. **上位机容易超时**：如果它的请求超时设成 1～3 秒，就会时不时失败。之前同事说\"连接不上\"，很可能就是这个原因。\n2. **任务中额外占用控制器**：机械臂干活时，每 3 秒还要另开一条连接去控制器读状态。目前没出事，但这是不必要的负担。\n3. **两个请求重复**：`/health` 只说明服务活着，`/device` 本身就包含了这个信息。\n\n**建议的改法**（先说思路，你同意再改）：\n- **设备端加缓存**：后台线程每 1 秒读一次控制器状态，`/device` 直接返回最新缓存，耗时从 1 秒以上降到几毫秒；返回里带上\"状态读取时间\"，上位机能看出数据新不新。上位机那边**不用改**。\n- **建议上位机**：\n  - 轮询只调 `/device` 一个接口，`/health` 可以去掉。\n  - 有任务在跑时，用 `GET /tasks/{id}/events?since=N` 补拉事件。现在推送不通，它就收不到任何任务进展。\n\n要先做设备端的缓存吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1629,"cache_read_input_tokens":760874,"output_tokens":1296,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":390},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1629,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1296,"cache_read_input_tokens":760874,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1629,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1629},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"dd9c3e05-cd3d-46f4-8dab-c529c4b87175","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJH9Xur5vuioPToBpqJd","requestRef":"8067befa-277b-4551-82a5-e8ef32878cfd","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8f3312cc-ccea-48e1-b0a2-dcf1dd5d45c7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:11:58.426Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
