{"parentUuid":"58a99b82-c29f-4880-9a67-af6117e5de60","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJHTMkuvpR3CN89G8SZV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1749,"cache_read_input_tokens":769085,"output_tokens":1408,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":500},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1749,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1408,"cache_read_input_tokens":769085,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1749,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1749},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":14890,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"d90370a1-e099-479f-a720-057b72961b3b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJHTM9TPAiVNh9AWxQan","requestRef":"bb5fac24-9192-4475-b7fd-db09000ba655","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"78883b19-b6a7-4f45-877a-50858b551b8e","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:16:01.110Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"78883b19-b6a7-4f45-877a-50858b551b8e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJHTMkuvpR3CN89G8SZV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"查清楚了，\"断线\"的原因不在网络，而在设备这边的 `/device` 接口有时候特别慢：\n\n**1. `/device` 慢的时段，正好是设备在干活的时候**\n- 今天 09:07～09:09，有 29 次超过 2.5 秒，最长 4.6 秒。这正是**任务 134 在跑**的时候（识别、吸取、扫码、放置）。\n- 昨天 13:10～13:11，有 42 次超过 2.5 秒，**最长 23.9 秒**。那时候没有任务，是在用 `check_cell.sh scanner` 测扫码，扫码服务正等着人过码，最长等 30 秒。\n\n**2. 为什么会慢**\n`/device` 每次都要**当场**去问三个地方：\n- 连一次机械臂控制器，读状态和关节。机械臂干活时控制器响应变慢。\n- 问一下视觉服务在不在。\n- 问一下**扫码服务**在不在。扫码服务一次只能处理一个请求，它在扫码（等码最多 5～30 秒）的时候，`/device` 的这一问就得排队等着。\n\n所以设备一干活，`/device` 就从 1 秒变成 3～5 秒，甚至 20 多秒。上位机每 3 秒问一次，等不到回复就超时，界面上就显示\"断线一会\"，过一阵又恢复了。**设备从来没有返回过错误**，4556 次请求全部是 200，只是慢。\n\n**3. 换 WebSocket 能不能解决？**\n**单靠换 WebSocket 不能根治**：如果设备读状态的方式不变，推送出去的状态一样会卡住，只是从\"请求超时\"变成\"消息断档\"。真正要改的是**设备读状态的方式**：\n- **后台线程每秒读一次**控制器状态，存成缓存，`/device` 直接返回缓存，耗时变成几毫秒，永远不会卡。\n- 视觉和扫码在不在线，改成看后台记录的最近一次结果，不在请求里当场去问。\n\n**4. 这样改了以后，要不要再上 WebSocket？**\n- **只解决\"断线\"**：做缓存就够了，上位机那边**一行都不用改**。\n- **想要实时，同时彻底换掉 webhook**（现在推不过去）：在缓存的基础上再加 WebSocket。状态一变立刻推，任务事件也走同一条通道，上位机不用再开 8080 端口。\n\n我的建议：**先做缓存**，马上解决断线问题，风险小。WebSocket 作为第二步，等同事有时间改上位机时再一起做。你觉得呢？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1749,"cache_read_input_tokens":769085,"output_tokens":1408,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":500},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1749,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1408,"cache_read_input_tokens":769085,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1749,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1749},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d90370a1-e099-479f-a720-057b72961b3b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJHTM9TPAiVNh9AWxQan","requestRef":"bb5fac24-9192-4475-b7fd-db09000ba655","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"165d3884-a66f-4e94-856f-64ce39551b47","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:16:01.868Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
