{"parentUuid":"b1237816-7e22-4c58-9559-5d2171ec2f64","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJHiz3tfjbcZqTfYzHn6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_read_input_tokens":770834,"output_tokens":688,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":688,"cache_read_input_tokens":770834,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":130,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"d49bde95-cbba-4aaa-89d5-f95529432d78","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJHiy5cLsUv7MmLAfdbv","requestRef":"63bd554c-f1ef-451e-8328-9b040703ef6e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"e97a57d0-3c26-4447-82ac-744b82deba4f","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:19:18.263Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"e97a57d0-3c26-4447-82ac-744b82deba4f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJHiz3tfjbcZqTfYzHn6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"打个比方。\n\n**现在的做法：每问一次，就现场跑去查一遍**\n\n上位机每 3 秒问一次\"设备现在怎么样\"，设备每次收到这个问题，都要**当场**跑去问三个人：\n1. 问机械臂控制器：\"你现在在哪、正不正常？\"\n2. 问视觉服务：\"你在不在？\"\n3. 问扫码服务：\"你在不在？\"\n\n三个人都回答了，设备才把结果告诉上位机。\n\n**卡在哪**：扫码服务一次只能接待一个人。设备干活时，扫码服务正忙着扫码，最长要等 5 秒；人工测扫码时最长等 30 秒。这时候设备去问它\"你在不在\"，就得**排队等它忙完**。机械臂控制器在干活时，回答也会变慢。\n\n所以设备一干活，上位机问一句\"你怎么样\"，要等 3～5 秒甚至 20 多秒才有回答。上位机等不及，就认为\"断线了\"，过一会儿回答来了，又显示恢复。\n\n**缓存的做法：派一个人专门在后台定时查，结果写在白板上**\n\n设备里专门安排一个后台线程，**每秒**去问一遍这三个人，把最新结果写在一块\"白板\"上。\n\n上位机来问的时候，设备**不再现场跑去问**，直接看一眼白板就回答，**几毫秒**就能答复。\n\n- 就算扫码服务正忙、后台那次查询要等，也只是白板上的信息晚更新几秒，上位机来问时**照样立刻有回答**，不会卡住。\n- 白板上会写着\"这是几点几分查到的\"，上位机能看出信息新不新。\n\n**一句话**：现在是\"上位机问一次，设备跑一趟\"，被最慢的那个拖住；改成\"设备自己定时查好放着，上位机来问直接给\"，就不会卡了。\n\n上位机那边不用改任何东西，还是照常每 3 秒问一次。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_read_input_tokens":770834,"output_tokens":688,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":688,"cache_read_input_tokens":770834,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d49bde95-cbba-4aaa-89d5-f95529432d78","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJHiy5cLsUv7MmLAfdbv","requestRef":"63bd554c-f1ef-451e-8328-9b040703ef6e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8c5467a3-764c-4d96-9440-439cea0f44c5","timestamp