{"parentUuid":"ddf547d0-e87c-43f8-a391-4136909c3419","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJHnCEhZaU9Y1Umfrq6K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_read_input_tokens":772290,"output_tokens":790,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":157},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":790,"cache_read_input_tokens":772290,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1767,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"4701925b-8836-4e64-b80a-b944b6c43c81","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJHnBixLCycJBNtpRMjx","requestRef":"f8a33553-b75d-4e02-a44a-e674f82260d3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"74915d98-ab75-448e-8da8-4012bcc8d889","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:20:03.560Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"74915d98-ab75-448e-8da8-4012bcc8d889","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJHnCEhZaU9Y1Umfrq6K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**只为解决\"断线\"，不需要。** 做了缓存以后，上位机每 3 秒问一次，每次几毫秒就有回答，就不会再断线了。状态最多晚 3 秒知道，对显示设备状态来说足够了。\n\n**WebSocket 真正有用的地方，是\"任务事件\"这条路，不是设备状态。**\n\n上苗、取货的过程中，设备会产生事件：扫到码了、放好了、吸空了、出故障了。上位机必须及时收到，尤其是\"扫到码\"，上位机要在 10 秒内回复放哪，否则盒子会被丢回。现在这些事件靠 webhook 推送，**而 webhook 从昨天下午到现在一直推不过去**（上位机的 8080 端口连不上），上位机又没有在轮询事件，所以这段时间它其实**收不到任务过程**。\n\n这条路有三种修法：\n\n| 做法 | 要改哪边 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **修好 webhook** | 上位机 | 让同事查一下 8080 接收服务为什么连不上，恢复后什么都不用改 |\n| **上位机轮询事件** | 上位机 | 有任务在跑时，每 1～2 秒调一次 `GET /tasks/{id}/events?since=N`，简单可靠 |\n| **WebSocket** | 设备 + 上位机 | 事件和状态都走同一条连接，实时推送，上位机不用开端口，以后 webhook 就可以不要了 |\n\n**我的建议**：\n1. **现在**：设备端做缓存，解决断线。同时请同事先把 webhook 修好，或者加上事件轮询，二选一，改动都很小。\n2. **以后**：如果 webhook 还是经常出问题，或者想要更实时，再一起换成 WebSocket。\n\n要我先做缓存吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_read_input_tokens":772290,"output_tokens":790,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":157},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":790,"cache_read_input_tokens":772290,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4701925b-8836-4e64-b80a-b944b6c43c81","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJHnBixLCycJBNtpRMjx","requestRef":"f8a33553-b75d-4e02-a44a-e674f82260d3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"20221e44-00ae-4e35-84cf-a29ca223323e","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:20:10.176Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
