{"parentUuid":"4d636a1b-f249-482c-a81a-d7056254c396","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJJrb4d9BJ2STmpxdRrd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**现在不需要 WebSocket。**\n\n设备和上位机之间，有两种东西要传：\n\n| 要传的东西 | 怎么传 | 现在的情况 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **设备状态**（在哪、忙不忙、有没有急停） | 上位机每 3 秒来问一次 | ✅ 刚修好，每次 1 毫秒回答，不再断线 |\n| **任务事件**（扫到码、放好了、吸空、故障） | 设备主动推给上位机（webhook） | ✅ 同事那边的接收服务已经恢复了，刚才任务 137 推了 23 条，**全部送达、0 次失败**，每条十几毫秒 |\n\n两条路现在都是通的，所以不需要再换一种方式。\n\n**什么时候才需要 WebSocket？**\n- 如果上位机的接收服务又经常掉线，导致 webhook 推不过去（就像昨天下午那样）。WebSocket 是上位机主动连设备，不需要上位机开着接收端口，所以不怕这个问题。\n- 或者想让设备状态实时变化（现在最多晚 3 秒）。\n\n这两种情况现在都没有，先不用做。以后如果 webhook 又频繁出问题，再考虑换。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":652,"cache_read_input_tokens":787667,"output_tokens":429,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":652,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":787667,"cache_creation_input_tokens":652,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":652},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e02d24f2-bac2-4731-8fc0-2ccc8973f621","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJJraZMRrdXiBF4m1r4V","requestRef":"ec97b30c-c6ab-4ff0-ab3d-0430b11e2ef9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"43ced5b0-cd96-4576-9379-6c339a77ac65","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:34:12.527Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e