{"parentUuid":"d5a49c0c-315f-4f51-b6f4-a67ef838aeed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJJzaFUgWSU8vAwrDhgC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":788319,"output_tokens":705,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":140},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":705,"cache_read_input_tokens":788319,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1577,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"1e174c19-a5e5-47db-a536-c78c7c6fa25c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJJzZKR9EmouWX9cNdKZ","requestRef":"5d0fb188-1428-4dde-9fb2-5ef86bfbe328","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"e57caaf3-0110-4345-953f-64f37ad667a7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:35:58.135Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"e57caaf3-0110-4345-953f-64f37ad667a7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJJzaFUgWSU8vAwrDhgC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白，只把\"设备状态\"这一条改成 WebSocket，任务事件还是走 webhook。\n\n**改了会有什么不同**\n\n| | 现在：轮询（每 3 秒问一次） | WebSocket |\n|---|---|---|\n| 状态变化多久能知道 | 最多晚 3 秒 | 不到 1 秒，一变就推 |\n| 网络请求量 | 每 3 秒 2 个请求，6 分钟约 550 个 | 一条连接一直开着，有变化才发 |\n| 上位机要做的 | 现在已经在做了 | 新写一个 WebSocket 客户端，还要处理断线重连 |\n| 设备这边 | 已经改好 | 要新加一个推送接口 |\n\n**我的看法：现在没必要。**\n- 轮询的问题（断线）已经解决了，现在每次只要 1 毫秒，550 个请求对设备来说几乎没有负担。\n- WebSocket 唯一明显的好处是**更快**：从\"最多晚 3 秒\"变成\"立刻\"。设备状态主要是给人在界面上看的，晚 3 秒基本感觉不到。\n- 代价是上位机要多写一套连接和重连逻辑，多一个可能出问题的地方。\n\n**什么时候值得改：**\n- 界面上要**实时显示机械臂在动**，比如 3D 画面跟着真机同步转。\n- 要求**急停、故障一发生就立刻弹出提醒**，不能等 3 秒。\n\n如果有这类需求，再改成 WebSocket。如果只是显示\"空闲 / 运行中 / 急停\"这些状态，轮询已经够用了。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":788319,"output_tokens":705,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":140},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":705,"cache_read_input_tokens":788319,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1e174c19-a5e5-47db-a536-c78c7c6fa25c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJJzZKR9EmouWX9cNdKZ","requestRef":"5d0fb188-1428-4dde-9fb2-5ef86bfbe328","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"f471e52d-a16a-4d41-9948-b239fae04a07","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:36:04.628Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEff