{"parentUuid":"421fca36-12fa-4200-9a7f-6f9d48177b92","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJKACK9JUBhC24VTB9CG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"WebSocket 测试通过：连接后立即推送完整状态（changed=True），之后每2秒推送心跳（changed=False），状态均正确。接下来整理一份对接说明文档，包含浏览器和Java两种示例代码（带断线重连）。\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":793677,"output_tokens":2533,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":324},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2533,"cache_read_input_tokens":793677,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":2,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"8c1c4354-981a-4457-be22-fa7e7d2e3850","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJKABER4yvmhHrDdGt3o","requestRef":"f52c5a35-0b56-4309-9f3c-c26aec0f9bfb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b96da6c0-b0f6-49b6-b1ba-ba102a5c8376","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:38:11.829Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"b96da6c0-b0f6-49b6-b1ba-ba102a5c8376","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJKACK9JUBhC24VTB9CG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LLvkwpuLCKEhSm5mQUz9gH","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备状态WebSocket对接说明.md","content":"# 设备状态 WebSocket 对接说明\n\n> 给上位机开发。2026-10-23\n> 只改\"设备状态\"的获取方式；任务事件仍走 webhook（不变）。原来的 `GET /device` 保留，可以先并行、再切换。\n\n## 1. 地址\n\n```\nws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\n```\n\n上位机**主动连设备**（和调接口同一个方向），不需要上位机开端口。\n\n## 2. 会收到什么\n\n连上后**立刻**收到一份完整状态；之后：\n\n- **状态一变就推**（比如开始任务、急停、机械臂移动、手上有货/没货）。\n- **没变化时每 2 秒推一次**，当作心跳。\n\n每条消息就是 `GET /device` 的返回内容，多了两个字段：\n\n| 字段 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `type` | 固定为 `\"device\"` |\n| `changed` | `true` = 状态变了才推的；`false` = 心跳 |\n\n示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"device\",\n  \"changed\": true,\n  \"t\": \"2026-10-23 09:45:12\",\n  \"age_s\": 0.8,\n  \"state\": \"busy\",\n  \"arm_at\": \"A-L10\",\n  \"payload\": \"holding\",\n  \"estop\": false,\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"sim_mode\": false,\n  \"detail\": \"正常 [已使能 / 安全正常 / 自动模式]\",\n  \"joints_deg\": [12.3, 30.1, -95.2, -4.0, 90.0, 0.1],\n  \"services\": {\"vision\": true, \"scanner\": true},\n  \"task_id\": 138,\n  \"webhook\": {\"enabled\": true, \"state\": \"ok\", \"sent\": 23, \"failed\": 0}\n}\n```\n\n字段含义和 `GET /device` 完全一样（见设备接口文档）。`age_s` = 这份机械臂状态是几秒前读的，正常在 1 秒左右。\n\n## 3. 上位机要做的\n\n1. 启动时连上 `ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device`。\n2. 每收到一条消息，就用它**整体替换**界面上的设备状态。\n3. **判断断线**：超过 **6 秒**没收到任何消息（正常每 2 秒至少一条），就当断线，界面显示\"设备离线\"。\n4. **断线重连**：连接断开或判定断线后，隔 1～3 秒重新连接，一直重试。重连上会先收到一份完整状态，**不需要补数据**。\n5. 设备只推不收，上位机不用发任何消息。\n\n## 4. 示例代码\n\n### 浏览器 / Node.js\n\n```js\nfunction connectDevice(onStatus, onOffline) {\n  let ws, timer;\n  const resetTimer = () => { clearTimeout(timer); timer = setTimeout(() => { onOffline(); ws && ws.close(); }, 6000); };\n  const open = () => {\n    ws = new WebSocket(\"ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\");\n    ws.onopen = resetTimer;\n    ws.onmessage = e => { resetTimer(); onStatus(JSON.parse(e.data)); };\n    ws.onclose = () => { clearTimeout(timer); onOffline(); setTimeout(open, 2000); };   // 2 秒后重连\n    ws.onerror = () => ws.close();\n  };\n  open();\n}\n\nconnectDevice(\n  s => console.log(\"设备状态\", s.state, s.arm_at, s.task_id),\n  () => console.log(\"设备离线, 重连中…\")\n);\n```\n\n### Java（Spring，`StandardWebSocketClient`）\n\n```java\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.*;\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.client.standard.StandardWebSocketClient;\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.handler.TextWebSocketHandler;\nimport java.util.concurrent.*;\n\npublic class DeviceStatusClient extends TextWebSocketHandler {\n    private static final String URL = \"ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\";\n    private final ScheduledExecutorService ses = Executors.newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor();\n    private volatile long lastMsg = 0;\n    private volatile WebSocketSession session;\n\n    public void start() {\n        connect();\n        // 看门狗: 6 秒没消息就断开重连\n        ses.scheduleAtFixedRate(() -> {\n            if (session != null && System.currentTimeMillis() - lastMsg > 6000) {\n                onOffline();\n                try { session.close(); } catch (Exception ignored) {}\n            }\n        }, 1, 1, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n    }\n\n    private void connect() {\n        new StandardWebSocketClient().execute(this, URL).whenComplete((s, e) -> {\n            if (e != null) ses.schedule(this::connect, 2, TimeUnit.SECONDS);   // 连不上: 2 秒后再试\n        });\n    }\n\n    @Override public void afterConnectionEstablished(WebSocketSession s) { session = s; lastMsg = System.currentTimeMillis(); }\n\n    @Override protected void handleTextMessage(WebSocketSession s, TextMessage msg) {\n        lastMsg = System.currentTimeMillis();\n        String json = msg.getPayload();      // 用 Jackson 等解析, 整体替换界面上的设备状态\n        // DeviceStatus st = objectMapper.readValue(json, DeviceStatus.class);\n    }\n\n    @Override public void afterConnectionClosed(WebSocketSession s, CloseStatus status) {\n        session = null; onOffline();\n        ses.schedule(this::connect, 2, TimeUnit.SECONDS);                     // 断了: 2 秒后重连\n    }\n\n    private void onOffline() { /* 界面显示\"设备离线\" */ }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. 切换建议\n\n1. 先**并行**：保留现在每 3 秒的 `GET /device` 轮询，同时接上 WebSocket，对比两边显示一致。\n2. 确认稳定后，去掉轮询（`GET /health` 也可以一起去掉）。\n3. 任务事件仍走 webhook，不受影响。\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":793677,"output_tokens":2533,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":324},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2533,"cache_read_input_tokens":793677,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LLvkwpuLCKEhSm5mQUz9gH":{"file_path":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备状态WebSocket对接说明.md","content":"# 设备状态 WebSocket 对接说明\n\n> 给上位机开发。2026-10-23\n> 只改\"设备状态\"的获取方式；任务事件仍走 webhook（不变）。原来的 `GET /device` 保留，可以先并行、再切换。\n\n## 1. 地址\n\n```\nws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\n```\n\n上位机**主动连设备**（和调接口同一个方向），不需要上位机开端口。\n\n## 2. 会收到什么\n\n连上后**立刻**收到一份完整状态；之后：\n\n- **状态一变就推**（比如开始任务、急停、机械臂移动、手上有货/没货）。\n- **没变化时每 2 秒推一次**，当作心跳。\n\n每条消息就是 `GET /device` 的返回内容，多了两个字段：\n\n| 字段 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `type` | 固定为 `\"device\"` |\n| `changed` | `true` = 状态变了才推的；`false` = 心跳 |\n\n示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"device\",\n  \"changed\": true,\n  \"t\": \"2026-10-23 09:45:12\",\n  \"age_s\": 0.8,\n  \"state\": \"busy\",\n  \"arm_at\": \"A-L10\",\n  \"payload\": \"holding\",\n  \"estop\": false,\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"sim_mode\": false,\n  \"detail\": \"正常 [已使能 / 安全正常 / 自动模式]\",\n  \"joints_deg\": [12.3, 30.1, -95.2, -4.0, 90.0, 0.1],\n  \"services\": {\"vision\": true, \"scanner\": true},\n  \"task_id\": 138,\n  \"webhook\": {\"enabled\": true, \"state\": \"ok\", \"sent\": 23, \"failed\": 0}\n}\n```\n\n字段含义和 `GET /device` 完全一样（见设备接口文档）。`age_s` = 这份机械臂状态是几秒前读的，正常在 1 秒左右。\n\n## 3. 上位机要做的\n\n1. 启动时连上 `ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device`。\n2. 每收到一条消息，就用它**整体替换**界面上的设备状态。\n3. **判断断线**：超过 **6 秒**没收到任何消息（正常每 2 秒至少一条），就当断线，界面显示\"设备离线\"。\n4. **断线重连**：连接断开或判定断线后，隔 1～3 秒重新连接，一直重试。重连上会先收到一份完整状态，**不需要补数据**。\n5. 设备只推不收，上位机不用发任何消息。\n\n## 4. 示例代码\n\n### 浏览器 / Node.js\n\n```js\nfunction connectDevice(onStatus, onOffline) {\n  let ws, timer;\n  const resetTimer = () => { clearTimeout(timer); timer = setTimeout(() => { onOffline(); ws && ws.close(); }, 6000); };\n  const open = () => {\n    ws = new WebSocket(\"ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\");\n    ws.onopen = resetTimer;\n    ws.onmessage = e => { resetTimer(); onStatus(JSON.parse(e.data)); };\n    ws.onclose = () => { clearTimeout(timer); onOffline(); setTimeout(open, 2000); };   // 2 秒后重连\n    ws.onerror = () => ws.close();\n  };\n  open();\n}\n\nconnectDevice(\n  s => console.log(\"设备状态\", s.state, s.arm_at, s.task_id),\n  () => console.log(\"设备离线, 重连中…\")\n);\n```\n\n### Java（Spring，`StandardWebSocketClient`）\n\n```java\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.*;\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.client.standard.StandardWebSocketClient;\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.handler.TextWebSocketHandler;\nimport java.util.concurrent.*;\n\npublic class DeviceStatusClient extends TextWebSocketHandler {\n    private static final String URL = \"ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\";\n    private final ScheduledExecutorService ses = Executors.newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor();\n    private volatile long lastMsg = 0;\n    private volatile WebSocketSession session;\n\n    public void start() {\n        connect();\n        // 看门狗: 6 秒没消息就断开重连\n        ses.scheduleAtFixedRate(() -> {\n            if (session != null && System.currentTimeMillis() - lastMsg > 6000) {\n                onOffline();\n                try { session.close(); } catch (Exception ignored) {}\n            }\n        }, 1, 1, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n    }\n\n    private void connect() {\n        new StandardWebSocketClient().execute(this, URL).whenComplete((s, e) -> {\n            if (e != null) ses.schedule(this::connect, 2, TimeUnit.SECONDS);   // 连不上: 2 秒后再试\n        });\n    }\n\n    @Override public void afterConnectionEstablished(WebSocketSession s) { session = s; lastMsg = System.currentTimeMillis(); }\n\n    @Override protected void handleTextMessage(WebSocketSession s, TextMessage msg) {\n        lastMsg = System.currentTimeMillis();\n        String json = msg.getPayload();      // 用 Jackson 等解析, 整体替换界面上的设备状态\n        // DeviceStatus st = objectMapper.readValue(json, DeviceStatus.class);\n    }\n\n    @Override public void afterConnectionClosed(WebSocketSession s, CloseStatus status) {\n        session = null; onOffline();\n        ses.schedule(this::connect, 2, TimeUnit.SECONDS);                     // 断了: 2 秒后重连\n    }\n\n    private void onOffline() { /* 界面显示\"设备离线\" */ }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. 切换建议\n\n1. 先**并行**：保留现在每 3 秒的 `GET /device` 轮询，同时接上 WebSocket，对比两边显示一致。\n2. 确认稳定后，去掉轮询（`GET /health` 也可以一起去掉）。\n3. 任务事件仍走 webhook，不受影响。\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"8c1c4354-981a-4457-be22-fa7e7d2e3850","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgJKABER4yvmhHrDdGt3o","requestRef":"f52c5a35-0b56-4309-9f3c-c26aec0f9bfb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"3763c456-85ba-4169-9537-9c221c6ed76e","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:38:27.822Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"3763c456-85ba-4169-9537-9c221c6ed76e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"85bd974d-fc05-47e5-b21a-5155fa877c49","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LLvkwpuLCKEhSm5mQUz9gH","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备状态WebSocket对接说明.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"d3231b4c-5b24-4603-97b9-99abfc5fcc31","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:38:27.924Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/设备状态WebSocket对接说明.md","content":"# 设备状态 WebSocket 对接说明\n\n> 给上位机开发。2026-10-23\n> 只改\"设备状态\"的获取方式；任务事件仍走 webhook（不变）。原来的 `GET /device` 保留，可以先并行、再切换。\n\n## 1. 地址\n\n```\nws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\n```\n\n上位机**主动连设备**（和调接口同一个方向），不需要上位机开端口。\n\n## 2. 会收到什么\n\n连上后**立刻**收到一份完整状态；之后：\n\n- **状态一变就推**（比如开始任务、急停、机械臂移动、手上有货/没货）。\n- **没变化时每 2 秒推一次**，当作心跳。\n\n每条消息就是 `GET /device` 的返回内容，多了两个字段：\n\n| 字段 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `type` | 固定为 `\"device\"` |\n| `changed` | `true` = 状态变了才推的；`false` = 心跳 |\n\n示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"device\",\n  \"changed\": true,\n  \"t\": \"2026-10-23 09:45:12\",\n  \"age_s\": 0.8,\n  \"state\": \"busy\",\n  \"arm_at\": \"A-L10\",\n  \"payload\": \"holding\",\n  \"estop\": false,\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"sim_mode\": false,\n  \"detail\": \"正常 [已使能 / 安全正常 / 自动模式]\",\n  \"joints_deg\": [12.3, 30.1, -95.2, -4.0, 90.0, 0.1],\n  \"services\": {\"vision\": true, \"scanner\": true},\n  \"task_id\": 138,\n  \"webhook\": {\"enabled\": true, \"state\": \"ok\", \"sent\": 23, \"failed\": 0}\n}\n```\n\n字段含义和 `GET /device` 完全一样（见设备接口文档）。`age_s` = 这份机械臂状态是几秒前读的，正常在 1 秒左右。\n\n## 3. 上位机要做的\n\n1. 启动时连上 `ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device`。\n2. 每收到一条消息，就用它**整体替换**界面上的设备状态。\n3. **判断断线**：超过 **6 秒**没收到任何消息（正常每 2 秒至少一条），就当断线，界面显示\"设备离线\"。\n4. **断线重连**：连接断开或判定断线后，隔 1～3 秒重新连接，一直重试。重连上会先收到一份完整状态，**不需要补数据**。\n5. 设备只推不收，上位机不用发任何消息。\n\n## 4. 示例代码\n\n### 浏览器 / Node.js\n\n```js\nfunction connectDevice(onStatus, onOffline) {\n  let ws, timer;\n  const resetTimer = () => { clearTimeout(timer); timer = setTimeout(() => { onOffline(); ws && ws.close(); }, 6000); };\n  const open = () => {\n    ws = new WebSocket(\"ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\");\n    ws.onopen = resetTimer;\n    ws.onmessage = e => { resetTimer(); onStatus(JSON.parse(e.data)); };\n    ws.onclose = () => { clearTimeout(timer); onOffline(); setTimeout(open, 2000); };   // 2 秒后重连\n    ws.onerror = () => ws.close();\n  };\n  open();\n}\n\nconnectDevice(\n  s => console.log(\"设备状态\", s.state, s.arm_at, s.task_id),\n  () => console.log(\"设备离线, 重连中…\")\n);\n```\n\n### Java（Spring，`StandardWebSocketClient`）\n\n```java\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.*;\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.client.standard.StandardWebSocketClient;\nimport org.springframework.web.socket.handler.TextWebSocketHandler;\nimport java.util.concurrent.*;\n\npublic class DeviceStatusClient extends TextWebSocketHandler {\n    private static final String URL = \"ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\";\n    private final ScheduledExecutorService ses = Executors.newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor();\n    private volatile long lastMsg = 0;\n    private volatile WebSocketSession session;\n\n    public void start() {\n        connect();\n        // 看门狗: 6 秒没消息就断开重连\n        ses.scheduleAtFixedRate(() -> {\n            if (session != null && System.currentTimeMillis() - lastMsg > 6000) {\n                onOffline();\n                try { session.close(); } catch (Exception ignored) {}\n            }\n        }, 1, 1, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n    }\n\n    private void connect() {\n        new StandardWebSocketClient().execute(this, URL).whenComplete((s, e) -> {\n            if (e != null) ses.schedule(this::connect, 2, TimeUnit.SECONDS);   // 连不上: 2 秒后再试\n        });\n    }\n\n    @Override public void afterConnectionEstablished(WebSocketSession s) { session = s; lastMsg = System.currentTimeMillis(); }\n\n    @Override protected void handleTextMessage(WebSocketSession s, TextMessage msg) {\n        lastMsg = System.currentTimeMillis();\n        String json = msg.getPayload();      // 用 Jackson 等解析, 整体替换界面上的设备状态\n        // DeviceStatus st = objectMapper.readValue(json, DeviceStatus.class);\n    }\n\n    @Override public void afterConnectionClosed(WebSocketSession s, CloseStatus status) {\n        session = null; onOffline();\n        ses.schedule(this::connect, 2, TimeUnit.SECONDS);                     // 断了: 2 秒后重连\n    }\n\n    private void onOffline() { /* 界面显示\"设备离线\" */ }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. 切换建议\n\n1. 先**并行**：保留现在每 3 秒的 `GET /device` 轮询，同时接上 WebSocket，对比两边显示一致。\n2. 确认稳定后，去掉轮询（`GET /health` 也可以一起去掉）。\n3. 任务事件仍走 webhook，不受影响。\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3763c456-85ba-4169-9537-9c221c6ed76e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
