{"parentUuid":"13c3c653-7d89-490e-aece-74e0e6ee9f73","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJKCEBKwJmuABQpr8cxF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_read_input_tokens":797383,"output_tokens":694,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":60},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":964,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":694,"cache_read_input_tokens":797383,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":964},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7242,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"c031be3c-19fd-4bf9-9fd4-95ce5b1c123e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJKCDeZrAPqXBBnReq7c","requestRef":"a547a741-b5e7-4d01-8efa-715bc9fd8c4f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"887bfbab-1b0f-4941-b9df-5c0561fc1cd5","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:38:41.828Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"887bfbab-1b0f-4941-b9df-5c0561fc1cd5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJKCEBKwJmuABQpr8cxF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"设备状态改成 WebSocket 推送了，已经上线。\n\n**地址**：`ws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device`\n\n**实测**（在设备上用测试客户端连接）：\n- 连上后**立刻**收到一份完整状态。\n- 之后每 2 秒收到一次心跳，状态都正确。\n- 状态一有变化（开始任务、急停、机械臂移动、手上有没有货）就会马上推送。\"有变化就推\"这部分写好了，但测试时设备空闲，状态没变，所以**还没实际验证到**；下次跑任务时可以看到。\n\n**推送内容**：和 `GET /device` 完全一样，只多了 `type` 和 `changed` 两个字段，上位机原来的解析代码可以直接复用。\n\n**原来的轮询还保留着**，上位机可以先两种方式同时用，对比一致了再去掉轮询。任务事件仍然走 webhook，没有变化。\n\n**给同事的对接说明**：`docs/设备状态WebSocket对接说明.md`，里面有：\n- 消息格式和字段说明；\n- 怎么判断断线（超过 6 秒没收到消息）、怎么重连（隔 2 秒重试）；\n- 浏览器和 Java（Spring）两份可以直接用的示例代码；\n- 切换步骤。\n\n**设备环境的变化**：在设备的 `robot` 环境里装了 `websockets` 17.3，这是 WebSocket 必需的库。\n\n提交：设备端 bd054f7，Mac 端 eba0b8a。\n\n另外，仓库里还有几个不是我产生的未提交文件：昨天的盘点原始帧、识别失败图片，还有两份 GCR10-1300 测试报告 PDF。我没有动它们。测试报告里有一份标着\"外发\"，要不要提交进仓库由你决定。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_read_input_tokens":797383,"output_tokens":694,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":60},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":964,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":694,"cache_read_input_tokens":797383,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":964},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c031be3c-19fd-4bf9-9fd4-95ce5b1c123e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJKCDeZrAPqXBBnReq7c","requestRef":"a547a741-b5e7-4d01-8efa-715bc9fd8c4f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"45517ee0-f7ac-4926-8846-9