{"parentUuid":"877990f8-8de2-4aae-a51a-dd67a96b882f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJL41XDMHAweKLJKZry2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"阶段文字已经按方案改好，部署上线了。\n\n**改了什么：**\n- 任务快照 `GET /tasks/{id}` 里的 `stage` 换成了新的中文术语，比如 扫码 → **追溯码识读**、飞行 → **路径搬运**、放置 → **货位上架**、等去处 → **等待货位分配**。\n- 新增 `stage_code` 字段，放固定的英文代码，比如 `SCANNING`、`TRANSFERRING`。上位机程序做判断时用这个，以后中文措辞再调整也不会对不上。\n- \"等待人工放盒\"拆成了两个：**等待上料**（`WAIT_LOADING`，桌上没盒）和**等待人工摆正**（`WAIT_ADJUST`，盒子太远或太斜）。\n- 所有阶段的中文都集中在一张表里，以后想改措辞只改这一处。\n\n**已确认的**：服务重启正常，接口说明里已经有新字段。**还没确认的**：重启后还没跑过任务，所以还没亲眼看到新阶段文字实际显示出来，下次跑任务时就能看到。\n\n**文档已同步**：\n- 设备接口文档（`docs/设备接口文档_V1.docx` 和 `.md`）已重新生成。\n- `docs/上位机提示文字清单.md` 里的阶段表换成了新的中英对照表。\n\n**需要提醒同事**：如果上位机原来用中文阶段做判断（比如判断\"等去处\"），要改成用 `stage_code`。只是在界面上显示的话，不用改任何东西。\n\n提交：设备端 ccc4cfa，Mac 端 92ba12b。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1610,"cache_read_input_tokens":815312,"output_tokens":576,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1610,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":576,"cache_read_input_tokens":815312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1610,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1610},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"31d388b3-9fd3-4c02-8334-4cdfef2b9aed","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJL413gNHhfvQAStmkks","requestRef":"e4045794-8a25-45e3-aeea-5d90fc31b24f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"bf2c5574-6476-49da-84a0-a8fc8fc7f718","timestamp":"2026-10-23T01:49:55.028Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5",