{"parentUuid":"de223459-92d2-4584-a6fb-d5739631fc69","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJM2xkrD5jsX4deNEFbR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2394,"cache_read_input_tokens":822825,"output_tokens":1628,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":843},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2394,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1628,"cache_read_input_tokens":822825,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2394,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2394},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":19039,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"1a2248cb-4695-4e65-926f-e233245f3a97","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJM2xD7W9rRoBuV6eiBs","requestRef":"8da342fb-d96c-4dad-9be7-7c469d47e4f8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"17839a55-6c3a-4f2b-92aa-05e996f7cc07","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:03:01.463Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"17839a55-6c3a-4f2b-92aa-05e996f7cc07","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJM2xkrD5jsX4deNEFbR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"查完了，结论是：**设备计划的位置是紧贴的，空隙是盒子放下以后才出现的。**\n\n**设备这边算得没问题**\n\n最近四列，每两盒的推进量差值都正好等于盒厚，序号连续、没有跳号：\n\n| 列 | 品种 | 盒数 | 每两盒推进差 | 上位机给的盒厚 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| A-L10 x=-178.2 | 麻腮风 | 17 盒（今天放的） | 22.4 | 22.4 |\n| A-L10 x=-246.2 | 麻腮风 | 11 | 22.4 | 22.4 |\n| A-L10 x=30.8 | 麻腮风 | 14 | 22.4 | 22.4 |\n| A-L10 x=-73.7 | 脊灰 | 4 | 25.0 | 25.0 |\n\n而且相机量出来的盒厚普遍**比 22.4 略厚**（麻腮风 22.4～23.1，脊灰 26.7～27.2）。按理说只会越放越紧，不会留缝。\n\n**所以空隙是放下以后才出现的，可能的原因：**\n1. **松手时回弹**：每盒都多推 2mm 顶紧前一盒，纸盒被压缩。吸盘一松，压缩的纸盒弹回来，把刚放的这盒往外推。\n2. **吹气时被带动**：放置的最后一步是\"边吹气边往外退\"，盒子如果还粘在吸盘上，会被往外带一点。\n3. **盒子倾斜**：盒子是立着放的，推的是底部、靠的是上部，松手后可能前后歪，看起来像有缝。\n\n单靠日志分不出是哪一种，需要你帮我确认几件事：\n- **哪一列**？x=-178.2、-246.2、30.8 还是脊灰那列（-73.7）？\n- **缝在哪**：是每两盒之间都有一点，还是只有某一两处？大概几毫米？\n- **什么时候出现的**：放下那一刻就有，还是放下一盒后才出现？\n\n也可以客观量一下：对 A-L10 做一次**盘点**，相机会量出每列队首的实际位置，和设备计划的位置一比，就知道整列被撑长了多少。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2394,"cache_read_input_tokens":822825,"output_tokens":1628,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":843},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2394,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1628,"cache_read_input_tokens":822825,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2394,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2394},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1a2248cb-4695-4e65-926f-e233245f3a97","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJM2xD7W9rRoBuV6eiBs","requestRef":"8da342fb-d96c-4dad-9be7-7c469d47e4f8",