{"parentUuid":"fcb46079-d90a-4e8b-bfd3-16a6b162cd9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJMPJwcKuxnuLayujNMi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":829522,"output_tokens":2689,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1831},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2689,"cache_read_input_tokens":829522,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":20277,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"29777c31-4259-4495-a7b4-b11a1ce24dfc","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJMPJDT2KvpeJp6ZNvtk","requestRef":"64de9608-f286-4746-96ac-278522f69626","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"f697a04b-a2c2-485e-a497-17114edc5647","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:07:38.694Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"f697a04b-a2c2-485e-a497-17114edc5647","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJMPJwcKuxnuLayujNMi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第 4 列和其他列用的是**同一个计算公式**：每两盒的推进量都差 22.4mm，放置动作的每一步也完全一样。所以问题不在\"算的位置\"，而在**这一列所处的位置有什么不同**。我对比了各列的情况，有三个怀疑方向，按可能性从高到低：\n\n**1. 左边紧挨着脊灰那一列，盒子被侧面卡住，推不到位（最可疑）**\n\n第 4 列夹在两列中间：\n\n| | 左边界 | 右边界 | 和第 4 列的间隙 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 第 3 列（脊灰，133mm 宽） | -140.2 | **-7.2** | 8mm |\n| 第 4 列（麻腮风，60mm 宽） | 0.8 | 60.8 | — |\n| 第 5 列 | 68.8 | 128.8 | 8mm |\n\n计划间隙只有 8mm，可是吸取时盒子在吸盘上会有几毫米的偏心或转角。脊灰盒子又长又重，如果稍微斜着站，侧面就会探进这 8mm 的空隙。第 4 列的盒子往里推时侧面蹭到它，被摩擦力卡住，机械臂推到了位置，盒子却没跟着到位，松手后就停在那里，和前一盒之间留了缝。\n\n第 2 列虽然也夹在两列之间，但它两边都是窄的麻腮风，不容易卡。\n\n**2. 层板中间下垂，盒子松手时掉下去**\n\n第 4 列在格口的**正中间**（x≈+30），离两侧支撑最远，层板最容易往下弯。设备是按一个统一的层板高度把盒子放下去的，中间层板偏低的话，盒子松手时会掉下一点，落下时可能弹一下、往外歪。\n\n**3. 推进时盒底蹭层板**\n\n如果层板在这里反而偏高或不平，最后推的那 10mm 盒底会和层板摩擦，阻力大，盒子跟不上吸盘。\n\n**想请你帮忙看两件事，就能分出是哪一种：**\n1. 第 4 列的盒子，**左侧面是不是贴着、甚至压着脊灰那列**？\n2. 缝出现时，盒子是**站直的**，还是**往外歪**的？\n\n另外，可以人为验证一下：下一盒放到第 4 列时，先把脊灰那列整体往左推一推，让出空间，看看还会不会留缝。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":829522,"output_tokens":2689,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1831},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2689,"cache_read_input_tokens":829522,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"29777c31-4259-4495-a7b4-b11a1ce24dfc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJMPJDT2KvpeJp6ZNvtk","requestRef":"6