{"parentUuid":"9cc25427-9f16-43ff-b5db-54ea23cbfa2e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJN3DCPUWcmonqbM87Qr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37,"cache_read_input_tokens":842400,"output_tokens":1059,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":503},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1059,"cache_read_input_tokens":842400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5879,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"b5f6b9d5-28a4-4224-b5da-2c176d4f2821","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJN3CGp9qvfQ8ViE3oh2","requestRef":"4eee781d-317f-4ad5-9450-89ef18530642","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b3ba1d4c-b556-404b-9fba-68fb007443cb","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:16:02.058Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"b3ba1d4c-b556-404b-9fba-68fb007443cb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJN3DCPUWcmonqbM87Qr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有，但要先确定是哪种原因，解决方法不一样：\n\n**情况 1：第 4 列那段背板更靠里**（最里面那盒和背板之间有缝）\n\n- **软件补偿（推荐）**：现在整个格口只标定了一个背板深度。改成在格口的**左、中、右各标定一次**背板深度，中间位置按横向距离插值。放置时每一列按自己位置的背板深度来推，第 4 列就会多推进去那几毫米。\n  - 标定要你在现场用示教器做三次\"持货顶背板\"，大约 10 分钟。我改一下标定脚本和计算公式。\n- **机械调整**：把货架或背板调正，让背板和格口前沿平行。改完不用动软件，但要你们动货架，而且调完要重新标定。\n\n**情况 2：第 4 列那段层板不平**（盒子放下后歪着，或者底部明显不贴板）\n\n- **机械处理（推荐）**：在层板下面加支撑或垫片，把中间垫平。层板下凹的问题，软件不好补偿。\n- **软件补偿**：和背板一样，按左、中、右分别标定层板高度。只能补偿高低差，补不了\"表面不平\"。\n\n**先确定原因，两种办法任选：**\n1. **你肉眼看**：第 4 列最里面那盒和背板之间有没有缝？盒子是站直的还是歪的？（最快）\n2. **做一次盘点**：相机量出每列队首和背板的实际位置，看第 4 列差多少毫米。（客观，需要动机械臂大约 1 分钟）\n\n你想用哪种方式先确认？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37,"cache_read_input_tokens":842400,"output_tokens":1059,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":503},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1059,"cache_read_input_tokens":842400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b5f6b9d5-28a4-4224-b5da-2c176d4f2821","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJN3CGp9qvfQ8ViE3oh2","requestRef":"4eee781d-317f-4ad5-9450-89ef18530642","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"60256d5f-7da1-40ce-90d3-f260cc36713c","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:16:08.649Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
