{"parentUuid":"3cdfc563-12bb-4c73-be43-a84fba1004f1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJNYistTXmAgNyBJN3uR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1353,"cache_read_input_tokens":848303,"output_tokens":1633,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":677},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1353,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1633,"cache_read_input_tokens":848303,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1353},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":16596,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"161bad4e-5b60-4471-8b25-d3dc88f42b28","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJNYgUXBySu4M4ZxS3Vk","requestRef":"6bab7862-9022-4f22-a66e-1320decd414e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"3d6789fe-b7a0-4a74-9060-a71f0f3aba9f","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:22:49.532Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"3d6789fe-b7a0-4a74-9060-a71f0f3aba9f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJNYistTXmAgNyBJN3uR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看完了。这次是 10:19～10:20 连续盘点了两次 A-L10。两次结论都是\"5 列全部相符\"，但第一次盘点里有两个值得注意的地方。\n\n## 1. 有一个\"账外物体\"（`stray`）\n\n相机在**横向 138.8～162.9mm** 的位置看到了东西：宽约 24mm，有 255 个点。上位机的账上，这个位置**没有任何一列**：\n\n| | 横向范围 |\n|---|---|\n| 第 5 列（麻腮风，2 盒） | 68.8 ～ 128.8 |\n| **账外物体** | **138.8 ～ 162.9** |\n\n也就是**第 5 列右边约 1cm 的地方，有一个约 24mm 宽的东西**。麻腮风的盒子厚 22.4mm，所以很可能是**一盒麻腮风侧着立在那里**，或者是之前掉落、被丢、没记账的盒子。也可能是货架上的结构件被误认成了盒子（之前 A-R10、A-R2 出现过这种误报），但 A-L10 这个位置以前没有过。\n\n**请你看一眼**：A-L10 第 5 列右边，靠里面的位置，有没有一盒多出来的疫苗？\n\n## 2. 印证了第 4 列压不紧\n\n第一次盘点（任务 142）量出每列队首的实际位置，和账上计划的位置相比：\n\n| 列 | 盒数 | 实际比计划**往外**多出 | 平均每盒 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 第 1 列 x=-246.2 | 10 | 3.4 mm | 0.3 mm |\n| 第 2 列 x=-178.2 | 15 | 5.0 mm | 0.3 mm |\n| 第 3 列 x=-73.7（脊灰） | 3 | 10.7 mm | 3.6 mm |\n| **第 4 列 x=30.8** | **17** | **11.1 mm** | **0.65 mm** |\n| 第 5 列 x=98.8 | 2 | 8.0 mm | 4.0 mm |\n\n第 4 列整列比计划长了 11mm，每盒平均多 0.65mm，是第 2 列的两倍。这和你看到的\"压不紧\"是一致的。\n\n另外，脊灰这列 3 盒就多出 10.7mm，是因为脊灰盒子实际厚约 27mm，上位机给的是 25mm，每盒差 2mm 左右，这个要改上位机给的盒厚。第 5 列只有 2 盒却多出 8mm，可能和旁边那个账外物体有关。\n\n**第二次盘点（任务 143）全部归零**：是因为上位机用第一次实测的位置更新了账，所以第二次比对时差值都接近 0，这是正常的。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1353,"cache_read_input_tokens":848303,"output_tokens":1633,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":677},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1353,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1633,"cache_read_input_tokens":848303,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1353},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"161bad4e-5b60-4471-8b25-d3dc88f42b28","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJNYgUXBySu4M4ZxS3Vk","requestRef":"6bab7862-9022-4f22-a66e-1320decd414e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"f3cc86db-394f-458f-974d-1963ac7fffcc","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:22:49.553Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
