{"parentUuid":"f0918992-1e42-45d0-bb8d-a6e37fa10c2b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJNeXNFr2xmkytLc4Zuc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能看。放大以后，画面里的东西是这样的（相机在格口正前方往里拍，左右和货架一致）：\n\n- **最左边**：第 1 列（-246.2）只露出最上面一点，盒子在靠里的位置。\n- **左边的白色盒子**：第 2 列（-178.2）的队首，比较靠外。\n- **中间靠里的一长条**：第 3 列的脊灰，盒子 133mm 宽，横着排在最里面。\n- **右边的白色盒子**：第 4 列（30.8）的队首，是 5 列里**最靠外**的，站得是直的，没有歪。\n- **右后方**：第 4 列队首后面露出的几盒深色盒子，靠里，是第 5 列（98.8）的 2 盒。\n- **最右后方**：在第 5 列再往右一点、贴着背板的位置，还有一个**深色的盒状轮廓**，就是盘点报出的那个\"账外物体\"（横向 139～163mm）。从图上看**像是一盒立着的盒子**，不是货架结构。\n\n**看不到的部分**：相机是从正面拍的，每列只能看到最前面那盒的正面，**列里面盒与盒之间的缝从这个角度看不见**。所以第 4 列压不紧，图上只能体现为\"整列比计划长了 11mm\"，看不到具体缝在哪几盒之间。\n\n**建议你现场看一下**第 5 列右后方那个盒子：\n- 如果是**多出来的一盒**（没记账），需要拿出来，或者让上位机补登记。\n- 如果它歪着靠在第 5 列旁边，也可能把第 5 列挤歪了，第 5 列只有 2 盒却比计划长了 8mm，可能就是这个原因。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":911,"cache_read_input_tokens":851714,"output_tokens":1309,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":708},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":911,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1309,"cache_read_input_tokens":851714,"cache_creation_input_tokens":911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":911},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8d82b815-1fbc-4a15-9a40-fd8cf51c60c5","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJNeVZrYmttedYBVUohj","requestRef":"091c6129-82d6-43e2-8000-02e0026201da","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"c35a521a-e378-462e-ba45-6933ca4198ae","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:24:06.906Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perT