{"parentUuid":"99ebc777-4aa2-464e-af42-4faa84929fda","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJPQMH1SU2e9GjxAHGj1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1451,"cache_read_input_tokens":876566,"output_tokens":1317,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":586},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1451,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1317,"cache_read_input_tokens":876566,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1451},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7155,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"1596c128-25cf-4165-bd01-d3fa27858342","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJPQLgo2yrezfTcNaup8","requestRef":"aa1a671e-f067-4715-98ce-ebfddd2273b9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"529994a0-2ccd-45c0-b534-14e26600c529","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:33:53.358Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"529994a0-2ccd-45c0-b534-14e26600c529","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJPQMH1SU2e9GjxAHGj1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我觉得思路是对的，但建议不要固定多拍几张，而是**按需补拍**。\n\n**为什么会被挡**\n相机现在只在格口正中拍一张。某一列如果比旁边的列短很多（比如第 5 列 2 盒、第 4 列 17 盒），从正中斜着看过去，就会被长的那列挡住。\n\n**两种做法对比**\n\n| | 固定多拍（左、中、右各一张） | 按需补拍（推荐） |\n|---|---|---|\n| 怎么做 | 每次都拍 3 张，合在一起算 | 先在中间拍一张；哪一列看不全，再移到**正对那一列**的位置补拍一张 |\n| 耗时 | 每个格口多 2 张，约多 6～8 秒 | 大多数时候不用补拍，只有被挡的时候才多几秒 |\n| 效果 | 左右两边看得清，但中间某一列还可能被挡 | 补拍时相机**正对那一列往里看**，旁边的列再长也挡不住 |\n\n**补拍什么时候触发**\n算每一列看到的盒面点数，太少（比如第 5 列只有 420 个点，其他列都在 1000 以上），或者旁边有一列比它短很多、可能被挡，就补拍。补拍那一张只用来算这一列。\n\n**需要注意的**\n- **左右移动的范围**：相机在格口前面横向移动，要在机械臂够得着、不撞的范围里。靠中柱那一侧本来就受限，以前做过格内安全筛查，可以直接用那份结果来限制补拍位置。\n- **耗时**：每补拍一张大约多 3～4 秒（移动、停稳、拍照）。\n\n**还有一个更简单的办法可以先试**：盘点时相机**降得更低一点、更靠近格口**，视线更平，前面的长列挡住后面的概率会小一些。不过这只能减轻，不能根治。\n\n你倾向哪种？如果选按需补拍，我先离线验证一下：用这次的照片，算出第 5 列被挡住了多少，再算一下相机移到 x=+99 正前方时能不能看全。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1451,"cache_read_input_tokens":876566,"output_tokens":1317,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":586},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1451,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1317,"cache_read_input_tokens":876566,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1451},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1596c128-25cf-4165-bd01-d3fa27858342","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJPQLgo2yrezfTcNaup8","requestRef":"aa1a671e-f067-4715-98ce-ebfddd2273b9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"f2081c21-8143-438c-8530-bf2e2d92e2c7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:34:02.248Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
