{"parentUuid":"33e61ba9-1b70-492e-844e-9576ec13ed0b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJQ3TrvkeJ8CiKUqBikc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"当前姿态和 A-L10 悬停点是**同一个构型**（J1 都在 150° 左右、J5 都在 -150° 左右），只是往格口里多伸进去了一点。复位动作专门处理这种情况，可以安全退出来。\n\n**操作（在你的电脑终端执行，人站在急停旁边）：**\n\n```\n./scripts/act.sh reset\n```\n它会先从格口里退到 A-L10 悬停点，再沿路径库飞回 mid。执行前要你输入 YES 确认。完成后再回 home：\n```\n./scripts/act.sh goto home\n```\n\n**或者用一条接口命令**，复位后自动回 home（没有 YES 确认，会直接动，确认人站好了再发）：\n```\ncurl -X POST http://192.168.100.190:8902/device/reset\n```\n\n**为什么不用 `go_real.sh home`**：AutoDL 现在是关机状态，没法判卷，脚本会拒绝执行。而且从格口里直接 movej 回 home，J1 要转 150°、手腕要转 240°，伸在格口里的方管会扫到格口，绝对不能直接 movej。\n\n另外想问一下：刚才是在跑什么任务时急停的？是不是在往第 2 列放盒子？我之后查一下急停前的记录。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1202,"cache_read_input_tokens":881744,"output_tokens":709,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":268},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1202,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":709,"cache_read_input_tokens":881744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1202,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1202},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ac92428a-d722-499b-addc-ab5718c344d8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJQ3TDUcJ5RZhCBWb8Do","requestRef":"aabead58-2944-44a4-8dfa-fbabc5192a1a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"c2234edf-29fa-4d97-a127-1eed92f8838e","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:42:19.016Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49