{"parentUuid":"6f319be4-4f7c-47a6-9176-8015382f81d6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e31ea220-a550-46f3-a4a1-f123ea82a0aa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"\n\n<pasted_content id=\"0aa3\">\n▶ 复位→mid  [真机]   过程日志 → logs/actions_20261023.log\n真机执行, 输入 YES 开始: YES\n┌─ 回执: 复位→mid ─\n│ 结果   : 失败 (E_UNKNOWN_LOCATION)\n│ 下一步 : 需人工处理\n│ 货物   : 无\n│ 臂在哪 : 未知位置; 最近路径 A-L10_to_mid 第6点, 偏17.7°(超4.6°容差)\n│ 说明   : 不在任何已知路径/位姿上, 请手动 jog 回 mid(或格内: 待接账本自动退出)\n│ 耗时   : 1.6s\n│ 起点关节(°) : 150.1 83.7 -87.0 3.0 -150.0 -0.3\n└────────────────────────────────────────\n▷ 红卡: 按上面'下一步'处置; 空手需复位 → act.sh reset\nShared connection to 100.106.76.91 closed.\n(base) chen@Mac robocenter %\n</pasted_content id=\"0aa3\">\n"},"uuid":"5b00b2dd-0af2-43a3-919a-0fe1a4438f02","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:43:14.730Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
