{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"42b84a2bf54686a4c72bcf15fb6e8174b395a6d0c12cbf31911eacff6218cfe7","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"复位动作认不出这个位置：它能识别\"在路径上\"或\"在格口里\"，但**立放格口的格内脱困还没接上**（回执里写着\"格内：待接账本自动退出\"）。现在机械臂离 A-L10 的路径偏了 17.7°，超出容差，所以它拒绝自动动作。这是保护机制在起作用。\n\n需要你**用示教器手动把方管从格口里退出来**，退到 A-L10 悬停点附近，然后复位就能接上。我先查一下悬停点的坐标："},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y4r4zDWSL789szdJeu96Tc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && /usr/bin/python3 -c \"\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('data/slot_range/A-L10_stand.json'))\nprint('悬停点 TCP', d.get('origin_tcp_xyz'), '货架偏角', d.get('shelf_yaw_rad'))\nprint('当前 TCP', [-0.579,0.692,0.927])\no=d['origin_tcp_xyz']; print('需要移动: X %+.0f mm  Y %+.0f mm  Z %+.0f mm' % ((o[0]+0.579)*1000,(o[1]-0.692)*1000,(o[2]-0.927)*1000))\"","description":"计算从当前位置退回悬停点的移动量"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
