{"parentUuid":"2fe44431-6b84-4f3c-88f5-14fbefb286d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJQBCCZa3dNNriB6NwDi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，有：`run_real.sh` 播放 A-L10→mid 的库路径，起点对不上时会列出每个关节的差值，你输入 YES 放行后，它先慢慢移到路径起点，再按路径飞回 mid。命令是：\n\n```\n./scripts/arm/run_real.sh data/paths/A-L10_to_mid.json 0.6 0.5\n```\n\n**但现在不建议直接用，因为\"先慢慢移到起点\"这一步有风险：**\n- 路径起点是 A-L10 悬停点，在格口外面。机械臂现在是**伸在格口里面 89mm**、横向偏左 180mm、离层板只有约 5mm。\n- 移到起点用的是关节插补，方管会**在格口里一边横着扫 180mm、一边往外退**，轨迹是弯的，可能蹭到层板或盒子。\n\n**安全的做法，分两步：**\n1. **示教器手动退出来**：坐标系选**基座坐标、直线点动**，先按 **Z+ 抬 5cm**（离开层板），再按 **Y− 退 10cm**（方管完全退出格口）。退的时候方管是水平的，沿着它自己的方向往外抽，不会碰到东西。\n2. **再用强制回 mid 的命令**，这时机械臂已经在格口外面，移到起点就是在空旷处移动：\n   ```\n   ./scripts/arm/run_real.sh data/paths/A-L10_to_mid.json 0.6 0.5\n   ```\n   回到 mid 以后：\n   ```\n   ./scripts/act.sh goto home\n   ```\n\n如果示教器点动用的是手动模式，做完第 1 步记得切回自动模式（`./scripts/check_cell.sh opmode auto`），否则第 2 步的速度会被限制。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1191,"cache_read_input_tokens":884069,"output_tokens":1501,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":887},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1191,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1501,"cache_read_input_tokens":884069,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1191},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"afd39dcb-8523-469d-b2d6-a30843e15506","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJQAnACF41veyEw1wjUx","requestRef":"56ad18a8-149