{"parentUuid":"f56fafd0-6fa5-46d8-b0d2-636e121b5bcf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJQHdfukGz8HV6XHyXWk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有一个，但它不是真正的\"急停\"：\n\n**`POST /tasks/{id}/abort`（立即停止）**\n- 作用：让控制器**立刻停止当前运动**，机械臂停在原地，任务结束。如果机械臂手上有货，任务会转成\"待人工处置\"。\n- 实现方式：设备另开一条连接，给控制器发停止运动的指令。正在等人放盒、等上位机回复去处的时候，也能打断。\n- **限制**：必须带任务号，只能停**正在跑的任务**。\n\n另外两个是温和的停法：\n- `POST /tasks/{id}/stop`：**做完当前这一盒**再停。\n- `POST /tasks/{id}/pause`：做完当前这一盒后**暂停**，可以继续。\n\n**和真正急停的区别**\n\n| | 软件\"立即停止\" | 硬件急停按钮 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 怎么停 | 控制器收到指令后减速停下 | 直接切断动力，安全回路生效 |\n| 依赖 | 网络、工作站服务、控制器都正常 | 不依赖任何软件 |\n| 恢复 | 停下后可直接继续操作 | 要解除急停、上电、使能 |\n\n按安全规范，**上位机的\"立即停止\"只能作为辅助**，不能代替现场的物理急停按钮。网络断了或者服务卡住时，软件停止就不起作用了。\n\n**现在的一个缺口**：没有任务时（比如用 `/device/reset`、`/device/home` 这类调试恢复动作让机械臂动的时候），上位机**没有接口能让它停下**。如果需要，我可以加一个不需要任务号的 `POST /device/stop`：不管机械臂因为什么在动，调用就立刻停止运动。要加吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1548,"cache_read_input_tokens":885260,"output_tokens":854,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":239},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1548,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":854,"cache_read_input_tokens":885260,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1548,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1548},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"eb18a95a-8058-4574-a7a6-ca35e03e1b76","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJQHctHfEZHrND5nhdD2","requestRef":"8f403eec-0c2d-4a5d-a172-84de4d4d91ec","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d8f603a-5a4a-416c-980c-8e3ee64ce74f","timest