{"parentUuid":"b6a3e1d0-fb06-4f43-b373-8cd06506445c","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"我们在把急停后卡在 A-L10 格口门口的机械臂收回 home，同时在看上位机能不能让设备停下。下一步：你用示教器把方管从格口里退出来，再用强制命令飞回 mid；另外请你决定要不要加 /device/stop 接口。","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:50:03.256Z","uuid":"fea03203-02d9-47e9-a4ec-8b03c25eb951","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
