{"parentUuid":"7e99ffd7-60ea-40d6-8bed-5732d7c58922","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRYEYuF7zMHDMSAp6Eg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CLiitbx99eP8K5e1JvouWt","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory/end-effector-loose.md","content":"---\nname: end-effector-loose\ndescription: 2026-10-23 末端(立放方管+吸盘)松动导致上架压不紧/盒子放歪/盘点报账外物体; 放置异常先查末端紧固\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n2026-10-23 上架一系列异常的根因是**末端松了**(用户现场发现), 不是放置算法: A-L10 第4列(x=30.8)整列比计划长 11mm 压不紧、第5列盒子偏右/歪被盘点报 stray(横向139~163, 深度同队首)、随后机械臂在格口门口急停。当时日志里各列放置动作完全一致(推进量/贴板高/吹开都正常), 盘点 front_diff 才暴露差异。\n\n**Why:** 末端松动时方管/吸盘角度随受力变, 推进不正、松手回弹, 软件侧看不出(控制器报到位)。\n\n**How to apply:** 再遇到\"某列压不紧/盒子放歪/账外物体/盘点队首普遍偏外\", 先让用户检查末端紧固(用户计划加防松垫片), 再查软件。紧固后建议复核: `tcp_sync.sh check`(必要时 tcp_verify 重标)、`handeye_verify2.sh` 落点复核、空列放5盒+盘点核队首。相关: [[stand-tool-design]] [[stocktake-design]]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":71,"cache_read_input_tokens":887662,"output_tokens":1535,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":374},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":71,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1535,"cache_read_input_tokens":887662,"cache_creation_input_tokens":71,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":71},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01CLiitbx99eP8K5e1JvouWt":{"file_path":"/Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-roboc