{"parentUuid":"7c1fe631-c7a5-4fcb-baf3-a67b393baeb2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRqcBP9qfNGzL1mCubC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_read_input_tokens":890878,"output_tokens":2136,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1063},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":422,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2136,"cache_read_input_tokens":890878,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":422},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13911,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"f9ff03de-571e-45f3-b106-e7bb698cc69a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJRqbFZiuerN4AdPFN8R","requestRef":"35be7fcd-ff1e-41be-ac2f-91453cad2d18","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"1dc8203d-c0ac-4763-ab55-dfe6a2650cc7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:05:56.564Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"1dc8203d-c0ac-4763-ab55-dfe6a2650cc7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRqcBP9qfNGzL1mCubC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，而且你说的\"根据执行记录倒着走回去\"，比现在按路径库匹配的复位更通用。先说现状，再说方案。\n\n**现在的复位能处理什么**\n\n现有接口 `POST /device/reset` 只认得两种情况：\n- 在路径库的某条路径上：沿路径倒退回 mid，再回 home；\n- 在 home 附近：直接回。\n\n其余情况都报\"未知位置，请手动\"，比如今天这种**伸在立放格口里**，或者在吸取、扫码、丢回、投放途中。\n\n**方案：给机械臂留一条\"脚印\"，复位时原路倒回去**\n\n1. **记脚印**：后台线程本来就在每秒读关节，改成每秒读 10 次。机械臂每次从 home 或 mid 出发，就开始记它走过的每一个关节位置，一直记到回到 home 或 mid 为止。记录存成文件，服务重启也不会丢。\n2. **复位**：取出最近这一段脚印，找到机械臂现在在脚印上的哪一点，然后**沿着走过来的路慢速倒着走回去**，回到出发点（home 或 mid），最后回 home。\n3. **为什么安全**：机械臂就是沿着这条路走过来的，倒着走，扫过的空间完全一样，不会撞到原来没撞到的东西。如果是因为撞到东西停下的，倒回去正好是离开障碍物。\n\n**你担心的抓取桌面那一段**：脚印同样能覆盖。从 home 到近拍位、下探、吸取，每一步都会被记下来，倒回去就是\"抬起来 → 回 home\"。昨天算过从桌面直接 movej 回 home 也是安全的（吸盘一路往上、往里走），可以作为没有脚印时的备用办法，但优先用脚印。\n\n**几种特殊情况的处理**\n\n| 情况 | 处理 |\n|---|---|\n| 手上有货 | 带着货倒回 home，不自动丢；回执里写明\"持货\"，让上位机决定丢回还是放回 |\n| 停下后被人用示教器挪过，不在脚印上了 | 离脚印很近（几度以内）就先接上再倒回；离得远就拒绝，提示人工处理 |\n| 急停后还没解除 | 先报\"请先解除急停并使能\"，不动 |\n| 有任务正在跑 | 拒绝，先停任务 |\n\n**给上位机的接口**：还是一个 `POST /device/reset`，升级它的内部逻辑，上位机不用改。回执里会写清楚走了哪段脚印、倒退了多少步、最后停在哪、手上有没有货。\n\n**要先说明的**：这是比较大的改动，后台要高频记关节，还要改复位逻辑。做完要在**控制器仿真模式**下验证：先人为在各种位置（格口里、吸取途中、扫码途中、投放途中）停下，再调用复位，看能不能回到 home。这需要你不跑真机的时候做。\n\n你觉得这个方向可以吗？可以的话我先做\"记脚印\"和\"倒回\"，然后在仿真里逐个情况验证。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_read_input_tokens":890878,"output_tokens":2136,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1063},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":422,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2136,"cache_read_input_tokens":890878,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":422},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f9ff03de-571e-45f3-b106-e7bb698cc69a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJRqbFZiuerN4AdPFN8R","requestRef":"35be7fcd-ff1e-41be-ac2f-91453cad2d18","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"484e7d45-bad9-4ba0-80a1-bc8f26dfbbe6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:06:09.402Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
