{"parentUuid":"4e1816e1-f501-460f-96fb-9f281ad84482","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRzwgPPETQe8iAmHndr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2174,"cache_read_input_tokens":891300,"output_tokens":968,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":313},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2174,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":891300,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2174,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2174},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3711,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"68ff3dc2-fe1f-49c4-a253-afa9219449d6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJRzvcu6jNaGtLAGKJuL","requestRef":"5511a40d-2cd9-4b1a-a195-dd22a99ed658","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"4bbbcf1b-31d4-4c2f-9865-4fd8d8bbfc67","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:07:53.148Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"4bbbcf1b-31d4-4c2f-9865-4fd8d8bbfc67","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRzwgPPETQe8iAmHndr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"其实**不一定要一直记**，你问到点子上了。我先说为什么想到要记，再说一个更轻的办法。\n\n**为什么需要\"记点什么\"**\n机械臂很多动作不在路径库里：在格口里推进、退出，在桌面下探吸取，去扫码口，去近拍位。这些都是设备临时算出目标点，让控制器\"直线走过去\"或\"关节转过去\"。路径库里没有这些轨迹，所以中途停下以后，复位不知道它是从哪儿来的、该往哪儿退。\n\n**更轻的办法：只记\"每一步从哪儿出发\"**\n不用每秒记十次，只在**每发一个运动指令之前**，记下\"出发点在哪、用的是直线还是关节运动\"，像叠盘子一样一层层往上叠：\n\n```\nhome → (关节) 近拍位 → (直线) 吸取悬停 → (直线) 下探 → 停在这里\n```\n\n复位时**从最上面一层开始，倒着一步步走回去**：\n- 用直线走过来的，就直线退回它的出发点；\n- 用关节运动过来的，就关节运动回它的出发点；\n- 沿路径库飞过来的，就沿同一条路径倒着飞回去。\n\n一直退到 home 或 mid 就完成了。\n\n**这个办法的好处**\n- 没有额外负担：只在发指令时记一行，平时不占资源。\n- 倒回去走的是**同一种运动、同一条线**，扫过的空间和来时一样，所以是安全的。\n- 停在一段运动的中间也没问题：从当前位置退回这一段的出发点，走的还是原来那条线。\n\n**需要做的**：在发运动指令的统一入口加上\"记出发点\"。设备里所有动作最终都通过同一个机械臂类发指令，只要改那一处。\n\n所以建议用这个\"记每一步出发点\"的办法，不用一直记关节。你觉得可以吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2174,"cache_read_input_tokens":891300,"output_tokens":968,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":313},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2174,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":891300,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2174,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2174},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"68ff3dc2-fe1f-49c4-a253-afa9219449d6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJRzvcu6jNaGtLAGKJuL","requestRef":"5511a40d-2cd9-4b1a-a195-dd22a99ed658","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"036bedce-8495-41ad-a7d8-05f9d18c647a","timestamp":"2026-