{"parentUuid":"c76ec6e2-81b3-4c44-be0e-2ca6829a302d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJS4vDSwd4Jab2aJwfFk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能，大部分可以我自己在**控制器仿真模式**下验证，不用你守着。办法是这样的：\n\n1. 让设备在仿真里跑一个完整流程（上架、出库、退苗、盘点都有现成的空跑模式）。\n2. 在不同时刻**人为让机械臂中途停下**：另开一条连接给控制器发停止指令，模拟急停或运动中断。停的位置覆盖今天碰到的几种：伸在格口里、桌面吸取途中、扫码途中、沿路径飞行途中、投放到退苗筐途中。\n3. 每停一次就调用复位，检查两件事：**能不能回到 home**；**倒回去的轨迹和来时的轨迹是不是重合**（把两段录制叠起来比）。\n4. 全部跑完，我**自己切回真实模式**，再把结果整理给你。\n\n**自己验证不了的，需要你在真机上试一次：**\n- **真正的急停**：仿真里只能模拟\"运动被停下\"，模拟不了硬件急停后要解除、上电、使能的过程。\n- **手上真的吸着盒子**时复位：仿真里没有真空，验证不了盒子会不会在倒退时掉下来。\n\n**前提**：我做验证的时候控制器会切到仿真模式，这段时间**你不能跑真机**。另外，如果想同时做碰撞判卷，需要开 AutoDL；只验证\"能不能原路回去\"的话，不开也行。\n\n要开始的话告诉我一声，做完代码、准备验证之前，我会先问你现在能不能占用控制器。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":198,"cache_read_input_tokens":894480,"output_tokens":828,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":286},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":198,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":828,"cache_read_input_tokens":894480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":198},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4ac52b9f-fc50-409d-ad2b-05b627159222","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJS4ufi4WevwNTnDbfnS","requestRef":"7ed371aa-e8c7-4cbe-aa50-35d22c14eb75","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"9f90d580-836d-49a7-8b88-ef1205abab74","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:08:53.459Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType