{"parentUuid":"0c8ef65d-b8af-486d-9d96-e96f5b07f31a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJSgzC4kChhQ1XsXaKQz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你的用量额度到了，这一轮只能先停在这里。\n\n**已完成：**\n- **记脚印**：机械臂每发一条运动指令（关节运动、直线运动、沿路径飞行）之前，都会记下\"从哪出发、用的哪种运动、去哪\"。从 home 或 mid 出发时自动清空重记。记录存成文件，服务重启也不会丢。\n- **按脚印原路倒回**：已接进复位动作，作为第一种策略。倒回之前，每一步都会先核对\"当前位置确实在这一段上\"，对不上就不走，改用原来的复位策略。上位机的 `POST /device/reset` 接口不变。\n- **仿真验证工具** `rewind_check.py`：让一个动作跑起来，第 N 秒发停止指令，再调用复位，最后检查机械臂是否回到了 home 或 mid。\n- 以上已在 Mac 端提交（c249a75）。\n\n**还没做的：**\n1. **部署到设备**：代码还没推上去，设备现在跑的仍然是旧逻辑。\n2. **仿真验证**：要在控制器仿真模式下，逐个场景试中途停下再复位：格内放置、格内取货、沿路径飞行、投放到退苗筐、回 home 途中。这一步会占用控制器，需要你确认当时没在跑真机。\n3. **重启工作站服务**：让上位机调用的复位接口，以及任务中的运动也开始记脚印。要等设备空闲时做。\n\n设备现在空闲，在 home，真实模式。额度恢复后告诉我\"可以占用控制器\"，我就从部署和仿真验证开始。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1193,"cache_read_input_tokens":928779,"output_tokens":563,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1193,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":563,"cache_read_input_tokens":928779,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1193,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1193},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"28cbf0e5-c204-4acc-966b-16e549194ed9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJSgyUfHwEc2ot8bwovC","requestRef":"98b52b2b-4c51-49ab-9e1e-60566485431f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ceb5c62-9baa-4450-9c62-398995a33e70","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:16:58.434Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medi