{"parentUuid":"0013b79f-a1f6-48c2-a75f-87d0cd4ca264","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory/end-effector-loose.md","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory/end-effector-loose.md","content":"---\nname: end-effector-loose\ndescription: 2026-10-23 末端(立放方管+吸盘)松动导致上架压不紧/盒子放歪/盘点报账外物体; 放置异常先查末端紧固\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe\n  modified: 2026-10-23T03:02:04.045Z\n---\n\n2026-10-23 上架一系列异常的根因是**末端松了**(用户现场发现), 不是放置算法: A-L10 第4列(x=30.8)整列比计划长 11mm 压不紧、第5列盒子偏右/歪被盘点报 stray(横向139~163, 深度同队首)、随后机械臂在格口门口急停。当时日志里各列放置动作完全一致(推进量/贴板高/吹开都正常), 盘点 front_diff 才暴露差异。\n\n**Why:** 末端松动时方管/吸盘角度随受力变, 推进不正、松手回弹, 软件侧看不出(控制器报到位)。\n\n**How to apply:** 再遇到\"某列压不紧/盒子放歪/账外物体/盘点队首普遍偏外\", 先让用户检查末端紧固(用户计划加防松垫片), 再查软件。紧固后建议复核: `tcp_sync.sh check`(必要时 tcp_verify 重标)、`handeye_verify2.sh` 落点复核、空列放5盒+盘点核队首。相关: [[stand-tool-design]] [[stocktake-design]]\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}},"displayPath":"../../.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory/end-effector-loose.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"45b4797b-5ce0-49d5-b9d1-b6dd5b1f25bc","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:48:00.716Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory/end-effector-loose.md\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t---\n2\tname: end-effector-loose\n3\tdescription: 2026-10-23 末端(立放方管+吸盘)松动导致上架压不紧/盒子放歪/盘点报账外物体; 放置异常先查末端紧固\n4\tmetadata:\n5\t  node_type: memory\n6\t  type: project\n7\t  originSessionId: 9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe\n8\t  modified: 2026-10-23T03:02:04.045Z\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t2026-10-23 上架一系列异常的根因是**末端松了**(用户现场发现), 不是放置算法: A-L10 第4列(x=30.8)整列比计划长 11mm 压不紧、第5列盒子偏右/歪被盘点报 stray(横向139~163, 深度同队首)、随后机械臂在格口门口急停。当时日志里各列放置动作完全一致(推进量/贴板高/吹开都正常), 盘点 front_diff 才暴露差异。\n12\t\n13\t**Why:** 末端松动时方管/吸盘角度随受力变, 推进不正、松手回弹, 软件侧看不出(控制器报到位)。\n14\t\n15\t**How to apply:** 再遇到\"某列压不紧/盒子放歪/账外物体/盘点队首普遍偏外\", 先让用户检查末端紧固(用户计划加防松垫片), 再查软件。紧固后建议复核: `tcp_sync.sh check`(必要时 tcp_verify 重标)、`handeye_verify2.sh` 落点复核、空列放5盒+盘点核队首。相关: [[stand-tool-design]] [[stocktake-design]]\n16\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
