{"parentUuid":"e55b821e-25af-4b65-80be-d6fc96a4d650","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJeFHCgHSwwyWzgPLcSg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20586,"cache_read_input_tokens":80208,"output_tokens":1021,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":527},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1021,"cache_read_input_tokens":80208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6061,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"35983fdd-13d1-4832-a811-48c91a3f09f6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJeFGsbY99TS69jRrnF7","requestRef":"d274113b-3cbc-4b7f-a2f2-b5495d4c1dcc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"dedcee56-7fef-4318-a4a5-d8c2eba0df44","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:48:32.691Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"dedcee56-7fef-4318-a4a5-d8c2eba0df44","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJeFHCgHSwwyWzgPLcSg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"建议先从最简单的一个场景开始：**空手飞往格口，半路急停**。\n\n**步骤**\n\n1. 确认臂在 home 或 mid，控制器处于真实模式、自动模式。\n2. 让臂飞往格口：\n   ```\n   ./scripts/act.sh fly mid_to_A-L10\n   ```\n3. 飞到一半时，按示教器急停。\n4. 依次解除急停、上使能。如果示教器切到了手动模式，执行 `./scripts/check_cell.sh opmode auto` 切回自动。\n5. 复位：\n   ```\n   ./scripts/act.sh reset\n   ```\n   复位时手放在急停上。\n\n**怎么算通过**\n- 臂沿来时的路倒回 mid 或 home，回执的\"说明\"里写的是按脚印倒回。\n- 如果回执说对不上，并改用了旧策略，说明脚印没用上。这次不算失败，但请把回执发给我看。\n\n**想先看脚印记了什么**（第 4 步之后、第 5 步之前，只读）：\n```\nssh 26293@100.106.76.91 \"type D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\logs\\breadcrumb.json\"\n```\n飞行中断时，这里应该只有 1 条记录，类型是 track。\n\n这个场景过了再测下一个：持货在格内放置时急停（`flow.sh store` 跑到格内推进时按急停）。\n\n你测试期间我不碰控制器。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20586,"cache_read_input_tokens":80208,"output_tokens":1021,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":527},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1021,"cache_read_input_tokens":80208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"35983fdd-13d1-4832-a811-48c91a3f09f6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJeFGsbY99TS69jRrnF7","requestRef":"d274113b-3cbc-4b7f-a2f2-b5495d4c1dcc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"c744325b-d7bc-4339-b418-71aaab63d269","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:48:38.103Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","eff