 \"place A-L10 -246.2 10 0\" --stop 3`(控制器先切仿真, 跑完切回); 10-23 七场景全过 |","+| **中途停下(急停/中断/卡在格口里)回 home** | 上位机 `POST /device/reset` 或 `./scripts/act.sh reset`(2026-10-23 起**按脚印原路倒回**: 每条运动指令发令前记出发点/类型/目标到设备 `logs/breadcrumb.json`(源 `actions/breadcrumb.py`, 挂在 ducocobot 4 个运动方法 + track_play), 复位从最近一步倒回到 home/mid, **停在 mid 的再 movej 回 home(10-23 用户定: 复位一律收尾 home, 持货也一样)**; 走完闭环自动删段; 对不上(被示教器挪过>容差)则退回老策略/报需人工). 前提: 解除急停+使能+**自动模式**(手动模式下指令不动). 仿真验证 `tools/arm/rewind_check.py --setup \"pose:A-L10\" --run \"place A-L10 -246.2 10 0\" --stop 3`(控制器先切仿真, 跑完切回); 10-23 七场景全过 |"," | 真机回任意命名位姿(判卷→切真实→播放,一条命令) | `scripts/arm/go_real.sh <位姿名> [--lift <mm>]`(编排sim_mode on→check_motion→sim_mode off→run_real;判卷红不动真机;YES确认;--lift=贴着物体时先竖直抬离再回位) |"," | 码牌检测体检(相机拍到什么/PnP距离准不准) | `scripts/aruco_snap.sh [帧数]`(blue-space robot_cell/tools/handeye/aruco_snap.py拍摄+ArUco检测+深度互验,标注图取回data/images/; 视觉服务在跑会先停它, 用完vision_service.sh start) |"," | 视觉识别不准, 定位坏在哪一步 | `scripts/vision_steps.sh [run_XXX\\|step1..8\\|closeup\\|plane]`(**九步管线2026-08-27定稿**: v3分割0.65→桌面门卫(同帧拟合滤贴桌点)→多脸连片剥离→逐脸量尺量高→step8场景认亲去重, 每脸输出中心/朝向/L×W/H/倾角; 场景唯一最终图=run目录scene_final.jpg; closeup=近拍**斜10°退+y货架侧**, 新目标须走closeup判卷链: dry→sim closeup→登记poses→check_motion→go_real; plane=桌面平面自动标定; 考题库20帧`data/vision_steps/考题库索引.md`+最终图集`data/vision_steps/最终结果/`; 解读`docs/视觉算法通俗解读.md`) |"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/CLAUDE.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"905613a1-9a6a-4296-a20e-8c7827955954","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":14},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"aa4f6ae2-8bd4-4051-b7e5-9448b02fb8f2","permissio