{"parentUuid":"6daab327-24a8-4dcc-82ea-829b763a5ca2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJehEt1mz3Tt1rZUPa1Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"改好了：现在所有复位最后都回到 **home**，持货时也一样。已部署，工作站服务已重启，代码已提交（ecdb398）。\n\n**具体变化**\n- 原来停在 mid 的复位，现在会再从 mid 走到 home。这一段是每天都在走的固定路径。\n- 已经在 home 就不动。以前在 home 执行复位，会反过来把臂送到 mid。\n- 上位机调 `POST /device/reset` 本来就是最后回 home，所以上位机那边行为不变。\n- 唯一例外：格内脱困时如果设置为不飞回，仍然停在格口悬停点。现在没有地方这样调用。\n\n臂现在正停在 mid。你可以直接执行 `./scripts/act.sh reset` 验证新收尾，它应该会从 mid 走回 home。\n\n你刚才的急停测试，复位回执里\"说明\"写的是不是\"按脚印原路倒回\"？方便的话把回执贴给我，我对一下。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":465,"cache_read_input_tokens":122263,"output_tokens":398,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":58},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":465,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":122263,"cache_creation_input_tokens":465,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":465},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a8e1a296-7ec8-4a3d-8d08-7d4b512cdaa3","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJehEaewkzWNjPgKymLP","requestRef":"bdc99049-39af-4625-8cdf-a15495999d78","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"92711baa-29d7-4d85-8e90-bd20bf679741","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:54:22.335Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-pl