{"parentUuid":"973278ea-af0b-4b84-aad0-39371778ae93","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJes26M7TaLC5ggi5tKJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已确认参数格式。命令如下：\n\n```\n./scripts/flow.sh store A-R10 0 0 0\n```\n\n- `A-R10`：目标格口，换成你想放的格口。\n- `0 0 0`：横向位置 x=0mm（格口正中）、序号 0（这一列第一盒）、最后一位固定填 0。\n- 输入一次 YES 后全程自动：回 home → 识别 → 吸取 → 扫码 → 认脸 → 飞往格口 → 放置 → 回 home。\n\n**跑之前确认三件事**\n1. 选的那个位置是空的。设备不管占位，由你保证。\n2. 桌上放一盒已录入尺寸表的药盒，或者让上苗机送料。\n3. 控制器是真实模式、自动模式。\n\n末端是重新装的，建议跑之前先执行一次只读对账，确认 TCP 没变：`./scripts/tcp_sync.sh check`。\n\n放完后，看盒子是不是正、背面有没有顶紧背板。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1045,"cache_read_input_tokens":125967,"output_tokens":660,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":314},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1045,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":660,"cache_read_input_tokens":125967,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1045,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1045},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"329ae37e-f79a-4f49-a8fd-75874a5b7b11","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJes1qU7ZBZ2CuFH2pUE","requestRef":"116a0d04-e191-46fd-86a3-f0eb6c01b19d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"d052ef60-f23d-45ad-b58e-bd96d2832b34","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:56:38.640Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stan