{"parentUuid":"30a1eb03-95a2-451d-b0a2-040d189d3649","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"feb95aaa-abd2-49a7-9126-cec0e9a8bc31","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016VvqgnhKnpdnShFynZEfKp","type":"tool_result","content":"# 设备状态 WebSocket 对接说明\n\n> 给上位机开发。2026-10-23\n> 只改\"设备状态\"的获取方式；任务事件仍走 webhook（不变）。原来的 `GET /device` 保留，可以先并行、再切换。\n\n## 1. 地址\n\n```\nws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\n```\n\n上位机**主动连设备**（和调接口同一个方向），不需要上位机开端口。\n\n## 2. 会收到什么\n\n连上后**立刻**收到一份完整状态；之后：\n\n- **状态一变就推**（比如开始任务、急停、机械臂移动、手上有货/没货）。\n- **没变化时每 2 秒推一次**，当作心跳。\n\n每条消息就是 `GET /device` 的返回内容，多了两个字段：\n\n| 字段 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `type` | 固定为 `\"device\"` |\n| `changed` | `true` = 状态变了才推的；`false` = 心跳 |\n\n示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"device\",\n  \"changed\": true,\n  \"t\": \"2026-10-23 09:45:12\",\n  \"age_s\": 0.8,\n  \"state\": \"busy\",\n  \"arm_at\": \"A-L10\",\n  \"payload\": \"holding\",\n  \"estop\": false,\n  \"enabled\": true,","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"97347c5d-9bed-467f-bd24-399e7bfd263c","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:59:26.079Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# 设备状态 WebSocket 对接说明\n\n> 给上位机开发。2026-10-23\n> 只改\"设备状态\"的获取方式；任务事件仍走 webhook（不变）。原来的 `GET /device` 保留，可以先并行、再切换。\n\n## 1. 地址\n\n```\nws://192.168.100.190:8902/ws/device\n```\n\n上位机**主动连设备**（和调接口同一个方向），不需要上位机开端口。\n\n## 2. 会收到什么\n\n连上后**立刻**收到一份完整状态；之后：\n\n- **状态一变就推**（比如开始任务、急停、机械臂移动、手上有货/没货）。\n- **没变化时每 2 秒推一次**，当作心跳。\n\n每条消息就是 `GET /device` 的返回内容，多了两个字段：\n\n| 字段 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `type` | 固定为 `\"device\"` |\n| `changed` | `true` = 状态变了才推的；`false` = 心跳 |\n\n示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"device\",\n  \"changed\": true,\n  \"t\": \"2026-10-23 09:45:12\",\n  \"age_s\": 0.8,\n  \"state\": \"busy\",\n  \"arm_at\": \"A-L10\",\n  \"payload\": \"holding\",\n  \"estop\": false,\n  \"enabled\": true,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ee1abb45-10ce-4a55-8251-9789cea9595d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":14},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"30a1eb03-95a2-451d-b0a2-040d189d3649","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
