{"parentUuid":"de7969aa-226c-4994-88c5-b7ae4a826a4c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJfAopunHALgwmpTJ269","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"复位的对接说明写好了：`docs/复位对接说明.md`，可以直接发给上位机同事。\n\n**同事需要特别注意的四点**\n- **设备不做二次确认。** 调用前要由上位机界面弹窗，请操作员确认三件事：周围没人、急停已解除、控制器是自动模式。\n- **接口要等动作做完才返回。** 一般几秒，长的约 1 分钟，HTTP 超时要设 120 秒以上。\n- **持货复位后，盒子还在手上。** 臂会回到 home，但设备不会自动放下。要人工取下，或调丢回传送带的接口。这盒没有入库，不要记账。\n- **任务被立即停止或出异常后，任务已经结束。** 复位后要另下新任务，不要恢复原任务。\n\n文档里还有返回字段、错误码怎么处理，以及一个建议的界面流程。\n\n**顺带修正的地方**\n- 接口代码里有两处说明过时了：失败分类的取值写错了，动作名还写着\"复位→mid\"。已改正，已部署，工作站服务已重启。\n- 两版设备接口文档已重新生成，`设备接口文档_V1.docx` 已同步更新。\n\n需要的话，我可以把这份说明做成一个网页链接，方便转给同事。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":612,"cache_read_input_tokens":139954,"output_tokens":444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":612,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":139954,"cache_creation_input_tokens":612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":612},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b236cfc7-4afc-4749-9e2e-6c8ae5b76d64","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJfAoYJ8Ts1a3JqPx42t","requestRef":"95381300-0ecc-441d-a1f2-9d98d22ac00d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"6b5920b0-8a86-4e47-a600-799c5f63bea4","timestamp":"2026-10-23T06:00:36.311Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9