{"parentUuid":"8084265d-ef07-4562-b4c2-567d1dd2b102","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJorT9k9wtVQWVeAS5XD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，它是本地 Java 服务，只给 blue-space 本机用。我在 blue-space 上访问 `http://127.0.0.1:8977/`，后端能正常响应：\n\n> 欢迎使用RuoYi后台管理框架…请通过前端地址访问。\n\n所以后端本身没有问题，只是设计上不对外开放。\n\n**正确的用法**\n- 在 blue-space 上直接打开上位机桌面应用就行，前端和后端都在本机通信，用不到 `192.168.100.190` 这个地址。\n- `8977` 是后端接口，不是页面，用浏览器打开只会看到上面这句话。页面在桌面应用的窗口里。\n\n**它和设备的对接也都在本机**\n- 上位机调设备：`http://127.0.0.1:8902`。现在已经有连接连着 8902，说明这条路是通的。\n- 设备推送 webhook 给上位机：要改成 `http://127.0.0.1:8977/<路径>`。现在推送还指向旧地址 `192.168.100.212:8080`，事件推不到新部署的上位机。\n\n请同事告诉我 webhook 的接收路径，我来改设备的推送配置。路径大概是 `/vaccine/device/webhook` 这样的形式。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":395,"cache_read_input_tokens":144718,"output_tokens":428,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":395,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":428,"cache_read_input_tokens":144718,"cache_creation_input_tokens":395,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":395},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d41e5ae6-14e0-409c-b26e-bdd46f234a77","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJorSqPye5ai62oTBEKc","requestRef":"e63a582e-148e-4ca7-a1be-45b3fbadf492","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"69048e8a-189f-4f14-9085-2e6df9541f4a","timestamp":"2026-10-23T07:54:23.883Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","e