{"parentUuid":"0d48cdd0-8f30-4257-acfe-782d6493116c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJpbvs4bnFoydPiG5k4A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"原因找到了：是**服务看门狗**。\n\nblue-space 上有一个计划任务 `robot_cell_services_watchdog`，**每分钟**运行一次 `ensure_services.bat`。它负责检查视觉（8900）、扫码（8901）、工作站（8902）、上位机后端（8903）这四个服务还在不在，挂了就自动拉起来。\n\n这个任务是在桌面会话里运行的，因为扫码服务的键盘钩子必须住在桌面会话里。所以每次运行 `.bat`，都会弹出一个命令行黑框，跑完就消失。如果你看到的黑框是大约每分钟闪一次，就是它。\n\n**改法**：加一个很小的 `.vbs` 启动器，用隐藏窗口去运行同一个 `ensure_services.bat`。计划任务改成调用这个启动器。\n- 看门狗逻辑一行不改，只是不再弹窗。\n- 仍然在桌面会话里运行，扫码钩子不受影响。\n- 改完我会手动触发一次，确认四个服务都正常。\n\n要不要改？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1270,"cache_read_input_tokens":146952,"output_tokens":706,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":330},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1270,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":706,"cache_read_input_tokens":146952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1270,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1270},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"908aca56-9814-488d-9668-0c53ab04a1da","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJpbvVVpneWsJXptQNqD","requestRef":"fef16417-0f28-4239-8f7d-b1fb07582940","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"7f242ebf-157e-4d62-80fe-4be8017c3a0a","timestamp":"2026-10-23T08:04:16.909Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.