 if ! alive || ! upper_alive; then\nscripts/cell_service.sh:43:      ssh -n -o ControlMaster=no -o ControlPath=none -o ConnectTimeout=15 \"$BS\" \"schtasks /run /tn robot_cell_services_watchdog\" >/dev/null 2>&1\nscripts/cell_service.sh-44-      for i in $(seq 1 15); do sleep 2; alive && upper_alive && break; done\nscripts/cell_service.sh-45-    fi\ndocs/服务托管.md-14-- `services\\ensure_services.bat`(看门狗): 四个端口哪个没在听就拉起。vision/cell/upper 用 PowerShell `Start-Process run_service.bat <name>` 脱离计划任务进程树; scan 走 `schtasks /run /tn scan_service`。\ndocs/服务托管.md-15-- `services\\run_service.bat <name>`: 循环跑 python, 退出 5 秒后重启; 输出追加 `logs\\<name>_service.log`; vision 看到 hold 旗则停循环。\ndocs/服务托管.md:16:- 计划任务(Interactive, 最高权限, 用户 26293): `robot_cell_services_logon`(登录时) + `robot_cell_services_watchdog`(每 5 分钟)。两者都跑在桌面会话(SessionId 1), 实证 13:34 拉起的视觉进程在任务实例结束后仍存活。\ndocs/服务托管.md-17-- bat 文件必须 CRLF 行尾(LF 时 cmd 找不到 :label)。\ndocs/服务托管.md-18-","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1e4b5bcf-9a13-420e-91a0-69c5c0df3b29","timestamp":"2026-10-23T08:04:35.651Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"scripts/bluespace/services/svc.bat-88-:start\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/svc.bat-89-call :each clr\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/svc.bat:90:schtasks /run /tn robot_cell_services_watchdog >nul 2>&1\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/svc.bat-91-if \"%SVC_NOWAIT%\"==\"1\" ( echo watchdog triggered & exit /b 0 )\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/svc.bat-92-echo watchdog triggered, waiting for ports...\r\nscripts/vision_service.sh-8-#   ./scripts/vision_service.sh log      # 远端日志尾部 robot_cell\\logs\\vision_service.log\nscripts/vision_service.sh-9-#\nscripts/vision_service.sh:10:# 机制(2026-09-10定稿): 服务由 blue-space 本机托管 —— 计划任务 robot_cell_services_logon(登录时)/\nscripts/vision_service.sh:11:#   robot_cell_services_watchdog(每5分钟) 跑 services\\ensure_services.bat, 8900没在听就用\nscripts/vision_service.sh-12-#   services\\run_service.bat vision 拉起(崩了5秒自动重启); 与 Mac/ssh 无关, 开机即有.\nscripts/vision_service.sh-13-#   ⚠️ 经 ssh 直接跑 ensure_services.bat 拉