{"parentUuid":"b05c2bf2-906b-49b8-a27d-a9d97586d492","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJrsfmPyRTAz2v3SuFnz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1686,"cache_read_input_tokens":167965,"output_tokens":1165,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":600},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1686,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1165,"cache_read_input_tokens":167965,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1686,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1686},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13794,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"e3172c2d-ec29-43f0-a483-75b1138630fa","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJrsfJcTaWjyPoQTtehi","requestRef":"510830eb-cc99-403d-b62c-da06f42a0d8f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"653d3b0e-50e5-4edc-bc9d-6c4923f1ce86","timestamp":"2026-10-23T08:34:10.659Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"2e8bfcd4-e637-441c-b83c-f83c49135d41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"653d3b0e-50e5-4edc-bc9d-6c4923f1ce86","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJrsfmPyRTAz2v3SuFnz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"原因基本查清了。扫码服务在 16:32 被**卡死**了，不是掉线。\n\n**时间线**\n- 16:32:15　出苗任务回到 home，请求扫码服务扫码。\n- 扫码服务收到请求，但一直没有回应，日志里连一行都没写。\n- 16:32:29　工作站等待超时，任务异常结束。\n- 16:33:11　看门狗发现扫码服务连续两次没有回应，把它杀掉。16:33:24 重新拉起，现在已恢复正常。\n\n**为什么会卡死**\n\n扫码服务每处理完一个请求，会先往它自己的命令行窗口打印一行，然后才回复。\n\nWindows 命令行窗口有一个\"快速编辑\"功能：用鼠标在窗口里点一下，窗口就进入选中状态。这时程序只要往窗口打印，就会一直卡住，直到有人按回车或 Esc。\n\n所以这次很可能是有人点过扫码服务的窗口。16:05 我请你在现场观察黑框，这段时间正好落在服务最后一次正常（16:11）和卡死（16:32）之间。这是推断，但现象完全吻合：卡住时一行日志都没写进去，因为程序先写窗口、后写文件。\n\n**改法**\n1. 服务启动时，把自己窗口的\"快速编辑\"关掉。以后点窗口不会再把服务卡住。\n2. 日志改成先写文件、再写窗口。万一窗口还是卡住，日志里也能留下记录。\n\n视觉、工作站、上位机后端这三个服务也有命令行窗口，有同样的风险，我一并改。\n\n要不要改？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1686,"cache_read_input_tokens":167965,"output_tokens":1165,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":600},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1686,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1165,"cache_read_input_tokens":167965,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1686,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1686},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e3172c2d-ec29-43f0-a483-75b1138630fa","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJrsfJcTaWjyPoQTtehi","requestRef":"510830eb-cc99-403d-b62c-da06f42a0d8f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2ec28585-04e9-49e0-9ce7-abd7bc3922ea","timestamp":"2026-10-23T08:34:10.679Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session