{"parentUuid":"a7ad300b-140b-405a-a085-ba469bfc02d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPxzzBqY18ysNiAp2Avj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，仿真用的就是这套模型，我手上都有。它由两部分组成：\n\n| 部分 | 来源 | 精细程度 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 机械臂 GCR10-1300 | DUCO 官方模型 | 真实外形 |\n| 立放末端 | 你画的 SolidWorks 模型（`3D_model/`） | 真实外形 |\n| 底座、货架（两列）、工作台、上苗机、相机 | 按实测尺寸，用方块搭出来 | 只有外轮廓，没有细节 |\n\n这套模型做碰撞判断够用，但货架、工作台这些在模型里只是一堆长方体，不是真实的外观图。\n\n**我可以直接从这套模型导出俯视图 DXF**\n- 1:1，单位毫米，每台设备一个图块：机械臂、底座、货架、工作台、上苗机。\n- 各设备之间的相对位置就是现场实测的位置。\n- 机械臂按 home 姿态取俯视轮廓，另外可以加一个工作半径圆，投标布局图常用。\n\n货架和上苗机导出来是矩形轮廓（货架能看到立柱和格口分隔），做布局足够用。如果同事要更像实物的图块，货架和上苗机得找供应商要 CAD 文件。\n\n生成 DXF 需要在 Mac 上装一个画 DXF 的 Python 库（ezdxf），装在临时环境里，不影响别的东西。可以的话我就开始做。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":931,"cache_read_input_tokens":200991,"output_tokens":645,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":134},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":931,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":645,"cache_read_input_tokens":200991,"cache_creation_input_tokens":931,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":931},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"90b924a2-f096-4f64-8990-136498fa281c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPxzyrVsLesQQZSmgKaL","requestRef":"9e6c3511-d367-4f00-acdc-6c735dbca6c1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"f747ac8d-cba2-4d8b-bed2-c91a54db3156","timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:17:26.894Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4a5608cc-8439-46c4-aa57-90a8932cb84f","userType":"external