 等不碰). 回滚标签 `pre-shelf-prefix`(两端) |","+| **设备布局俯视图 CAD(投标/布局图块)** | `<venv>/bin/python scripts/export_layout_dxf.py [输出目录=docs/投标布局] [--pose home]`(venv 需 ezdxf/trimesh/shapely/pyyaml/matplotlib; 仿真同源: 机械臂=URDF 正运动学+DUCO 官方网格+现役末端 STL 投影取真实轮廓, 货架/工作台/上苗机/回流带/侧扫码器/扫码口=scene_params 实测位姿尺寸; 1:1 mm, 原点=底座中心, 每台设备一个 BLOCK; 产物 设备布局俯视图.dxf(+png 预览), AutoCAD 打开另存 DWG. ⚠ 底座只有占位半径不画; shelf2 位姿未标定放单独图层) |"," | 格口操作空间自动报告(前/左/右) | `scripts/arm/probe_slot.sh <格口名>`(自动复位+三向探测+表格,存档data/slot_range/;前提格口已solve_slot) |"," "," (新增脚本时同步更新本表和 `help` 菜单)"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/投标布局/设备布局俯视图.dxf","hunks":[{"oldStart":489,"oldLines":7,"newStart":489,"newLines":7,"lines":["   9"," $TDCREATE","  40","-2461340.3891898147","+2461340.389548611","   9"," $TDUCREATE","  40"]},{"oldStart":497,"oldLines":7,"newStart":497,"newLines":7,"lines":["   9"," $TDUPDATE","  40","-2461340.389224537","+2461340.3895949074","   9"," $TDUUPDATE","  40"]},{"oldStart":929,"oldLines":11,"newStart":929,"newLines":11,"lines":["   9"," $FINGERPRINTGUID","   2","-{DC0FBBD1-0E05-4010-B1CF-3AA9829870D9}","+{A0D39318-4219-4079-BB9E-96E94A5CF30A}","   9"," $VERSIONGUID","   2","-{23C7C5BD-E8F1-4288-BB74-F6E90E0F9DF9}","+{F24F2B13-7502-4878-A4E5-8D7056E79A5E}","   9"," $EXTNAMES"," 290"]},{"oldStart":8789,"oldLines":7,"newStart":8789,"newLines":7,"lines":[" 280"," 0","   1","-1.4.2 @ 2026-10-26T01:20:26.263283+00:00","+1.4.2 @ 2026-10-26T01:20:57.461509+00:00","   0"," VISUALSTYLE","   5"]},{"oldStart":9501,"oldLines":7,"newStart":9501,"newLines":7,"lines":[" 280"," 0","   1","-1.4.2 @ 2026-10-26T01:20:29.991730+00:00","+1.4.2 @ 2026-10-26T01:21:01.174970+00:00","   0"," ENDSEC","   0"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/export_layout_dxf.py","hunks":[{"oldStart":98,"oldLines":7,"newStart":98,"newLines":8,"lines":["                 b = trimesh.creation.box(extents=[sx, sy, sz]); V, F = b.vertices, b.faces","             else:","                 continue","-            W = (T[:3, :3] @ V.T).T + T[:3, 3]","+            with np.errstate(all=\"ignore\"):            # macOS Accelerate 的 matmul 误报(坐标已核实全有限)","+                W = (T[:3, :3] @ V.T).T + T[:3, 3]","             tri = W[F][:, :, :2] * 1000.0                   # 投影到地面, 毫米","             area = 0.5 * np.abs((tri[:, 1, 0] - tri[:, 0, 0]) * (tri[:, 2, 1] - tri[:, 0, 1]) - (tri[:, 2, 0] - tri[:, 0, 0]) * (tri[:, 1, 1] - tri[:, 0, 1]))","             polys += [Polygon(t) for t in tri[area > 1e-4]]"]},{"oldStart":206,"oldLines":12,"newStart":207,"newLines":13,"lines":["         import matplotlib.pyplot as plt","         from matplotlib import font_manager","         from ezdxf.addons.drawing import RenderContext, Frontend","+        from ezdxf.addons.drawing.config import Configuration, BackgroundPolicy, ColorPolicy","         from ezdxf.addons.drawing.matplotlib import MatplotlibBackend","         for f in (\"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", \"Arial Unicode MS\"):","             if any(f in x.name for x in font_manager.fontManager.ttflist):","                 plt.rcParams[\"font.family\"] = f; break","         fig = plt.figure(figsize=(12, 12)); ax = fig.add_axes([0, 0, 1, 1])","-        Frontend(RenderContext(doc), MatplotlibBackend(ax)).draw_layout(msp)","+        Frontend(RenderContext(doc), MatplotlibBackend(ax), config=Configuration(background_policy=BackgroundPolicy.WHITE, color_policy=ColorPolicy.COLOR_SWAP_BW)).draw_layout(msp)","         fig.savefig(os.path.join(OUT, \"设备布局俯视图.png\"), dpi=150, facecolor=\"white\")","     except Exception as e:","         print(\"(预览图没出: %s)\" % e)"]}]}],"moreFiles":1,"changedFiles":["/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/CLAUDE.md","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/投标布局/设备布局俯视图.dxf","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/投标布局/设备布局俯视图.png","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/export_layout_dxf.py"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"786803da-b437-4dfd-8e71-c5e8fd966644","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop