{"parentUuid":"bdc9d6b0-99c0-48c0-9b2d-c0365f1f13b1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14964672 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"eca375ed-aacf-49ac-a15d-c252262c9623","timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:21:20.438Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14964672 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"4a5608cc-8439-46c4-aa57-90a8932cb84f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"eca375ed-aacf-49ac-a15d-c252262c9623","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01M67jEoW3A13pbcKMMFUvc9","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"80810ae7-a6eb-436b-8927-a248707d1dae","timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:21:28.623Z","session_id":"4a5608cc-8439-46c4-aa57-90a8932cb84f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"80810ae7-a6eb-436b-8927-a248707d1dae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPyJp9avJG2JstiaeGgj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"俯视图已经导出，可以发给同事。上面那张就是预览图。\n\n**文件**\n- `docs/投标布局/设备布局俯视图.dxf`：给同事的 CAD 文件，AutoCAD 能直接打开，需要 DWG 格式就另存一下。\n- `docs/投标布局/设备布局俯视图.png`：预览图。\n\n**图里有什么**\n- 比例 1:1，单位毫米，原点是机械臂底座中心。\n- 每台设备是一个独立图块，同事可以整块移动或复制：\n  - **机械臂 GCR10-1300**：用 DUCO 官方模型摆成 home 姿态后取的真实俯视轮廓，连带末端和相机，另画了 R1300 的最大工作半径圆。\n  - **货架 1500×400**：画了外框和 6 根立柱。\n  - **工作台 710×395**：含扫码口。\n  - **上苗机 1300×600**：整机外轮廓。\n  - **回流传送带 600×350、侧扫码器 70×145。**\n- 各设备的位置和转角都是现场标定的实测值。\n\n**发给同事前，请你确认两件事**\n1. **右侧第二个货架（货架 B）**：它在仿真里存在，但位置是早期估计值，从来没有标定过。现场如果没有这个货架，或者位置不同，让同事删掉或挪动这个图块，它单独放在\"货架B_位置未标定\"图层里。\n2. **底座**：仿真里底座只有一个占位尺寸，所以没画。如果底座比机械臂底盘大，比如有方形底板，请把实际尺寸告诉我，我补进去。\n\n货架、上苗机都只有外轮廓。如果同事要更像实物的图块，需要找供应商要 CAD 文件。\n\n以后场地标定值改了，重新运行 `scripts/export_layout_dxf.py` 就能出新图，这个用法已经登记进能力目录。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_read_input_tokens":237537,"output_tokens":666,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":666,"cache_read_input_tokens":237537,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c357e336-aacd-41f3-b0f8-dd004a6ac57d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPyJoiJJptsHCfNP6J8a","requestRef":"5e23466e-b4dc-4e25-ba4b-98e2b8350842","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"5a7af172-75f6-4fc7-