scription=\"任务类型: store=上架(把桌上的盒放进货架); retrieve=取出直接送到去处(退苗等); outbound=出库: 取出→到扫码口扫码→推 outbound_scanned 事件→送到去处(不等上位机回复, 码对不上也照送; 2026-10-22); retrieve 与 outbound 参数完全相同(items/dest/reason/on_empty), dest 均可选能力表里任一可用去处; stocktake=盘点一个格口(设备飞到格口, 降到盘点位用深度相机拍一帧, 算每列几盒, 与 columns 逐列比对后回 stocktake 事件; 臂回 home)\")\n245:    dest: str = Field(\"drop\", description=\"出库/退苗用: 取出后放到哪里。可选值和当前是否可用见 GET /capability 的 destinations(drop=传送带口, outbound=出库筐, return=退苗筐)。位置还没标定的去处不能用, 会返回 400 dest_unavailable\")\n320:    destinations: List[DestCap] = Field(..., description=\"出库/退苗任务可选的去处\")\n383:    outbound_scanned(出库扫码, 2026-10-22): slot, x_mm, index, dest, code_expected(任务 items 里给的码), code_scanned(扫到的; 四面没读到=null), match(true/false; 没读到或没给账上码=null). 不论结果都照常投放\n389:    kind: str = Field(..., description=\"task_start/box_start/card/text/code_scanned/destination/stored/discarded/lost/retrieved/outbound_scanned/pit_empty/stocktake/waiting_box/fault/needs_human/paused/resumed/pause_requested/stop_requested/abort_requested/aborted/box_end/task_end\")\n413:    code_expected: Optional[str] = Field(None, description=\"outbound_scanned 事件: 上位机在任务 items 里给的这盒追溯码\")\n414:    code_scanned: Optional[str] = Field(None, description=\"outbound_scanned 事件: 扫码口实际扫到的码(四面都没读到=null)\")\n415:    match: Optional[bool] = Field(None, description=\"outbound_scanned 事件: 扫到的码与账上是否一致(没读到或任务没给码=null). 设备不据此改变去处\")\n592:             \"dest\": self.req.dest if self.req.type in (\"retrieve\", \"outbound\") else None, \"reason\": self.req.reason,","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8caaeba7-1d6e-4af3-a8b1-f6656172da36","timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:31:24.548Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"drop_point:\n  tcp: [-1.2630, 0.1847, 0.3943, -2.6283, -0.0020, 1.5902]   # 2026-09-15 立放末端: 抬高20mm(旧z 0.3743=带面+8.5cm; 长杆时 drop_mid→drop_point 手腕翻转半路持货盒扫带边2.6mm)\n  joints: [-0.026337, -0.586337, -0.741926, 0.270257, 1.590605, -0.038530]   # 2026-09-15 立放末端: 上面tcp按新TCP控制器IK(种子=旧关节); 旧电机工具 [0.013963, -0.652753, -0.755728, 0.350811, 1.570796, 