{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"60cb6196799b728dcc85453b3c8712d5696c33b83600db6fbc6e09881d332711","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"现有的投放点里，**退苗筐已经在机械臂正南方**（底座前方约 1 米）。出库传送带要避开它。先把现有投放点标进布局图，再画出建议位置："},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K3AxHXw5M7RmJaVmCsL8pK","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && /usr/bin/python3 - <<'EOF'\np=\"scripts/export_layout_dxf.py\"; s=open(p,encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\na='''    label(msp, \"设备布局俯视图  1:1'''\nadd='''    # 现有投放点(config/drop_point.yaml 示教/标定值, TCP 的 xy): 传送带口=丢回, 退苗筐\n    DP = yaml.safe_load(open(os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"drop_point.yaml\"), encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n    doc.layers.add(\"投放点\", color=1)\n    for key, nm in ((\"drop_point\", \"丢回点(传送带口)\"), (\"return_point\", \"退苗筐投放点\")):\n        if (DP.get(key) or {}).get(\"tcp\"):\n            x, y = DP[key][\"tcp\"][0] * 1000, DP[key][\"tcp\"][1] * 1000\n            msp.add_circle((x, y), 25, dxfattribs={\"layer\": \"投放点\"})\n            msp.add_line((x - 40, y), (x + 40, y), dxfattribs={\"layer\": \"投放点\"}); msp.add_line((x, y - 40), (x, y + 40), dxfattribs={\"layer\": \"投放点\"})\n            label(msp, nm, x, y - 70, 30, layer=\"投放点\")\n            report.append((nm, True, \"(%.0f, %.0f) 离底座 %.0f mm\" % (x, y, math.hypot(x, y))))\n'''\nassert s.count(a)==1; s=s.replace(a,add+a); open(p,\"w\",encoding=\"utf-8\").write(s)\nEOF\nS=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe/scratchpad; $S/cadenv/bin/python scripts/export_layout_dxf.py 2>&1 | tail -4","description":"布局图加入现有投放点标记并重新导出","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
