-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"6e884394-5857-418f-8e07-abca45f79b21","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"92eee11b-5708-4ca3-bcf0-e930f2f6ce13","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n# ROS2 + MoveIt + Foxglove 调试环境\n\n## 服务器信息\n\n| 项目 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 平台 | AutoDL 云 GPU |\n| 系统 | Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (容器) |\n| 主机 | connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com |\n| SSH 端口 | 38814 (每次重建可能变化，需检查 AutoDL 控制台) |\n| 用户 | root |\n| GPU | RTX 4090 24GB |\n| 数据盘 | /root/autodl-tmp (50GB，持久化) |\n| Python | /root/miniconda3/bin/python3.12 |\n\n## 已安装的软件\n\n- ROS2 Humble Desktop (`/opt/ros/humble/`)\n- MoveIt2 2.5.9 (`ros-humble-moveit`)\n- Foxglove Bridge (`ros-humble-foxglove-bridge`)\n- ros2_control + ros2_controllers\n- 环境已写入 `/root/.bashrc`: `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash`\n\n## 机械臂项目\n\n- **机械臂型号**: DUCO GCR10-1300\n- **驱动包位置**: `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver/`\n- **MoveIt 配置包**: `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config`\n- **工作空间已编译**: `duco_support` + `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config`\n- **原始 URDF**: `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/.../src/duco_support/urdf/duco_gcr10_1300.urdf`\n- **Mesh 文件**: `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/.../src/duco_support/meshes/GCR10_1300/*.stl` (base_link ~ link_6)\n\n## 启动方式\n\n### 一键启动（服务器端）\n\n```bash\nssh -p 38814 root@connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com \"nohup bash /root/autodl-tmp/start_foxglove.sh > /root/autodl-tmp/startup.log 2>&1 &\"\n```\n\n启动脚本 `/root/autodl-tmp/start_foxglove.sh` 会自动执行：\n1. source ROS2 和工作空间环境\n2. 启动 HTTP 服务器 (端口 9090，提供 URDF 和 mesh 文件)\n3. 启动 `foxglove_demo.launch.py`（包含 robot_state_publisher + move_group + ros2_control + foxglove_bridge）\n\n等待约 10 秒后检查是否就绪：\n```bash\nssh -p 38814 root@connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com \"strings /root/autodl-tmp/startup.log | grep -E 'You can start planning|Server listening'\"\n```\n应看到 `Server listening on port 8765` 和 `You can start planning now!`\n\n### 本地 SSH 隧道（一条命令，合并两个端口）\n\n```bash\nssh -CNg -L 8765:127.0.0.1:8765 -L 9090:127.0.0.1:9090 root@connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com -p 38814\n```\n\n- 8765: Foxglove Bridge WebSocket\n- 9090: HTTP 服务器（URDF + STL mesh 文件）\n\n此命令需在后台运行（加 `&` 或用 `run_in_background`）。\n\n### Foxglove Desktop 连接\n\n1. 打开 Foxglove Studio（已安装在 `/Applications/Foxglove.app`）\n2. 连接 `ws://localhost:8765`\n3. 添加 **三维 (3D)** 面板\n4. **关键设置**: 3D 面板 → 左侧 **场景** → **Mesh up axis** 改为 **Z-up**（不设此项机械臂 mesh 会错位）\n5. 左侧 **自定义图层** → 点 **+** → 添加 **URDF**\n6. Source: **URL** → 填 `http://localhost:9090/gcr10_1300.urdf`\n\n## 重要注意事项\n\n### Mesh up axis 必须设为 Z-up\nFoxglove 和 RViz 对 STL 坐标轴默认不同。不设置会导致 base_link/link_1 和 link_5/link_6 之间出现间隙，mesh 错位。这是 Foxglove 的已知问题。\n\n### URDF 通过 HTTP URL 加载（非 Topic）\n`/robot_description` 话题使用 TRANSIENT_LOCAL QoS，foxglove_bridge 无法正常中继。因此 URDF 通过 HTTP URL 加载，mesh 路径已从 `package://duco_support/` 替换为 `http://localhost:9090/`。\n\n### HTTP 提供的 URDF 文件\n(eval):1: ===== not found","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QKWmk2crCujBEtbmiDh8oP"}]},"uuid":"68219752-6671-4100-952d-ab5c0fb75878","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:16:11.783Z","toolUseResult":"Error: Exit code 1\n# ROS2 + MoveIt + Foxglove 调试环境\n\n## 服务器信息\n\n| 项目 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 平台 | AutoDL 云 GPU |\n| 系统 | Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (容器) |\n| 主机 | connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com |\n| SSH 端口 | 38814 (每次重建可能变化，需检查 AutoDL 控制台) |\n| 用户 | root |\n| GPU | RTX 4090 24GB |\n| 数据盘 | /root/autodl-tmp (50GB，持久化) |\n| Python | /root/miniconda3/bin/python3.12 |\n\n## 已安装的软件\n\n- ROS2 Humble Desktop (`/opt/ros/humble/`)\n- MoveIt2 2.5.9 (`ros-humble-moveit`)\n- Foxglove Bridge (`ros-humble-foxglove-bridge`)\n- ros2_control + ros2_controllers\n- 环境已写入 `/root/.bashrc`: `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash`\n\n## 机械臂项目\n\n- **机械臂型号**: DUCO GCR10-1300\n- **驱动包位置**: `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver/`\n- **MoveIt 配置包**: `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config`\n- **工作空间已编译**: `duco_support` + `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config`\n- **原始 URDF**: `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/.../src/duco_support/urdf/duco_gcr10_1300.urdf`\n- **Mesh 文件**: `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/.../src/duco_support/meshes/GCR10_1300/*.stl` (base_link ~ link_6)\n\n## 启动方式\n\n### 一键启动（服务器端）\n\n```bash\nssh -p 38814 root@connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com \"nohup bash /root/autodl-tmp/start_foxglove.sh > /root/autodl-tmp/startup.log 2>&1 &\"\n```\n\n启动脚本 `/root/autodl-tmp/start_foxglove.sh` 会自动执行：\n1. source ROS2 和工作空间环境\n2. 启动 HTTP 服务器 (端口 9090，提供 URDF 和 mesh 文件)\n3. 启动 `foxglove_demo.launch.py`（包含 robot_state_publisher + move_group + ros2_control + foxglove_bridge）\n\n等待约 10 秒后检查是否就绪：\n```bash\nssh -p 38814 root@connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com \"strings /root/autodl-tmp/startup.log | grep -E 'You can start planning|Server listening'\"\n```\n应看到 `Server listening on port 8765` 和 `You can start planning now!`\n\n### 本地 SSH 隧道（一条命令，合并两个端口）\n\n```bash\nssh -CNg -L 8765:127.0.0.1:8765 -L 9090:127.0.0.1:9090 root@connect.nmb2.seetacloud.com -p 38814\n```\n\n- 8765: Foxglove Bridge WebSocket\n- 9090: HTTP 服务器（URDF + STL mesh 文件）\n\n此命令需在后台运行（加 `&` 或用 `run_in_background`）。\n\n### Foxglove Desktop 连接\n\n1. 打开 Foxglove Studio（已安装在 `/Applications/Foxglove.app`）\n2. 连接 `ws://localhost:8765`\n3. 添加 **三维 (3D)** 面板\n4. **关键设置**: 3D 面板 → 左侧 **场景** → **Mesh up axis** 改为 **Z-up**（不设此项机械臂 mesh 会错位）\n5. 左侧 **自定义图层** → 点 **+** → 添加 **URDF**\n6. Source: **URL** → 填 `http://localhost:9090/gcr10_1300.urdf`\n\n## 重要注意事项\n\n### Mesh up axis 必须设为 Z-up\nFoxglove 和 RViz 对 STL 坐标轴默认不同。不设置会导致 base_link/link_1 和 link_5/link_6 之间出现间隙，mesh 错位。这是 Foxglove 的已知问题。\n\n### URDF 通过 HTTP URL 加载（非 Topic）\n`/robot_description` 话题使用 TRANSIENT_LOCAL QoS，foxglove_bridge 无法正常中继。因此 URDF 通过 HTTP URL 加载，mesh 路径已从 `package://duco_support/` 替换为 `http://localhost:9090/`。\n\n### HTTP 提供的 URDF 文件\n(eval):1: ===== not found","serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0dafae9c-ae22-4377-955e-d610ff550df0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":16},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6e884394-5857-418f-8e07-abca45f79b21","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"10b58a1d-15c6-42bb-94b0-7144dac78e24","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"92eee11b-5708-4ca3-bcf0-e930f2f6ce13","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013jDdqvnEZwkCN2kkzFDvsf","type":"tool_result","content":"#!/bin/bash\n# ============================================================\n# 恢复 AutoDL 仿真环境(幂等:缺什么补什么,已好的跳过)\n# 场景: 服务器重启了/Foxglove连不上/机械臂不显示/连杆黄色警告\n# 用法: ./scripts/restore_autodl.sh\n# 做了什么: ①连AutoDL ②起仿真栈 ③停jsb+起中继 ④重建本地隧道 ⑤发显示帧 ⑥体检\n# 依赖: ~/.ssh/config 的 autodl 别名(端口变了→AutoDL控制台查→更新config→重跑)\n# ============================================================\nset -u\nssh -O exit autodl 2>/dev/null; true   # 清SSH复用僵尸通道(服务器重启后旧master会卡死一切)\nSSH=\"ssh -o ConnectTimeout=12 autodl\"\nROS_SRC=\"source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash && source /root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver/install/setup.bash\"\nMID=\"[-0.045940, 0.471117, -1.717635, -0.065799, 1.570736, 0.000161]\"\nstep(){ echo; echo \"── $*\"; }\n\nstep \"1/6 连接 AutoDL\"\nif ! $SSH \"echo ok\" >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  PORT=$(awk '/Host autodl/{f=1} f&&/Port/{print $2; exit}' ~/.ssh/config)\n  echo \"❌ FAIL: 连不上 autodl(当前配置端口 $PORT)\"\n  echo \"   实例可能关机或端口已变 → 去 AutoDL 控制台查看/开机,更新 ~/.ssh/config 的 Port 后重跑本脚本\"\n  exit 1\nfi\necho \"✅ SSH 可达\"\n\nstep \"2/6 仿真栈(foxglove_bridge/move_group/robot_state_publisher)\"\nCNT=$($SSH \"ps aux | grep -E 'foxglove_bridge|move_group|robot_state_pub' | grep -v grep | wc -l\" | tr -d ' \\r')\nif [ \"${CNT:-0}\" -ge 3 ]; then\n  echo \"✅ 栈已在运行,跳过\"\nelse\n  echo \"   栈未运行,启动中(约20秒)...\"\n  $SSH \"cd /root/autodl-tmp && (setsid nohup bash start_foxglove.sh >/tmp/foxglove_stack.log 2>&1 &) ; sleep 18\" >/dev/null 2>&1\nfi\n\nstep \"3/6 停 joint_state_broadcaster + 起中继(9095)\"\n$SSH \"$ROS_SRC && ros2 control set_controller_state joint_state_broadcaster inactive\" 2>/dev/null | grep -q Success && echo \"✅ jsb 已停用\" || echo \"   (jsb 状态未变,可能已inactive)\"\nRELAY=$($SSH \"ps aux | grep joint_relay | grep -v grep | wc -l\" | tr -d ' \\r')\nif [ \"${RELAY:-0}\" -ge 1 ]; then\n  echo \"✅ 中继已在运行,跳过\"\nelse\n  $SSH \"$ROS_SRC && (setsid nohup python3 /root/autodl-tmp/duco_joint_relay.py >/tmp/relay.log 2>&1 &) ; sleep 3\" >/dev/null 2>&1\n  echo \"   中继已启动\"\nfi\n\nstep \"4/6 本地隧道(8765/9090/9095)\"\npkill -f \"ssh.*-L 8765\" 2>/dev/null; sleep 1\n# ControlMaster=no: 绕开ssh连接复用 —— 隧道若搭在共享主通道上, 主通道ControlPersist到期\n# 退出会带走全部端口(2026-08-31实证\"隧道起来几分钟就死\"), 独立连接自生自灭\nssh -f -o ControlMaster=no -o ControlPath=none \\\n  -o ServerAliveInterval=20 -o ServerAliveCountMax=5 -o ExitOnForwardFailure=yes -o TCPKeepAlive=yes -CNg \\\n  -L 8765:127.0.0.1:8765 -L 9090:127.0.0.1:9090 -L 9095:127.0.0.1:9095 autodl\nsleep 2\nTN=0; for p in 8765 9090 9095; do nc -z -w 2 localhost $p >/dev/null 2>&1 && TN=$((TN+1)); done\nif [ \"$TN\" -eq 3 ]; then echo \"✅ 隧道已重建(3端口实探通过)\"; else\n  echo \"❌ 隧道重建失败(实探 $TN/3), 手动排查: ssh -O exit autodl 后重跑\"; exit 1; fi\n\nstep \"5/6 发显示帧(MID位姿,消除连杆警告)\"\n/usr/bin/python3 - <<PY\nimport socket, json, sys\ntry:\n    s = socket.create_connection((\"127.0.0.1\", 9095), timeout=6)\n__pycache__\ncable_envelope_gen.py\ncartesian_probe.py\nhighlight_object.py\nik_batch.py\nik_cert.py\nik_moveit.py\nkill_stack.sh\nload_scene.py\nplan_path.py\nreplay_check.py\nscene_overlay.py\nself_check.py\ntcp_solve.py\ntool_overlay.py","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"219555f9-8670-4bf7-a54b-7e3e1316c97d","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:16:11.827Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"#!/bin/bash\n# ============================================================\n# 恢复 AutoDL 仿真环境(幂等:缺什么补什么,已好的跳过)\n# 场景: 服务器重启了/Foxglove连不上/机械臂不显示/连杆黄色警告\n# 用法: ./scripts/restore_autodl.sh\n# 做了什么: ①连AutoDL ②起仿真栈 ③停jsb+起中继 ④重建本地隧道 ⑤发显示帧 ⑥体检\n# 依赖: ~/.ssh/config 的 autodl 别名(端口变了→AutoDL控制台查→更新config→重跑)\n# ============================================================\nset -u\nssh -O exit autodl 2>/dev/null; true   # 清SSH复用僵尸通道(服务器重启后旧master会卡死一切)\nSSH=\"ssh -o ConnectTimeout=12 autodl\"\nROS_SRC=\"source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash && source /root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver/install/setup.bash\"\nMID=\"[-0.045940, 0.471117, -1.717635, -0.065799, 1.570736, 0.000161]\"\nstep(){ echo; echo \"── $*\"; }\n\nstep \"1/6 连接 AutoDL\"\nif ! $SSH \"echo ok\" >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  PORT=$(awk '/Host autodl/{f=1} f&&/Port/{print $2; exit}' ~/.ssh/config)\n  echo \"❌ FAIL: 连不上 autodl(当前配置端口 $PORT)\"\n  echo \"   实例可能关机或端口已变 → 去 AutoDL 控制台查看/开机,更新 ~/.ssh/config 的 Port 后重跑本脚本\"\n  exit 1\nfi\necho \"✅ SSH 可达\"\n\nstep \"2/6 仿真栈(foxglove_bridge/move_group/robot_state_publisher)\"\nCNT=$($SSH \"ps aux | grep -E 'foxglove_bridge|move_group|robot_state_pub' | grep -v grep | wc -l\" | tr -d ' \\r')\nif [ \"${CNT:-0}\" -ge 3 ]; then\n  echo \"✅ 栈已在运行,跳过\"\nelse\n  echo \"   栈未运行,启动中(约20秒)...\"\n  $SSH \"cd /root/autodl-tmp && (setsid nohup bash start_foxglove.sh >/tmp/foxglove_stack.log 2>&1 &) ; sleep 18\" >/dev/null 2>&1\nfi\n\nstep \"3/6 停 joint_state_broadcaster + 起中继(9095)\"\n$SSH \"$ROS_SRC && ros2 control set_controller_state joint_state_broadcaster inactive\" 2>/dev/null | grep -q Success && echo \"✅ jsb 已停用\" || echo \"   (jsb 状态未变,可能已inactive)\"\nRELAY=$($SSH \"ps aux | grep joint_relay | grep -v grep | wc -l\" | tr -d ' \\r')\nif [ \"${RELAY:-0}\" -ge 1 ]; then\n  echo \"✅ 中继已在运行,跳过\"\nelse\n  $SSH \"$ROS_SRC && (setsid nohup python3 /root/autodl-tmp/duco_joint_relay.py >/tmp/relay.log 2>&1 &) ; sleep 3\" >/dev/null 2>&1\n  echo \"   中继已启动\"\nfi\n\nstep \"4/6 本地隧道(8765/9090/9095)\"\npkill -f \"ssh.*-L 8765\" 2>/dev/null; sleep 1\n# ControlMaster=no: 绕开ssh连接复用 —— 隧道若搭在共享主通道上, 主通道ControlPersist到期\n# 退出会带走全部端口(2026-08-31实证\"隧道起来几分钟就死\"), 独立连接自生自灭\nssh -f -o ControlMaster=no -o ControlPath=none \\\n  -o ServerAliveInterval=20 -o ServerAliveCountMax=5 -o ExitOnForwardFailure=yes -o TCPKeepAlive=yes -CNg \\\n  -L 8765:127.0.0.1:8765 -L 9090:127.0.0.1:9090 -L 9095:127.0.0.1:9095 autodl\nsleep 2\nTN=0; for p in 8765 9090 9095; do nc -z -w 2 localhost $p >/dev/null 2>&1 && TN=$((TN+1)); done\nif [ \"$TN\" -eq 3 ]; then echo \"✅ 隧道已重建(3端口实探通过)\"; else\n  echo \"❌ 隧道重建失败(实探 $TN/3), 手动排查: ssh -O exit autodl 后重跑\"; exit 1; fi\n\nstep \"5/6 发显示帧(MID位姿,消除连杆警告)\"\n/usr/bin/python3 - <<PY\nimport socket, json, sys\ntry:\n    s = socket.create_connection((\"127.0.0.1\", 9095), timeout=6)\n__pycache__\ncable_envelope_gen.py\ncartesian_probe.py\nhighlight_object.py\nik_batch.py\nik_cert.py\nik_moveit.py\nkill_stack.sh\nload_scene.py\nplan_path.py\nreplay_check.py\nscene_overlay.py\nself_check.py\ntcp_solve.py\ntool_overlay.py","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0dafae9c-ae22-4377-955e-d610ff550df0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":16},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"10b58a1d-15c6-42bb-94b0-7144dac78e24","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
