{"parentUuid":"3ec05635-22be-4e6e-807f-fc3d4f51157e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU4qx2KZaDFf6feLMe1r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好，等你开机。\n\n开机后有两件事：\n1. 如果 AutoDL 控制台显示的 SSH 端口变了，把 `~/.ssh/config` 里 `Host autodl` 下的 `Port` 改成新端口。\n2. 告诉我\"开好了\"。这次我只做**只读盘点**：查装了哪些包、用了多少内存和 CPU、启动脚本里起了哪些进程、有哪些自写的文件。不启动仿真栈，也不碰控制器。\n\n**目前已知的情况**：AutoDL 上跑的是 Ubuntu 22.04 + ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2，外加 DUCO 驱动包、Foxglove 桥、一个 9095 中继、`serverside/` 下 14 个自写脚本（规划、判卷、IK、自碰撞检查等）。这些都是标准 Linux 软件，理论上能在 blue-space 的 WSL2 里装 Ubuntu 22.04 后照样运行。\n\n**有三点我现在还不能确定**，开机后要逐一核实：\n- **内存**：MoveIt 和其他程序加起来要占多少，blue-space 的 16GB 还要分给视觉服务和上位机。\n- **网络**：控制器的仿真模式会把数据推给 AutoDL（`duco_sim_bridge`），换到 WSL2 以后，这条链路能不能接上。\n- **有没有只存在服务器上、没进 git 的文件**：比如 `start_foxglove.sh`、中继脚本、编译好的工作空间。\n\n核实完我会给你一张逐项的\"能搬 / 要改 / 搬不了\"清单。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22,"cache_read_input_tokens":276320,"output_tokens":625,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":55},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":625,"cache_read_input_tokens":276320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"98aede7b-fd3b-46db-bdff-fc86c3f37365","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU4qtsKYfPy3hh9LdH6B","requestRef":"4f0190ba-4bc6-4293-9429-2b39a6e34894","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"06166767-e9af-4b60-9c