{"parentUuid":"dc7f7aa5-9213-47bf-8b35-5406b3b8c762","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"我们在梳理项目，准备交接，目标是全部跑在公司电脑上；当前要确认 AutoDL 上的东西能否搬到 blue-space。下一步请你打开 AutoDL，必要时更新 SSH 端口，然后告诉我\"开好了\"，我做只读盘点。 (disable recaps in /config)","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:20:00.692Z","uuid":"10f5f217-7b0e-4d6e-8cda-ec5097d4f2e4","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
