{"parentUuid":"58ceaa83-56b1-4187-98cb-ec4b65ea21e1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU6PdB1BdchjC5yYZUWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"清单已经写好，访达里已经打开文件位置：\n\n`/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/交接整理/blue-space桌面整理清单.md`\n\n**总览**\n\n| 目标目录（都在 `D:\\项目资料\\` 下） | 条目数 |\n|---|---|\n| 01_末端执行器_历代版本 | 25 |\n| 02_场地设备模型 | 7 |\n| 03_废弃方案_小车 | 17 |\n| 04_器件资料 | 11 |\n| 05_杂项 | 6 |\n| 待删除（你看过后自己删） | 35 |\n| 留在桌面 | 1（应用软件文件夹） |\n\n**需要你重点看的五条**，都是我按名字或日期推断的，清单里标了\"待你确认\"：\n- `STEP文件` 文件夹：6 月的早期设计，我归到了末端执行器。\n- `控制器.png`、`s300.pdf`：归到了小车资料。\n- `IGK-KL02使用说明书.pdf`、`JY-LD6900…doc`：看不出用途，暂时放在器件资料。\n\n**有一点要提前说明**：桌面上的末端设计都是电机摆臂版和更早的版本。现役立放方管末端的成品不在桌面，在 E 盘和代码仓库里，所以这次不涉及它。\n\n你看完清单，告诉我哪些要改，或者直接说\"执行\"。执行时只挪不删，同时生成一份\"原位置 → 新位置\"的记录，需要时可以照着还原。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3109,"cache_read_input_tokens":293012,"output_tokens":527,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3109,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":527,"cache_read_input_tokens":293012,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3109},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cf9f7cd3-062e-4181-b8ad-58fe436d492c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU6PcqArjnnq5vx1UiDj","requestRef":"3adbc368-1b9b-48b5-90f4-955c165e9b2e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c89d365e-edeb-42cd-b3fc-fa1df0814ae9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:36:41.566Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","sess