{"parentUuid":"7a350087-4a6e-4d57-8f18-3682d480b173","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU6bZXZuj8ZFWZ4AyUdJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"blue-space 桌面已经整理好了，什么都没删。\n\n**桌面现在只有**\n- 应用软件（文件夹）\n- 项目资料（快捷方式，指向 `D:\\项目资料`）\n- 设备代码（快捷方式，指向 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell`）\n- 公共桌面上的上位机和嘉立创两个快捷方式，没动\n\n**`D:\\项目资料\\` 里**\n\n| 目录 | 条目数 |\n|---|---|\n| 01_末端执行器_历代版本 | 25 |\n| 02_场地设备模型 | 7 |\n| 03_废弃方案_小车 | 17 |\n| 04_器件资料 | 11 |\n| 05_杂项 | 6 |\n| 待删除 | 35 |\n\n另有两个文件：\n- `整理清单.md`：说明每个目录里放的是什么。\n- `整理记录.csv`：每个文件的原位置和新位置，要找回时照着挪回去即可。\n\n**中途出了一个小问题，已处理好**：「笔记记录」文件夹里有个 git 仓库，里面的文件是只读的，导致搬完后桌面原件删不掉。我逐个比对了 31 个文件的内容，确认 D 盘的副本完全一致，桌面那边已经没有文件了，才把留下的空目录清掉。\n\n**还剩两件事**\n- `待删除` 目录里是 2023 年留下的临时文件，你有空看一眼后自己删掉。\n- \"设备操作说明\"快捷方式等交接文档写好后再加。\n\n清单已提交进仓库（391f6f9）。下一步按之前的计划，等你打开 AutoDL 后，我盘点上面装了什么。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":368,"cache_read_input_tokens":306165,"output_tokens":584,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":368,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":584,"cache_read_input_tokens":306165,"cache_creation_input_tokens":368,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":368},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"38225d3a-64eb-41be-ae2e-b30c045c931c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU6bZCyWmL61vEMWpyqz","requestRef":"41cb4c5f-0555-460d-b73e-abc01533dcc0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"432e04a5-34a1-4850-b326-e5dc2e69f9a7","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:39:24.044Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort"