{"parentUuid":"75f9ce96-6d63-4c96-b902-319eb68680a6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU6tqbvkRh9xmxU3nDKU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第一类已经处理完了：17 项挪进了 `D:\\其他资料_与本项目无关\\`，什么都没删。\n\n| 子目录 | 条目数 |\n|---|---|\n| 01_小车相关 | 4 |\n| 02_其他项目与旧资料 | 7 |\n| 03_旧笔记与U盘备份 | 5 |\n| 04_系统镜像_26GB_可删 | 1（那个 26GB 的 iso） |\n\n逐项的原位置和新位置记在同一目录下的 `整理记录.csv`，要还原时照着挪回去即可。\n\n**有两项我原先分错了，已经留在原位**\n- `6.1.10.7`：是**百度输入法**的安装目录，输入法正在运行，算\"软件\"，不能挪。\n- `Documents_迁移`：里面是**微信和 QQ 的聊天文件**，微信正在用。挪走的话，微信会找不到以前的聊天文件。\n\n**顺带一提**：D 盘剩余空间从 28GB 变成了 24GB。这次是盘内移动，不占额外空间，减少的部分应该是别的程序写入的，比如百度网盘（10-26 有改动）。那个 26GB 的镜像如果确定不要了，删掉就能腾出空间，后面装 WSL2 时也用得上。\n\n整理记录已提交进仓库（c1897e1）。下一步可以看第四类那 6 个拿不准的文件夹，或者整理 `D:\\Destop`。你定先做哪个。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1585,"cache_read_input_tokens":322297,"output_tokens":515,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1585,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":515,"cache_read_input_tokens":322297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1585,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1585},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e76c83bc-53dd-417b-bd82-178938605075","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU6tqJZsorBgoAqeUqxu","requestRef":"ec62435e-72c2-4f21-baee-991991865240","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e411e487-64fe-4560-96e4-66e262c2c2ea","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:43:18.113Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b",