{"parentUuid":"80ab2fab-0d05-4ab4-b5e0-b9674756c954","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU7U6o9u2N4Ki231fkaJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，这对现在来说是最实际的方案。\n\n**能解决什么**\n- 代码不再只在你的 Mac 上，公司电脑上有一份完整的主仓库，带全部历史。\n- 你离开以后，接手的人从 blue-space 上就能拿到全部东西。\n\n**不能解决什么**\n- 主仓库只在一台电脑上，硬盘坏了还是会丢。所以要**加一份备份**：最简单的是每周把主仓库打一个包，拷到 U 盘或公司共享盘。这一步可以做成脚本，执行一下就完成。\n\n**具体做法（第一步只\"搬家\"，不改任何结构，设备照常运行）**\n1. 在 blue-space 上建一个主仓库：`D:\\git\\robocenter.git`。\n2. 把 Mac 上 robocenter 的全部历史推上去。以后 Mac 只是它的一个副本，平时改完要推回主仓库。\n3. 设备代码 `robot_cell` 现在有 205 处未提交的改动，先给它做一次快照提交，也推一份进主仓库。\n4. 写一个备份脚本，并在交接文档里写明。\n\n两份代码合并成一个仓库、改掉\"Mac 推送到设备\"的部署方式，涉及部署流程，放到后面单独做。这一步先把东西保住。\n\n整个过程不碰正在运行的服务和机械臂，最坏情况下，删掉 `D:\\git` 就能完全回到现在的状态。\n\n我先只读检查一下 robot_cell 那 205 处改动都是什么。如果有大文件，比如日志、录制数据、模型，要先决定哪些不进仓库，避免把主仓库撑大。然后再动手。可以吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1669,"cache_read_input_tokens":325830,"output_tokens":1560,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":971},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1669,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1560,"cache_read_input_tokens":325830,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1669},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d85474cf-5f08-4e2f-943c-3f2d977122e7","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU7U6P6YaqHVQnGveit7","requestRef":"7e4d00a7-7fa8-4e88-aefe-e51aa6dff34e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"97e85b59-e458-4a20-bcbd-f3915ce98da1","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:51:03.027Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effor