{"parentUuid":"2b6a5b1f-d49c-4b06-a31a-964b1d664f7a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU7jh468F2LjYeP21Pm4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1056,"cache_read_input_tokens":329905,"output_tokens":1470,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":665},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1056,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1470,"cache_read_input_tokens":329905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1056,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1056},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7865,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"ec5c8ab6-85f6-46e3-911b-a70873d632b6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU7jgdJV7QajDT18dVre","requestRef":"40b59139-f3ae-4e97-9d6a-f4bc54336c46","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"943bb0d1-4f53-4544-8d00-48672bfde4c8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:54:23.728Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"943bb0d1-4f53-4544-8d00-48672bfde4c8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU7jh468F2LjYeP21Pm4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，但我建议迁移的是**这个对话积累下来的知识**，而不是聊天记录本身。\n\n**为什么不迁移聊天记录**\n- 这个对话已经被压缩过好几次，现在我能\"接上\"，靠的其实也不是完整记录，而是三样东西：项目里的 `CLAUDE.md`（能力目录和铁规）、39 条项目记忆、你的全局规则（用中文、自动提交等）。\n- 聊天记录是按\"哪台电脑、哪个目录\"存放的。复制到另一台 Windows 电脑上能不能直接恢复，我不确定，不建议依赖它。\n- 更关键的是**交接**：接手的人会用他自己的账号开新对话，看不到你的聊天记录。知识只有写进仓库里的文件，才能传下去。\n\n**这样迁移，就能在 blue-space 上接着做**\n\n| 要带过去的 | 现在在哪 | 迁到哪 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 项目规则和能力目录 `CLAUDE.md` | 仓库里 | 跟着主仓库走，自动带过去 |\n| 39 条项目记忆 | 你 Mac 的 `~/.claude/` 下，**不在仓库里** | 整理后放进仓库，比如 `docs/经验记录/`。有价值的内容，交接文档本来就要用 |\n| 全局规则（中文、提交规范） | 你 Mac 的 `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` | 项目相关的几条并入项目的 `CLAUDE.md` |\n\n迁过去以后，在 blue-space 上开新对话，说一句\"继续交接整理，看 CLAUDE.md\"，我就能从这些文件里读到上下文，接着往下做。\n\n**两点要注意**\n- 现在很多命令是 Mac 上的 bash 脚本，通过 ssh 遥控 blue-space。在 blue-space 本机上开对话，这些脚本需要改成能在本机直接运行。这正好就是之前说的第 3 阶段\"去个人化\"。\n- 在公司电脑上登录 Claude Code 用谁的账号，要你自己确定。\n\n**顺序上**：先建主仓库，再把记忆整理进仓库，最后在 blue-space 上装 Claude Code 开新对话。第一步还是建主仓库。要开始吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1056,"cache_read_input_tokens":329905,"output_tokens":1470,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":665},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1056,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1470,"cache_read_input_tokens":329905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1056,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1056},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ec5c8ab6-85f6-46e3-911b-a70873d632b6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU7j