{"parentUuid":"c802a0cb-f650-4ee8-ad1d-6c9d8c336e91","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU7raFkfSqXMTgHb9Qix","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"直观上像是完整记录更好，但实际不是。原因是这个对话的完整记录有 **460MB、10 万多条**，相当于上亿字。我每次能\"看到\"的上下文远远装不下它。\n\n所以就算把它原样搬到 blue-space：\n- **我也不会读完它再继续。** 现在这个对话就已经是这样了：每次上下文满了，前面的内容会被压缩成一段摘要。我能接上，靠的是摘要加上 `CLAUDE.md` 和记忆文件，而不是逐字记住了全部内容。\n- **里面有很多已经过时的内容。** 比如早期试过又放弃的方案、后来改掉的参数、中途判断错的结论。直接按聊天记录接着做，很容易被旧信息带偏。整理好的文件只保留现在仍然成立的结论。\n\n**但完整记录也有价值**：遇到\"当时为什么这么定\"之类的问题，可以回头搜索。所以我建议两样都要：\n\n| | 作用 | 怎么用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **整理好的文件**（CLAUDE.md、经验记录、交接文档） | 主力，新对话每次都会读 | 放进主仓库 |\n| **完整聊天记录**（本项目 10 个对话，共 478MB） | 档案，需要查当年的细节时搜一下 | 原样拷到 blue-space，比如 `D:\\项目资料\\对话记录\\`，不进 git 仓库（太大） |\n\n这样接手的人或新对话平时看整理好的文件就够用，遇到疑问再去档案里搜。\n\n按这个思路，顺序不变：先建主仓库。要开始吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":497,"cache_read_input_tokens":332451,"output_tokens":622,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":52},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":497,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":622,"cache_read_input_tokens":332451,"cache_creation_input_tokens":497,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":497},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"aeaa2614-d9d8-4a39-bc6e-8bad701da61c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU7rZj1GT13jjj2JSgUQ","requestRef":"9ee067c5-2d63-41cb-982a-65cf9bc8c8f6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"469fcfb3-90cb-434f-a8f3-f7a159f8fa97","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:55:56.698Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"med