{"parentUuid":"bc35b729-a034-4ed9-b75c-864b9dc38884","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU8LDuRkQfiLVvdHzqMA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"合理，而且这正好可以作为交接的\"最终形态\"：**接手的人只看桌面的两个图标就能用，要维护时只进 D 盘的一个文件夹。** 我在细节上补充几点。\n\n## 桌面：只留两个\n\n| 图标 | 作用 |\n|---|---|\n| **沈苏单机版CRV** | 上位机，已经有了 |\n| **设备控制台**（新做） | 双击后出一个简单菜单：查看设备状态、启动/重启服务、打开设备网页面板、查看日志、复位机械臂 |\n\n有一点要说明：设备的四个服务**开机会自动启动**，不需要人去点。所以第二个图标与其说是\"启动\"，不如说是\"控制台\"：平时用来确认设备是否正常，出问题时用来重启和排查。\n\n## D 盘：最终目标的布局\n\n```\nD:\\\n├── robot_cell\\                 代码（在这里改，设备也直接从这里运行）\n├── git\\robot_cell.git          主仓库（备份和历史，平时不用打开）\n├── 项目资料\\                   设计图、器件资料、厂家文档\n├── ss_crv\\                     上位机程序（同事的，不动）\n└── 其他资料_与本项目无关\\\n```\n\n接手的人只需要记住：**代码在 `D:\\robot_cell`，资料在 `D:\\项目资料`。**\n\n## 现在的 `D:\\Destop` 怎么办\n\n设备代码现在在 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell`（\"Destop\"还是个拼写错误的名字），开机任务、看门狗、各种启动脚本里都写死了这个路径。\n\n- **现在不动它。** 挪了服务会起不来。\n- **到第 6 步再统一搬到 `D:\\robot_cell`。** 那时把所有引用路径一起改掉，再验证服务能正常启动。\n- `D:\\Destop` 里其他东西（老夹爪、其他品牌机械臂的 SDK、视觉课程资料等）到时一起分到 `项目资料` 或 `其他资料`，最后把 `D:\\Destop` 整个去掉。\n\n刚才在桌面放的\"项目资料\"\"设备代码\"快捷方式，以及「应用软件」文件夹，等\"设备控制台\"做好以后再一起收走，桌面就只剩两个图标。\n\n所以第 1 步的主仓库，直接建在最终位置：**`D:\\git\\robot_cell.git`**。这样定可以吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1770,"cache_read_input_tokens":337181,"output_tokens":2151,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1314},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1770,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2151,"cache_read_input_tokens":337181,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1770,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1770},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"75f2489c-007d-4f4a-9295-3289332c0d13","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU8LDB2cQQXGe9AnsLag","requestRef":"7c53330e-f286-48bc-8161-3bc15ce76b76","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"da75476c-e5a7-4e78-9f6f-4d5d072c9bd3","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:02:27.804Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
