{"parentUuid":"bd2502ba-a415-47d9-80fa-0f802214b7df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU8SAgsNoYp7y4ikTSTW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，它就是用来承接 Mac 上的代码的。我之前多绕了一层，换个更简单的说法：\n\n**其实可以不要 `D:\\git\\robot_cell.git`，直接把 Mac 的代码推到最终位置 `D:\\robot_cell`。**\n\n```\n迁移期间：\n  Mac 的 robocenter ──推送──→ D:\\robot_cell           （新建：Mac 代码的完整副本，带全部历史）\n                              D:\\Destop\\robot_cell    （旧的：设备照常从这里运行，不动）\n\n第 6 步以后：\n  设备改成从 D:\\robot_cell 运行，D:\\Destop 去掉\n  → D 盘上只剩一份代码：D:\\robot_cell\n```\n\n**`D:\\robot_cell` 是什么**\n- 就是你 Mac 上 robocenter 文件夹的一模一样的副本，连每一次修改的历史都在。\n- 迁移期间，它**只接收 Mac 推过来的内容**，不要在 blue-space 上直接改它。\n- 最后 Mac 停用后，它就是唯一的代码目录：在这里改，设备也从这里运行。\n\n**备份**另外做：写一个脚本，把 `D:\\robot_cell` 打包成一个文件，拷到 U 盘或公司共享盘。不需要再单独维护一个仓库。\n\n这样 D 盘上自始至终只多出一个文件夹，也就是最终会用的那个，少一个概念。\n\n按这个做，第 1 步就是：**在 blue-space 上建 `D:\\robot_cell`，把 Mac 的代码完整推过去。** 可以开始吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2190,"cache_read_input_tokens":338951,"output_tokens":1149,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":587},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2190,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1149,"cache_read_input_tokens":338951,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2190,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2190},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d22e0e28-a1f0-403b-bdf5-ff315d7d1e8f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU8SACMX8gCsgr68oUtf","requestRef":"cc57a2fd-420b-4ab1-8e60-b2078cc80f64","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"785a90b3-e40b-4746-8d12-7aac9de