{"parentUuid":"d7a144c2-1e54-47db-a8a3-e8b9f8a10079","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU8aEqNprLGEg4H2y8wZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1235,"cache_read_input_tokens":341141,"output_tokens":1506,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":770},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1235,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1506,"cache_read_input_tokens":341141,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1235,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1235},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7970,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"b5fc7881-78b1-4bde-aa71-d57b7540da54","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU8aDyXwwpdRFMwdrNnt","requestRef":"be45e3b4-e707-4d0f-807c-f47835462023","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"29e4c0fb-c9b9-456a-841e-532de65a3a4c","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:05:22.499Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"29e4c0fb-c9b9-456a-841e-532de65a3a4c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU8aEqNprLGEg4H2y8wZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，这一点很关键，会改变优先级。按你说的，整个项目其实分两部分：\n\n| | 运行系统 | 部署和标定工具 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 做什么 | 日常上架、出库、盘点，以及上位机 | 换一个现场后，把所有位置重新标定、重新生成路径 |\n| 在哪 | **已经全部在 blue-space 上** ✅ | **Mac + AutoDL** ❌ |\n| 什么时候用 | 每天 | 每次到新现场、设备挪位置、换末端时 |\n\n到新现场要重做的事，基本都依赖 Mac 和 AutoDL：\n- 底座高度、桌子、货架的码牌标定，TCP 和手眼标定：Mac 上的脚本遥控 blue-space 完成；\n- 场景模型更新、格口点位求解、路径规划、碰撞判卷：都要用 AutoDL；\n- 退苗点、出库点的路径：同上。\n\n所以**部署和标定工具不是\"前期开发用完就扔\"的东西，而是每次部署都必须用的。** 交接时如果不把它搬过来，接手的人就只能用设备，没法把设备装到新现场。\n\n这也让我之前的第 3、6 步变得必需：\n- Mac 上的标定脚本改成在 blue-space 本机运行；\n- AutoDL 的规划和判卷搬到公司电脑上，比如 blue-space 的 WSL2；\n- 写一份**《现场部署手册》**：到新现场后按什么顺序标定哪些东西、每一步用哪个命令、怎么判断成功。这份手册是交接里最有价值的文档之一，现在这些顺序主要在你脑子里。\n\n还有一个现实问题会影响 AutoDL 怎么处理：**现场有没有外网？** AutoDL 是云服务器，现场如果没外网就连不上。那样的话，规划和判卷必须在本机运行，搬到 WSL2 就要提前做。\n\n第 1 步不受影响，还是先把代码推到 `D:\\robot_cell`。你确认一下现场网络的情况，我们就开始第 1 步？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1235,"cache_read_input_tokens":341141,"output_tokens":1506,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":770},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1235,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1506,"cache_read_input_tokens":341141,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1235,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1235},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b5fc7881-78b1-4bde-aa71-d57b7540da54","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU8aDyXwwpdRFMwdrNnt","requestRef":"be45e3b4-e707-4d0f-807c-f47835462023","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4074016e-6269-4467-9959-71fd3eefb2bd","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:05:30.911Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
