{"parentUuid":"953edab7-f18d-46bd-95fb-aa2ff00d74ca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU8nZKDBzDzfrw96LGPd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4076,"cache_read_input_tokens":349511,"output_tokens":2322,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1271},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4076,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2322,"cache_read_input_tokens":349511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4076,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4076},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":20773,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"c2520e4d-96d2-4b6e-bfbe-3c15860146b0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU8nYtAAQThXWMXYiTgm","requestRef":"94e993ed-4971-45cf-8c2a-f007e7c47ab4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa441060-4c67-40a2-8256-47d8a932b9b3","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:08:22.447Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"aa441060-4c67-40a2-8256-47d8a932b9b3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU8nZKDBzDzfrw96LGPd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两边都看完了。\n\n## U 盘（E 盘）里和项目有关的\n\n| 内容 | 位置 | 价值 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **现役末端：立放方案（方管无电机）** | `3D模型\\立放方案(方管无电机)` | ⭐ 最重要，现役设计的原始文件 |\n| 末端历代方案（长杆无电机、电机 90 度翻转） | `3D模型\\` 下 2 个文件夹 | 历史版本 |\n| **末端 SolidWorks 源文件**（转接件全套 SLDPRT、整体组合 SLDASM、GCR10-1300 模型、管线包） | `装配体\\` | ⭐ 可编辑的原件，比 STEP 更有用 |\n| 机械臂、相机、真空吸盘模型 | `3D模型\\` | 布局和设计参考 |\n| **DUCO ROS2 驱动 V4.2.0、控制器升级包 Core_U18_V4.4.0** | `未分类\\` | ⭐ AutoDL 上用的就是这个驱动；升级包重装控制器时要用 |\n| 旧代码备份 `robot_code.zip`（8 月） | `资料收集\\` | 历史存档 |\n| DUCO 硬件手册 | 根目录 | D 盘已经有一份 |\n\n**拿不准的**：`crv\\20240708-宁波-CRV验收`（约 6GB）。名字和上位机\"沈苏单机版CRV\"一样，是公司以前的 CRV 项目资料吗？另外，`未分类` 里 2024 年的疫苗瓶识别模型和数据集、根目录的 `疫苗问答系统.zip`，看起来是更早的其他项目。\n\n**无关的**：小车、扫地机、AGV、舵机、电机相关的大部分资料，以及 SolidWorks 学习资料（一共一百多 GB）。\n\n## blue-space 上的 Claude Code：已经装好并登录了\n\n这是个好消息：第 2 步\"装开发环境\"基本省了，迁移对话的条件也已经具备。\n\n上面还有 8 月份在 blue-space 上做项目时留下的对话和记忆，有些是现在 Mac 这边没有的经验，交接时要一起整理：\n- `D:\\Destop\\robot_code` 项目（11 个对话，71MB）：J1 安全转向、上苗机对接、腕部 IO 触发、示教回放流程、L6 路径优化、步进电机资料等 10 条记忆；\n- 桌面项目：末端气管拉伸问题、上苗机桌面布置；\n- 手眼标定、GCR10 转接件重建。\n\n顺便解开了之前的一个疑问：D 盘的 `Leesn-Config` 是腕部步进电机的配置软件。\n\n**建议**：把上面三个 ⭐ 复制（不是移动）到 `D:\\项目资料`，这样公司电脑上就有了现役末端的源文件和驱动。U 盘是你个人的，拔走后这些东西就不在公司电脑上了。要我复制吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4076,"cache_read_input_tokens":349511,"output_tokens":2322,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1271},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4076,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2322,"cache_read_input_tokens":349511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4076,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemer