{"parentUuid":"4f642e6c-d6c6-478d-b4e8-b9d751f2e664","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a7b8308e-7928-477d-9964-aec97cd5910a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"其实最终我只需要满足一个需求，因为别人接手后，肯定也不会看代码了，肯定是让ai看代码，我只需要写好文档。配置好相关工具，比如视觉上识别不出来，把标注工具，采集失败的图像，怎么训练这些都整理好。然后怎么标定，手眼标定，货架标定等。\n\n\n你能理解我的意思吗？"},"uuid":"c5ac745b-3744-4e7b-910c-b58d6a5dac1d","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:13:50.214Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
