{"parentUuid":"c5ac745b-3744-4e7b-910c-b58d6a5dac1d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU9EKCs2FHBMhhoEP8Pq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":956,"cache_read_input_tokens":360567,"output_tokens":1189,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":422},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":956,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":360567,"cache_creation_input_tokens":956,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":956},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5092,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"e1f7a4d7-9a1d-43c6-b08f-8695bda8ac60","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU9EJWCVhV6iNu1wPrdX","requestRef":"b9a31c98-7013-45b4-b36c-bd8b928b8107","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"69b368a1-8532-4e48-b8cb-0dc99a150f02","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:13:56.126Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"69b368a1-8532-4e48-b8cb-0dc99a150f02","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU9EKCs2FHBMhhoEP8Pq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"理解。我用自己的话复述一遍，你看对不对：\n\n**接手的是\"一个人 + 他的 AI\"。人不看代码，AI 看代码。** 所以你要交出去的不是\"整理好的代码\"，而是两样东西：\n\n1. **文档**：让人知道这套系统是什么、能做什么、遇到什么情况该找什么；也让 AI 读完就能理解系统，可以接着改和修。\n2. **配好的工具**：常见的维护场景，每个都有一套现成的工具和固定步骤，在公司电脑上能直接用，不需要重新摸索。比如：\n   - **视觉认不出来**：采集失败的图片 → 用标注工具标注 → 训练新模型 → 验证比旧模型好 → 替换上线\n   - **标定**：手眼标定、货架标定、桌子标定、TCP 标定、格口标定，各自按什么顺序、用什么命令、怎么判断合格\n\n这就相当于把 `CLAUDE.md` 里那张\"遇到情况 → 用哪个脚本\"的能力目录，做成**面向接手者的完整版**：按场景组织，每个场景都写清楚\"什么时候需要做、怎么做、怎么判断做好了\"，而且工具都已经搬到公司电脑上能直接运行。\n\n这样一来，前面讨论的事情也都能归到这个目标下：\n- 建主仓库：让工具和文档有一个固定的家；\n- 命令本地化、AutoDL 搬到公司电脑：让工具在公司电脑上能直接运行；\n- 现场部署手册：就是\"标定类场景\"按顺序串起来。\n\n我先去核实一件事：**视觉训练现在依赖什么。** 以前训练是在 AutoDL 的 GPU 上做的，blue-space 有没有能用来训练的显卡还不清楚。标注工具（`D:\\Destop` 里有一个\"药盒姿态估计标注软件\"）是不是现在在用的那个，也要确认。\n\n下一步，我先拟一份**场景清单**：接手的人可能会遇到的情况，每个对应哪些工具，现在是否已经能在公司电脑上运行。你看了以后补充或删减，它就是整个交接工作的任务表。这样可以吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":956,"cache_read_input_tokens":360567,"output_tokens":1189,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":422},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":956,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":360567,"cache_creation_input_tokens":956,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":956},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e1f7a4d7-9a1d-43c6-b08f-8695bda8ac60","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU9EJWCVhV6iNu1wPrdX","requestRef":"b9a31c98-7013-45b4-b36c-bd8b928b8107","requestedModel":"cl