{"parentUuid":"9a95b0a0-e929-4b99-986e-767e65640889","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU9QVifL5SHFatcW6X4s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"盘点完成，Foxglove 有 Windows 版，后面可以直接在 blue-space 上装，接本机仿真环境即用。接下来我把盘点结果写入仓库，避免信息只留在对话里。\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2589,"cache_read_input_tokens":369723,"output_tokens":2263,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":519},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2589,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2263,"cache_read_input_tokens":369723,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2589,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2589},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"1e158358-8113-42b1-a409-00b67b7fe2b6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU9QVM6J2PkRJBAqfxco","requestRef":"c9504c6f-ab43-4c0b-8016-f6a61ad2958b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b176890-c4b5-402d-8ce9-f0ba1e27cdb2","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:16:16.264Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"2b176890-c4b5-402d-8ce9-f0ba1e27cdb2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU9QVifL5SHFatcW6X4s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012umwNF2LrwKqjmCfmBSCEG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"F=\"docs/交接整理/AutoDL盘点.md\" && cat > \"$F\" <<'EOF'\n# AutoDL 服务器盘点(迁移前)\n\n> 2026-10-28 只读盘点。AutoDL 是个人云服务器, 交接前要把下面\"必须带走\"的东西收进主仓库或公司电脑。\n\n## 环境\n\n- Ubuntu 22.04.5(容器), ROS2 Humble(368 个 ros-humble 包) + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control\n- 无卡模式即可跑规划/判卷(纯 CPU); 视觉训练才需要 GPU(本次开机分到 RTX 3080 Ti)\n- 数据盘 `/root/autodl-tmp`(754 个顶层文件, 615 个是规划/判卷产生的 json 中间结果)\n\n## 它在系统里干什么\n\n| 功能 | 谁在用 |\n|---|---|\n| MoveIt 路径规划(新格口、退苗点等) | plan_best / plan_smooth / solve_slot / reverse_candidate |\n| 碰撞判卷(路径会不会撞、臂自碰撞) | check_motion / replay / judge_traj / stand_screen |\n| IK 求解 | solve_slot / home_view_solve / handeye_grid |\n| 仿真画面(Foxglove 看) | 所有 show_* / demo_motion / sync_pose |\n| 视觉模型训练(YOLO 分割) | `/root/YOLO_SEG` |\n\n## 必须带走、但主仓库里没有的\n\n1. **启动与中继**\n   - `/root/autodl-tmp/start_foxglove.sh`: 起 9090 HTTP(URDF/网格)+ `foxglove_demo.launch.py`(robot_state_publisher + move_group + ros2_control + foxglove_bridge)\n   - `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_joint_relay.py`: 9095 中继(真机/控制器关节 → 仿真显示)\n2. **DUCO 驱动包里改过/新增的文件**(相对原始 duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip; 原始 zip 已在 blue-space `D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件`)\n   - 改: `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/config/gcr10_1300.srdf`、`config/initial_positions.yaml`、`duco_support/urdf/duco_gcr10_1300.urdf`\n   - 增: `moveit_config/launch/foxglove_demo.launch.py`、`moveit_config/scripts/`、`duco_support/meshes/accessories/`、`meshes/GCR10_1300/suction_cup.STL`\n   - (还有若干 `.bak` 备份, 不需要)\n3. **视觉训练** `/root/YOLO_SEG`(524MB): train.py / train_v2.py / val.py / predict.py、data.yaml / data_v2.yaml、数据集(dataset_v2、my_dataset、20260519)、runs(训练产物)、预训练权重\n   - 代码和配置进仓库; 数据集和权重体积大, 放 `D:\\项目资料` 或单独存放\n\n## 已在主仓库、无需额外处理\n\n`scripts/serverside/` 下的规划/判卷/IK/叠显脚本(plan_path、load_scene、replay_check、self_check、ik_*、scene_overlay、tool_overlay、cable_envelope_gen 等), 由 Mac 脚本按需推送到服务器。`web_serve/` 由 `build_scene.py` + `deploy_scene.sh` 生成, 可重建。\n\n## 可以不要的\n\n- 6 月份探索期的一次性脚本(`_append_*`、`_repair_*`、`_select_config*`、`_pose_*` 等约 60 个下划线开头的 py)\n- 规划/判卷的 json 中间结果(约 615 个)\n- `/root/疫苗数据探索`(1.8GB, 疑似早期其他项目, 待确认)\n\n## 迁到公司电脑时还要装\n\n- WSL2 + Ubuntu 22.04 + ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge(装法同上)\n- **Foxglove 桌面版**(Windows)装在 blue-space, 连本机 `ws://localhost:8765`\nEOF\ngit add \"$F\" && git commit -q -m \"docs: AutoDL 盘点(功能/必须带走的文件/可丢弃项/迁移要装的软件)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"写入 AutoDL 盘点文档并提交"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2589,"cache_read_input_tokens":369723,"output_tokens":2263,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":519},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2589,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2263,"cache_read_input_tokens":369723,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2589,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2589},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_012umwNF2LrwKqjmCfmBSCEG":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && F=\"docs/交接整理/AutoDL盘点.md\" && cat > \"$F\" <<'EOF'\n# AutoDL 服务器盘点(迁移前)\n\n> 2026-10-28 只读盘点。AutoDL 是个人云服务器, 交接前要把下面\"必须带走\"的东西收进主仓库或公司电脑。\n\n## 环境\n\n- Ubuntu 22.04.5(容器), ROS2 Humble(368 个 ros-humble 包) + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control\n- 无卡模式即可跑规划/判卷(纯 CPU); 视觉训练才需要 GPU(本次开机分到 RTX 3080 Ti)\n- 数据盘 `/root/autodl-tmp`(754 个顶层文件, 615 个是规划/判卷产生的 json 中间结果)\n\n## 它在系统里干什么\n\n| 功能 | 谁在用 |\n|---|---|\n| MoveIt 路径规划(新格口、退苗点等) | plan_best / plan_smooth / solve_slot / reverse_candidate |\n| 碰撞判卷(路径会不会撞、臂自碰撞) | check_motion / replay / judge_traj / stand_screen |\n| IK 求解 | solve_slot / home_view_solve / handeye_grid |\n| 仿真画面(Foxglove 看) | 所有 show_* / demo_motion / sync_pose |\n| 视觉模型训练(YOLO 分割) | `/root/YOLO_SEG` |\n\n## 必须带走、但主仓库里没有的\n\n1. **启动与中继**\n   - `/root/autodl-tmp/start_foxglove.sh`: 起 9090 HTTP(URDF/网格)+ `foxglove_demo.launch.py`(robot_state_publisher + move_group + ros2_control + foxglove_bridge)\n   - `/root/autodl-tmp/duco_joint_relay.py`: 9095 中继(真机/控制器关节 → 仿真显示)\n2. **DUCO 驱动包里改过/新增的文件**(相对原始 duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip; 原始 zip 已在 blue-space `D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件`)\n   - 改: `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/config/gcr10_1300.srdf`、`config/initial_positions.yaml`、`duco_support/urdf/duco_gcr10_1300.urdf`\n   - 增: `moveit_config/launch/foxglove_demo.launch.py`、`moveit_config/scripts/`、`duco_support/meshes/accessories/`、`meshes/GCR10_1300/suction_cup.STL`\n   - (还有若干 `.bak` 备份, 不需要)\n3. **视觉训练** `/root/YOLO_SEG`(524MB): train.py / train_v2.py / val.py / predict.py、data.yaml / data_v2.yaml、数据集(dataset_v2、my_dataset、20260519)、runs(训练产物)、预训练权重\n   - 代码和配置进仓库; 数据集和权重体积大, 放 `D:\\项目资料` 或单独存放\n\n## 已在主仓库、无需额外处理\n\n`scripts/serverside/` 下的规划/判卷/IK/叠显脚本(plan_path、load_scene、replay_check、self_check、ik_*、scene_overlay、tool_overlay、cable_envelope_gen 等), 由 Mac 脚本按需推送到服务器。`web_serve/` 由 `build_scene.py` + `deploy_scene.sh` 生成, 可重建。\n\n## 可以不要的\n\n- 6 月份探索期的一次性脚本(`_append_*`、`_repair_*`、`_select_config*`、`_pose_*` 等约 60 个下划线开头的 py)\n- 规划/判卷的 json 中间结果(约 615 个)\n- `/root/疫苗数据探索`(1.8GB, 疑似早期其他项目, 待确认)\n\n## 迁到公司电脑时还要装\n\n- WSL2 + Ubuntu 22.04 + ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge(装法同上)\n- **Foxglove 桌面版**(Windows)装在 blue-space, 连本机 `ws://localhost:8765`\nEOF\ngit add \"$F\" && git commit -q -m \"docs: AutoDL 盘点(功能/必须带走的文件/可丢弃项/迁移要装的软件)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"写入 AutoDL 盘点文档并提交"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_012umwNF2LrwKqjmCfmBSCEG":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"1e158358-8113-42b1-a409-00b67b7fe2b6","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgU9QVM6J2PkRJBAqfxco","requestRef":"c9504c6f-ab43-4c0b-8016-f6a61ad2958b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"34d37a81-dfb8-42a5-891f-b4f891bdba6e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:16:30.249Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
