{"parentUuid":"8fa3b806-0fa9-414e-8a02-d3d4cf2ab0df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU9SMB2L1Y4JXEPGLeTE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AutoDL 已经盘点完，结果写进了 `docs/交接整理/AutoDL盘点.md`（已提交 03e1ca6）。Foxglove 也记进去了：装 Windows 桌面版，连 blue-space 本机。\n\n**它在系统里负责四件事**：路径规划、碰撞判卷、IK 求解、仿真画面。另外发现**视觉模型训练也在这台服务器上**（`/root/YOLO_SEG`）。\n\n**大部分在用的脚本主仓库里已经有了**（`scripts/serverside/`）。真正\"只在服务器上、丢了就麻烦\"的有三样：\n\n| 缺的东西 | 内容 | 为什么重要 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 启动脚本 + 中继 | `start_foxglove.sh`、`duco_joint_relay.py` | 没有它们，仿真环境起不来 |\n| DUCO 驱动包里改过的文件 | 碰撞配置（srdf）、URDF、自写的启动文件、末端网格等 | 用原厂驱动包重装会丢失这些修改，规划结果会不一样 |\n| 视觉训练 | 训练、验证、预测脚本，数据集配置，数据集，训练记录 | 以后视觉认不出来时，要靠它重新训练 |\n\n**可以不要的**：6 月份探索期的约 60 个一次性脚本、615 个规划中间结果。\n\n**建议下一步**：先把这三样收回来，放进安全的位置：\n- 前两样和训练脚本、配置，都是小文件，放进 Mac 的仓库，之后随主仓库一起到 blue-space。\n- 训练数据集和权重（几百 MB）不进 git，复制到 blue-space 的 `D:\\项目资料`。\n\n这样就算 AutoDL 到期或被释放，这些东西也不会丢。要我现在收回来吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2317,"cache_read_input_tokens":372312,"output_tokens":648,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2317,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":648,"cache_read_input_tokens":372312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2317,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2317},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ce2159e8-eeaa-4035-94b6-afee1f2ed3ba","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgU9SLqRXxPPD7ete17hh","requestRef":"febc563e-6df1-4148-bc23-1c4272aa513a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9f9ecaec-7a08-4080-9f88-f9bf13