{"parentUuid":"9a04718c-0866-45e3-bd0c-9ffd9afa87bf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU9eSCirY6UXakWC2Mdm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我建议**下一步就把 AutoDL 上那三样东西收回来**，理由有两个：\n\n1. **AutoDL 现在开着，正是取文件的时机。** 它按时计费，关机后实例还可能被回收。启动脚本、驱动包的修改、视觉训练这三样现在只存在于这台服务器上，是目前**唯一可能真正丢失**的东西。其他东西都已经有备份（Mac 仓库）或者就在公司电脑上。\n2. **工作量小、风险低。** 只是复制文件，不改任何运行中的东西，大约十几分钟。\n\n做完这一步，就可以关掉 AutoDL 省钱，后面的事都不需要它开着。\n\n**之后的顺序**\n1. ✅ 收回 AutoDL 上的三样东西 ← **现在做**\n2. 在 blue-space 建 `D:\\robot_cell`，把 Mac 的代码完整推过去：从此代码原件在公司电脑上\n3. 拟**场景清单**：接手的人会遇到哪些情况，每个场景对应什么工具、现在能不能在公司电脑上运行。这是整个交接的任务表\n4. 按场景清单逐项补齐工具和文档，同时在 blue-space 上装 WSL2 和 Foxglove\n5. 迁移对话，Mac 停用\n\n要开始第 1 步吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14,"cache_read_input_tokens":375277,"output_tokens":537,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":69},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":537,"cache_read_input_tokens":375277,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"01f83cbf-ab30-4e12-99cf-972776c1e6eb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgU9eRTKgf7GWoFF3Udac","requestRef":"0e00d795-af84-4b01-bd34-cd242fcb3d53","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2dbb8a8d-726f-4f04-80f1-ba1b97bf3a79","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:19:24.178Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_c