 echo \"source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\" >> ~/.bashrc","+","+step \"3/5 DUCO 驱动包 + 本项目改动\"","+mkdir -p \"$ROOT\" && cd \"$ROOT\"","+[ -d duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 ] || unzip -q \"$ZIP\"","+WS=\"$ROOT/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver\"","+cp -r \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config\" \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_support\" \"$WS/src/\"","+source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash","+cd \"$WS\" && colcon build","+","+step \"4/5 启动件\"","+cp \"$HERE/stack/start_foxglove.sh\" \"$HERE/stack/duco_joint_relay.py\" \"$ROOT/\"","+mkdir -p \"$ROOT/web_serve\"","+sed -i \"s#/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver#$WS#; s#/root/autodl-tmp/web_serve#$ROOT/web_serve#\" \"$ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"","+","+step \"5/5 完成\"","+echo \"安装根目录: $ROOT\"","+echo \"下一步: ① 用 build_scene.py + deploy_scene.sh 生成 web_serve(场景 URDF/网格) ② bash $ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"","+echo \"⚠ Mac 侧脚本里写死的 /root/autodl-tmp 路径要改成 $ROOT(迁移第 3 步做)\""]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/serverside/env/README.md","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/serverside/env/setup_sim_env.sh"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ffdb7edb-4e02-4695-87ca-921a0886985e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":17},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"92dca0c1-8262-4011-a75d-07a8e1439ea9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"63f109f8-9d48-4f61-890a-2a643aa5aa35","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"queued_command","prompt":"你确定是所有脚本都下载下来了是吗？我看有很多呢","source_uuid":"d19299d9-efa0-45ad-9ccb-888d1d5e50a9","delivery_id":"5e6be6a5-5f12-40d6-bda1-5fbe4ef0f4d3","commandMode":"prompt","origin":{"kind":"human"},"timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:50:14.670Z","humanTurn":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e6e9cc0f-b83c-4bbb-869f-71da55534279","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:50:14.670Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe user sent a new message while you were working:\n你确定是所有脚本都下载下来了是吗？我看有很多呢\n\nThis is how Claude Code surfaces messages the user sends mid-turn — within the running turn, often alongside the next tool result, rather than as a separate conversation turn. Address the message above as you continue this turn.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"7dc1ec7183b610c24cb26933fe49f6e9144f9d61eafeabfa48fa014f01908917","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"依赖都确认了：规划脚本只依赖 ROS 自带库加 numpy/scipy/yaml，环境变量只需 `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash`。接下来我把重装步骤整理成脚本，方便你以后在 WSL2 里运行。\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TkLfqL1Gn5FkeoEE8xrbZg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && cat > scripts/serverside/env/setup_sim_env.sh <<'EOF'\n#!/bin/bash\n# ============================================================\n# 仿真/规划环境重装(在 Ubuntu 22.04 上复现 AutoDL 的环境; 目标: blue-space 的 WSL2)\n# 用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip 路径> [安装根目录=~/sim]\n#   zip 在 blue-space D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件\\ (WSL2 里是 /mnt/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/)\n# 依据: 同目录 env_*.txt/tsv = 2026-10-28 从 AutoDL 导出的环境快照(系统/370 个 ros-humble 包/pip/bashrc)\n# 做什么: ①装 ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control ②装 Python 依赖\n#         ③解压原厂驱动包 + 覆盖本项目改动(../duco_driver_patch) + colcon 编译 ④放好启动件(../stack)\n# ⚠ 2026-10-28 写成, 尚未在 WSL2 上实测; 跑完后按 README 的\"验收\"一节确认\n# ============================================================\nset -eu\nZIP=\"${1:?用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip> [安装根目录]}\"\nROOT=\"${2:-$HOME/sim}\"\nHERE=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/..\" && pwd)\"          # scripts/serverside\nstep(){ echo; echo \"── $*\"; }\n\nstep \"1/5 ROS2 Humble 软件源\"\nsudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y software-properties-common curl unzip\nsudo add-apt-repository -y universe\nsudo curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg\necho \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu $(. /etc/os-release && echo $UBUNTU_CODENAME) main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ros2.list >/dev/null\nsudo apt-get update\n\nstep \"2/5 ROS 包(与 AutoDL 手动安装的一致) + Python 依赖\"\nsudo apt-get install -y ros-humble-desktop ros-humble-moveit ros-humble-foxglove-bridge \\\n  ros-humble-ros2-control ros-humble-ros2-controllers python3-colcon-common-extensions \\\n  python3-numpy python3-scipy python3-yaml\ngrep -q \"/opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\" ~/.bashrc || echo \"source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\" >> ~/.bashrc\n\nstep \"3/5 DUCO 驱动包 + 本项目改动\"\nmkdir -p \"$ROOT\" && cd \"$ROOT\"\n[ -d duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 ] || unzip -q \"$ZIP\"\nWS=\"$ROOT/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver\"\ncp -r \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config\" \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_support\" \"$WS/src/\"\nsource /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\ncd \"$WS\" && colcon build\n\nstep \"4/5 启动件\"\ncp \"$HERE/stack/start_foxglove.sh\" \"$HERE/stack/duco_joint_relay.py\" \"$ROOT/\"\nmkdir -p \"$ROOT/web_serve\"\nsed -i \"s#/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver#$WS#; s#/root/autodl-tmp/web_serve#$ROOT/web_serve#\" \"$ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"\n\nstep \"5/5 完成\"\necho \"安装根目录: $ROOT\"\necho \"下一步: ① 用 build_scene.py + deploy_scene.sh 生成 web_serve(场景 URDF/网格) ② bash $ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"\necho \"⚠ Mac 侧脚本里写死的 /root/autodl-tmp 路径要改成 $ROOT(迁移第 3 步做)\"\nEOF\nchmod +x scripts/serverside/env/setup_sim_env.sh\ncat > scripts/serverside/env/README.md <<'EOF'\n# 仿真/规划环境(原 AutoDL)的重装资料\n\nAutoDL 是云上的 Linux 容器, 不能整体拷走, 只能在新机器上按相同配置重装。本目录是重装所需的全部依据。\n\n| 文件 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| `setup_sim_env.sh` | **重装脚本**(Ubuntu 22.04 / WSL2): ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control → Python 依赖 → 驱动包 + 本项目改动 + 编译 → 启动件。⚠ 尚未实测 |\n| `env_os.txt` | AutoDL 系统: Ubuntu 22.04.5 |\n| `env_apt_manual.txt` | 手动安装的 apt 包(165 个; ROS 相关核心只有 5 个: desktop / moveit / foxglove-bridge / ros2-control / ros2-controllers) |\n| `env_ros_packages.tsv` | 全部 370 个 ros-humble 包及版本(对比排错用) |\n| `env_pip.txt` | 系统 Python 3.10 与 miniconda Python 3.12 的 pip 清单 |\n| `env_bashrc.txt` | .bashrc 里的环境设置(只有 `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash`) |\n| `env_script_imports.txt` | 服务器上脚本用到的模块统计 |\n\n规划/判卷脚本的依赖: ROS 自带的 rclpy / moveit_msgs / geometry_msgs 等 + numpy / scipy / yaml。\n视觉训练另需 GPU + ultralytics 8.4.50, 见 `scripts/vision_train/README.md`。\n\n## 验收(装完后确认)\n\n1. `bash ~/sim/start_foxglove.sh` 后日志出现 `You can start planning now!` 和 `Server listening on port 8765`\n2. Foxglove 桌面版连 `ws://localhost:8765`, 3D 面板 Mesh up axis 设 Z-up, URDF 用 `http://localhost:9090/gcr10_1300.urdf`, 能看到机械臂+场景\n3. 跑一次已知结果的判卷(如某条已入库路径 `replay.sh`), 结论与 AutoDL 上一致\nEOF\ngit add scripts/serverside/env && git commit -q -m \"chore: AutoDL 环境快照(系统/ROS包/pip/bashrc)与重装脚本 setup_sim_env.sh(待实测)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"编写环境重装脚本与说明并提交"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
