{"parentUuid":"a38be6fb-6cf7-4762-bfb4-0d3493c1d730","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_012rggZuAKxffRPHJEghMLL3","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"d3477a4c-8397-45f2-a3dc-baaed5b23bca","timestamp":"2026-10-28T06:54:53.615Z","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"d3477a4c-8397-45f2-a3dc-baaed5b23bca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUCMMSqus6ECmiSpfTeH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在 AutoDL 上的东西已经**全部**备份，所有脚本也逐个核实、分好了类。\n\n**脚本：106 个全部核实**\n\n我的核实方法是三条：和仓库同名文件逐字节比对；在仓库所有脚本里搜它有没有被调用；读每个文件开头的说明和日期。\n\n| 分类 | 数量 | 结论 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 00_现役 | 16 | 和仓库里的版本**完全一致**，现役以仓库为准 |\n| 01_用不上：旧货架旧吸盘时期（2 月到 6 月） | 80 | 旧的 9 层货架和旧吸盘时期的探索、路径修复、旧格口标定。8 月换货架、换吸盘后全部作废，方法已经沉淀进现在的规划工具 |\n| 02_用不上：一次性分析工具 | 4 | 效果已经固化，比如关节限位已经改进 URDF 里 |\n| 03_用不上：仓库里已有旧件 | 6 | 早期的中柱可达性实验 |\n\n分类后放在仓库 `archive/autodl_scripts_2026-10-28/`，README 里逐个列出了文件名、日期和用途说明。\n\n**整盘备份**：除驱动包外，数据盘全部内容（脚本、规划结果、轨迹、日志，共 4925 个文件）原样拷到了 blue-space `D:\\项目资料\\08_AutoDL完整备份\\`，文件数核对一致。驱动包本身已经有\"原厂包 + 改动补丁\"两部分。\n\n**环境**：容器不能直接拷走，所以我导出了完整的环境清单（系统版本、370 个 ROS 包、Python 包、环境变量），并写了重装脚本 `scripts/serverside/env/setup_sim_env.sh`，留给你以后在 WSL2 里运行。脚本还没实测，README 里写了装完后怎么验收。\n\n到这里，**AutoDL 可以关机了**，上面没有任何只存在于它那里的东西。\n\n下一步还是那件事：在 blue-space 建 `D:\\robot_cell`，把 Mac 上的代码（包括今天收回的这些）推过去。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":415369,"output_tokens":760,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":760,"cache_read_input_tokens":415369,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"dec8e98c-ea79-448d-9715-eb10b5158845","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUCMM4HhpasJS28VMsGw","requestRef":"84d8f9fc-