{"parentUuid":"17e07447-a7f3-46db-b499-9df11a8afaf4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUCy6uEzC9mQ9txnHpCq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26,"cache_read_input_tokens":416745,"output_tokens":899,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":11},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":899,"cache_read_input_tokens":416745,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":76,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"62eb43a4-1b1e-430d-86ca-f3149a0cea40","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUCxyAA58PsUpDB5CHuY","requestRef":"656e719c-28e6-49c5-af6b-f7babc855405","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"287c728d-d346-46c7-af77-bc81734b70d2","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:02:52.042Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"287c728d-d346-46c7-af77-bc81734b70d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUCy6uEzC9mQ9txnHpCq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 刚刚完成的（今天的交接整理）\n\n**1. 明确了目标**\n接手的是\"一个人 + 他的 AI\"。要交出去的是两样：**一份人和 AI 都能读懂的全面文档**，加上**在公司电脑上能直接用的工具**（视觉重新训练、各类标定、现场部署等）。最终把这个对话也迁到 blue-space 接着做，Mac 和 AutoDL 停用。\n\n**2. 整理了 blue-space**\n- 桌面：101 项挪进 `D:\\项目资料`，按\"现役 / 历代 / 废弃 / 器件 / 杂项\"分类。\n- D 盘：17 项无关资料挪进 `D:\\其他资料_与本项目无关`。\n- 做法都是只挪不删，每一步都留了记录，可以还原。\n\n**3. 从 U 盘复制了关键资料**\n现役末端的设计文件、末端 SolidWorks 源文件、DUCO 驱动和控制器固件，复制到了 `D:\\项目资料`。\n\n**4. 把 AutoDL 上的东西全部收回**\n- 启动脚本、驱动包改动、视觉训练脚本：进了 Mac 的代码仓库。\n- 训练数据集和整盘备份：拷到 blue-space 的 `D:\\项目资料\\07`、`08`。\n- 106 个脚本逐个核实：16 个现役（仓库里已有相同版本），90 个用不上，分类归档。\n- 导出了环境清单，写好了重装脚本（待你在 WSL2 上安装时实测）。\n- 核实清楚：设备上现在用的视觉模型来自 AutoDL 的哪次训练。\n\n**现在 AutoDL 可以关机了。**\n\n## 下一步\n\n**在 blue-space 建 `D:\\robot_cell`，把 Mac 上的代码仓库完整推过去。**\n\n这一步很关键：今天收回的脚本和所有记录，现在**都还只在你的 Mac 上**。推过去以后，公司电脑上才有完整的代码原件，包括全部修改历史。整个过程不碰正在运行的设备代码。\n\n## 之后的顺序\n\n1. 推代码到 `D:\\robot_cell` ← **下一步**\n2. 拟场景清单：接手的人会遇到哪些情况，每个场景对应什么工具、现在能不能在公司电脑上用\n3. 按清单补齐工具和文档；你安装 WSL2、ROS2、Foxglove\n4. 写全面文档\n5. 迁移对话，Mac 停用\n\n可以开始推代码吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26,"cache_read_input_tokens":416745,"output_tokens":899,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":11},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":899,"cache_read_input_tokens":416745,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"62eb43a4-1b1e-430d-86ca-f3149a0cea40","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUCxyAA58PsUpDB5CHuY","requestRef":"656e719c-28e6-49c5-af6b-f7babc855405","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b758aa0-a1f9-49dd-b8ef-41f408db9626","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:03:00.192Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
