{"parentUuid":"00b8af16-d402-4985-9278-83434352303b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUDg6W5PXSFNxHd3RhEd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":169,"cache_read_input_tokens":437574,"output_tokens":831,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":169,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":831,"cache_read_input_tokens":437574,"cache_creation_input_tokens":169,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":169},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":198,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"19d5651f-c426-40dc-87f0-b6990a53de88","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUDg63YdGNj8rTVaidms","requestRef":"84e45fab-be06-4c22-b454-78ed1dc4286d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"035d1333-58df-48cf-a366-ad269f534bb2","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:12:08.222Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"035d1333-58df-48cf-a366-ad269f534bb2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUDg6W5PXSFNxHd3RhEd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"场景清单就是一张表，**列出接手的人以后可能遇到的每一种情况，并写明每种情况现在怎么处理、能不能在公司电脑上处理。**\n\n它的作用是把\"交接\"这件很模糊的事，变成一条条可以打勾的任务。\n\n**举几行例子，大概是这个样子：**\n\n| 场景 | 什么时候会遇到 | 用什么工具 | 现在能在公司电脑上做吗 | 缺什么 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 设备开机、确认正常 | 每天 | 看门狗自动启动、设备网页 | ✅ 能 | 缺一个\"设备控制台\"图标 |\n| 机械臂中途急停，复位 | 偶尔 | 上位机复位按钮 / `act.sh reset` | ⚠️ 部分能 | 命令是 Mac 上的脚本 |\n| 视觉认不出药盒 | 偶尔 | 采图 → 标注 → 训练 → 替换模型 | ❌ 不能 | 标注工具不明；训练要 GPU |\n| 换了新现场，桌子挪了位置 | 每次部署 | 桌子码牌标定 | ⚠️ 部分能 | 编排脚本在 Mac 上 |\n| 新加一个格口 | 偶尔 | 点位求解 → 路径规划 → 判卷 → 标定 | ❌ 不能 | 依赖 AutoDL |\n| 录入新药盒品种 | 经常 | `sku_add.sh` | ⚠️ 部分能 | 命令是 Mac 上的脚本 |\n\n整张表大概会有二三十行，分成几类：**日常使用、故障处理、视觉维护、现场部署与标定、改动与扩展**。\n\n**它能带来三样东西**\n1. **任务表**：\"缺什么\"那一列，就是后面要补的工作，做一项勾一项。\n2. **文档骨架**：将来全面文档的\"操作\"部分，就按这些场景组织，一个场景一节。\n3. **判断交接是否完成**：所有行都变成 ✅，交接就完成了。\n\n我先起草初稿，主要依据是现有的能力目录（`CLAUDE.md` 那张大表）、文档和这段时间的经验。你看完后补充漏掉的场景，或者删掉用不上的就行。要我起草吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":169,"cache_read_input_tokens":437574,"output_tokens":831,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":169,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":831,"cache_read_input_tokens":437574,"cache_creation_input_tokens":169,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":169},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"19d5651f-c426-40dc-87f0-b6990a53de88","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUDg63YdGNj8rTVaidms","requestRef":"84e45fab-be06-4c22-b454-78ed1dc42