{"parentUuid":"405dbcdc-4be3-43e2-9900-6fe8113848dd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cde04198-abf1-4dc6-b000-02537a222c7a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n@echo off\r\nrem robot_cell 服务开关(2026-09-10): 命令行手动起停四个常驻服务; 与看门狗(计划任务)/上位机网页(/services)共用同一机制\r\nrem 用法: svc.bat status\r\nrem       svc.bat start|stop|restart [vision|scan|cell|upper|all]   (默认 all)\r\nrem   start   = 清 hold 旗 + 触发看门狗计划任务(在桌面会话里拉起, 从 ssh 里跑也活得住), 等到端口在听\r\nrem   stop    = 放 hold 旗(看门狗与循环都不再拉起) + 杀监听进程\r\nrem   restart = 清旗 + 杀监听进程, run_service.bat 循环 5 秒内拉回(scan 走 schtasks /run scan_service)\r\nrem   等待用 ping 代替 timeout(timeout 在 ssh 无 stdin 时直接报错退出)\r\nrem   环境变量 SVC_NOWAIT=1 时 start/restart 不等, 立即返回(上位机接口用)\r\nsetlocal enabledelayedexpansion\r\ncd /d D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\r\nif not exist logs mkdir logs\r\nset CMD=%1\r\nset TARGET=%2\r\nif \"%TARGET%\"==\"\" set TARGET=all\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"status\" goto status\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"start\" goto start\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"stop\" goto stop\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"restart\" goto restart\r\necho usage: svc.bat status ^| start^|stop^|restart [vision^|scan^|cell^|upper^|all]\r\nexit /b 1\r\n\r\n:each\r\nif \"%TARGET%\"==\"all\" (\r\n  call :%1 vision\r\n  call :%1 scan\r\n  call :%1 cell\r\n  call :%1 upper\r\n) else (\r\n  call :%1 %TARGET%\r\n(eval):1: === not found","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_0123NfkmNati5xQKLXZAxyYn"}]},"uuid":"9c552b8b-724e-4fdf-b161-ae267ac3ec54","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:17:34.503Z","toolUseResult":"Error: Exit code 1\n@echo off\r\nrem robot_cell 服务开关(2026-09-10): 命令行手动起停四个常驻服务; 与看门狗(计划任务)/上位机网页(/services)共用同一机制\r\nrem 用法: svc.bat status\r\nrem       svc.bat start|stop|restart [vision|scan|cell|upper|all]   (默认 all)\r\nrem   start   = 清 hold 旗 + 触发看门狗计划任务(在桌面会话里拉起, 从 ssh 里跑也活得住), 等到端口在听\r\nrem   stop    = 放 hold 旗(看门狗与循环都不再拉起) + 杀监听进程\r\nrem   restart = 清旗 + 杀监听进程, run_service.bat 循环 5 秒内拉回(scan 走 schtasks /run scan_service)\r\nrem   等待用 ping 代替 timeout(timeout 在 ssh 无 stdin 时直接报错退出)\r\nrem   环境变量 SVC_NOWAIT=1 时 start/restart 不等, 立即返回(上位机接口用)\r\nsetlocal enabledelayedexpansion\r\ncd /d D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\r\nif not exist logs mkdir logs\r\nset CMD=%1\r\nset TARGET=%2\r\nif \"%TARGET%\"==\"\" set TARGET=all\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"status\" goto status\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"start\" goto start\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"stop\" goto stop\r\nif \"%CMD%\"==\"restart\" goto restart\r\necho usage: svc.bat status ^| start^|stop^|restart [vision^|scan^|cell^|upper^|all]\r\nexit /b 1\r\n\r\n:each\r\nif \"%TARGET%\"==\"all\" (\r\n  call :%1 vision\r\n  call :%1 scan\r\n  call :%1 cell\r\n  call :%1 upper\r\n) else (\r\n  call :%1 %TARGET%\r\n(eval):1: === not found","serverClassifierContext":{"request":"190dfb91-a986-41f4-90e7-ae85bef187f7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":16},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"405dbcdc-4be3-43e2-9900-6fe8113848dd","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
