es`同一机制; stop=放hold旗看门狗不拉, start=清旗触发看门狗, restart=杀进程循环5s拉回; 详见docs/服务托管.md) |"," | 视觉常驻服务(相机+模型热着,抓取免付3.3s init) | `scripts/vision_service.sh start\\|status\\|stop\\|log\\|snap\\|fail`(blue-space本机看门狗托管, start=清hold旗拉起, stop=放hold旗退出; ⚠️独占相机:跑其他相机脚本前先stop;识别数学=services/vision_core.py单一来源,改后跑`services/selftest_offline.py <run>`离线对账再上真机) |"," | robot_cell硬件逐项体检(相机/机械臂/腕转电机/吸盘/扫码器) / **控制器手动↔自动模式切换** | `scripts/check_cell.sh camera\\|arm\\|rotator\\|suction\\|scanner\\|vacuum\\|opmode auto\\|manual\\|status`(**opmode=免示教器切模式**, 手动=限速慢一倍多, 真机跑流程前切 auto, 示教完切回 auto; 各自独立PASS/FAIL;camera取回照片;rotator交互菜单顺90/零/逆90;suction=DO7吹1秒回吸取待机;scanner=经扫码服务要码+手动过盒; vacuum=真空开关DI4手拿盒贴/拿开看跳变; 实测/读法见docs/真空开关接入.md, 回执`真空DI4`栏只标注) |"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/CLAUDE.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"99395b95-0c56-411e-b23f-22ecc5107181","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":4,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":17},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8077e81f-c8a8-401c-8613-baf11f9de2dd","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
