{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"41bb500719b017b3837f428605e5b0630a41c3aa8ea9f9793ecba0817d5ae639","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"两个地址都返回200，说明CRV对任何路径都给页面，无法判断事件接收路径是否真实存在，为避免产生假数据我不会发测试事件，推送地址需等同事确认。现在先把控制台改成从CRV配置文件读取端口。\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ARGJk87aD8qDNp1XbQo6db","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && /usr/bin/python3 - <<'PYEOF'\np = \"scripts/bluespace/services/device_console.ps1\"\ns = open(p, \"rb\").read().decode(\"utf-8-sig\")\ndef rep(a, b):\n    global s; assert s.count(a) == 1, a; s = s.replace(a, b)\nrep('''function Test-Port($p)''', '''# CRV 上位机(沈苏单机版CRV, 同事的桌面应用)的后端端口以它自己的配置为准(2026-10-28 由 8977 改为 8080), 不写死\n$CRV_CONF = \"C:\\\\Users\\\\26293\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\my-react-app\\\\local-runtime\\\\application-standalone.properties\"\nfunction Get-CrvPort {\n    $m = Select-String -LiteralPath $CRV_CONF -Pattern '^\\\\s*server\\\\.port\\\\s*=\\\\s*(\\\\d+)' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1\n    if ($m) { [int]$m.Matches[0].Groups[1].Value } else { 8080 }\n}\nfunction Test-Port($p)''')\nrep('''    if (Test-Port 8977) { Line \"CRV上位机\" \"运行中\" \"Green\" } else { Line \"CRV上位机\" \"未运行(桌面双击'沈苏单机版CRV'打开)\" \"Yellow\" }''',\n    '''    $crv = Get-CrvPort\n    if (Test-Port $crv) { Line \"CRV上位机\" \"运行中 (端口 $crv)\" \"Green\" } else { Line \"CRV上位机\" \"未运行(桌面双击'沈苏单机版CRV'打开)\" \"Yellow\" }''')\nopen(p, \"wb\").write(b\"\\xef\\xbb\\xbf\" + s.replace(\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\").replace(\"\\n\", \"\\r\\n\").encode(\"utf-8\"))\np = \"CLAUDE.md\"; c = open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\nc = c.replace(\"CRV上位机(8977)是否在运行\", \"CRV上位机是否在运行(端口读 CRV 自己的 application-standalone.properties, 10-28 起 8080)\", 1)\nopen(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\").write(c)\nPYEOF\n./scripts/deploy_cell.sh 2>&1 | grep -E \"PASS|FAIL\"; S=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe/scratchpad; printf '\\xef\\xbb\\xbf' > $S/t2.ps1; cat >> $S/t2.ps1 <<'EOF'\n$f = \"D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services\\device_console.ps1\"\n$errs = $null; [void][System.Management.Automation.Language.Parser]::ParseFile($f, [ref]$null, [ref]$errs); \"语法错误数: \" + $errs.Count\n$code = ((Get-Content $f -Raw -Encoding UTF8) -replace '(?s)\\r?\\nwhile \\(\\$true\\).*$', '') -replace 'Clear-Host', '' -replace '\\$Host\\.UI\\.RawUI\\.WindowTitle.*', ''\nInvoke-Expression $code; \"CRV端口=\" + (Get-CrvPort)\nShow-Status *>&1 | Out-String\nEOF\nscp -q $S/t2.ps1 26293@100.106.76.91:D:/Destop/t.ps1 && ssh 26293@100.106.76.91 \"powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File D:\\Destop\\t.ps1 > D:\\Destop\\r.txt 2>&1 & powershell -NoProfile -Command \\\"Get-Content D:\\Destop\\r.txt | Out-File D:\\Destop\\r8.txt -Encoding utf8\\\" & type D:\\Destop\\r8.txt & del /f D:\\Destop\\t.ps1 D:\\Destop\\r.txt D:\\Destop\\r8.txt\" 2>&1 | LC_ALL=C tr -d '\\r' | sed 's/^\\xef\\xbb\\xbf//' | grep -A1 \"语法\\|CRV\"; git add CLAUDE.md scripts/bluespace/services/device_console.ps1 && git commit -q -m \"fix: 设备控制台 CRV 端口改读其配置文件(10-28 由 8977 改为 8080)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git push -q origin exp/stand-place 2>&1 | tail -1; git log --oneline -1","description":"控制台改为读取 CRV 配置端口，部署验证并提交推送","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
