{"parentUuid":"7f1ada88-5e11-4628-b35f-9602d0229405","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01ARGJk87aD8qDNp1XbQo6db","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2e116411-6bce-4b19-940a-69da9b925de2","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:22:43.584Z","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"2e116411-6bce-4b19-940a-69da9b925de2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUEUZXKCVBA6exrcs6pq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**判断标准**：CRV 上位机的后端（一个 Java 程序）在它配置的端口上监听，就算在运行。双击桌面上的\"沈苏单机版CRV\"，打开它的窗口，就会自动把后端带起来；关掉窗口，后端也会停。\n\n**刚才误报的原因**：你的同事今天 15:20 改了 CRV 的配置，后端端口从 **8977 改成了 8080**，还改成了对外开放。我的控制台把端口写死成 8977，所以没找到它。\n\n**已修好**：控制台改成直接读取 CRV 自己的配置文件来获取端口，以后同事再改端口也能跟着变。现在显示\"CRV上位机 运行中（端口 8080）\"，已部署并提交。\n\n**顺带的好消息**：你之前遇到的\"`http://192.168.100.190:8080/` 访问不了\"，现在已经能访问了，我从 Mac 上试过返回正常。这是同事改配置解决的。\n\n**还要同事确认一件事**：设备的事件推送（上架、出库完成等通知）还在发往旧地址 `192.168.100.212`，已经失败 171 次。要改成本机的 `127.0.0.1:8080`，但需要同事确认接收路径是不是还是原来的 `/vaccine/device/webhook`。这个路径从外面探测不出来，我也不想往里发测试事件，免得给它记一笔假账。同事确认后，我改一行配置就好。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2088,"cache_read_input_tokens":471910,"output_tokens":502,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2088,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":502,"cache_read_input_tokens":471910,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2088},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"41ca5ffc-d4eb-4df4-af92-c6fa755f3148","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUEUZ4XpNPrPPybVqXVE","requestRef":"5af15766-af68-4758-81f2-f2f3b154052c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7b25e8a-c2d9-4723-aae4-228ef7fa5502","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:22:43.582Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad4