{"parentUuid":"5065c6b7-b9ab-4ce7-b423-3a633523d75e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUEYubAx9YaS8oi4Uenk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"弄清楚了，**是 CRV 程序自己改的，不是人改的**：\n\n- CRV 每次启动都会**自动重新生成**这份配置文件。今天 15:20 你打开 CRV 时，它写入了端口 8080。\n- 它的运行状态文件也记录着 `apiPort = 8080`，程序版本是 0.1.4。\n- `D:\\ss_crv` 的安装时间是 **10 月 23 日 16:57**。我上次看到 8977，很可能是重装之前的旧版本。新版本的默认设置改成了 8080，并且对局域网开放。\n\n所以这是**新版本 CRV 的默认行为**，不是谁手动改的。抱歉我之前说成了\"同事改的\"。\n\n**对设备这边的影响**\n- **控制台**：已改为每次从这份配置文件读取端口，以后不管 CRV 用哪个端口都能正确显示。\n- **事件推送**：现在上位机由你管，所以这个问题要问你：新版 CRV 有没有接收设备事件的接口？如果有，路径还是 `/vaccine/device/webhook` 吗？\n  - 如果有，我把推送地址改成 `http://127.0.0.1:8080/vaccine/device/webhook`，重启工作站服务后，看到推送状态变成\"正常\"就说明通了。\n  - 如果新版没有这个接口，我就先把推送关掉，免得一直失败、刷错误日志。CRV 仍然可以主动来查询任务事件，功能上不受影响。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":478135,"output_tokens":852,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":333},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":852,"cache_read_input_tokens":478135,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"386d603f-fb31-45fb-8cbb-bec52a51ac1e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUEYuDqfBP1GHWnjyLSR","requestRef":"91299e57-ac9b-47e2-8779-d7cb01c6fe4b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"64d23ba2-25ff-4846-ab2a-e636211221e8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:23:46.710Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id