{"parentUuid":"c237d7f0-5edc-4909-a7a6-eb9b613e5960","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUFErZDUfq2xXuW3tpro","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CRV 程序包有几百 MB，搜索比较慢，已经转到后台运行，完成后我会收到通知。\n\n先回答你的问题：**和上位机的通信资料已经有不少，但都是按专题分散写的，没有一份\"总览\"**。现有的是：\n\n| 文档 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| `设备接口文档_V1.docx` / `.md` | 全部 23 个接口的正式说明 |\n| `webhook对接说明.md` | 设备主动推送事件 |\n| `设备状态WebSocket对接说明.md` | 实时设备状态 |\n| `复位对接说明.md`、`出库扫码对接说明.md`、`盘点对接说明.md` | 专项流程 |\n| `对接交互样例/` | 真机跑出来的完整交互记录 |\n| 设备端配置 `config/webhook.yaml` | 推送开关、地址、重试、推哪些事件 |\n\n**缺的是一份一页纸的总览**：两边各在哪个地址、用哪几种方式通信、配置分别写在哪个文件里、现在的实际值是多少。比如现在 webhook 还指向旧地址 `192.168.100.212`，这种问题在总览里一眼就能看出来。\n\n等 CRV 那边\"设备地址写在哪里\"查出来，我就写这份总览。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":997,"cache_read_input_tokens":481618,"output_tokens":605,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":150},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":997,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":605,"cache_read_input_tokens":481618,"cache_creation_input_tokens":997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":997},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0c4df9b0-337f-4f98-b555-4369e6f8bbb4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUFEqoKjEhbaeFbv5qHF","requestRef":"f022911a-cffb-497b-b254-5ac10abbfb82","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b1c60f1-20f8-4a5a-b1b4-4cdfeef85789","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:32:46.338Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":