{"parentUuid":"4448061e-bd7d-45b9-be73-feb03dde4205","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUFUoa1nvCdG2UnkxYCo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1630,"cache_read_input_tokens":483279,"output_tokens":1383,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":551},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1630,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1383,"cache_read_input_tokens":483279,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1630},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6813,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"34f0a108-1983-477b-932a-00f681ab26e6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUFUnwpAmMzJ8QRZ7SYy","requestRef":"7b194201-c5c5-4e0e-8ecb-6aa663147ef7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5420ff80-5dae-407b-ae26-5cb87b203c4a","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:35:55.227Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"5420ff80-5dae-407b-ae26-5cb87b203c4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUFUoa1nvCdG2UnkxYCo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白了：你想要**设备端有一个专门的配置文件，把\"和上位机怎么连\"的所有设置集中在一起**。以后上位机换电脑、换端口，只改这一个文件就行，不用去翻代码。\n\n现在这些设置是分散的：推送地址在 `config/webhook.yaml`，设备自己的端口 8902 写死在代码里，上位机地址也没有单独的配置项。\n\n**我建议的文件：`config/upper_link.yaml`**（上位机对接配置）\n\n```yaml\n# ===== 设备与上位机的对接配置 =====\n# 改完后在\"设备控制台\"选 2 重启服务才生效\n\n# 设备自己（上位机通过这个地址调用设备）\ndevice:\n  port: 8902                     # 接口、WebSocket 都在这个端口\n\n# 上位机在哪\nupper:\n  host: 127.0.0.1                # 上位机和设备在同一台电脑上就填 127.0.0.1\n  port: auto                     # auto = 自动读 CRV 自己的配置（CRV 重装后端口会变）\n                                 #        也可以直接填数字，比如 8080\n\n# 设备主动推送事件给上位机\nwebhook:\n  enabled: true\n  path: /vaccine/device/webhook  # 上位机接收事件的路径\n  token: \"xxxx\"                  # 和上位机约定的口令\n  timeout_s: 3\n  retries: 3\n  events: [stored, retrieved, discarded, ...]   # 推哪些事件\n```\n\n**这样设计的几点考虑**\n1. **地址拆成\"主机 + 端口 + 路径\"**：换电脑只改 host，换端口只改 port，不用整串重写。\n2. **端口可以填 `auto`**：设备启动时自动读 CRV 自己记录的端口。这次 CRV 从 8977 变成 8080，用 `auto` 就不需要人改。\n3. **设备控制台同步显示**：控制台上会显示\"推送目标：127.0.0.1:8080/vaccine/device/webhook  正常/失败\"，配错了一眼就能看出来。\n4. **旧的 `webhook.yaml` 合并进来**后删掉，只留这一份，避免两处配置打架。\n\n**还差一个信息**：接收事件的路径 `path`。我在后台搜 CRV 程序包，就是为了找它，结果出来后填进去；如果搜不到，就要你确认。\n\n按这个方案做可以吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1630,"cache_read_input_tokens":483279,"output_tokens":1383,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":551},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1630,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1383,"cache_read_input_tokens":483279,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1630},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"34f0a108-1983-477b-932a-00f681ab26e6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUFUnwpAmMzJ8QRZ7SYy","requestRef":"7b194201-c5c5-4e0e-8ecb-6aa663147ef7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9c427107-6634-4be0-b0ce-80e89471b35f","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:36:03.770Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
