{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","id":"4b75bdf4-8b6e-4658-90ed-be613c2bdb16","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:36:33.976Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread","shapeHash":"5aa3177d287d66f42967136b8439b73cd5f13a4fa14f22e72b6d7e7040f7b1f1","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"724ee19e-d3d0-489a-a021-fae4154818c5","keep":618,"tail":["a8165644c16bbb0fd38e0d1eb8548d7c46abfa1bec9bf1148a8b077e9454da9d","2673cb8f3e6bdf6373e97f1d5a9fa6e29c0eb5abfbeadede3017d316d3e85939"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",619,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"04ed12308fcf67f6bd816498a4af334a4e0eb309d67a53420d04005d81a32f59"}
{"parentUuid":"ee8fea48-de7c-426d-af66-b83af0b1e1ef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUFYDF9Hmdkkh9bwrj99","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"接收路径\"就是网址里**端口号后面的那一段**，用来指明上位机里由哪个程序处理设备发来的消息。\n\n拿现在配置里的完整地址来拆：\n\n```\nhttp://192.168.100.212:8080/vaccine/device/webhook\n       └─────┬──────┘ └┬─┘ └──────────┬─────────┘\n          主机(host)   端口(port)    路径(path)\n         哪台电脑     哪个程序      程序里的哪个功能\n```\n\n打个比方：\n- **主机** = 哪栋楼（哪台电脑）\n- **端口** = 哪家公司（这台电脑上的哪个程序，比如 CRV 的 8080）\n- **路径** = 公司里的哪个部门（CRV 里专门负责\"接收设备事件\"的那个功能）\n\nCRV 后端会提供很多功能，每个功能对应一个路径，比如登录是一个路径，查库存是另一个路径。**设备的事件必须发到\"接收设备事件\"那个路径上**，发错了，CRV 就不知道该怎么处理。\n\n`/vaccine/device/webhook` 是之前和旧上位机联调时，对方开发告诉我们的。现在 CRV 换成了新版本（0.1.4），**这个路径是否还一样，只有写 CRV 后端代码的人知道**。我在后台搜程序包，就是想从代码里把它找出来。\n\n你可以问一下 CRV 后端的开发：\"设备推送事件的接收接口路径是什么？\"他应该能直接回答。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_read_input_tokens":486305,"output_tokens":521,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":521,"cache_read_input_tokens":486305,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bb87a26c-f3cd-486f-9fa8-4cbfa2e527ed","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUFYCnrLJBppmpxGNykD","requestRef":"4b75bdf4-8b6e-4658-90ed-be613c2bdb16","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"120c7fcf-43c2-4aff-9407-665a0d19e340","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:36:40.220Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5