{"parentUuid":"81e91ea8-877d-4933-bae3-bca93289a109","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUFe5YTEy8zzxrbXNWyV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":618,"cache_read_input_tokens":498305,"output_tokens":1235,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":301},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":618,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1235,"cache_read_input_tokens":498305,"cache_creation_input_tokens":618,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":618},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11287,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"799acf2e-1c14-4039-8880-0bd4c3ff58f4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUFe5EM8ey5t8MnEe5i6","requestRef":"bfe0c646-6f4d-4f2b-9b6f-21d20ccf6d71","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"55996cab-49fe-40e6-aebe-4e892a20fc52","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:38:05.535Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"55996cab-49fe-40e6-aebe-4e892a20fc52","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUFe5YTEy8zzxrbXNWyV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"查清楚了，而且发现了一个**会导致推送失败的不匹配**。\n\n## 两边的配置各在哪里\n\n| | 设备这边 | CRV 上位机这边 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **上位机怎么找到设备** | 设备监听 8902 端口（写死在代码里） | CRV 系统参数 **`crv.device.baseUrl`**（设备根地址，例如 `http://127.0.0.1:8902`）。WebSocket 地址由它自动推出：`/ws/device` |\n| **设备推送到哪** | `config/webhook.yaml` 的 `url`，现在是旧地址 `192.168.100.212:8080/...` | 接收接口 **`/vaccine/device/webhook`**（已确认存在，只收 POST） |\n| **推送口令** | `config/webhook.yaml` 的 `token`，放在请求头 **`X-Cell-Token`** 里发 | 从请求头 **`X-Webhook-Token`** 读取，和系统参数 **`crv.device.webhookToken`** 比对 |\n\nCRV 的两个参数都在它界面里的\"系统管理 → 参数设置\"中，存在 CRV 自己的数据库里。\n\n## 发现的问题\n\n**口令的请求头名字对不上**：设备发的是 `X-Cell-Token`，新版 CRV 读的是 `X-Webhook-Token`。所以就算把地址改对了，CRV 也很可能因为\"口令不对\"拒收。之前和旧上位机能通，可能是旧上位机读的是 `X-Cell-Token`。\n\n## 结合你要的\"可配置文件\"，这样改\n\n在新的 `config/upper_link.yaml` 里，把这些全部变成可配置项：\n\n```yaml\nupper:\n  host: 127.0.0.1\n  port: auto                       # 自动读 CRV 的端口\nwebhook:\n  path: /vaccine/device/webhook\n  token: \"xxxx\"                    # 要和 CRV 参数 crv.device.webhookToken 一致\n  token_header: X-Webhook-Token    # 口令放在哪个请求头（新版 CRV 用这个）\n```\n\n以后上位机换了软件、换了口令方式，都只改这个文件。\n\n**需要你做一件事**：打开 CRV → 系统管理 → 参数设置，看一下这两个参数的值：\n- `crv.device.baseUrl`：应该是 `http://127.0.0.1:8902`\n- `crv.device.webhookToken`：口令，设备这边要填成一样的\n\n这两个值你告诉我（口令也可以你自己填进设备配置文件，不用发给我），我就把配置文件做出来，改好以后试推一次，在控制台上看到\"事件推送：正常\"为止。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":618,"cache_read_input_tokens":498305,"output_tokens":1235,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":301},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":618,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1235,"cache_read_input_tokens":498305,"cache_creation_input_tokens":618,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":618},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"799acf2e-1c14-4039-8880-0bd4c3ff58f4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUFe5EM8ey5t8MnEe5i6","requestRef":"bfe0c646-6f4d-4f2b-9b6f-21d20ccf6d71","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d4f12b17-c205-4cb9-8fe8-7813d994c82a","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:38:06.097Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
