{"parentUuid":"41e4c7ad-3a46-42c8-93b2-8294c577644a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_018e4x4j4JE1Nq72EbofHwDr","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b5e13da9-a21c-458b-b8ba-dc29764e553a","timestamp":"2026-10-28T07:44:24.777Z","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"b5e13da9-a21c-458b-b8ba-dc29764e553a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUG8RHP9y8Tzd1yMRbyg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"服务已经重启，配置生效，**可以开始测试了**。\n\n**刚完成的**\n- **新配置文件 `config/upper_link.yaml`**：和上位机对接的所有设置都在这一个文件里，包括设备端口、上位机地址（端口设为 `auto`，自动跟随 CRV）、推送路径和口令。旧的 `webhook.yaml` 已删除。\n- **推送已恢复**：重启后的自检推送成功了（15:43:38，CRV 返回 200）。目标地址是 `http://127.0.0.1:8080/vaccine/device/webhook`，控制台上会显示\"事件推送：正常\"。\n- **说明文档**：`docs/上位机对接配置说明.md`，内容包括四条通信通道、设备端每个配置项什么时候改、CRV 端要设置的两个参数、出问题去哪里查。\n- 已提交，并同步到 blue-space 主仓库。\n\n**测试前请先确认一件事**：设备现在显示**\"机械臂连不上\"**。请检查机械臂控制器是否开机，以及是否切到了自动模式。打开设备控制台，看到\"状态：空闲\"再开始。\n\n**测试怎么配合**\n- 你用 CRV 上位机逐项操作，每做完一项告诉我\"做完了 XX\"，带上任务号更好。\n- 我会读两边的日志：\n  - **设备端**：工作站服务日志、任务事件记录、推送出站流水、动作过程日志；\n  - **CRV 端**：`backend.log` 和 `sys-error.log`。\n- 每一项我都会核对：流程有没有走完、事件有没有推到 CRV 并被接收、两边有没有报错或异常耗时。\n\n建议的测试顺序：**上架 → 出库 → 退苗 → 盘点 → 暂停/继续/停止 → 复位**。你也可以按自己的习惯来。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":836,"cache_read_input_tokens":529846,"output_tokens":647,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":836,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":647,"cache_read_input_tokens":529846,"cache_creation_input_tokens":836,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":836},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8f9bdae9-e2ff-47eb-b0f8-feebf3aa1f4b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUG8QgfbHUB4yq9h4Frg","requestRef":"2b78250f-93d6-4cc2-98cd-27c3122d9cc7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ea83560c-7d