{"parentUuid":"f6ffeb31-541f-4200-9dc4-4cc16ca4a619","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/复位对接说明.md","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/复位对接说明.md","content":"# 复位对接说明\n\n> 给上位机开发。2026-10-23\n> 接口地址不变，还是 `POST /device/reset`。本次变化：复位改为按原路倒回，最后**一律回到 home**。\n\n## 1. 什么时候用\n\n机械臂停在半路、不在 home 时，用复位把它安全收回来。常见情况：\n\n- 急停或断电恢复以后\n- 任务进入 `needs_human`（需人工处理），或被\"立即停止\"（abort）以后\n- 设备上电时，机械臂不在 home\n\n复位不会重新规划路线，只沿机械臂来时走过的路倒回去。即使停在格口里、桌面上方或扫码口，也能原路退出。\n\n## 2. 调用前，界面上要让操作员确认\n\n1. **现场安全**：机械臂周围没有人，路线上没有障碍物。复位会让真机直接运动，设备这边**没有二次确认**，确认由上位机界面负责。\n2. **急停已解除，已上使能**。\n3. **控制器在自动模式**。用示教器示教过以后，常停在手动模式，手动模式下机械臂不会动。\n\n## 3. 调用\n\n```\nPOST http://192.168.100.190:8902/device/reset\n```\n\n- 不需要请求体。\n- **同步返回**：动作做完才返回，一般几秒，长的约 1 分钟。**HTTP 超时请设为 120 秒以上**。\n- 只能在设备空闲，或当前任务处于 `needs_human` / `paused` 时调用；其他时候返回 409。\n\n## 4. 返回\n\n返回一张\"动作卡片\"：\n\n| 字段 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `ok` | `true` = 复位成功 |\n| `code` | `OK`，或错误码（见第 5 节） |\n| `category` | 失败后怎么办：`none`=成功；`manual`=需人工；`need_reset`=需先复位；`retryable`=可再试；`fatal`=需停机检修 |\n| `message` | 说明文字，可以直接显示给操作员 |\n| `payload` | 手上有没有货：`none`=空手；`holding`=持货 |\n| `where` | 机械臂现在在哪：成功时是 `home` |\n| `elapsed_s` | 用时（秒） |\n| `data` | 附加信息，排查问题用，不需要解析 |\n\n成功示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"复位→home\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"code\": \"OK\",\n  \"category\": \"none\",\n  \"message\": \"按脚印原路倒回 3 步, 已回到 mid, 再回 home\",\n  \"payload\": \"none\",\n  \"where\": \"home\",\n  \"elapsed_s\": 18.4,\n  \"data\": { \"脚印\": \"3 步: ...\", \"收尾\": \"✅ mid → home\" }\n}\n```\n\n如果当前有任务（`needs_human` / `paused`），这张卡片也会写进该任务的事件流（`card` 事件）。\n\n## 5. 结果怎么处理\n\n**成功（`ok=true`，`where=home`）**\n\n- `payload=none`（空手）：可以直接下新任务。\n- `payload=holding`（持货）：盒子是原样带回来的，**设备不会自动放下**。需要先处理这盒：人工取下，或调 `POST /device/drop` 丢回传送带。处理完再下新任务。**这盒没有入库，不要记账。**\n\n**失败（`ok=false`）**\n\n| 错误码 | 含义 | 处理 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `E_ROBOT_NOT_READY` | 急停没解除 / 没上电 / 没使能，机械臂没动 | 让操作员处理后再调一次 |\n| `E_RESET_INCOMPLETE` | 倒回途中停下了（如又被急停） | 看 `where` 和 `message`，排除原因后再调一次 |\n| `E_UNKNOWN_LOCATION` | 机械臂不在任何认识的位置（一般是被示教器手动挪过） | 需人工：用示教器把臂移回 home 附近，再调一次 |\n| `E_NOT_AT_PORT` / `E_PATH_NOT_TO_MID` | 位置和路线对不上 | 同上，需人工 |\n\nHTTP 层错误：\n\n| 状态码 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| 409 `busy` | 有任务正在运行，不能复位。要先停止任务（`POST /tasks/{id}/abort`） |\n| 503 `arm_offline` | 连不上机械臂控制器 |\n\n## 6. 和任务的关系\n\n- 任务被\"立即停止\"或出异常后已经结束，复位后**另下新任务**，不要 resume。\n- 任务处于 `needs_human` 时：先复位，确认现场（尤其是持货的情况），再按业务决定 resume 或结束任务。\n- 复位期间，设备状态（`GET /device` 或 WebSocket）里的 `arm_at` 会实时变化，最后变为 `home`。\n\n## 7. 建议的界面流程\n\n```\n[复位] 按钮\n  → 弹窗确认: \"请确认: 机械臂周围无人 / 急停已解除 / 控制器为自动模式\"  [确认] [取消]\n  → POST /device/reset (超时 120s, 期间显示\"复位中…\")\n  → ok=true 且 payload=none    : 提示\"已回到原点\", 可下新任务\n  → ok=true 且 payload=holding : 提示\"已回到原点, 手上还有一盒, 请取下或丢回\"\n  → ok=false                   : 显示 message, 按错误码提示操作员\n```\n","numLines":104,"startLine":1,"totalLines":104}},"displayPath":"docs/复位对接说明.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c8b0d003-b735-4f5b-99ea-16d6cb475168","timestamp":"2026-10-28T08:39:03.772Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/复位对接说明.md\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t# 复位对接说明\n2\t\n3\t> 给上位机开发。2026-10-23\n4\t> 接口地址不变，还是 `POST /device/reset`。本次变化：复位改为按原路倒回，最后**一律回到 home**。\n5\t\n6\t## 1. 什么时候用\n7\t\n8\t机械臂停在半路、不在 home 时，用复位把它安全收回来。常见情况：\n9\t\n10\t- 急停或断电恢复以后\n11\t- 任务进入 `needs_human`（需人工处理），或被\"立即停止\"（abort）以后\n12\t- 设备上电时，机械臂不在 home\n13\t\n14\t复位不会重新规划路线，只沿机械臂来时走过的路倒回去。即使停在格口里、桌面上方或扫码口，也能原路退出。\n15\t\n16\t## 2. 调用前，界面上要让操作员确认\n17\t\n18\t1. **现场安全**：机械臂周围没有人，路线上没有障碍物。复位会让真机直接运动，设备这边**没有二次确认**，确认由上位机界面负责。\n19\t2. **急停已解除，已上使能**。\n20\t3. **控制器在自动模式**。用示教器示教过以后，常停在手动模式，手动模式下机械臂不会动。\n21\t\n22\t## 3. 调用\n23\t\n24\t```\n25\tPOST http://192.168.100.190:8902/device/reset\n26\t```\n27\t\n28\t- 不需要请求体。\n29\t- **同步返回**：动作做完才返回，一般几秒，长的约 1 分钟。**HTTP 超时请设为 120 秒以上**。\n30\t- 只能在设备空闲，或当前任务处于 `needs_human` / `paused` 时调用；其他时候返回 409。\n31\t\n32\t## 4. 返回\n33\t\n34\t返回一张\"动作卡片\"：\n35\t\n36\t| 字段 | 含义 |\n37\t|---|---|\n38\t| `ok` | `true` = 复位成功 |\n39\t| `code` | `OK`，或错误码（见第 5 节） |\n40\t| `category` | 失败后怎么办：`none`=成功；`manual`=需人工；`need_reset`=需先复位；`retryable`=可再试；`fatal`=需停机检修 |\n41\t| `message` | 说明文字，可以直接显示给操作员 |\n42\t| `payload` | 手上有没有货：`none`=空手；`holding`=持货 |\n43\t| `where` | 机械臂现在在哪：成功时是 `home` |\n44\t| `elapsed_s` | 用时（秒） |\n45\t| `data` | 附加信息，排查问题用，不需要解析 |\n46\t\n47\t成功示例：\n48\t\n49\t```json\n50\t{\n51\t  \"action\": \"复位→home\",\n52\t  \"ok\": true,\n53\t  \"code\": \"OK\",\n54\t  \"category\": \"none\",\n55\t  \"message\": \"按脚印原路倒回 3 步, 已回到 mid, 再回 home\",\n56\t  \"payload\": \"none\",\n57\t  \"where\": \"home\",\n58\t  \"elapsed_s\": 18.4,\n59\t  \"data\": { \"脚印\": \"3 步: ...\", \"收尾\": \"✅ mid → home\" }\n60\t}\n61\t```\n62\t\n63\t如果当前有任务（`needs_human` / `paused`），这张卡片也会写进该任务的事件流（`card` 事件）。\n64\t\n65\t## 5. 结果怎么处理\n66\t\n67\t**成功（`ok=true`，`where=home`）**\n68\t\n69\t- `payload=none`（空手）：可以直接下新任务。\n70\t- `payload=holding`（持货）：盒子是原样带回来的，**设备不会自动放下**。需要先处理这盒：人工取下，或调 `POST /device/drop` 丢回传送带。处理完再下新任务。**这盒没有入库，不要记账。**\n71\t\n72\t**失败（`ok=false`）**\n73\t\n74\t| 错误码 | 含义 | 处理 |\n75\t|---|---|---|\n76\t| `E_ROBOT_NOT_READY` | 急停没解除 / 没上电 / 没使能，机械臂没动 | 让操作员处理后再调一次 |\n77\t| `E_RESET_INCOMPLETE` | 倒回途中停下了（如又被急停） | 看 `where` 和 `message`，排除原因后再调一次 |\n78\t| `E_UNKNOWN_LOCATION` | 机械臂不在任何认识的位置（一般是被示教器手动挪过） | 需人工：用示教器把臂移回 home 附近，再调一次 |\n79\t| `E_NOT_AT_PORT` / `E_PATH_NOT_TO_MID` | 位置和路线对不上 | 同上，需人工 |\n80\t\n81\tHTTP 层错误：\n82\t\n83\t| 状态码 | 含义 |\n84\t|---|---|\n85\t| 409 `busy` | 有任务正在运行，不能复位。要先停止任务（`POST /tasks/{id}/abort`） |\n86\t| 503 `arm_offline` | 连不上机械臂控制器 |\n87\t\n88\t## 6. 和任务的关系\n89\t\n90\t- 任务被\"立即停止\"或出异常后已经结束，复位后**另下新任务**，不要 resume。\n91\t- 任务处于 `needs_human` 时：先复位，确认现场（尤其是持货的情况），再按业务决定 resume 或结束任务。\n92\t- 复位期间，设备状态（`GET /device` 或 WebSocket）里的 `arm_at` 会实时变化，最后变为 `home`。\n93\t\n94\t## 7. 建议的界面流程\n95\t\n96\t```\n97\t[复位] 按钮\n98\t  → 弹窗确认: \"请确认: 机械臂周围无人 / 急停已解除 / 控制器为自动模式\"  [确认] [取消]\n99\t  → POST /device/reset (超时 120s, 期间显示\"复位中…\")\n100\t  → ok=true 且 payload=none    : 提示\"已回到原点\", 可下新任务\n101\t  → ok=true 且 payload=holding : 提示\"已回到原点, 手上还有一盒, 请取下或丢回\"\n102\t  → ok=false                   : 显示 message, 按错误码提示操作员\n103\t```\n104\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"c8b0d003-b735-4f5b-99ea-16d6cb475168","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/bluespace/services/webhook.py","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/bluespace/services/webhook.py","content":"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"事件 webhook 投递(设备 → 上位机)。配置在 config/upper_link.yaml 的 webhook 段(2026-10-28 起; 旧 config/webhook.yaml 仅在新文件缺失时兜底读)。\nenabled=false 时行为与没有本模块完全一致。\n地址 = webhook.url(填了就用) 否则 http://<upper.host>:<upper.port><webhook.path>; upper.port=auto 时每次投递前读 CRV 的 runtime-state.json apiPort\n(CRV 重启/重装会换端口, 不能只在设备启动时读一次)。口令放进 webhook.token_headers 列出的每个请求头。\n\n设计要点(每条都是踩过或预判的坑, 改之前先读):\n 1. **绝不阻塞机械臂**: post_event() 只做 queue.put_nowait(), 微秒级返回。真正的 POST/超时/重试全在独立的送信线程里。\n    cell_server.Task.emit() 跑在机械臂执行线程上——那里同步发 HTTP, 上位机一重启机械臂就僵在格口里(3s×3次=9s)。\n 2. **单线程串行保序**: 一条发完(或彻底放弃)才发下一条。并发发会让 task_end 抢在 stored 前面到, 上位机以为任务完了账还没记全。\n 3. **幂等键 X-Event-Id = <task_id>-<seq>**, 重试时不变。上位机必须据此去重, 否则 stored 重投一次账上多一盒。\n 4. **丢了不追**: 重试耗尽就记一笔继续往下。可靠性由 GET /tasks/{id}/events?since=N 补拉兜底, 不是由这里保证。\n    队列满也是同理(直接丢+计数), 宁可丢事件也不能卡住调用方。\n 5. **任何异常都不向上抛**: 调用方是机械臂流程, 投递失败绝不能影响干活。\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport os\nimport queue\nimport threading\nimport time\nimport urllib.error\nimport urllib.request\n\n_CFG = {}\n_Q = None\n_TH = None\n_LOCK = threading.Lock()\n_ST = {\"enabled\": False, \"state\": \"disabled\", \"queued\": 0, \"sent\": 0, \"failed\": 0,\n       \"dropped\": 0, \"last_error\": \"\", \"last_ok_at\": \"\", \"inflight\": False}\n_OUT = None          # logs/webhook_out.log: 设备自己的出站流水(每次投递尝试一行), 不依赖接收端是否留了日志\n_ROOT = \"\"\n\n\ndef _out(line):\n    \"\"\"出站流水, 追加写(2026-09-22: 接收端日志被 > 覆盖后, 任务1的投递记录全丢, 设备侧 sent 计数也随服务重启归零 —— 设备必须自己留底)\"\"\"\n    global _OUT\n    try:\n        if _OUT is None and _ROOT:\n            os.makedirs(os.path.join(_ROOT, \"logs\"), exist_ok=True)\n            _OUT = open(os.path.join(_ROOT, \"logs\", \"webhook_out.log\"), \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        if _OUT is not None:\n            _OUT.write(\"[out %s] %s\\n\" % (time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\"), line)); _OUT.flush()\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\nDEFAULTS = {\"enabled\": False, \"url\": \"\", \"path\": \"\", \"token\": \"\", \"token_headers\": [\"X-Cell-Token\"], \"timeout_s\": 3.0, \"retries\": 3,\n            \"backoff_s\": 2.0, \"queue_max\": 2000,\n            \"events\": [\"stored\", \"discarded\", \"lost\", \"retrieved\", \"outbound_scanned\", \"pit_empty\",\n                       \"code_scanned\", \"stocktake\", \"needs_human\", \"fault\", \"task_end\"]}\n\n\ndef init(root, quiet=False):\n    \"\"\"读配置并(在 enabled 时)起送信线程。cell_server 启动时调一次; 配置缺失/关闭都安静返回。\"\"\"\n    global _CFG, _Q, _TH, _ROOT\n    _ROOT = root\n    cfg = dict(DEFAULTS)\n    cfg[\"_upper\"] = {}\n    try:\n        import yaml\n        for name in (\"upper_link.yaml\", \"webhook.yaml\"):   # 新文件优先; 旧 webhook.yaml 只在新文件缺失时兜底\n            path = os.path.join(root, \"config\", name)\n            if not os.path.exists(path):\n                continue\n            y = yaml.safe_load(open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\")) or {}\n            cfg[\"_upper\"] = y.get(\"upper\") or {}\n            w = y[\"webhook\"] if isinstance(y.get(\"webhook\"), dict) else y\n            cfg.update({k: v for k, v in w.items() if k in DEFAULTS})\n            cfg[\"_file\"] = \"config/\" + name\n            break\n    except Exception as e:\n        _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"配置读取失败: %s\" % str(e)[:80]\n    _CFG = cfg\n    _ST[\"enabled\"] = bool(cfg[\"enabled\"] and (cfg[\"url\"] or cfg[\"path\"]))\n    if not _ST[\"enabled\"]:\n        _ST[\"state\"] = \"disabled\"\n        if not quiet:\n            print(\"[webhook] 未启用(%s enabled=false 或地址为空), 事件仅存本地供 events?since= 拉取\" % cfg.get(\"_file\", \"config/upper_link.yaml\"), flush=True)\n        return False\n    _Q = queue.Queue(maxsize=int(cfg[\"queue_max\"]))\n    _ST[\"state\"] = \"starting\"\n    _TH = threading.Thread(target=_sender_loop, name=\"webhook-sender\", daemon=True)\n    _TH.start()\n    if not quiet:\n        print(\"[webhook] 已启用 -> %s (超时%.1fs 重试%d次 白名单%d种, 配置 %s)\"\n              % (target_url(), cfg[\"timeout_s\"], cfg[\"retries\"], len(cfg[\"events\"]), cfg.get(\"_file\")), flush=True)\n    threading.Thread(target=_ping, name=\"webhook-ping\", daemon=True).start()\n    return True\n\n\ndef _upper_port():\n    \"\"\"upper.port: 数字直接用; auto = 读 CRV runtime-state.json 的 apiPort(读不到退 8080)\"\"\"\n    up = _CFG.get(\"_upper\") or {}\n    p = up.get(\"port\", \"auto\")\n    if str(p).lower() != \"auto\":\n        return int(p)\n    try:\n        return int(json.load(open(up.get(\"crv_state_file\", \"\"), encoding=\"utf-8\"))[\"apiPort\"])\n    except Exception:\n        return 8080\n\n\ndef target_url():\n    \"\"\"当前推送目标(每次投递前现算, port=auto 时跟随 CRV 端口变化)\"\"\"\n    if _CFG.get(\"url\"):\n        return _CFG[\"url\"]\n    up = _CFG.get(\"_upper\") or {}\n    return \"http://%s:%d%s\" % (up.get(\"host\", \"127.0.0.1\"), _upper_port(), _CFG.get(\"path\", \"\"))\n\n\ndef post_event(task_id, ev):\n    \"\"\"机械臂线程调这里。只入队, 不做任何网络动作, 不抛异常。\"\"\"\n    try:\n        if not _ST[\"enabled\"] or _Q is None:\n            return\n        kind = ev.get(\"kind\")\n        if _CFG.get(\"events\") and kind not in _CFG[\"events\"]:\n            return                                    # 白名单外(card/text 等刷屏事件)不推, 对方按需用 events?since= 拉\n        item = dict(ev)\n        item[\"task_id\"] = task_id\n        _Q.put_nowait(item)\n        _ST[\"queued\"] = _Q.qsize()\n    except queue.Full:\n        with _LOCK:\n            _ST[\"dropped\"] += 1\n            _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"队列满(%d), 丢弃 seq=%s; 对方可用 events?since= 补拉\" % (_CFG.get(\"queue_max\", 0), ev.get(\"seq\"))\n    except Exception as e:\n        with _LOCK:\n            _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"入队异常: %s\" % str(e)[:80]\n\n\ndef status():\n    \"\"\"给 GET /device 用的一小段状态。\"\"\"\n    s = dict(_ST)\n    try:\n        s[\"url\"] = target_url() if _CFG else \"\"\n    except Exception:\n        s[\"url\"] = _CFG.get(\"url\", \"\")\n    # 待发条数要把\"正在发的那一条\"算进去, 否则重试期间 /device 显示 0 条, 看着像发完了其实没有\n    s[\"queued\"] = (_Q.qsize() if _Q is not None else 0) + (1 if _ST.get(\"inflight\") else 0)\n    return s\n\n\ndef _deliver(item, event_id):\n    \"\"\"发一条; 返回 (成功?, 状态码或错误文字)。只在送信线程里调。\"\"\"\n    body = json.dumps(item, ensure_ascii=False).encode(\"utf-8\")\n    req = urllib.request.Request(target_url(), data=body, method=\"POST\")\n    req.add_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json; charset=utf-8\")\n    req.add_header(\"X-Event-Id\", event_id)             # 幂等键, 重试时不变\n    if _CFG.get(\"token\"):\n        for h in (_CFG.get(\"token_headers\") or [\"X-Cell-Token\"]):\n            req.add_header(h, _CFG[\"token\"])\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=float(_CFG[\"timeout_s\"])) as r:\n            return (200 <= r.status < 300), str(r.status)\n    except urllib.error.HTTPError as e:\n        return False, \"HTTP %s\" % e.code\n    except Exception as e:\n        return False, type(e).__name__\n\n\ndef _sender_loop():\n    \"\"\"送信线程: 从队列取一条, 发到成功或放弃, 再取下一条(串行=保序)。\"\"\"\n    retries = int(_CFG[\"retries\"])\n    backoff = float(_CFG[\"backoff_s\"])\n    while True:\n        item = _Q.get()\n        _ST[\"inflight\"] = True\n        event_id = \"%s-%s\" % (item.get(\"task_id\"), item.get(\"seq\"))\n        ok, info = False, \"\"\n        for attempt in range(retries + 1):\n            t0 = time.time()\n            ok, info = _deliver(item, event_id)\n            _out(\"%s %s -> %s %.0fms attempt=%d%s\" % (event_id, item.get(\"kind\"), info, (time.time() - t0) * 1000,\n                                                      attempt + 1, \"\" if ok else \" RETRY\" if attempt < retries else \" GIVEUP\"))\n            if ok:\n                break\n            if attempt < retries:\n                time.sleep(backoff * (2 ** attempt))   # 2s, 4s, 8s\n        with _LOCK:\n            if ok:\n                _ST[\"sent\"] += 1\n                _ST[\"state\"] = \"ok\"\n                _ST[\"last_ok_at\"] = time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\")\n            else:\n                _ST[\"failed\"] += 1\n                _ST[\"state\"] = \"unauthorized\" if info == \"HTTP 401\" else \"unreachable\"\n                _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"%s 投递失败(%s), 已放弃; 对方可用 events?since= 补拉\" % (event_id, info)\n                print(\"[webhook] %s\" % _ST[\"last_error\"], flush=True)\n        _ST[\"inflight\"] = False\n        _Q.task_done()\n\n\ndef _ping():\n    \"\"\"启动自检: 发一条 kind=ping, 让 GET /device 能报出地址配错/口令不对, 而不是默默失败。\"\"\"\n    time.sleep(1.0)\n    t0 = time.time()\n    ok, info = _deliver({\"task_id\": 0, \"seq\": 0, \"kind\": \"ping\", \"t\": time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\"),\n                         \"ts\": round(time.time(), 3), \"text\": \"设备启动自检\"}, \"0-0\")\n    _out(\"0-0 ping -> %s %.0fms (startup selfcheck)\" % (info, (time.time() - t0) * 1000))\n    with _LOCK:\n        if ok:\n            _ST[\"state\"] = \"ok\"\n            _ST[\"last_ok_at\"] = time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\")\n        else:\n            _ST[\"state\"] = \"unauthorized\" if info == \"HTTP 401\" else \"unreachable\"\n            _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"启动自检失败(%s): 检查 config/upper_link.yaml 的 upper/webhook(当前目标 %s)\" % (info, target_url())\n    print(\"[webhook] 启动自检: %s (%s)\" % (\"通\" if ok else \"不通\", info), flush=True)\n","numLines":208,"startLine":1,"totalLines":208}},"displayPath":"scripts/bluespace/services/webhook.py"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fd442e9d-cbd0-45d0-ab65-c3bea7796548","timestamp":"2026-10-28T08:39:03.773Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/scripts/bluespace/services/webhook.py\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n2\t\"\"\"事件 webhook 投递(设备 → 上位机)。配置在 config/upper_link.yaml 的 webhook 段(2026-10-28 起; 旧 config/webhook.yaml 仅在新文件缺失时兜底读)。\n3\tenabled=false 时行为与没有本模块完全一致。\n4\t地址 = webhook.url(填了就用) 否则 http://<upper.host>:<upper.port><webhook.path>; upper.port=auto 时每次投递前读 CRV 的 runtime-state.json apiPort\n5\t(CRV 重启/重装会换端口, 不能只在设备启动时读一次)。口令放进 webhook.token_headers 列出的每个请求头。\n6\t\n7\t设计要点(每条都是踩过或预判的坑, 改之前先读):\n8\t 1. **绝不阻塞机械臂**: post_event() 只做 queue.put_nowait(), 微秒级返回。真正的 POST/超时/重试全在独立的送信线程里。\n9\t    cell_server.Task.emit() 跑在机械臂执行线程上——那里同步发 HTTP, 上位机一重启机械臂就僵在格口里(3s×3次=9s)。\n10\t 2. **单线程串行保序**: 一条发完(或彻底放弃)才发下一条。并发发会让 task_end 抢在 stored 前面到, 上位机以为任务完了账还没记全。\n11\t 3. **幂等键 X-Event-Id = <task_id>-<seq>**, 重试时不变。上位机必须据此去重, 否则 stored 重投一次账上多一盒。\n12\t 4. **丢了不追**: 重试耗尽就记一笔继续往下。可靠性由 GET /tasks/{id}/events?since=N 补拉兜底, 不是由这里保证。\n13\t    队列满也是同理(直接丢+计数), 宁可丢事件也不能卡住调用方。\n14\t 5. **任何异常都不向上抛**: 调用方是机械臂流程, 投递失败绝不能影响干活。\n15\t\"\"\"\n16\timport json\n17\timport os\n18\timport queue\n19\timport threading\n20\timport time\n21\timport urllib.error\n22\timport urllib.request\n23\t\n24\t_CFG = {}\n25\t_Q = None\n26\t_TH = None\n27\t_LOCK = threading.Lock()\n28\t_ST = {\"enabled\": False, \"state\": \"disabled\", \"queued\": 0, \"sent\": 0, \"failed\": 0,\n29\t       \"dropped\": 0, \"last_error\": \"\", \"last_ok_at\": \"\", \"inflight\": False}\n30\t_OUT = None          # logs/webhook_out.log: 设备自己的出站流水(每次投递尝试一行), 不依赖接收端是否留了日志\n31\t_ROOT = \"\"\n32\t\n33\t\n34\tdef _out(line):\n35\t    \"\"\"出站流水, 追加写(2026-09-22: 接收端日志被 > 覆盖后, 任务1的投递记录全丢, 设备侧 sent 计数也随服务重启归零 —— 设备必须自己留底)\"\"\"\n36\t    global _OUT\n37\t    try:\n38\t        if _OUT is None and _ROOT:\n39\t            os.makedirs(os.path.join(_ROOT, \"logs\"), exist_ok=True)\n40\t            _OUT = open(os.path.join(_ROOT, \"logs\", \"webhook_out.log\"), \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n41\t        if _OUT is not None:\n42\t            _OUT.write(\"[out %s] %s\\n\" % (time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\"), line)); _OUT.flush()\n43\t    except Exception:\n44\t        pass\n45\t\n46\tDEFAULTS = {\"enabled\": False, \"url\": \"\", \"path\": \"\", \"token\": \"\", \"token_headers\": [\"X-Cell-Token\"], \"timeout_s\": 3.0, \"retries\": 3,\n47\t            \"backoff_s\": 2.0, \"queue_max\": 2000,\n48\t            \"events\": [\"stored\", \"discarded\", \"lost\", \"retrieved\", \"outbound_scanned\", \"pit_empty\",\n49\t                       \"code_scanned\", \"stocktake\", \"needs_human\", \"fault\", \"task_end\"]}\n50\t\n51\t\n52\tdef init(root, quiet=False):\n53\t    \"\"\"读配置并(在 enabled 时)起送信线程。cell_server 启动时调一次; 配置缺失/关闭都安静返回。\"\"\"\n54\t    global _CFG, _Q, _TH, _ROOT\n55\t    _ROOT = root\n56\t    cfg = dict(DEFAULTS)\n57\t    cfg[\"_upper\"] = {}\n58\t    try:\n59\t        import yaml\n60\t        for name in (\"upper_link.yaml\", \"webhook.yaml\"):   # 新文件优先; 旧 webhook.yaml 只在新文件缺失时兜底\n61\t            path = os.path.join(root, \"config\", name)\n62\t            if not os.path.exists(path):\n63\t                continue\n64\t            y = yaml.safe_load(open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\")) or {}\n65\t            cfg[\"_upper\"] = y.get(\"upper\") or {}\n66\t            w = y[\"webhook\"] if isinstance(y.get(\"webhook\"), dict) else y\n67\t            cfg.update({k: v for k, v in w.items() if k in DEFAULTS})\n68\t            cfg[\"_file\"] = \"config/\" + name\n69\t            break\n70\t    except Exception as e:\n71\t        _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"配置读取失败: %s\" % str(e)[:80]\n72\t    _CFG = cfg\n73\t    _ST[\"enabled\"] = bool(cfg[\"enabled\"] and (cfg[\"url\"] or cfg[\"path\"]))\n74\t    if not _ST[\"enabled\"]:\n75\t        _ST[\"state\"] = \"disabled\"\n76\t        if not quiet:\n77\t            print(\"[webhook] 未启用(%s enabled=false 或地址为空), 事件仅存本地供 events?since= 拉取\" % cfg.get(\"_file\", \"config/upper_link.yaml\"), flush=True)\n78\t        return False\n79\t    _Q = queue.Queue(maxsize=int(cfg[\"queue_max\"]))\n80\t    _ST[\"state\"] = \"starting\"\n81\t    _TH = threading.Thread(target=_sender_loop, name=\"webhook-sender\", daemon=True)\n82\t    _TH.start()\n83\t    if not quiet:\n84\t        print(\"[webhook] 已启用 -> %s (超时%.1fs 重试%d次 白名单%d种, 配置 %s)\"\n85\t              % (target_url(), cfg[\"timeout_s\"], cfg[\"retries\"], len(cfg[\"events\"]), cfg.get(\"_file\")), flush=True)\n86\t    threading.Thread(target=_ping, name=\"webhook-ping\", daemon=True).start()\n87\t    return True\n88\t\n89\t\n90\tdef _upper_port():\n91\t    \"\"\"upper.port: 数字直接用; auto = 读 CRV runtime-state.json 的 apiPort(读不到退 8080)\"\"\"\n92\t    up = _CFG.get(\"_upper\") or {}\n93\t    p = up.get(\"port\", \"auto\")\n94\t    if str(p).lower() != \"auto\":\n95\t        return int(p)\n96\t    try:\n97\t        return int(json.load(open(up.get(\"crv_state_file\", \"\"), encoding=\"utf-8\"))[\"apiPort\"])\n98\t    except Exception:\n99\t        return 8080\n100\t\n101\t\n102\tdef target_url():\n103\t    \"\"\"当前推送目标(每次投递前现算, port=auto 时跟随 CRV 端口变化)\"\"\"\n104\t    if _CFG.get(\"url\"):\n105\t        return _CFG[\"url\"]\n106\t    up = _CFG.get(\"_upper\") or {}\n107\t    return \"http://%s:%d%s\" % (up.get(\"host\", \"127.0.0.1\"), _upper_port(), _CFG.get(\"path\", \"\"))\n108\t\n109\t\n110\tdef post_event(task_id, ev):\n111\t    \"\"\"机械臂线程调这里。只入队, 不做任何网络动作, 不抛异常。\"\"\"\n112\t    try:\n113\t        if not _ST[\"enabled\"] or _Q is None:\n114\t            return\n115\t        kind = ev.get(\"kind\")\n116\t        if _CFG.get(\"events\") and kind not in _CFG[\"events\"]:\n117\t            return                                    # 白名单外(card/text 等刷屏事件)不推, 对方按需用 events?since= 拉\n118\t        item = dict(ev)\n119\t        item[\"task_id\"] = task_id\n120\t        _Q.put_nowait(item)\n121\t        _ST[\"queued\"] = _Q.qsize()\n122\t    except queue.Full:\n123\t        with _LOCK:\n124\t            _ST[\"dropped\"] += 1\n125\t            _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"队列满(%d), 丢弃 seq=%s; 对方可用 events?since= 补拉\" % (_CFG.get(\"queue_max\", 0), ev.get(\"seq\"))\n126\t    except Exception as e:\n127\t        with _LOCK:\n128\t            _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"入队异常: %s\" % str(e)[:80]\n129\t\n130\t\n131\tdef status():\n132\t    \"\"\"给 GET /device 用的一小段状态。\"\"\"\n133\t    s = dict(_ST)\n134\t    try:\n135\t        s[\"url\"] = target_url() if _CFG else \"\"\n136\t    except Exception:\n137\t        s[\"url\"] = _CFG.get(\"url\", \"\")\n138\t    # 待发条数要把\"正在发的那一条\"算进去, 否则重试期间 /device 显示 0 条, 看着像发完了其实没有\n139\t    s[\"queued\"] = (_Q.qsize() if _Q is not None else 0) + (1 if _ST.get(\"inflight\") else 0)\n140\t    return s\n141\t\n142\t\n143\tdef _deliver(item, event_id):\n144\t    \"\"\"发一条; 返回 (成功?, 状态码或错误文字)。只在送信线程里调。\"\"\"\n145\t    body = json.dumps(item, ensure_ascii=False).encode(\"utf-8\")\n146\t    req = urllib.request.Request(target_url(), data=body, method=\"POST\")\n147\t    req.add_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json; charset=utf-8\")\n148\t    req.add_header(\"X-Event-Id\", event_id)             # 幂等键, 重试时不变\n149\t    if _CFG.get(\"token\"):\n150\t        for h in (_CFG.get(\"token_headers\") or [\"X-Cell-Token\"]):\n151\t            req.add_header(h, _CFG[\"token\"])\n152\t    try:\n153\t        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=float(_CFG[\"timeout_s\"])) as r:\n154\t            return (200 <= r.status < 300), str(r.status)\n155\t    except urllib.error.HTTPError as e:\n156\t        return False, \"HTTP %s\" % e.code\n157\t    except Exception as e:\n158\t        return False, type(e).__name__\n159\t\n160\t\n161\tdef _sender_loop():\n162\t    \"\"\"送信线程: 从队列取一条, 发到成功或放弃, 再取下一条(串行=保序)。\"\"\"\n163\t    retries = int(_CFG[\"retries\"])\n164\t    backoff = float(_CFG[\"backoff_s\"])\n165\t    while True:\n166\t        item = _Q.get()\n167\t        _ST[\"inflight\"] = True\n168\t        event_id = \"%s-%s\" % (item.get(\"task_id\"), item.get(\"seq\"))\n169\t        ok, info = False, \"\"\n170\t        for attempt in range(retries + 1):\n171\t            t0 = time.time()\n172\t            ok, info = _deliver(item, event_id)\n173\t            _out(\"%s %s -> %s %.0fms attempt=%d%s\" % (event_id, item.get(\"kind\"), info, (time.time() - t0) * 1000,\n174\t                                                      attempt + 1, \"\" if ok else \" RETRY\" if attempt < retries else \" GIVEUP\"))\n175\t            if ok:\n176\t                break\n177\t            if attempt < retries:\n178\t                time.sleep(backoff * (2 ** attempt))   # 2s, 4s, 8s\n179\t        with _LOCK:\n180\t            if ok:\n181\t                _ST[\"sent\"] += 1\n182\t                _ST[\"state\"] = \"ok\"\n183\t                _ST[\"last_ok_at\"] = time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\")\n184\t            else:\n185\t                _ST[\"failed\"] += 1\n186\t                _ST[\"state\"] = \"unauthorized\" if info == \"HTTP 401\" else \"unreachable\"\n187\t                _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"%s 投递失败(%s), 已放弃; 对方可用 events?since= 补拉\" % (event_id, info)\n188\t                print(\"[webhook] %s\" % _ST[\"last_error\"], flush=True)\n189\t        _ST[\"inflight\"] = False\n190\t        _Q.task_done()\n191\t\n192\t\n193\tdef _ping():\n194\t    \"\"\"启动自检: 发一条 kind=ping, 让 GET /device 能报出地址配错/口令不对, 而不是默默失败。\"\"\"\n195\t    time.sleep(1.0)\n196\t    t0 = time.time()\n197\t    ok, info = _deliver({\"task_id\": 0, \"seq\": 0, \"kind\": \"ping\", \"t\": time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\"),\n198\t                         \"ts\": round(time.time(), 3), \"text\": \"设备启动自检\"}, \"0-0\")\n199\t    _out(\"0-0 ping -> %s %.0fms (startup selfcheck)\" % (info, (time.time() - t0) * 1000))\n200\t    with _LOCK:\n201\t        if ok:\n202\t            _ST[\"state\"] = \"ok\"\n203\t            _ST[\"last_ok_at\"] = time.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\")\n204\t        else:\n205\t            _ST[\"state\"] = \"unauthorized\" if info == \"HTTP 401\" else \"unreachable\"\n206\t            _ST[\"last_error\"] = \"启动自检失败(%s): 检查 config/upper_link.yaml 的 upper/webhook(当前目标 %s)\" % (info, target_url())\n207\t    print(\"[webhook] 启动自检: %s (%s)\" % (\"通\" if ok else \"不通\", info), flush=True)\n208\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
