{"parentUuid":"40f9a3b0-cbcb-46bd-8bfd-19e325bc29a6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUPATFpQdJEZjCSTExrB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2468,"cache_read_input_tokens":84300,"output_tokens":521,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":51},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2468,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":521,"cache_read_input_tokens":84300,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2468,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2468},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6520,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"01644159-8d3e-4197-baab-99d8de8a7b15","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUPASxTx3PAnJ3qF5n9C","requestRef":"564933aa-bd01-4aae-99b2-a40970f91d41","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"cedbbd41-d526-43a1-924d-50de32e84f03","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:16:40.578Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"cedbbd41-d526-43a1-924d-50de32e84f03","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUPATFpQdJEZjCSTExrB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`config/speed_profile.yaml` 是**速度参数总表**，机械臂所有和\"快慢\"有关的数值都集中放在这一个文件里。\n\n**里面有什么**：按动作分段，每段是这个动作的速度、加速度和等待时间：\n- `fly`：在货架和桌子之间飞路径的速度\n- `place`：在格口里放盒时，伸进、下降、退出各段的速度\n- `pick`：吸盒时下探和抬起的速度\n- `detect` / `scan` / `drop` / `reset` / `retrieve`：识别、扫码、丢回、复位、出库各自的速度\n- `feeder`：上苗机的开关和串口\n\n**为什么这样放**：以前这些数散在各个代码文件里。9 月做速度优化时集中到了这里，方便\"一次只调一个、调完对比\"。每个数后面的注释都记着调过几轮、为什么退回。设备从 `robot_cell/config/` 读这份文件，`deploy_cell.sh` 部署时会同步过去。\n\n**为什么把开关放这里**：手动模式的效果就是\"限速变慢\"，所以算速度相关的设置，放这里方便你一处找到。如果你觉得它属于\"控制器设置\"、不该和速度数值混在一起，也可以单独放进一个新文件，比如 `config/arm.yaml`。\n\n你倾向放哪？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2468,"cache_read_input_tokens":84300,"output_tokens":521,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":51},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2468,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":521,"cache_read_input_tokens":84300,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2468,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2468},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"01644159-8d3e-4197-baab-99d8de8a7b15","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUPASxTx3PAnJ3qF5n9C","requestRef":"564933aa-bd01-4aae-99b2-a40970f91d41","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"016cdd41-c4ad-4355-b39e-da6b7832e54c","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:16:40.597Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b