{"parentUuid":"ba6d9f60-a348-4f7b-ac9f-98581f9bc0c6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_014spPJeiADQUtPk76p42WD5","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"978e7d61-3521-4ca3-99a0-f3e1099388e1","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:20:28.284Z","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"978e7d61-3521-4ca3-99a0-f3e1099388e1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUPTJwV9P4C2e1U66CTr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我把这个问题改好了，已经部署并重启了服务。以后开机后**不用再手动切自动模式**了。\n\n**现在的效果**：\n- 上位机下任务（上架、出库、盘点）或者按复位时，设备会先看控制器是不是手动模式。是的话就自动切成自动模式，然后再开始干活。\n- 自动切换后，任务事件里会多一条记录：\"控制器原为手动模式，已自动切到自动模式\"，事后可以追查。\n- 开机时和后台查状态时都**不会**切，避免有人正拿着示教器调试时，臂突然全速动起来。\n- 开关在 `config/speed_profile.yaml` 的 `arm.auto_opmode`，改成 `false` 就恢复成原来的人工切。\n\n**验证情况**：\n- 我在设备上单独测了切换函数，只切模式，臂没动。手动模式成功切到了自动；已经是自动时再调用，不做任何操作。\n- 重启后的服务显示：空闲、在 home、**自动模式**。现在可以直接开始测试了。\n- 还没真机验证的一点：下一次开机后，第一个任务能不能自动切过去。你明天开机时留意一下任务事件里有没有那条记录就行。\n\n**一个例外**：在 Mac 上用 `act.sh` 跑单个动作时不会自动切，还是要手动切。正常业务都走上位机，不受影响。\n\n已提交 `1cc13d0`，并推送到了 blue-space 主仓库；CLAUDE.md 也补了说明。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":106059,"output_tokens":529,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":529,"cache_read_input_tokens":106059,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b4a2c06b-6306-42c1-b4e1-86355a77a266","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUPTJcdxD8scpuHWNzrz","requestRef":"88dff890-4b77-4c58-872b-030aea91061e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5e2f0db2-daae-4664-b8e2-4e24e652030f","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:20:28.283Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc