{"parentUuid":"6a679d46-1cf7-40c8-b6c1-cbf2c9493886","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUQUGiBtkyYCcU8AsZ5J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**出库测试（任务 182）：两边通信正常。**\n\n| 通道 | 这次的情况 |\n|---|---|\n| ① CRV → 设备 调接口 | 正常。下出库任务：A-R10，横向位置 -70.0，序号 3，原因\"工作台发苗 1号工作台\"，15ms 受理 |\n| ② 设备 → CRV 推送 | 3 条都在第一次就签收了：取到货（17:32:46）、出库扫码（17:33:02）、任务结束（17:33:09），每条 12～26ms |\n| ④ 实时状态 | 连接没断，没有重连记录 |\n| CRV 报错 | 没有。17:20 之后 CRV 的日志一行都没写 |\n\n**流程**：取货 → 回 home → 扫码 → 丢回传送带，共 35 秒。扫码结果和要出库的码**一致**（`match=true`）。\n\n**顺手修了一个小问题**：我那个合成日志的工具（`webhook_trace.py`）把\"出库扫码\"这条错标成了\"不推\"，实际上它推了，CRV 也签收了。这是工具自己的显示错误，设备和 CRV 都没问题。已修正并提交（`bf6b2f1`）。\n\n**同样请你在 CRV 界面上确认**：A-R10 那一列应该少了 1 盒，出库记录里有这个码（81893040085343441676）。\n\n**还有一点值得留意**：这次扫码又用了 9.6 秒，上架那次是 6.3 秒。这次是转到第 4 面才读到码，所以慢。如果盒子总是要转好几面才扫到，以后可以单独优化。\n\n下一项可以测**退苗**。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1048,"cache_read_input_tokens":126638,"output_tokens":580,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1048,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":580,"cache_read_input_tokens":126638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1048,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1048},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"01909c15-fdeb-47fc-b449-0e6132c60e08","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUQUGLs2EDqHYNe94EGt","requestRef":"815a2129-82a6-411b-ba83-bd6c14a9cfa2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd14938d-a3f5-4580-976b-57af3e747dbc","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:33:48.050Z","advisorModel":"c