{"parentUuid":"7a8f8078-a40f-4741-a514-745b4693d15d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Fbu1yqtRPaiL7rDYEe72jf","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9ea72f9f-680a-4469-be88-3ce955b4b435","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:34:11.171Z","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"9ea72f9f-680a-4469-be88-3ce955b4b435","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUQW5gxWfnBEPvJdt4ff","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"记得。出库扫码是 **10-22** 加的，任务类型叫 `outbound`（提交 42ec9df）。\n\n**规则是\"只报不判\"**：\n- 流程：从格口取出 → 回 home → 到扫码口扫码 → 推送 `outbound_scanned` 给 CRV → 送到去处。\n- 推送的内容包括：账上应有的码（`code_expected`，CRV 下任务时给的）、实际扫到的码（`code_scanned`）、是否一致（`match`）。\n- **设备不等 CRV 回复**，码对不上也照样送出去。怎么处理不一致，由 CRV 判断。\n- 退苗用的是另一个类型 `retrieve`，取出后直接送走，不扫码。\n\n**这次任务 182 正是这样跑的**：CRV 下的是 `type=outbound`，扫码在第 4 面读到，`match=true`，推送 CRV 也签收了。所以出库扫码是正常工作的。\n\n给 CRV 开发的说明在提交 ce6e3e1 的\"出库扫码对接说明\"里。\n\n你这么问，是想改这条规则吗？比如码对不上时设备停下来、不送出去？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1642,"cache_read_input_tokens":128284,"output_tokens":406,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1642,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":406,"cache_read_input_tokens":128284,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1642},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"09adacae-1dda-4304-91e2-f0dea6aa9274","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUQW5PrB1aPoHqCYGS62","requestRef":"99ac15fc-b73b-44b6-9391-140cddfe4a56","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a9afd478-08e0-41df-8b56-3cd771c7353e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:34:11.171Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessio