{"parentUuid":"0b06a216-8a73-4be7-a1ef-ef148e18bc4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUQYUxzQ4sWiqZwNyoiT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以做。我先说改法，你同意了我再动手。\n\n**配置项**：在 `config/speed_profile.yaml` 已有的 `retrieve:`（出库）段里加一项：\n```yaml\nretrieve:\n  outbound_scan: true    # 出库是否扫码。true=扫(默认)；false=跳过扫码，取出后直接送去处\n```\n改完要重启工作站服务才生效，方法和改对接配置一样。\n\n**设成 false 后的行为**：\n- 出库和退苗走同一条路：取出 → 回 mid → 直接送到去处。不回 home，也不去扫码口。\n- 每盒大约能省 **20 秒**：扫码本身 6～10 秒，加上 mid 和 home 之间来回约 13 秒。\n- CRV 那边不用改，照样下 `type=outbound` 的任务。\n\n**有一点需要你定**：跳过扫码时，还要不要推送 `outbound_scanned`？\n- **A（我推荐）**：照样推一条，扫到的码填空，并标明\"设备配置跳过扫码\"。CRV 的出库记录还是完整的，能看出这盒没扫是因为配置，不是扫码失败。\n- **B**：不推。CRV 只会收到\"取到货\"和\"任务结束\"两条。\n\n选哪个？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1469,"cache_read_input_tokens":131500,"output_tokens":820,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":376},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1469,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":820,"cache_read_input_tokens":131500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1469,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1469},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"47afeb62-33b5-4ece-be49-d8273b43d01b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUQYUeQ7sCXrv6xTTn86","requestRef":"409c3744-189f-4111-9ffc-d231c3c37bf1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b43515f7-d706-4931-848b-fb85a4b233c8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:34:48.444Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userTy