{"parentUuid":"f1cec72d-dfda-4984-9ed6-2854370d42f0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUQeKMU92iGXKUbJP56e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E7K8VEcAWkrVafEGvQ4bae","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/出库扫码对接说明.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='''> 设备不会因为 `match: false` 改变去处或停下来，盒子已经按 `dest` 送出去了。\n'''\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old, old+'''\n## 5.1 设备配置为\"跳过扫码\"时（2026-10-28 新增）\n\n出库是否扫码可以在**设备端**配置，上位机不用改，照样下 `type=outbound`。\n\n- 配置项：设备上 `config/speed_profile.yaml` 的 `retrieve.outbound_scan`。`true` = 扫码（**默认**），`false` = 跳过扫码。改完重启工作站服务生效（桌面「设备控制台」→ 3 → 工作站服务）。\n- 跳过时的路线：取出 → mid → 直接送到去处（和退苗一样），不回 home、不去扫码口，每盒约省 20 秒。\n- 事件：**仍会推一条 `outbound_scanned`**，紧跟在 `retrieved` 后面，多一个字段 `scan_skipped: true`，`code_scanned` 和 `match` 为 `null`：\n\n```json\n{ \"kind\": \"outbound_scanned\", \"slot\": \"A-L10\", \"x_mm\": -37.2, \"index\": 3, \"dest\": \"drop\",\n  \"code_expected\": \"81002713725433697176\", \"code_scanned\": null, \"match\": null, \"scan_skipped\": true }\n```\n\n| 情况 | 含义 | 建议 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `scan_skipped: true` | 设备配置了不扫码，**不是扫码失败** | 记\"未扫码出库（设备配置）\"，不要报异常 |\n\n> 为什么照样推：上位机的出库记录保持每盒都有一条，能区分\"没扫（配置）\"和\"没扫到（`code_scanned: null` 且无 `scan_skipped`）\"。正常扫码时事件里**不带** `scan_skipped` 字段。\n''',1)\ns=s.replace('''- **每盒多约 5~9 秒**（去扫码口、四面轮询）。''','''- **每盒多约 5~9 秒**（去扫码口、四面轮询）。不需要扫码时可在设备端关掉，见 5.1。''')\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\n\np='docs/流程规则手册.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='''- **吸空**：到位没吸到 → pit_empty 事件，on_empty=skip 继续 / stop 等人。/ 账实不符。/ 2026-09-09。/ `actions/retrieve.py`\n'''\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old, old+'''- **出库扫码可关**：`type=outbound` 默认取出后到扫码口扫码、推 `outbound_scanned`（只报不判，码不对也照送）；设备端 `speed_profile.yaml retrieve.outbound_scan=false` 时跳过扫码，走退苗同款路线 格口→mid→去处（每盒约省 20s），仍推 `outbound_scanned` 但 `scan_skipped=true`、`code_scanned/match=null`。/ 用户要设备端可配、默认扫；照样推是为了上位机出库记录每盒一条，且能区分\"配置不扫\"和\"没扫到\"。/ 2026-10-28 用户定。/ `cell_server.py scan_out`、`flows/retrieve_one_box.py scan_first`、`docs/出库扫码对接说明.md` 5.1\n''',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\n\np='scripts/api_doc_classic.py'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='''match（是否一致，没读到或没给码为 null）。只报不等，不论结果都照常投放\"),'''\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old,'''match（是否一致，没读到或没给码为 null）。只报不等，不论结果都照常投放。设备配置跳过扫码（retrieve.outbound_scan=false）时取出后照样发一条，scan_skipped=true，code_scanned/match 为 null\"),''')\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\n\np='CLAUDE.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='| **流程: 出库一盒(取货→回home→丢回; 出库位定后换尾段)** |'\nassert old in s\ni=s.index(old); j=s.index('\\n',i)\nline=s[i:j]\ns=s[:j]+' **上位机出库 type=outbound 默认先扫码(只报不判, 推 outbound_scanned); 设备端 `speed_profile.yaml retrieve.outbound_scan=false` 跳过扫码(走退苗路线, 仍推 outbound_scanned 带 scan_skipped=true), 2026-10-28, 详见 docs/出库扫码对接说明.md 5.1** |'[:0]+s[j:] if False else s\n# append inside last cell: replace trailing ' |' of that line\nnewline=line[:-1].rstrip()+' / **出库扫码开关**: 上位机 type=outbound 默认取出后扫码(只报不判, 推 outbound_scanned); 设备端 `speed_profile.yaml retrieve.outbound_scan=false` 跳过扫码(走退苗路线 格口→mid→去处, 仍推 outbound_scanned 带 scan_skipped=true; 2026-10-28; 详见 docs/出库扫码对接说明.md 5.1) |'\ns=s.replace(line,newline,1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"出库扫码开关\" CLAUDE.md | cut -c1-120; /usr/bin/python3 scripts/api_doc_classic.py 2>&1 | tail -2; /usr/bin/python3 scripts/api_doc.py 2>&1 | tail -1; git status --short | grep -v \"^??\" ","description":"更新各处文档并重新生成接口文档","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1354,"cache_read_input_tokens":143429,"output_tokens":2205,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1354,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global"