{"parentUuid":"762b3f25-9276-4f6c-a5cc-3ade120fa639","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01B9BZRtLFEEaAEEPRRcenBS","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8504bef8-a474-4b34-8d27-7e8fb4102948","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:37:07.945Z","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"8504bef8-a474-4b34-8d27-7e8fb4102948","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUQisenHWLNk7nS8X5Xa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"出库扫码开关加好了，已经部署、重启了服务，也提交了。不过**\"跳过扫码\"这条路还没在真机上跑过**，需要你测一次。\n\n**怎么用**\n- 开关在设备上的 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\config\\speed_profile.yaml`，`retrieve:` 那一段里的 `outbound_scan`。\n  - `true`：扫码，这是默认值。\n  - `false`：跳过扫码。取出后经 mid 直接送去处，和退苗走同一条路线，每盒大约省 20 秒。\n- 改完要重启工作站服务才生效：打开设备控制台，选 3，再选工作站服务。\n- 跳过扫码时，照样会给 CRV 推一条 `outbound_scanned`，里面带 `scan_skipped: true`，扫到的码填空。CRV 那边不用改。\n\n**现在的状态**：开关是默认的 `true`，所以刚重启后的服务和你上一轮测试时行为完全一样。设备显示空闲、在 home、自动模式。\n\n**还没验证的**：跳过扫码时，\"直接送去处\"的路线和那条带 `scan_skipped` 的推送都没实际跑过。代码只过了语法检查。建议你出库测试时顺带测一次：\n1. 把开关改成 `false`，重启工作站服务。\n2. 在 CRV 上出库 1 盒，跑完告诉我，我去读日志核对路线和推送。\n3. 测完改回 `true`，再重启一次。\n\n**留给后续 AI 看的记录**：\n- `docs/出库扫码对接说明.md` 新增 5.1 节\"设备配置为跳过扫码时\"，有示例和上位机该怎么处理。\n- `docs/流程规则手册.md` 的出库段加了一条规则，写明谁定的、为什么、代码在哪。\n- 两份设备接口文档都重新生成了，`scan_skipped` 字段已经写进去。\n- CLAUDE.md 的能力目录里也登记了这个开关。\n\n提交号 `f6e959a`，已推送到 blue-space 主仓库。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":535,"cache_read_input_tokens":148304,"output_tokens":727,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":535,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":727,"cache_read_input_tokens":148304,"cache_creation_input_tokens":535,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":535},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"517b6922-e2b0-40c2-a3d5-977702019ae5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUQisExsB1fmHPsQ5gWF","requestRef":"57901068-d0af-4