{"parentUuid":"814d4e2a-dcd5-4cd5-9330-13aebc00c7b7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUR328m28GK6Bpc6QNBU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**跳过扫码测试（任务 183）通过。** 开关已经改回 `true`，服务已重启，设备空闲。\n\n**核对结果**\n- **没有去扫码口**：取货后直接走\"回 mid → 回 home → 丢回传送带\"。\n- **推送正常**：`retrieved` 后面紧跟一条 `outbound_scanned`，带 `scan_skipped: true`，账上的码也带上了，CRV 签收用时 31ms。3 条推送全部第一次就成功。\n- CRV 端没有报错。\n\n**有一处我之前说错了**：我原来说每盒能省约 20 秒，实际只省了 **约 7.5 秒**（35.1 → 27.6 秒），也就是扫码本身那段时间。原因是只有配了 mid 出发路径的去处（比如退苗筐 `return`）才能从 mid 直达；传送带口 `drop` 没有这条路径，所以还是要经过 home。文档、配置注释和 CLAUDE.md 里的说法都已经改正，并记下了这次实测数据（`a653875`，已推送）。\n\n下一项可以测**退苗**。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2098,"cache_read_input_tokens":153607,"output_tokens":389,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2098,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":153607,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2098,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2098},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"50b411b5-4cf4-46dc-bded-b30a75fb88ce","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUR31kSNNZppRxPQNuJ3","requestRef":"4b02f6fb-501e-449c-bf57-8bf631575b34","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6ecbd87b-e6e0-4cca-8f85-5b685ad67486","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:41:10.942Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0