{"parentUuid":"7651d588-1f86-4eb9-bc14-d541999d4dc0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURN67QLiybUqdfEBEix","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2380,"cache_read_input_tokens":165884,"output_tokens":1443,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":603},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2380,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1443,"cache_read_input_tokens":165884,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2380,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2380},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":16164,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"8a392c3d-e0ae-45db-81b6-c16c3c14220e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgURN5e8XAmQJ6KFidENN","requestRef":"eb8cf240-c99f-4b0f-abeb-be63121f6a82","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7e77622c-3f7e-4f78-9cfd-2945cce5b1d2","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:45:41.750Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"7e77622c-3f7e-4f78-9cfd-2945cce5b1d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURN67QLiybUqdfEBEix","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你看得没错，图上标的是对的。**这一列实际就是 5 盒，没有被碰过，问题出在账上的队首位置一开始就记偏了。**\n\n**证据**：查了这一列从 10-26 上架以来的全部记录。\n\n| 时间 | 事件 | 队首位置 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 10-26 13:57～14:01 | 上架 5 盒 | 536 → 511 → 486 → 461 → **436** |\n| 10-26 14:05 | 盘点 | 实测 419.1 |\n| 10-26 14:40 | 盘点 | 实测 420.9 |\n| 10-28 17:43 | 盘点（今天） | 实测 420.7 |\n\n三次盘点跨了两天，实测值都稳定在 420 左右，前后只差 2mm。所以这一列一直没动过。\n\n**原因有两层**：\n1. **上架时记的是理论值，不是实测值**。可以看到上架时的位置是每盒正好 25mm 一档，这是按盒子厚度 25mm 算出来的推进量（`actions/place.py` 里用的是规划值）。但纸盒实际每盒占约 28mm：盒子会鼓，盒与盒之间还有缝；设备学到的节距也是 27mm。5 盒累计下来就偏了约 15mm，超过了半个节距（13.5mm），判据就报成\"整列被碰动\"。另一列甲肝只有 3 盒，偏 5.5mm，还在容差内，所以判了相符。\n2. **盘点的实测值没有写回账上**。按设计，盘点判\"整列被碰动\"时，要人在上位机上点\"采纳实测\"，把账上的 436 改成 420.7。10-26 那两次盘点都没有采纳，所以每次盘点都会报同一个差异。\n\n**建议**\n- **现在**：在 CRV 上对这一列点\"采纳实测\"（如果 CRV 有这个功能）。之后再盘点就会判相符。如果 CRV 没做这个功能，需要告诉 CRV 开发补上。\n- **根治**（要不要做由你定）：上架时队首位置不再按盒子厚度推算，改成按学到的节距（约 27mm）推算，这样盒子越多也不会越偏。这只改记账用的数，不改机械臂实际放盒的动作。\n\nA-L10 和 A-L9 两个格口的盘点我也会接着看，看完一起汇报。要先做\"根治\"吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2380,"cache_read_input_tokens":165884,"output_tokens":1443,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":603},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2380,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1443,"cache_read_input_tokens":165884,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2380,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2380},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8a392c3d-e0ae-45db-81b6-c16c3c14220e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgURN5e8XAmQJ6KFidENN","requestRef":"eb8cf240-c99f-4b0f-abeb-be63121f6a82","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c38c0ad7-5e2e-4144-aedc-017496025089","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:45:41.763Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
