{"parentUuid":"51a3d71b-59be-4c3f-afa8-0522b4fab013","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURSWANV7AiUZcf9E4kA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用一句话说：**账上记的位置是\"算出来的\"，不是\"量出来的\"，盒子越多，算的和实际差得越多。**\n\n打个比方：\n- 往格口里一盒挨一盒地立放，设备记账时是这样算的：\"这盒 25mm 厚，前一盒的队首在 461，那这一盒的队首就在 461 − 25 = 436\"。\n- 但纸盒实际放进去，每盒要占约 28mm，因为盒子会鼓，盒与盒之间也有缝。\n- 每放一盒就少算约 3mm，5 盒累计下来，账上的 436 比实际的 420 差了 15mm。\n\n盘点时，相机**量到的是真实位置 420**，和账上的 436 一比，差了 15mm。差值太大，判据就以为\"这一列被人碰动了\"。\n\n所以：\n- **盒数没错**：相机数出来是 5 盒，图上标的也对。\n- **列也没被碰**：两天三次盘点都量到 420 左右。\n- **错的是账上那个 436**：它从上架那天起就偏了。\n\n**怎么解决**：在 CRV 上把这一列的位置改成量到的 420.7（\"采纳实测\"），这次就好了。以后不想再出现，就要把记账时的\"每盒 25mm\"改成按实际约 27mm 来算。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1458,"cache_read_input_tokens":168264,"output_tokens":470,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":17},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1458,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":470,"cache_read_input_tokens":168264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1458,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1458},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1ab226ac-7f06-4fb9-9f32-7ae8cc8c63a7","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgURSVdPNNj4cXfv7aoSX","requestRef":"aa04d25d-ae23-4e69-a1d0-c5cda045b0c2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6786249e-60c0-49cf-b49a-1aad51744db6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:46:31.112Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_