{"parentUuid":"e27a5b5b-654f-48ee-9f76-faf0b99c4b9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURVRg6CuQ3rMaBLuV4F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"阈值按**节距**算，不是一个固定的毫米数。这一列的节距是 27.0mm，所以：\n\n| 实测和账上的位置差 | 判定 | 这一列对应的毫米数 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 在半个节距以内 | **相符** | ≤ 13.5mm |\n| 接近整数倍节距（误差在 0.3 个节距以内） | **少了或多了几盒** | 比如 27±8mm 算少 1 盒，54±8mm 算少 2 盒 |\n| 其他情况 | **整列被碰动** | 13.5～19mm、35～46mm 等 |\n\n这次差了 15.3mm，刚好越过 13.5mm 的相符线，又不够 19mm 去算\"少 1 盒\"，所以落进了\"整列被碰动\"。\n\n两个参数在 `scripts/bluespace/calib/stocktake_core.py` 第 167～168 行：`MATCH_FRAC = 0.5`（相符线）和 `WHOLE_TOL_FRAC = 0.30`（整盒容差）。\n\n**注意**：这次的问题不在阈值，在账上的位置一开始就记偏了。光把阈值调大，只能把这一次盖过去：盒子再多放几盒，偏差会继续变大，还是会报错。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":938,"cache_read_input_tokens":170771,"output_tokens":444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":938,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":170771,"cache_creation_input_tokens":938,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":938},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cd73a452-9ac2-4b85-98aa-e8d1e3ef15a5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgURVRLjcsEHPxP5AwGTs","requestRef":"556aa426-64ad-4d12-acdd-b8f24533a63f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"85e1ff9f-fe8a-4ebf-a1b0-8d7ac97a6bc9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:47:09.203Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\ro