{"parentUuid":"89e47152-5cf1-43af-9aee-bcc0a7983fd2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURcvnF8AV3JGwTZBRaP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这盒脊灰疫苗在尺寸表里登记的是 **133 × 38 × 25mm**。立放时是一盒挨一盒地排，每盒占的就是厚度那一维，**理论值 25mm**。上架记账也是按每盒 25mm 算的：536 → 511 → 486 → 461 → 436，每次正好减 25。\n\n实际量出来的是：\n\n| 来源 | 每盒占多少 |\n|---|---|\n| 尺寸表（卡尺量的厚度） | 25mm |\n| 设备学到的节距 | 27.0mm |\n| 这次盘点：5 盒堆厚 140.4mm ÷ 5 | 28.1mm |\n\n每盒多出 2～3mm，来自纸盒鼓起和盒与盒之间的缝。5 盒累计下来，就是账上多出来的那 15mm。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":457,"cache_read_input_tokens":171709,"output_tokens":433,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":140},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":457,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":433,"cache_read_input_tokens":171709,"cache_creation_input_tokens":457,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":457},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"56b0e6e6-aede-4b26-b360-d10b7ce5e954","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgURcuy8gygGGc32XGfAT","requestRef":"16498d5b-7b1f-49db-833f-e3487859216a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ebaeedd-a6f1-442d-a756-a960a2db5da5","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:48:50.878Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
