{"parentUuid":"c82598c0-6fe0-4053-b471-5809506fbbd2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURh5s4RMLVF32Ab4gN6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"学到的节距来自一次**人工标定**，记在尺寸表 `config/sku_dims.yaml` 里，每个品种一个数。\n\n**怎么学的**（录入新品种时做一次）：\n1. 设备往一个空列里放至少 4 盒。\n2. 人确认这一列确实有几盒。\n3. 盘点时加 `--learn` 参数：相机量出整列堆了多厚，除以盒数，就是这个品种每盒实际占的厚度（含缝），写进尺寸表的 `pitch_mm`。\n\n**现在表里三个品种的情况**：\n\n| 品种 | 卡尺厚 | 学到的节距 | 样本数 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 麻腮风 | 22.4 | 22.81 | 2 次 |\n| 脊灰 Sabin | 25.0 | **26.99** | 1 次 |\n| 甲肝 | 23.0 | 27.67 | 1 次 |\n\n**目前它只用在盘点上**，比如判差了几盒、算阈值。上架记账时用的还是卡尺厚，所以才出现前面说的\"每盒按 25mm 算\"。\n\n**要注意的是**：脊灰和甲肝都只学过 1 次。纸盒每批松紧不一样，单次样本不一定有代表性：这次盘点 5 盒算出来是每盒 28.1mm，和学到的 26.99 也差了 1mm。如果改成按节距记账，最好每个品种多学几次取平均。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":174110,"output_tokens":567,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":58},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":567,"cache_read_input_tokens":174110,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7b3e5c6f-cef5-4d9b-b596-5d5e86a1e1e0","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgURh5Zgsf3d9Zy9wxorw","requestRef":"7c062536-8620-4efe-8082-5db43ee1e7a8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f3c56491-e7a5-4392-a952-6ec369c96e5c","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:49:48.975Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType"