{"parentUuid":"e3656b26-ae59-4031-86e7-94d21cafd073","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURkWQ1cwuWCVGCjvZdw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0137yvQMe5coL1ypeivPgkUU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/流程规则手册.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nanchor='- **判据二: 叠厚÷节距(粗估, 兜底)**'\nassert anchor in s\ns=s.replace(anchor,'''- **已知问题(未处理, 2026-10-28 用户定先不做): 上架记的队首是算出来的, 多盒会累积偏差**。立放 stored 事件的 `front_mm` = 规划推进量, 按尺寸表卡尺厚逐盒递减(A-R10 脊灰 536→511→…→436, 每盒正好 25), 实际每盒占 27~28mm(纸盒鼓+缝) → 5 盒偏 15mm > 半节距 13.5 → 盘点误报 shifted(盒数其实对, 两天三次实测稳定 420±1)。上位机不采纳实测就每次都报。根治两步(未做): ① 设备按已学节距 pitch_mm 记账(各品种节距现只学过 1~2 次, 先多学几次) ② CRV 在 measured_count==账上盒数时自动采纳实测 front_mm。/ `actions/place.py _front_cam`、`calib/stocktake_core.py compare_front`\n''' + anchor,1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ngit add docs/流程规则手册.md && git commit -q -m \"docs: 记录盘点已知问题(上架队首按卡尺厚推算, 多盒累积偏差致 shifted 误报; 2026-10-28 A-R10 实例, 暂不处理)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git push -q origin exp/stand-place && git log --oneline -1","description":"在规则手册记录盘点已知问题并提交"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":787,"cache_read_input_tokens":175713,"output_tokens":906,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":143},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":787,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":175713,"cache_creation_input_tokens":787,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":787},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transf