{"parentUuid":"6c93e48b-5378-499b-86b4-f30f4f841619","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgURmJxxqErTrhu4qUrKe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好，这个先不做。我把它作为\"已知问题\"记进了 `docs/流程规则手册.md` 的盘点段，写了原因和两步根治方法，以后的人或 AI 能查到（`74e21bd`）。\n\n另外两个格口的盘点也看了，都没问题：**A-L10 三列、A-L9 两列全部相符**，偏差在 -7.9～+3.8mm 之间。A-L9 被取空的那一列，CRV 账上也已经没有了，对得上。\n\n**下一步：测完剩下的控制功能。** 已经测过的有上架、出库（含跳过扫码）、退苗、盘点，还剩三项：\n\n1. **暂停 / 继续**：下一个多盒的上架任务，中途点暂停，看设备是不是放完手上这盒才停；再点继续，看能不能接着干。\n2. **立即停止（abort）**：任务进行中点立即停止，看臂停在哪里。\n3. **复位**：在立即停止之后点复位，看臂能不能原路回到 home。\n\n这三项可以连起来做一次。每项做完告诉我，我照样去读两边的日志。\n\n全部测完后，我把今天的结果整理成一份测试报告。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":176500,"output_tokens":410,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":985,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":410,"cache_read_input_tokens":176500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":985},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"85817516-baf0-4035-9829-dacdccc9a8d3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgURmJfrWmHD4Pggdzpun","requestRef":"719c94c7-0259-46e6-9b58-f957f3315fbc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ac39cdab-a945-40b3-9492-bb17869660f4","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:50:45.106Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version"