{"parentUuid":"11a1be46-2abf-4a2e-9f32-515e326dd067","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUSJLVbVBfhirKeXToQY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"测试报告已经写好并提交了：`docs/测试报告/2026-10-28 设备与CRV上位机联调测试.md`（`fa9d9f4`，已推送到 blue-space 主仓库）。\n\n**结论：10 项测试全部通过，两边通信正常。** 29 条推送都在第一次就被 CRV 签收，CRV 没有新的报错。\n\n**报告里记了 3 个待跟进的问题：**\n1. **盘点误报**：已知问题，你定了先不处理，规则手册里也记下了。\n2. **CRV 把暂停连发了两次**：建议转告 CRV 开发，给按钮加防重复点击。\n3. **等待上料时推送了 `fault`**：如果 CRV 把它显示成报警，就是误报。你在 CRV 界面上看一眼它是怎么显示的，再决定要不要改。\n\n**另外**：仓库里还有 19 个没提交的文件，是之前就有的，需要你来定：两份 PDF、盘点的原始数据、出库传送带建议图、布局导出脚本的改动。我没有动它们。\n\n**按交接计划，下一步是搭开发环境**：WSL2、ROS2、MoveIt、Foxglove 由你在 blue-space 上装，我把需要的命令整理好给你。要现在开始吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":470,"cache_read_input_tokens":190739,"output_tokens":490,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":41},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":470,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":490,"cache_read_input_tokens":190739,"cache_creation_input_tokens":470,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":470},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"442b6ceb-bdbc-421e-ad3f-4c9e4c5c949f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUSJLBzueXXAFMy52BgV","requestRef":"8f006e9c-c54a-48f9-8f9c-226a5b8545be","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e63e06fd-153f-4621-a434-23ac4a2f279b","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:57:46.616Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell