{"parentUuid":"f087749b-95c5-4b2a-8239-706d3a244d10","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"70b8d9ec-0dc6-4352-81d2-f195c25485b0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GWsKokgLswA3ABYHjV6mhg","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/服务托管.md:17:- 2026-10-23: 两个计划任务的动作改为 `wscript.exe //B //Nologo D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services\\ensure_hidden.vbs`(隐藏窗口跑同一个 ensure_services.bat), 原来每分钟在桌面闪一下黑框; 仍是 Interactive/最高权限, 扫码钩子不受影响。重建任务时动作照此填。\ndocs/服务托管.md:55:- 已知未改：扫码仍是 USB 键盘协议 + 全局钩子（锁屏/前台管理员窗口/钩子被系统摘除都会丢码）；根治要把扫码器切 USB-COM（德沃 DEWOD 7200DHS，官网同系列标 USB-COM/RS232，需设置码手册），用户暂缓。\ndocs/服务托管.md:56:- 2026-10-22 扫码: `start_scan_service.bat` 去掉末尾 `pause`(进程被杀后窗口停在'按任意键', 计划任务一直'正在运行', `schtasks /run` 不生效 → restart/看门狗都拉不起); `svc.bat restart scan` 改为先 `schtasks /end` 再 `/run`. 输出同时写 `logs\\scan_service.log`(带时间戳, 扫码超时记'钩子最后收到按键 N 秒前'). 起因: 任务111 出库扫码全空 = 键盘钩子失效(扫码器嘀了服务收不到), 重启服务即恢复.\nscripts/bluespace/services/start_scan_service.bat:2:rem scan service: must run in the desktop session (double-click, keep window open; no pause at end so schtasks /run can relaunch after a kill, output also goes to logs\\scan_service.log). Codes are also saved to storage/data/.\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/ensure_services.bat:33:powershell -NoProfile -Command \"Start-Process -FilePath 'D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services\\run_service.bat' -ArgumentList '%1' -WindowStyle Minimized\"\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/run_service.bat:15:title robot_cell %NAME%","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e6d83c3a-58f3-43ae-adfa-5f3a0cce9522","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:59:00.132Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"docs/服务托管.md:17:- 2026-10-23: 两个计划任务的动作改为 `wscript.exe //B //Nologo D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services\\ensure_hidden.vbs`(隐藏窗口跑同一个 ensure_services.bat), 原来每分钟在桌面闪一下黑框; 仍是 Interactive/最高权限, 扫码钩子不受影响。重建任务时动作照此填。\ndocs/服务托管.md:55:- 已知未改：扫码仍是 USB 键盘协议 + 全局钩子（锁屏/前台管理员窗口/钩子被系统摘除都会丢码）；根治要把扫码器切 USB-COM（德沃 DEWOD 7200DHS，官网同系列标 USB-COM/RS232，需设置码手册），用户暂缓。\ndocs/服务托管.md:56:- 2026-10-22 扫码: `start_scan_service.bat` 去掉末尾 `pause`(进程被杀后窗口停在'按任意键', 计划任务一直'正在运行', `schtasks /run` 不生效 → restart/看门狗都拉不起); `svc.bat restart scan` 改为先 `schtasks /end` 再 `/run`. 输出同时写 `logs\\scan_service.log`(带时间戳, 扫码超时记'钩子最后收到按键 N 秒前'). 起因: 任务111 出库扫码全空 = 键盘钩子失效(扫码器嘀了服务收不到), 重启服务即恢复.\nscripts/bluespace/services/start_scan_service.bat:2:rem scan service: must run in the desktop session (double-click, keep window open; no pause at end so schtasks /run can relaunch after a kill, output also goes to logs\\scan_service.log). Codes are also saved to storage/data/.\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/ensure_services.bat:33:powershell -NoProfile -Command \"Start-Process -FilePath 'D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services\\run_service.bat' -ArgumentList '%1' -WindowStyle Minimized\"\r\nscripts/bluespace/services/run_service.bat:15:title robot_cell %NAME%","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"34612d5b-1e04-472a-be0e-94a52470eb56","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":16},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f087749b-95c5-4b2a-8239-706d3a244d10","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
