{"parentUuid":"0871a6e9-58ca-4c56-8ab9-baa93b61d88e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUSQBhST6BbKrfCgez5W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这些黑色窗口就是**设备的常驻服务本身**，不是异常。**千万别关**，关掉哪个窗口，对应的服务就停了。\n\n| 窗口标题 | 是什么 |\n|---|---|\n| `robot_cell cell` | 工作站服务（8902）：CRV 下任务、查状态都走它 |\n| `robot_cell vision` | 视觉服务（8900）：相机和识别模型 |\n| `robot_cell upper` | 设备自带的简易上位机网页的后端（8903） |\n| `cmd.exe` | 大概率是扫码服务（8901），它是单独启动的，所以没带标题 |\n\n**为什么会有窗口**：开机后，计划任务看门狗会把这几个服务拉起来，每个服务跑在一个 cmd 窗口里，启动时是**最小化**的。服务被重启过（今天我重启了好几次工作站服务），或者有人点了任务栏，窗口就会显示出来。\n\n**可以改成完全隐藏**，桌面上就看不到了：\n- 工作站、视觉、上位机后端这 3 个改成隐藏窗口运行。它们的输出本来就写进了日志文件，隐藏后不影响排查问题。\n- **扫码服务建议保持现状**：它要靠桌面会话里的键盘钩子收码，以前出过钩子失效的问题，我不想冒这个险。\n- 隐藏以后就不会有人误关了。想看服务状态，用设备控制台或者看日志就行。\n\n要改成隐藏吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1033,"cache_read_input_tokens":191777,"output_tokens":868,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":342},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1033,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":868,"cache_read_input_tokens":191777,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1033,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1033},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bd7704dd-afe4-4706-876d-b0717530269c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUSQBPaVmbXniSnLK5Sd","requestRef":"9d253146-0474-47b3-b4fb-d7a26c875bf8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fe1621f1-67d8-4a00-af75-5dd23e3fc92d","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:59:09.908Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-a