{"parentUuid":"bcd8d092-0eae-4bb5-b62b-a47c167b661f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4e2d24bc-6cea-4b93-aad2-31a7a21d7e2e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FCiAV6sg6qAUWVzBuRzkDn","type":"tool_result","content":"device_console.ps1:3:# 复用: services\\svc.bat(起停服务) + 工作站接口 http://127.0.0.1:8902(/device 状态, /device/reset 复位)\r\ndevice_console.ps1:75:    & \"$CELL\\services\\svc.bat\" restart $key | Out-Null\r\nvision_server.py:7:     2026-09-14: 相机USB断开会让SDK卡死或流重启失败 → 取帧卡>25s自杀 / 重启失败即退出, 交给 run_service.bat 换新进程重连。\nvision_server.py:39:    \"\"\"相机流重启失败: 进程内没救了, 退出让 run_service.bat 换个新进程重连\"\"\"\ncell_server.py:47:    {\"name\": \"服务管理\", \"description\": \"四个常驻服务(视觉8900/扫码8901/工作站8902/上位机后端8903)的起停. 设备开机由计划任务看门狗(登录时+每5分钟)自动拉起没在听的服务; stop=放hold旗(看门狗不再拉)+杀进程, start=清旗+触发看门狗, restart=杀进程由循环5秒内拉回. 与 blu\ncell_server.py:1092:_SVC_BAT = os.path.join(ROOT, \"services\", \"svc.bat\")\ncell_server.py:1113:    output: str = Field(description=\"svc.bat 的输出(状态行)\")\ncell_server.py:1135:                    \"hold\": os.path.exists(os.path.join(ROOT, \"logs\", \"hold_%s.flag\" % name))})\ncell_server.py:1152:        if cmd != \"restart\": raise HTTPException(409, {\"error\": \"self\", \"detail\": \"工作站服务不能从接口停自己(它就是这个接口); 用命令行 services\\\\svc.bat stop cell\"})\ncell_server.py:1156:            time.sleep(0.8); print(\"[cell] restart requested via /services, exiting for run_service loop\", flush=True); os._exit(0)\ncell_server.py:1158:        return {\"ok\": True, \"name\": name, \"cmd\": cmd, \"output\": \"工作站服务 1s 后自退出, run_service.bat 循环约 5s 拉回; 轮询 /health 等它\"}\n../../cell_service.sh:7:#   ./scripts/cell_service.sh stop     # 杀远端进程(=重启: run_service.bat 5秒内拉回; 部署新代码后用)\n../../cell_service.sh:10:#   run_service.bat cell|upper 循环拉起), 与 Mac/ssh 无关, 开机即有; 详见 docs/服务托管.md\n../../cell_service.sh:43:      ssh -n -o ControlMaster=no -o ControlPath=none -o ConnectTimeout=15 \"$BS\" \"schtasks /run /tn robot_cell_services_watchdog\" >/dev/null 2>&1\n.