{"parentUuid":"0e20ebd2-899e-4a19-bdcc-fae418c91161","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUSrAhtBqq7zeHuBCikx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"安装这一步被权限检查拦下来了。原因是它要从外网下载一个程序，再在设备上注册成系统服务。我不会绕过这个拦截，需要你来决定怎么做。\n\n**这一步具体会做什么**\n1. 从 GitHub 官方发布页下载 **WinSW v2.12.0**（`WinSW-x64.exe`，开源的 Windows 服务包装工具），放到 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services\\winsw\\`。脚本会打印出文件大小和 SHA256，方便核对。\n2. 关掉现在的 3 个黑窗口：视觉、工作站、上位机后端。扫码那个窗口不动。\n3. 把这 3 个服务注册成 Windows 服务，并启动。\n4. 大约 20 秒后打印状态。\n\n执行期间设备服务会中断约 20～30 秒，现在设备是空闲的。\n\n**你可以选一种方式继续**\n- **你自己执行**：在这里的输入框里输入下面这行，输出会直接进到对话里，我接着验证：\n  ```\n  ! ssh 26293@100.106.76.91 \"powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File D:\\Destop\\robot_cell\\services\\install_services.ps1 install\"\n  ```\n- **或者**在 Claude Code 的权限设置里放行这条命令，然后让我重新执行。\n\n代码已经提交并部署到设备上了（`cf5514e`）。在安装之前，现有服务照常运行，不受影响。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":598,"cache_read_input_tokens":234121,"output_tokens":705,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":182},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":598,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":705,"cache_read_input_tokens":234121,"cache_creation_input_tokens":598,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":598},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3f8db09e-1497-4e78-aa54-f14a41778dd9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUSrAPXtwNJaDkaf3N9b","requestRef":"c8b03844-a924-404b-afc0-896ad370b59f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f14e0a75-03d4-4612-bc55-0525c95057f4","timestamp":"2026-10-28T10:04:59.934Z","advisorMode