{"parentUuid":"10c3f347-73c9-4787-9910-9e03a76b58e6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUSt6H2t3eV7tenxENDp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":507,"cache_read_input_tokens":235434,"output_tokens":578,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":67},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":507,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":235434,"cache_creation_input_tokens":507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":507},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7191,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9f6b3104-da61-4f32-803c-8a2b3ec017e1","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgUSt5sU5xAySeazFV3BZ","requestRef":"4031282c-84cf-4985-9c50-ce785ee86172","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d7792723-5460-42aa-9d9a-7eb68627d957","timestamp":"2026-10-28T10:05:26.640Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"d7792723-5460-42aa-9d9a-7eb68627d957","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUSt6H2t3eV7tenxENDp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"因为 **Windows 不能直接把 Python 脚本当成服务来运行**。\n\nWindows 服务必须会跟系统的\"服务管理器\"打招呼：启动时报告\"我起来了\"，收到停止指令时要响应。我们的 Python 脚本不会这一套。直接注册的话，系统等不到回应，30 秒后就判定启动失败。\n\n所以中间要垫一个\"翻译\"：系统跟它打交道，它再去运行我们的脚本。WinSW 就是这样一个翻译。设备上没有，所以要下载。我也查了，Python 里能做这件事的库（pywin32）设备上也没装，同样要下载。\n\n**其实有一个不用下载的办法**：用 Windows 自带的**计划任务**来做。\n- 每个服务建一个计划任务，设成\"开机时运行\"、\"以系统账户运行\"、\"不管用户是否登录都运行\"。这样也**没有窗口**，开机就启动，不需要登录桌面。\n- 自动重启照旧：服务主体脚本里本来就有循环，进程一退出，5 秒后自己拉起。再加上每分钟一次的看门狗兜底。\n- 全部用的是系统自带的功能，不往设备上装任何东西。\n\n两种办法的稳定性差不多。区别是 WinSW 是行业里的标准做法，在\"服务管理器\"里能看到、能管理；计划任务的办法要在\"任务计划程序\"里管理，没那么规范，但不用下载。\n\n你选哪种？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":507,"cache_read_input_tokens":235434,"output_tokens":578,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":67},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":507,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":235434,"cache_creation_input_tokens":507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":507},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9f6b3104-da61-4f32-803c-8a2b3ec017e1","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgUSt5sU5xAySeazFV3BZ","requestRef":"4031282c-84cf-4985-9c50-ce785ee86172","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"17b32cd3-f412-4950-8d21-3e9692f73580","timestamp":"2026-10-28T10:05:26.650Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9343acc9-1522-4f43-ad44-22eed585118b