{"parentUuid":"f7c10aec-f4a8-4050-bdfb-0bd220641f09","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVeQiC9PgYaxGJfJ3fbC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_read_input_tokens":255597,"output_tokens":639,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":639,"cache_read_input_tokens":255597,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6145,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"103ee799-65b2-44e7-acc8-e989211d0ae5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVeQhuHDZGvUsrfArFz2","requestRef":"6bdeb028-6a20-4354-80a9-b5599fa5267f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c11b8243-34b2-413d-b46b-47bd312e0548","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:17:12.402Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"c11b8243-34b2-413d-b46b-47bd312e0548","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVeQiC9PgYaxGJfJ3fbC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下一步要你先定一件事，定了我才能接着做。\n\n**待定：用哪种办法把服务改成后台运行，去掉桌面上的黑窗口**\n\n| | A. WinSW（Windows 服务） | B. 计划任务 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 要不要下载 | 要，从 GitHub 官方下载一个开源工具 | 不用，全是系统自带的功能 |\n| 黑窗口 | 没有 | 没有 |\n| 开机自启（不用登录桌面） | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 崩溃后自动重启 | Windows 自己负责，5 秒后拉起 | 脚本自己循环，5 秒后拉起 |\n| 每分钟看门狗兜底 | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 在哪里管理 | \"服务\"管理器，行业标准做法 | \"任务计划程序\" |\n\n两种办法稳定性差不多，代码我都已经准备好了一大半：\n- **选 A**：要你执行一条安装命令。上次被拦下来，就是因为这条命令要下载程序。\n- **选 B**：我把脚本改一下，用系统自带的方式注册，不需要下载，我自己就能装完。\n\n我建议选 **B**。不往设备上装第三方软件，以后交接给别人也少一样东西要解释。\n\n现在设备上 4 个服务照常运行，还是原来的窗口方式，不受影响。\n\n**这件事定了之后的计划**：\n1. 装好后验证：重启服务、杀掉进程看能不能自动拉回、重启电脑看能不能自启（重启电脑要你来安排时间）。\n2. 更新 `docs/服务托管.md`。\n3. 回到交接主线：搭开发环境（WSL2、ROS2、MoveIt、Foxglove）。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_read_input_tokens":255597,"output_tokens":639,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":639,"cache_read_input_tokens":255597,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"103ee799-65b2-44e7-acc8-e989211d0ae5","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVeQhuHDZGvUsrfArFz2","requestRef":"6bdeb028-6a20-4354-80a9-b5599fa5267f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"aae7846e-c1fc-4745-8dad-6a9eb9eb06da","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:17:12.415Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-