{"parentUuid":"7364232b-852a-4c65-8692-1f6eecc0ed3d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVems2YZjhnzQfaNuZNG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":387,"cache_read_input_tokens":260321,"output_tokens":1078,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":334},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":387,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":260321,"cache_creation_input_tokens":387,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":387},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11708,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"4c05e46b-ed88-4ced-b82a-3fb07eb1ab6f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVemrhCTcXJ4U7pVdsj7","requestRef":"21d69123-de19-4dea-ac2d-316c1323271a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5e313e2b-0a1f-4b2c-a041-5f64b3cbad1b","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:22:07.878Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"5e313e2b-0a1f-4b2c-a041-5f64b3cbad1b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVems2YZjhnzQfaNuZNG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**blue-space 现在连不上**。网络工具显示它最后一次在线是 **11 小时前**，现在 ping 也不通。可能是电脑关机了、睡眠了，或者网络断了。请你到现场看一下：开机，或者唤醒电脑，并确认已经联网。连上以后告诉我，我再接着装。\n\n**关于扫码服务的窗口，我更正一下前面的说法：窗口其实可以去掉，只是不能改成 Windows 服务。**\n\n原因是这样的：\n- 我们的扫码器是\"模拟键盘\"的，扫到码就像有人在键盘上把码敲了一遍。\n- Windows 只把键盘输入送给**当前登录的桌面**。Windows 服务运行在后台的另一个\"隔离区\"里，收不到这些按键。所以扫码服务必须运行在登录后的桌面上，没法变成服务。\n- 但**运行在桌面上**不等于**必须有窗口**。它可以在桌面里隐藏运行，照样能收到按键。看门狗现在就是这样隐藏运行的。\n\n所以扫码服务也可以去掉窗口，代价有两个：\n1. 它仍然**必须先登录桌面**才能运行，开机后如果没人登录，就扫不了码。可以把 blue-space 设成开机自动登录来解决。\n2. 隐藏以后要实测一下，确认扫码还正常。以前这个服务出过\"收不到码\"的问题，所以我之前想保守一点，没去碰它。\n\n**根治办法**是把扫码器切到**串口模式**：扫码器不再冒充键盘，而是像普通设备一样通过串口传数据。这样扫码服务也能改成 Windows 服务，不用登录，也不怕锁屏、不怕被别的窗口抢走按键。只需要你用扫码器说明书里的设置码扫一下，代码由我来改。\n\n我的建议：\n- 这次先把**扫码窗口隐藏掉**，跟另外 3 个服务一起做，做完桌面上就一个黑窗口都没有了。\n- 扫码器切串口模式，作为后续的改进。\n\n可以吗？blue-space 连上后我就开始。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":387,"cache_read_input_tokens":260321,"output_tokens":1078,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":334},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":387,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":260321,"cache_creation_input_tokens":387,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":387},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4c05e46b-ed88-4ced-b82a-3fb07eb1ab6f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVemrhCTcXJ4U7pVdsj7","requestRef":"21d69123-de19-4dea-ac2d-316c1323271a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4a9b9964-c40d-4205-b4ef-50ae8df747fe","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:22:07.893Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
