{"parentUuid":"8da54049-ddc2-4f4d-9a13-e79b3746fa48","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVfUr5t2SfvFkbQoiXHT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WGFDRH3rQh2P44N87xrXjD","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='ssh-controlmaster-hosting-pitfall.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns=s.replace('description: blue-space四服务(8900~8903)已改本机计划任务看门狗托管(2026-09-10); Mac侧只发schtasks /run, 勿经ssh直接拉进程(随会话死/stdout断→全站500), 托管ssh勿走ControlMaster',\n 'description: blue-space服务托管: 2026-10-29起视觉/工作站/上位机后端=Windows服务(WinSW, 无窗口/开机不登录/退出5s系统重启), 扫码仍计划任务; 勿经ssh直接拉进程; 历史坑汇总',1)\ns+='''\n**2026-10-29 改为 Windows 服务(现行)**: 用户嫌桌面黑窗口\"不是成熟产品\", 要\"工业软件标准做法\"\"足够稳定\". vision/cell/upper → WinSW v2.12.0 服务 RobotCellVision/Cell/Upper(LocalSystem, Session 0, Automatic), 主体 `services\\\\svc_run.bat <name>`: python 怎么结束都 exit 1(→SCM 5s 重启, 不限次), 有 hold 旗才 exit 0(服务停住); 看门狗照旧每分钟探活, 端口不在就 `sc start`. 安装 `services\\\\install_services.ps1 install|uninstall|status`(一条命令). **自动模式分类器会拦\"下载 WinSW 并安装\"**, 要用户自己 `! ssh ... install`. 普通权限窗口杀不动系统账户进程 → 设备控制台重启改走 `POST /services/<名>/restart`. 相机/CUDA 在系统账户下正常(实测). 扫码不能做服务(键盘钩子只在登录桌面会话), 可隐藏窗口, 根治仍是 USB-COM. 待用户: 重启电脑不登录验证自启. 详见 docs/服务托管.md 开头\"现状\".\n'''\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\np='MEMORY.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns=s.replace('- [服务托管定案与ssh托管坑](ssh-controlmaster-hosting-pitfall.md) — 四服务由blue-space本机计划任务看门狗托管(2026-09-10), Mac只发schtasks /run; 经ssh拉的进程随会话死; 2026-09-14加固: probe探活/1分钟/重复循环保险/bat CRLF+ASCII+标签不带%1; 扫码钩子根治=切USB-COM',\n '- [服务托管定案与ssh托管坑](ssh-controlmaster-hosting-pitfall.md) — 2026-10-29起视觉/工作站/上位机后端=Windows服务(WinSW), 扫码仍计划任务; 看门狗每分钟探活; 装服务需用户自己执行; 扫码钩子根治=切USB-COM',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"服务托管\" MEMORY.md","description":"更新服务托管记忆"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,