{"parentUuid":"51625148-1596-4c3d-856d-1b775acf6a82","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01F4tzxyt7jiJ7qC2sqEGFaX","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"97054d70-c6dd-4824-b9a7-1acc555143f3","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:37:15.769Z","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"97054d70-c6dd-4824-b9a7-1acc555143f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVfwMSh2KKLgSpymtsuw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"新版控制台已经做好，扫码服务也改成在后台隐藏运行了。按理说**桌面上已经一个黑窗口都没有了**。下面这两件事要你在 blue-space 现场确认：\n\n**1. 打开新控制台看看效果**\n桌面上多了一个图标 **「设备控制台(新版)」**，双击打开。窗口里有：\n- **服务**：4 个服务各一行，带绿/红指示灯和\"重启\"按钮，最下面一行显示 CRV 是否在运行。\n- **机械臂**：状态、控制器、位置、手上有没有货、仿真还是真实模式、当前任务、事件推送。\n- **按钮**：重启全部服务、机械臂复位（要输入\"是\"确认）、打开设备网页、接口调试。\n- **下方标签页**：扫码记录（实时）、工作站 / 视觉 / 扫码 / 上位机后端 / 看门狗的日志。\n\n我在设备上测过：数据都能正确读出来，4 个服务都显示\"运行中\"。\n\n**2. 扫码测试（关键）**\n扫码服务改成隐藏运行后，需要确认它还能收到码。请拿扫码器扫一下任意一盒的追溯码，看新控制台\"扫码记录\"标签页里有没有马上出现这个码。\n\n**另外帮我看两点**：\n- 桌面和任务栏上还有没有黑窗口？\n- 新控制台的界面你觉得怎么样，需要调整哪里？\n\n确认没问题后，我再把桌面上原来的「设备控制台」换成新版，旧版留作备用；然后更新文档。如果扫码收不到，原来的启动方式我已经备份了，可以马上恢复。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":313139,"output_tokens":584,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":584,"cache_read_input_tokens":313139,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1ffc8662-29cf-4857-9a6e-2ef37f2171ff","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVfwM6rx4XS4abugUxRy","requestRef":"a2534f96-9728-4788-8b97-88a83bd3e032","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"899b9260-dc43-40ab-9e63-1408def465ab","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:37:15.768Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id