{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv","lastSequenceNum":13639,"ownerAccountUuid":"b6adc3b5-c8e6-4193-9c5d-b3a726cd6f86","ownerOrganizationUuid":"ac90d4f7-a6f0-44de-95bc-eed28854da0d"}
{"parentUuid":"5af328a3-0905-4646-9b0a-dfa75676778a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVgHaUap8v5W4THnN9jB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不需要。**控制台只是一个\"查看和操作的窗口\"，平时关着也完全不影响设备工作。**\n\n- 4 个服务都在后台自己运行：视觉、工作站、上位机后端是 Windows 服务，扫码在后台隐藏运行。它们不依赖控制台，开机就有，挂了也会自动拉起。\n- 正常干活都走 CRV：上架、出库、盘点都在 CRV 上操作，跟控制台无关。\n- 控制台关掉，就只是看不到状态了，设备照常运行。\n\n**什么时候打开它**\n- 想确认设备是否一切正常，比如开机后看一眼服务是不是都绿灯。\n- 出了问题：CRV 报设备连不上、扫码没反应、机械臂停在半路，打开看状态、重启服务、做复位。\n- 想看扫码记录或日志，排查问题。\n\n看完直接关掉就行，下次需要再打开。它不会打开第二份，重复双击只会提示\"已经打开了\"。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":494,"cache_read_input_tokens":319016,"output_tokens":347,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":494,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":347,"cache_read_input_tokens":319016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":494,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":494},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7ca29433-86e3-4f63-86b8-ae88f0d45fcb","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVgHZrcymUKGBeM3tFNn","requestRef":"57fe1d9b-f19d-4c74-bea0-8a0aee54c032","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1c550118-399c-4818-bf79-8c61e26ed23d","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:41:50.749Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
