''**扫码窗口隐藏(2026-10-29)**: 计划任务 `scan_service` 动作改为 `wscript.exe //B //Nologo D:\\\\Destop\\\\robot_cell\\\\services\\\\scan_hidden.vbs`(隐藏窗口跑 start_scan_service.bat, 与看门狗的 ensure_hidden.vbs 同法)。任务定义存档 `scripts/bluespace/services/tasks/scan_service.xml`(重建: `schtasks /create /tn scan_service /xml <该文件> /f`, InteractiveToken 不需密码); 改前原定义备份在设备 `logs\\\\scan_task_backup_20261029.xml`。实测隐藏后进程在 Session 1(python ← cmd ← wscript), 用户扫两盒 09:37:33/09:37:53 都收到。看实时扫码: 设备控制台\"扫码记录\"页。\n\n### 设备控制台(图形界面, 2026-10-29)\n桌面「设备控制台」= `pythonw services\\\\console_gui.py`。它**不托管任何服务**, 只看状态和发操作, 平时不用开着。查端口用 netstat 监听表 —— ⚠ 不要 connect 扫码/视觉端口探活(单线程, 空连接刷 `unknown cmd` 并可能和任务抢连接, 首版踩过)。重启走工作站接口; 接口不通时退回 `svc.bat start`。旧 PowerShell 菜单版 `device_console.ps1` 保留, 快捷方式在 `D:\\\\项目资料\\\\常用软件快捷方式\\\\设备控制台(旧版-命令行).lnk`。\n\n### 验收(2026-10-29)''',1)\ns=s.replace('- [ ] **重启电脑后不登录**, 三服务自动运行(待用户安排重启)','- [x] 扫码隐藏运行后真实扫码两次都收到; 桌面黑窗口 0 个(待用户目视最终确认)\\n- [ ] **重启电脑后不登录**, 三服务自动运行; 登录后扫码服务自动起来(待用户安排重启)',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ngit add CLAUDE.md docs/服务托管.md && git commit -q -m \"docs: 设备控制台换图形界面版、扫码隐藏运行; 记录快捷方式迁移与任务定义存档\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git push -q origin exp/stand-place && git log --oneline -1","description":"更新能力目录和服务托管文档并提交"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1407,"cache_read_input_tokens":319888,"output_tokens":2420,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":76},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1407,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2420,"cache_read_input_tokens":319888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1407,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"e