{"parentUuid":"97e069b6-662e-4aae-b16d-bb5d4829ccc6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVgP8BDKV6mNjdRGmJDC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"快捷方式已经换好，文档也已同步。为了方便以后优化和排查问题，我再在 `docs/服务托管.md` 里补两节：\"出问题怎么查\"和\"待优化清单\"。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2575,"cache_read_input_tokens":321295,"output_tokens":2198,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":111},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2575,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2198,"cache_read_input_tokens":321295,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2575},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6374c08b-2ff2-47bc-b93c-2a47c0ad2353","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVgP7dxZhwMfrbk4W1cF","requestRef":"302179b9-67eb-462d-b8d3-810afacf770a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"746c251b-a3c9-41ca-8d7b-4419f2c08df0","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:43:00.954Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"746c251b-a3c9-41ca-8d7b-4419f2c08df0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVgP8BDKV6mNjdRGmJDC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NpwoSVjSMMZQLYJzrp7pm8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/服务托管.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\na='''---\n\n# 历史: 2026-09-10 定稿'''\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,'''### 出问题怎么查(按症状)\n| 症状 | 先看哪里 | 怎么处理 |\n|---|---|---|\n| CRV 报设备连不上 / 控制台\"读不到\" | 控制台服务面板; `svc.sh status`(看 `[service ...]`); `logs\\\\cell_service.log` 末尾 | 控制台点重启; 仍不行看 `logs\\\\winsw\\\\RobotCellCell.*.log`(服务启停记录)和系统\"事件查看器→Windows 日志→系统\"里 Service Control Manager 的报错 |\n| 某服务反复重启 | `logs\\\\<名>_service.log` 里成串的 `exited rc=... / windows will restart` | 看每次退出前的 Traceback; 视觉常见是相机 USB(见 camera-stream-stall 记忆) |\n| 服务停着不起来 | `logs\\\\hold_<名>.flag` 是否存在(控制台显示\"已手动停止\") | `svc.sh start <名>` 清旗; 有旗时服务设计上就保持停止 |\n| 卡死(端口在, 不干活) | `logs\\\\ensure.log` 有没有 `no response twice, killing` | 看门狗 1 分钟内会自动处理; 频繁出现就查该服务日志 |\n| 扫码没反应 | 控制台\"扫码记录\"页: 扫一下有没有新行 | 没有新行 = 钩子收不到(锁屏? 未登录?), 控制台重启扫码服务; 有新行但任务说没码 = 看 cell 日志的扫码卡片 |\n| 开机后什么都没有 | 先看是否登录了桌面(扫码要登录); `install_services.ps1 status` | 三个 Windows 服务应 Running/Automatic; 不是就 `install_services.ps1 install` 重装 |\n| 改了代码不生效 | 服务是常驻进程, 内存里是旧代码 | `deploy_cell.sh` 后 `svc.sh restart <名>`; 改了 `winsw\\\\*.xml` 要 `install_services.ps1 uninstall` + `install` |\n| 想回到老的窗口方式 | — | `install_services.ps1 uninstall`(看门狗自动退回 run_service.bat 窗口); 扫码: `schtasks /create /tn scan_service /xml logs\\\\scan_task_backup_20261029.xml /f` |\n\n日志位置一览(设备 `D:\\\\Destop\\\\robot_cell\\\\logs\\\\`): `<名>_service.log`(各服务输出, 追加) / `winsw\\\\`(服务启停) / `ensure.log`(看门狗动作) / `webhook_out.log`(推送流水) / `tasks\\\\<号>.jsonl`(任务事件)。\n\n### 待优化(未做, 按价值排)\n1. **扫码器切 USB-COM 串口模式** → 扫码也做成 Windows 服务, 不再依赖登录桌面/怕锁屏/怕钩子被摘。需用户扫设置码(德沃 DEWOD 7200DHS), 代码改读串口。\n2. **blue-space 开机自动登录 + 关自动锁屏**(在 1 做完前的权宜): 断电重启后无人值守也能扫码。属系统设置, 用户自己改。\n3. **日志滚动**: `<名>_service.log` 只在扫码服务启动时 >5MB 转存, 其余一直追加; 长期运行要加按大小滚动。\n4. **控制台加\"开机自启/托盘\"**: 目前按需打开即可, 暂不需要。\n5. **服务以专用低权限账户运行**: 现为 LocalSystem(权限大); 换账户需在服务里填密码, 交接后视安全要求再定。\n\n---\n\n# 历史: 2026-09-10 定稿''',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='ssh-controlmaster-hosting-pitfall.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns+='''\n**2026-10-29 续**: 扫码改隐藏窗口(任务动作 wscript scan_hidden.vbs, 实测钩子照常收码). 桌面控制台换 tkinter 图形版 console_gui.py(pythonw, 平时不必开). ⚠ 坑: 控制台首版每 2 秒 connect 8901/8900 探活 → 单线程服务日志刷 \"unknown cmd\" 且可能抢任务连接; 改查 netstat 监听表. 探活别连单线程服务. 排查表/待优化清单在 docs/服务托管.md.\n'''\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && git add docs/服务托管.md && git commit -q -m \"docs: 服务托管补'出问题怎么查'症状表、日志位置、回退方法与待优化清单\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git push -q origin exp/stand-place && git log --oneline -1","description":"补充排查表与待优化清单并更新记忆"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2575,"cache_read_input_tokens":321295,"output_tokens":2198,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":111},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2575,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2198,"cache_read_input_tokens":321295,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2575},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01NpwoSVjSMMZQLYJzrp7pm8":{"command":"cd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/服务托管.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\na='''---\n\n# 历史: 2026-09-10 定稿'''\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,'''### 出问题怎么查(按症状)\n| 症状 | 先看哪里 | 怎么处理 |\n|---|---|---|\n| CRV 报设备连不上 / 控制台\"读不到\" | 控制台服务面板; `svc.sh status`(看 `[service ...]`); `logs\\\\cell_service.log` 末尾 | 控制台点重启; 仍不行看 `logs\\\\winsw\\\\RobotCellCell.*.log`(服务启停记录)和系统\"事件查看器→Windows 日志→系统\"里 Service Control Manager 的报错 |\n| 某服务反复重启 | `logs\\\\<名>_service.log` 里成串的 `exited rc=... / windows will restart` | 看每次退出前的 Traceback; 视觉常见是相机 USB(见 camera-stream-stall 记忆) |\n| 服务停着不起来 | `logs\\\\hold_<名>.flag` 是否存在(控制台显示\"已手动停止\") | `svc.sh start <名>` 清旗; 有旗时服务设计上就保持停止 |\n| 卡死(端口在, 不干活) | `logs\\\\ensure.log` 有没有 `no response twice, killing` | 看门狗 1 分钟内会自动处理; 频繁出现就查该服务日志 |\n| 扫码没反应 | 控制台\"扫码记录\"页: 扫一下有没有新行 | 没有新行 = 钩子收不到(锁屏? 未登录?), 控制台重启扫码服务; 有新行但任务说没码 = 看 cell 日志的扫码卡片 |\n| 开机后什么都没有 | 先看是否登录了桌面(扫码要登录); `install_services.ps1 status` | 三个 Windows 服务应 Running/Automatic; 不是就 `install_services.ps1 install` 重装 |\n| 改了代码不生效 | 服务是常驻进程, 内存里是旧代码 | `deploy_cell.sh` 后 `svc.sh restart <名>`; 改了 `winsw\\\\*.xml` 要 `install_services.ps1 uninstall` + `install` |\n| 想回到老的窗口方式 | — | `install_services.ps1 uninstall`(看门狗自动退回 run_service.bat 窗口); 扫码: `schtasks /create /tn scan_service /xml logs\\\\scan_task_backup_20261029.xml /f` |\n\n日志位置一览(设备 `D:\\\\Destop\\\\robot_cell\\\\logs\\\\`): `<名>_service.log`(各服务输出, 追加) / `winsw\\\\`(服务启停) / `ensure.log`(看门狗动作) / `webhook_out.log`(推送流水) / `tasks\\\\<号>.jsonl`(任务事件)。\n\n### 待优化(未做, 按价值排)\n1. **扫码器切 USB-COM 串口模式** → 扫码也做成 Windows 服务, 不再依赖登录桌面/怕锁屏/怕钩子被摘。需用户扫设置码(德沃 DEWOD 7200DHS), 代码改读串口。\n2. **blue-space 开机自动登录 + 关自动锁屏**(在 1 做完前的权宜): 断电重启后无人值守也能扫码。属系统设置, 用户自己改。\n3. **日志滚动**: `<名>_service.log` 只在扫码服务启动时 >5MB 转存, 其余一直追加; 长期运行要加按大小滚动。\n4. **控制台加\"开机自启/托盘\"**: 目前按需打开即可, 暂不需要。\n5. **服务以专用低权限账户运行**: 现为 LocalSystem(权限大); 换账户需在服务里填密码, 交接后视安全要求再定。\n\n---\n\n# 历史: 2026-09-10 定稿''',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='ssh-controlmaster-hosting-pitfall.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns+='''\n**2026-10-29 续**: 扫码改隐藏窗口(任务动作 wscript scan_hidden.vbs, 实测钩子照常收码). 桌面控制台换 tkinter 图形版 console_gui.py(pythonw, 平时不必开). ⚠ 坑: 控制台首版每 2 秒 connect 8901/8900 探活 → 单线程服务日志刷 \"unknown cmd\" 且可能抢任务连接; 改查 netstat 监听表. 探活别连单线程服务. 排查表/待优化清单在 docs/服务托管.md.\n'''\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter && git add docs/服务托管.md && git commit -q -m \"docs: 服务托管补'出问题怎么查'症状表、日志位置、回退方法与待优化清单\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git push -q origin exp/stand-place && git log --oneline -1","description":"补充排查表与待优化清单并更新记忆"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01NpwoSVjSMMZQLYJzrp7pm8":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"6374c08b-2ff2-47bc-b93c-2a47c0ad2353","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgVgP7dxZhwMfrbk4W1cF","requestRef":"302179b9-67eb-462d-b8d3-810afacf770a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b48114ef-43b0-43e3-a46b-c6a2cfd2009d","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:43:22.054Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
