{"parentUuid":"6c25bb9e-7635-4ea5-b1ec-25f6671bb1a4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVgvjtA5xh1eSZQAdUqL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":330509,"output_tokens":697,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":169},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":330509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8240,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"e352e1ff-02dc-44cb-9c95-7fd5459867cb","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVgvja3nhxCYJ65qXepU","requestRef":"b3ae612c-3eff-4ce0-b4ec-cc75a2874878","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b871f9cc-7db5-459b-b5aa-457a704cd569","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:50:15.611Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"b871f9cc-7db5-459b-b5aa-457a704cd569","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVgvjtA5xh1eSZQAdUqL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能读到。**原因是开机顺序：设备服务比 CRV 先启动，自检的时候 CRV 还没起来。**\n\n| 时间 | 发生了什么 |\n|---|---|\n| 09:46:29 | 设备服务开机自启 |\n| 09:46:34 | 设备启动时发了一条自检推送，这时 CRV 还没打开，所以失败 |\n| 之后 | CRV 起来了，现在已经能连通（我刚测过，8080 端口在运行，推送地址也有响应） |\n\n控制台还显示\"异常\"，是因为设备**只在启动时自检一次**。之后要等到真有事件推送成功，状态才会变回\"正常\"。所以现在显示的是**开机那一刻的旧状态**，不是现在的真实情况。\n\n**有什么影响**：**对业务没有影响**。\n- 下一个事件（比如你马上要做的上架）会正常推到 CRV，推成功后状态自动变回\"正常\"。\n- 就算推送真的失败，CRV 也会通过\"补拉事件\"拿到，账不会丢。\n\n**但它会误导人**：以后每次开机都会这样，现场的人看到\"异常\"会以为出了问题。\n\n**建议改一下**：推送状态不正常时，设备每 30 秒自动重新检查一次，连上了就马上变回\"正常\"。这样开机后等 CRV 打开，最多 30 秒状态就会恢复。改动很小，只涉及推送模块。\n\n要改吗？你可以先做上架测试，测完了我再改；上架本身不受影响。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":330509,"output_tokens":697,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":169},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":330509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e352e1ff-02dc-44cb-9c95-7fd5459867cb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVgvja3nhxCYJ65qXepU","requestRef":"b3ae612c-3eff-4ce0-b4ec-cc75a2874878","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ccb21927-797a-444f-9550-d08e6d0bc537","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:50:15.621Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4