{"parentUuid":"7003f05c-f3f1-4a07-8d08-4bb15b90de7c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVh6dE6YfynjobQ4PygF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**这次上架通过，改成 Windows 服务后整条流程都正常。**\n\n**三个重点**\n1. **自动切模式生效了** ✅：任务一开始，事件里就记了\"控制器原为手动模式，已自动切到自动模式\"，现在控制器是自动模式。\n2. **流程正常** ✅：识别 → 吸取 → 扫码（3.2 秒）→ CRV 排位 → 放进 A-L9（横向位置 -257.6，序号 12）→ 回 home，一盒用了 45.7 秒，其中包括开头等你放盒的约 15 秒。相机、扫码在系统账户下都没问题。\n3. **推送正常** ✅：4 条推送都在第一次就签收了，控制台上的推送状态也已经变回\"正常\"（09:52:17）。所以开机后显示的\"异常\"，确实是开机那一刻的旧状态。\n\n**发现一个小问题**：你在 09:51:47 点了停止，但设备当时正在等放盒，一直等到 30 秒超时（09:52:17）才结束，**停止没有立刻生效**。昨天的任务 189 也是这样，我当时以为是巧合，现在看是个规律：等放盒的时候，设备没有去检查停止指令。\n\n**有两处可以改**，都很小：\n1. **停止要立刻打断\"等放盒\"**：在等待循环里加上对停止指令的检查。\n2. **推送状态自动恢复**：状态不正常时每 30 秒重新检查一次，开机后 CRV 一打开，最多 30 秒就显示\"正常\"。\n\n两个一起改吗？改完我先在不动机械臂的情况下验证，再等设备空闲时重启工作站服务。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2914,"cache_read_input_tokens":332245,"output_tokens":741,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":158},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2914,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":332245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2914,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2914},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f2bd7d94-f705-49af-9722-a3f18df2a0b5","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVh6csWRw8KEfqqtYCz7","requestRef":"bd4b4179-abad-4dd4-a84e-99abb34b5ea9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a5bf6e42-256a-48a3-a8bb-38c4ae6944f6","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:52:28.900Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium"