{"parentUuid":"33d135d6-9cbd-4c63-9c35-e423c6badb40","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVhMMibacoinbrg6Mak6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GsFej1N1L7UdzakYGAm6zc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/上位机对接配置说明.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\na='| 控制台\"事件推送: 异常 unreachable\" | 地址不通: 看\"推送到\"的地址对不对, CRV 是否开着 |'\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,'| 控制台\"事件推送: 异常 unreachable\" | 地址不通: 看\"推送到\"的地址对不对, CRV 是否开着。**开机后短暂显示异常是正常的**: 设备服务开机即启动, 总比 CRV 早; 2026-10-29 起状态不正常时设备每 30 秒自动重检一次, CRV 打开后最多 30 秒变回\"正常\"(重检记在 webhook_out.log, 只记结果变化)。CRV 已打开超过 1 分钟仍异常, 才是真有问题 |',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\n\np='docs/流程规则手册.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\na='## 出库 / 退苗'\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,'''## 任务控制\n\n- **停止=盒间生效, 但\"等人放盒\"时立刻生效**：`POST /tasks/{id}/stop` 后手上这盒照常做完才结束；若此刻臂在 home 空手等人放盒(feed=manual 桌上无盒/摆不正)，立即结束，`task_end reason=stopped`。/ 原来等待循环只看\"立即停止\"不看\"停止\"，停止后还要等满 `table_empty_s`(默认 30s)才结束且原因记成 table_empty，任务 189/191 实测；接口说明本就写\"等人中调用=直接结束\"。/ 2026-10-29。/ `flows/store_one_box.py _wait_for_box`、`cell_server.py stop_task`。上苗机送料等待(feed=auto)未改，仍盒间生效。\n\n## 出库 / 退苗''',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\ngit add docs/上位机对接配置说明.md docs/流程规则手册.md scripts/bluespace/services/webhook.py scripts/bluespace/services/cell_server.py scripts/bluespace/flows/store_one_box.py && git commit -q -m \"fix: 停止指令立即打断'等人放盒'(原要等满30s且原因记成table_empty); 推送状态异常时每30秒自动重检(开机设备先于CRV启动不再一直显示异常); 同步规则手册与对接说明\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git push -q origin exp/stand-place && git log --oneline -1","description":"记录规则与排查说明并提交"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1089,"cache_read_input_tokens":348096,"output_tokens":1089,