t 事件、臂空手安全回 home、账不记、任务继续下一盒；放置吹开前也核一次，丢了不吹原路退回。/ 长盒扫中柱掉落后被空放并记假账。/ 2026-09-17。/ `flows/store_one_box.Flow.card/_lost`, `stand_slot` 吹开前, `cell_server on_text/Stop`"," ","+## 任务控制","+","+- **停止=盒间生效, 但\"等人放盒\"时立刻生效**：`POST /tasks/{id}/stop` 后手上这盒照常做完才结束；若此刻臂在 home 空手等人放盒(feed=manual 桌上无盒/摆不正)，立即结束，`task_end reason=stopped`。/ 原来等待循环只看\"立即停止\"不看\"停止\"，停止后还要等满 `table_empty_s`(默认 30s)才结束且原因记成 table_empty，任务 189/191 实测；接口说明本就写\"等人中调用=直接结束\"。/ 2026-10-29。/ `flows/store_one_box.py _wait_for_box`、`cell_server.py stop_task`。上苗机送料等待(feed=auto)未改，仍盒间生效。","+"," ## 出库 / 退苗"," - **只取队首**：同列只能取序号最大的盒；同一任务里同列按序号从大到小连续。/ 立放一队，里面的取不到。/ 2026-09-15。/ `ledger.js isHeadSegment/orderForRetrieve`"," - **近效期先出**：按效期排批号，同列同批号连取，换批号即停。/ 业务。/ 2026-09-16。/ `ledger.js pickForOutbound`"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/上位机对接配置说明.md","/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter/docs/流程规则手册.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"db22fc41-b96e-4476-a40e-fbe176e1ad33","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","root":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":7,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":16},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/chen/Desktop/robocenter","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"abee2456-01d5-4dc2-a85b-e75d2c910242","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
