{"parentUuid":"ba84fcd9-b6c0-46f1-94c7-c9f052067583","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVhbtWA2YENphkudvfty","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**停止测试通过（任务 192）**：09:58:22 点了停止，同一秒任务就结束了，结束原因记为\"被停止\"，CRV 也收到了推送。验证结果已经记进规则手册。\n\n**下一步：处理 Mac 上还没提交的文件**。我分成 5 组，每组都给了建议：\n\n| # | 内容 | 我的建议 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 两份厂家 PDF：《GCR10-1300 性能测试报告(含距离)》《【外发】绝对定位精度和重复定位精度测试报告》 | 你来定。昨天已经提交了上海质检院那份正式报告，这两份是厂家内部的。投标时作为补充材料的话可以提交，否则就挪到 `D:\\项目资料` 存档，不进仓库 |\n| 2 | 10-21、10-23 四个格口的盘点原始帧、标注图和期望清单 | **提交**。盘点出问题时要拿它们来复查 |\n| 3 | 出库传送带建议图（dxf + png） | **提交**。投标布局要用 |\n| 4 | 布局导出脚本和布局 png 的改动 | **先给你看改了什么再决定**。你以前否过一次我对这个脚本的修改 |\n| 5 | 10-21 的\"识别失败\"底片，以及今天测试相机时拍的 `snap.jpg` | 底片**提交**（视觉问题的样本）；`snap.jpg` 只是临时测试照片，**还原**，不提交 |\n\n你直接回复就行，比如\"1 挪走，其余按建议\"。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1320,"cache_read_input_tokens":353535,"output_tokens":634,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":85},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1320,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":353535,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1320},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5a4d144c-6628-4fda-a76a-fcd77f58bbdc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVhbt9aPsBYRqhNumSqb","requestRef":"bdfd085d-f616-4914-8fbe-88fefaf9bb18","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"cb3d329c-3d33-4716-a0bd-e6ac029b6a25","timestamp":"2026-10-29T01:59:04.676Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","s