{"parentUuid":"af448976-f86e-410b-b5e5-fb08fceb6c67","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVhj43aaWrkRykwgcwyq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**第 1 组（两份 PDF）已处理**：复制到了 blue-space 的 `D:\\项目资料\\04_器件资料\\机械臂测试报告\\`，两份的 SHA256 都和原件一致，也记进了 `整理记录.csv`。Mac 上的原件挪到了 `~/Desktop/robocenter_已转存blue-space/`，没有删除，里面附了一份说明。\n\n**第 2、3、5 组已提交**（`6c91008`）：盘点数据、识别失败底片、出库传送带建议图都在里面。`snap.jpg` 已还原。\n\n**第 4 组需要你看一眼**：布局导出脚本只改了一处，是在布局图上**加画两个投放点**：\n- 丢回点（传送带口）\n- 退苗筐投放点\n\n每个点画成圆圈加十字，旁边标上名字，还会在报告里列出坐标和离底座的距离。坐标直接读现场标定好的 `config/drop_point.yaml`。那张布局预览 png 就是用这个改过的脚本重新生成的，所以 png 也跟着变了。\n\n这个改动应该是我那次做\"出库传送带建议图\"时，为了标出现有投放点加上的。你以前否过一次我改这个脚本，所以要你来定：\n- **保留**：提交脚本和新 png，以后导出的布局图都带投放点。\n- **不要**：两个文件都还原成原来的样子。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1328,"cache_read_input_tokens":359421,"output_tokens":595,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":106},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1328,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":359421,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1328,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1328},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e34e7303-554a-4339-b4dd-f8f1438ba3ca","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVhj3NepmXbcToJ3XZsC","requestRef":"45030a99-f6e2-4d65-8d7a-b880a35378c2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5ce6c0d4-f636-415e-b2a2-c71b274101a6","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:00:41.863Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d"