{"parentUuid":"4a83421e-bfe5-419c-9d17-86a8680c69b2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVhqzu2gSCkYqNfm6JJ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白，这类小事我自己定就好，不再拿来问你。布局图那处改动我保留并提交了，**Mac 上的未提交文件现在全部清空**。\n\n接下来做交接里最关键的一步：**在 blue-space 上装 Claude Code，把对话迁过去**。做完以后，你直接在 blue-space 上和我对话，Mac 就可以停用了。\n\n大致分四步：\n1. **你在 blue-space 上安装 Claude Code 并登录**：要用你的账号登录，所以这一步只能你来做。我把安装命令整理好给你。\n2. **我把这边积累的东西复制过去**：对话记录、记忆、全局规则（中文回复、自动提交等）、钩子脚本。\n3. **先拿一个测试对话试试能不能接上**：确认在 blue-space 上能读到记忆和规则，能直接操作设备。\n4. **改掉只适用于 Mac 的东西**：比如现在很多脚本是\"从 Mac 通过 ssh 去操作 blue-space\"，到了 blue-space 上要改成直接在本机执行。\n\n要开始吗？开始的话，我先查一下 blue-space 上有没有装 Node.js、Git 这些前置软件，再把安装步骤给你。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":396,"cache_read_input_tokens":361360,"output_tokens":429,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":396,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":361360,"cache_creation_input_tokens":396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":396},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c95a7d25-50d9-451d-933e-ad7249e34896","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVhqzbApzZTYN3SsNVDJ","requestRef":"8d0af7d9-666b-419a-90e5-a06a93e468e8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"70bef320-c28a-41a2-93d1-9562db9194da","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:02:13.515Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\ro