{"parentUuid":"34e0c4ac-dee6-4fd1-9f57-c805a846f0c8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVhtr9G4e1kS5gwZiyPv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我建议**在 `D:\\robot_cell`（主仓库）这个目录下启动 Claude Code**。\n\n**为什么启动目录很重要**：Claude Code 是按\"在哪个目录启动\"来区分项目的。对话记录和记忆都按这个目录分开存放，项目根目录下的 CLAUDE.md 也是按这个目录自动读取的。换一个目录启动，就像换了一个新项目：之前的记忆、对话都接不上。所以要选一个**以后不会再变**的目录。\n\n**为什么是 `D:\\robot_cell`**\n- 它是主仓库，CLAUDE.md、全部文档和代码都在里面，一启动我就能读到所有项目规则。\n- 交接计划里最后要把运行目录 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell` 合并进来，到时候**只剩这一个目录**。现在就定在这里，以后不用再搬。\n- 如果选 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell`：它只是运行目录，没有 CLAUDE.md 和文档，而且合并后这个目录就不存在了，记忆会断掉。\n\n**对话和记忆实际存在哪里**：这个不用你管，Claude Code 会自动存到 `C:\\Users\\26293\\.claude\\` 下面。具体是：\n- 对话记录：`C:\\Users\\26293\\.claude\\projects\\D--robot-cell\\`\n- 记忆：同一个目录下的 `memory\\`\n- 全局规则：`C:\\Users\\26293\\.claude\\CLAUDE.md`\n\n迁移时，我会把 Mac 上的对话和记忆复制到这些位置。\n\n**有一点要注意**：`C:\\Users\\26293\\.claude\\` 不在 git 仓库里，记忆和对话**不会**跟着代码一起备份。交接文档里我会写明要定期备份这个目录；也可以把记忆同步一份进仓库的 `docs/` 里。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":361756,"output_tokens":1058,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":407},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1058,"cache_read_input_tokens":361756,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a1a0b5b6-712e-4f77-9b66-1ed6eadec91d","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVhtqV4s3m7vFbRxvrGN","requestRef":"c7436969-f5dc-45c6-aeec-f8005b4e73f0","requestedModel":"cl