{"parentUuid":"60ad3b00-c550-44c6-ac90-c9f5efd486e4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgViBEnik9dxNxofWpYDi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"blue-space 上的旧对话整理好了，都是挪走，没有删除。\n\n**结果**：23 个旧项目文件夹分 4 类，放到了 `C:\\Users\\26293\\.claude\\projects_归档_20261029\\`：\n\n| 分类 | 个数 | 主要内容 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 01 货架机器人早期调试 | 9 | `robot_code` 时期的 11 个对话（带记忆）、DUCO SDK、上苗机等 |\n| 02 相机 SDK | 3 | Gemini335、Realsense |\n| 03 AGV 小车（废弃方案） | 4 | |\n| 04 杂项 | 7 | 桌面、下载、E 盘 |\n\n- 归档目录里有一份 `归档清单.md`，列了每个文件夹有几个对话、最近什么时候用过、有没有记忆，也写了恢复方法。\n- 只保留了用户主目录那一个，因为今天还在用。\n- 中途出过一个小差错：我写的分类函数和 PowerShell 自带的命令重名了，第一次没分成类。文件都挪进了归档目录，没有丢；第二次修好后就分好类了。\n\n**记录**：新建了 `docs/交接整理/Claude对话迁移.md`，写了启动目录为什么选 `D:\\robot_cell`、blue-space 现状、这次的整理结果，以及接下来的步骤（`6fe57b8`）。\n\n**下一步需要你做**：在 blue-space 上打开终端，执行：\n```\ncd /d D:\\robot_cell\nclaude\n```\n说一句\"你好\"然后退出，让它建好这个项目的文件夹。做完告诉我，我接着放测试对话进去。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1616,"cache_read_input_tokens":384121,"output_tokens":585,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1616,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":585,"cache_read_input_tokens":384121,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1616,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1616},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"80f34052-6b80-4f51-a58f-db2c2a90cf54","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgViBEV82U45Xer9duhZW","requestRef":"b60e80da-9845-4802-b416-322e0724a409","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc785b34-4e68-4db7-bdb1-8da4186fcac5","timestamp