{"parentUuid":"e84c5210-d178-4d57-b6a3-44ff92433b3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVj1TQ6B3QuKtY83YQD3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1229,"cache_read_input_tokens":411017,"output_tokens":1577,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":803},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1229,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1577,"cache_read_input_tokens":411017,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1229,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1229},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8736,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9971ffe6-6481-4477-97c1-37f815824ca7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVj1DqWgszwzPK43b1Yh","requestRef":"3684843a-259f-4485-b30b-48faec0efd80","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7b2026da-1b1a-4163-a6ae-2399661af297","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:17:32.904Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"7b2026da-1b1a-4163-a6ae-2399661af297","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVj1TQ6B3QuKtY83YQD3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"理解。你的意思是：搬到 blue-space 以后先有一个**过渡期**，Mac 先不停用：\n- 在 blue-space 上对话时，那边的 Claude 能**反过来登录 Mac**，取文件、跑只有 Mac 上才有的工具（比如 CAD 导出用的 Python 环境）。\n- 如果发现缺了什么，你还能**回到 Mac 这个对话**接着做。\n\n可以做到，分三部分：\n\n**1. 让 blue-space 能登录 Mac**（Mac 上要你开一个开关）\n- **你来做**：Mac 上打开「系统设置 → 通用 → 共享 → 远程登录」。这是系统安全设置，需要你自己开。\n- **我来做**：在 blue-space 上生成一把登录密钥，加进 Mac 的授权列表，再配一个别名 `mac`。之后 blue-space 那边用 `ssh mac \"命令\"` 就能登录 Mac，不用输密码。两台电脑本来就在同一个 Tailscale 网络里（Mac 是 100.67.85.97），直接就能连上。\n\n**2. 两边的对话会\"分叉\"，这一点要说清楚**\n- 搬过去的是此刻的对话副本。之后在 blue-space 上聊的内容，Mac 这边的对话看不到；反过来也一样。\n- 所以过渡期里**同一时间只在一边干活**，以 blue-space 为主。真要回 Mac 做事，先告诉那边的我做到了哪里。\n\n**3. 代码和文档靠 git 同步，这部分不会乱**\n- 两边用的是同一个仓库：blue-space 是主仓库，Mac 推送和拉取都指向它。\n- 在哪边改完都提交；回到另一边时先拉一下，就能拿到最新内容。\n- 记忆以 blue-space 为准。过渡期里 Mac 这边如果又记了新东西，切回去时我会同步过去。\n\n我会把这些规则写进迁移文档和 CLAUDE.md 那一节，让 blue-space 那边的 Claude 也知道\"Mac 还在、可以连\"。\n\n请先打开 Mac 的「远程登录」，打开了告诉我，我接着配置密钥并测试连通。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1229,"cache_read_input_tokens":411017,"output_tokens":1577,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":803},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1229,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1577,"cache_read_input_tokens":411017,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1229,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1229},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9971ffe6-6481-4477-97c1-37f815824ca7","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVj1DqW