d 顶部\"已从 Mac 迁到 blue-space\"一节。\n- **过渡期结束时**：Mac 关闭远程登录，删掉 Mac `authorized_keys` 里 blue-space-to-mac 那行，blue-space 删 `Host mac`。\n\n## 待做\n''',1)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='/Users/chen/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory/migrated-to-blue-space.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns=s.rstrip()+'\\n\\n**过渡期**: Mac 未关, blue-space 可 `ssh mac`(免密, Tailscale 100.67.85.97, 用户 chen)登录 Mac 取文件/跑 Mac 专有工具; 以 blue-space 为主、同一时间只在一边干活、代码走 git(Mac 的 origin=D:\\\\robot_cell)、两边对话已分叉需互通进度。用户说停用时: 关 Mac 远程登录 + 删 authorized_keys 里 blue-space-to-mac + 删 blue-space 的 Host mac。\\n'\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\nscp -q ~/.claude/projects/-Users-chen-Desktop-robocenter/memory/migrated-to-blue-space.md \"26293@100.106.76.91:C:/Users/26293/.claude/projects/D--robot-cell/memory/\" && git add CLAUDE.md \"docs/交接整理/Claude对话迁移.md\" && git commit -q -m \"docs: 过渡期 blue-space 可 ssh mac 反向访问; 写明过渡期规则与结束时的收尾\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SoknaJYdxMuRhrGtZYtRPv\" && git push -q origin exp/stand-place && git log --oneline -1","description":"把过渡期规则写进CLAUDE.md、迁移文档和记忆并提交","timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
