{"parentUuid":"58d7c40c-5c48-499d-992b-3cc9d1c9db75","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_016YUouD5YtyQD58vS44jxbx","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"55c7d4e0-8d7e-4703-a258-490add952fe4","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:20:17.133Z","session_id":"e3658006-fd31-4b0f-afb2-07a88a71385d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"55c7d4e0-8d7e-4703-a258-490add952fe4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVjDrzFSHRPTEMUBpGs5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"blue-space 现在可以免密登录 Mac 了，过渡期的规则也都写进了文档。\n\n**已完成**\n- blue-space 上执行 `ssh mac` 就能登录 Mac，不用输密码。走的是 Tailscale，地址 100.67.85.97，用户 chen。\n- 测过两种方式：Windows 自带的 ssh 和 Git Bash 里的 ssh，都能登录，也能看到 Mac 上的仓库，两边版本一致。\n- 改之前备份了原 ssh 配置。\n\n**过渡期规则**，写在项目 CLAUDE.md 顶部、迁移文档和记忆里：\n1. **以 blue-space 为主**，同一时间只在一边干活。\n2. **代码和文档走 git**：回 Mac 干活前先拉取最新，干完提交并推送回 blue-space。\n3. **两边的对话会分叉**：从一边切到另一边时，要互相告知进度。\n4. **记忆以 blue-space 为准**。\n\n**过渡期结束时的收尾**也写进了迁移文档：关掉 Mac 的远程登录，删掉授权的密钥和 `mac` 别名。\n\n提交 `71d5de3`，blue-space 那边已经同步。\n\n**只剩最后一步：搬这个主对话。** 搬完之后，这个对话以 blue-space 那份为主，Mac 这份作为过渡期的备用，需要时可以回来。\n\n现在切换吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_read_input_tokens":416851,"output_tokens":501,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":501,"cache_read_input_tokens":416851,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ac8e314d-92ac-41a6-a4af-d014f274879d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVjDreug7ovJP3pG4YzV","requestRef":"7d55882f-0b34-4235-8d0e-fac3a3db3866","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6cb825a7-dd33-4e0e-9da5-ba3f6707ce83","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:20:17.133Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"