{"parentUuid":"9db2eb57-4f00-47e0-ada5-abaf2ed2c41f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVkdvWco17KLkLohvvUb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"生效了。现在不加任何额外参数，直接用 git 也正常：信任列表里已经有 `D:/robot_cell`，工作区没有未提交的改动，最新提交是 `812a5ee`，以后可以正常提交了。\n\n下一步建议做**部署本机化**。现在改了 `scripts/bluespace/` 下的代码，得手动复制到运行目录 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell`，容易漏。有两条路：\n\n- **A. 写一个本机部署脚本**：功能和原来的 `deploy_cell.sh` 一样，只是从 scp 改成本机复制。工作量小，马上能用。\n- **B. 直接合并两个目录**：设备改成从 `D:\\robot_cell` 运行，就不存在\"部署\"这一步了。这样最彻底，但要改所有引用路径，包括三个 Windows 服务、计划任务、看门狗、控制台快捷方式等，而且要停服务、重新验证一遍。\n\n我建议**先做 A**，几分钟就能好，交接期间能马上用上；B 等交接收尾、设备空闲的时候再做。你看呢？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":167,"cache_read_input_tokens":429558,"output_tokens":387,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":167,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":387,"cache_read_input_tokens":429558,"cache_creation_input_tokens":167,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":167},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f5bef405-f351-47be-8a7a-f03b1d25d5ca","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVkdvCGNpUdappUPq5L6","requestRef":"9267c500-1bbd-4df4-8c9a-8daf3c24f478","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2269f2c9-6f98-486c-b027-72645884c0a1","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:38:49.272Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-p