{"parentUuid":"2996f12e-3a6e-4aa5-8d76-2da969958cf3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVkmjoA2FPAEkKNjM1dP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我换个说法。\n\n**现在的情况**：blue-space 上有两份代码。\n- `D:\\robot_cell`：**编辑用的**。我改代码、写文档、git 提交，都在这里。\n- `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell`：**运行用的**。设备的服务（视觉、扫码、工作站）实际跑的是这一份。\n\n以前在 Mac 上时，我在 Mac 上改代码，再用一个脚本（`deploy_cell.sh`）把改动\"发送\"到运行那份，这一步叫\"部署\"。现在搬到了 blue-space，那个脚本是按\"从 Mac 远程发送\"写的，在本机用不了。所以现在**改了代码，没有一键同步到运行那份的办法**。改完忘了同步，设备就还在跑旧代码。\n\n**我想解决的就是这个**，有两种办法：\n\n- **A. 写一个本机版的\"同步\"脚本**：改完代码执行一下，就把改动复制到运行那份。简单，马上能用。\n- **B. 两份合成一份**：让设备直接运行 `D:\\robot_cell` 里的代码，以后改完就生效，不用同步。这样最干净，但要调整服务的启动路径，还要重新测一遍设备，比较费事。\n\n我建议先做 A，等以后空闲时再做 B。\n\n不过这件事**不急**：只有下次要改设备代码时才用得到。你现在如果有别的事想先做，也完全可以先放着。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20,"cache_read_input_tokens":430112,"output_tokens":508,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":508,"cache_read_input_tokens":430112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7642f69b-09c0-4fff-9e4a-f1e6ade536ce","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVkmj2GxhkoQGSVgGV1s","requestRef":"0ca22db3-0630-4a80-b1f4-af5100e8c48d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b5b2e12d-ceda-4f89-9c36-65c2332f2703","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:40:36.612Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claud