{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","id":"7bf8722f-1ab0-4ec4-abeb-2fd1f144fef0","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:41:22.601Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"f09d6ff37f64b23277603ae23c5f37ca60462a48ec1b9dcb81dea03935a1fc66","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"0ca22db3-0630-4a80-b1f4-af5100e8c48d","keep":524,"tail":["b5938fa0c5a8c3494b22b6c11c924fb76c8f49496d9e0a8c377f0ea9444ae43e","ce68a88fa7c32b8ec91b11593fdab4beee5283ef8d311744647da88af6116b71"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",525,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"b57364c13834c4366654c758cf7847b9bb6da64b5bf6b650c65aa4bb73c5bfa1"}
{"parentUuid":"2535f54a-e966-448a-9282-052119917407","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVkqbZgKoju8QsUnjmBn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**我认为长远来看合并更好**，理由有三：\n\n1. **少一个出错的环节**。两份代码就有\"改了忘同步\"\"运行的和看到的不一样\"的风险。以前就踩过：改了代码没重启或没部署，结果设备跑的是旧逻辑。只有一份，就没这个问题。\n2. **交接更简单**。接手的人只要记住\"代码在 `D:\\robot_cell`\"，不用再去理解两个目录和部署这一步。\n3. **出问题好查**。设备跑的就是 git 里的版本，想知道当前是哪个版本、哪天改过什么，直接看 git 记录就行。\n\n**合并也有代价**：\n- 运行目录里有一些数据不在 git 里，比如日志、标定账本、录制文件、扫码数据库。要先把它们搬过来，并且设置好让 git 忽略日志这类文件。\n- 要改所有写死了路径的地方：3 个 Windows 服务、扫码计划任务、看门狗、控制台快捷方式，还有代码里的路径。\n- 改完要停服务、重新测一遍上架、出库，大约需要半天，设备得空着。\n\n所以我的建议是：**合并，但找个设备空闲的时段一次做完**。在那之前先不搭本机的同步脚本，真要改设备代码时，我手动复制一下就行，反正现在改得也不多。\n\n你看什么时候设备能空出半天？到时候我先列一份完整的改动清单给你确认，再动手。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14,"cache_read_input_tokens":430642,"output_tokens":509,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":509,"cache_read_input_tokens":430642,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"27574634-f71c-4a2b-805f-e5c88606ff91","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVkqbH4PMTVvU7Cg73SW","requestRef":"7bf8722f-1ab0-4ec4-abeb-2fd1f144fef0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"38f47064-294a-4a36-91d7-0000c35a9170","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:41:30.099Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_c