{"parentUuid":"1aab174d-1436-4f11-b04b-a61255386789","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVmsiHANRdrSShuPvo3J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不是，正好反过来：**合并后只留 `D:\\robot_cell`，不用的是 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell`。**\n\n| | 合并前 | 合并后 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `D:\\robot_cell` | 编辑代码、写文档、git 提交 | **全部都在这里**：编辑、提交、设备也直接从这里运行 |\n| `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell` | 设备运行用 | 改名为 `D:\\Destop\\robot_cell_旧运行目录_20261029`，**只作备份，不再使用** |\n\n选 `D:\\robot_cell` 作为留下的那份，原因有两个：\n- 它是主仓库，有完整的 git 历史、所有文档和 CLAUDE.md。\n- 我们的对话、记忆也是绑定在 `D:\\robot_cell` 这个目录上的。\n\n旧目录在确认合并后一切正常、稳定运行一段时间（比如一两周）后，你决定要不要删掉；在那之前一直留着，用来应急回退。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21,"cache_read_input_tokens":446928,"output_tokens":359,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":359,"cache_read_input_tokens":446928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4fb45103-f239-494d-bf48-9bac0b8b5b4f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVmshdiQgHMTFNL4usHB","requestRef":"605331d5-bc13-41e0-9d07-7a91917fb7e3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"53c7d9fd-1b61-4ac6-a942-af8f59865649","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:55:02.534Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-p