{"parentUuid":"3d26ba12-a343-4e96-b008-92c6cefdbff0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a422cbf8-e2f5-4f95-9b3c-98aeb76c6299","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D63NQLXdGN96db8p1Dowyg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n2\t\"\"\"格口数据快照(只读, 纯计算, 不动臂): 把每个格口\"算得出来的一切\"存成一份 JSON, 用于改名/迁移前后对账。\n3\t\n4\t每个格口记录:\n5\t  ledger    立放账本原文(<格口>_stand.json)\n6\t  geom      每个已登记品种的 stand_geometry(可用宽度/列宽/推进/节距/能放几盒…)\n7\t  pits      每个品种在 左端/中线/右端 × 序号0/末位 的 compute_stand_pit 结果(推进量/贴板高度/横向偏移, 或越界原因)\n8\t  pose      poses.yaml 里该格口悬停点关节角\n9\t  paths     mid_to_<格口> / <格口>_to_mid 两条路径: 点数、首末点、全体点的指纹\n10\t另附 plan_store 对一组样例表的答案(全格口参与装箱)。\n11\t\n12\t用法(blue-space, robot_cell 内): python tools/grasp/slot_snapshot.py <输出.json>\n13\t对账: Mac 上 /usr/bin/python3 scripts/slot_snapshot_diff.py <前.json> <后.json>\n14\t\"\"\"\n15\timport glob\n16\timport hashlib\n17\timport json\n18\timport os\n19\timport sys\n20\t\n21\tROOT = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))))\n22\tsys.path.insert(0, ROOT); os.chdir(ROOT)\n23\timport yaml  # noqa: E402\n24\tfrom tools.grasp.stand_slot import load_stand_config, stand_geometry, compute_stand_pit, plan_store  # noqa: E402\n25\t\n26\t\n27\tdef r(v, n=4):\n28\t    if isinstance(v, float): return round(v, n)\n29\t    if isinstance(v, dict): return {k: r(x, n) for k, x in v.items()}\n30\t    if isinstance(v, (list, tuple)): return [r(x, n) for x in v]\n31\t    return v\n32\t\n33\t\n34\tdef path_info(name):\n35\t    p = os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"paths\", name + \".json\")\n36\t    if not os.path.exists(p): return None\n37\t    d = json.load(open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n38\t    pts = d.get(\"points\") or d.get(\"traj\") or d.get(\"joints\") or d.get(\"rec\") or d\n39\t    if isinstance(pts, dict): pts = pts.get(\"points\") or []\n40\t    pts = [[round(float(x), 6) for x in (q.get(\"q\") if isinstance(q, dict) else q)] for q in pts] if isinstance(pts, list) else []"}]},"uuid":"4e1658f5-f302-4bf6-a218-c8d5364dfc7b","timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:59:25.373Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\robot_cell\\tools\\grasp\\slot_snapshot.py","content":"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"格口数据快照(只读, 纯计算, 不动臂): 把每个格口\"算得出来的一切\"存成一份 JSON, 用于改名/迁移前后对账。\n\n每个格口记录:\n  ledger    立放账本原文(<格口>_stand.json)\n  geom      每个已登记品种的 stand_geometry(可用宽度/列宽/推进/节距/能放几盒…)\n  pits      每个品种在 左端/中线/右端 × 序号0/末位 的 compute_stand_pit 结果(推进量/贴板高度/横向偏移, 或越界原因)\n  pose      poses.yaml 里该格口悬停点关节角\n  paths     mid_to_<格口> / <格口>_to_mid 两条路径: 点数、首末点、全体点的指纹\n另附 plan_store 对一组样例表的答案(全格口参与装箱)。\n\n用法(blue-space, robot_cell 内): python tools/grasp/slot_snapshot.py <输出.json>\n对账: Mac 上 /usr/bin/python3 scripts/slot_snapshot_diff.py <前.json> <后.json>\n\"\"\"\nimport glob\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\n\nROOT = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))))\nsys.path.insert(0, ROOT); os.chdir(ROOT)\nimport yaml  # noqa: E402\nfrom tools.grasp.stand_slot import load_stand_config, stand_geometry, compute_stand_pit, plan_store  # noqa: E402\n\n\ndef r(v, n=4):\n    if isinstance(v, float): return round(v, n)\n    if isinstance(v, dict): return {k: r(x, n) for k, x in v.items()}\n    if isinstance(v, (list, tuple)): return [r(x, n) for x in v]\n    return v\n\n\ndef path_info(name):\n    p = os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"paths\", name + \".json\")\n    if not os.path.exists(p): return None\n    d = json.load(open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n    pts = d.get(\"points\") or d.get(\"traj\") or d.get(\"joints\") or d.get(\"rec\") or d\n    if isinstance(pts, dict): pts = pts.get(\"points\") or []\n    pts = [[round(float(x), 6) for x in (q.get(\"q\") if isinstance(q, dict) else q)] for q in pts] if isinstance(pts, list) else []","numLines":40,"startLine":1,"totalLines":83}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3d26ba12-a343-4e96-b008-92c6cefdbff0","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
