{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","id":"c8e27c12-d453-4540-b9c4-c4a1b517a99f","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:05:23.830Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"f09d6ff37f64b23277603ae23c5f37ca60462a48ec1b9dcb81dea03935a1fc66","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"4f1afca0-8f6e-4966-8c9d-66d492e3cf2b","keep":615,"tail":["844edb76af97ad7c5372a41956134b9c214ecb81c56633fa6b1becf65d2b266d","c7d7b61f7bd61be1893ea635346a8921e480ca79e2ed9e0c0fd66a1c46f518f1"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",616,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"6246a496e56b40622e0dba406d58d0dc91bb6ac441a14c71ef6a76f7dd53013e"}
{"parentUuid":"400fa58a-f94e-4cb4-8f42-6d167cac3da2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVnfqazV8zWuhj14CDjU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"准备工作做完了，验证的前三层里，不用动设备的部分都已经通过。现在**需要你来执行切换**。\n\n**目前完成了什么**（设备一直照常运行，没受影响）\n- 代码按运行目录的结构并进了主仓库，131 个文件逐个核对和运行中的版本完全一致，改动历史也保留了。\n- 驱动、模型、标定账本、路径库、5 GB 运行数据都复制过来了。追溯平台的密钥文件不进 git。\n- 写死旧路径的 17 个文件已改为新路径，几处过时的注释也已更正。\n- **验证**：格口快照对账 PASS；全量哈希对账 10759 个文件 0 缺失，差异都是预期内的；盘点回归测试 PASS；视觉离线自检 PASS。\n- 提交到 `3b28774`，切换前打了回退标签 `pre-merge-20261029`。\n\n**请你执行切换**（设备现在空闲、在 home）：\n1. 在开始菜单里右键 **Windows PowerShell**，选\"**以管理员身份运行**\"。\n2. 粘贴下面这行，回车：\n```bash\npowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"D:\\robot_cell\\docs\\交接整理\\合并切换_20261029.ps1\"\n```\n\n**脚本会做这些**，大约 1 分钟：先确认设备空闲 → 停服务 → 同步停服前新写的数据 → 3 个服务和 3 个计划任务改指向新目录 → 更新桌面控制台快捷方式 → 启动服务 → 显示状态 → 旧目录改名留作备份。全程有记录。\n\n跑完把窗口里的输出告诉我（截图或复制都行），我接着做第 2、3 层验证。如果有问题，同目录下的 `合并回退_20261029.ps1` 可以一键切回旧目录。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_read_input_tokens":512884,"output_tokens":654,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":512884,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7eeb60e5-1239-4904-97a1-b87a8df4231d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVnfqEefX5XBLZ656vm6","requestRef":"c8e27c12-d453-4540-b9c4-c4a1b517a99f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"87a4