{"parentUuid":"111d09bc-e909-4aa0-ae54-e408bb4da33b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVnwzDr39NLtifTjcZUW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"相机正常 ✅，照片已经写到新目录。\n\n**目前的状态**\n- 设备已经从 `D:\\robot_cell` 运行了，4 个服务都正常，相机、推送都没问题。\n- 还剩两件事等你：\n  1. 在**管理员窗口**里执行上一条消息里那两行：结束残留进程 10712，并把旧目录改名。\n  2. **扫一盒码**，确认新的扫码服务能收到码。\n\n**然后做第 4 层真机验证**：和昨天联调一样，在 CRV 上依次做**上架 1 盒 → 出库 1 盒 → 退苗 1 盒 → 盘点 1 个格口 → 复位**，每做完一项告诉我，我读日志核对。\n\n控制器仿真干跑那一项我这次跳过了：真机测试会实际走一遍同样的路径和放置流程，效果更直接，也不用切仿真模式。\n\n**切换时发现的两个小问题，验证完一起处理**：\n- 切换脚本靠命令行判断进程来自哪个目录，但用相对路径启动的进程判断不出来，所以漏杀了旧的扫码进程。这一点会写进文档。\n- 设备运行时会不断覆盖几个已进 git 的文件，比如拍照的 `snap.jpg`，导致 git 总显示有改动。我会把这类运行产物从 git 里移除，并加进忽略列表。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":520342,"output_tokens":771,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":285},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":771,"cache_read_input_tokens":520342,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3da320f7-d54c-479e-9fdd-b7b77c033e87","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVnwyoYBbGTqB5QTDrv8","requestRef":"90273ae6-66ff-4897-aedb-1c6f8fdee020","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"57c33e8d-d7b7-489d-be82-49cbeeb0d60e","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:09:11.625Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0