{"parentUuid":"afb7673c-e411-4cfc-a328-30d50dd35884","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVo5b1ZDNm64nk8EAQDT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在都记录好了（提交 `7ab50d0`）。之前只有 git 提交说明里有记录，这次补了文档：\n\n**新建 [运行目录合并记录.md](docs/交接整理/运行目录合并记录.md)**，包括：\n1. 为什么要合并\n2. 合并后的目录结构：每个目录放什么、是否进 git\n3. 每一步对应的提交，以及对账时遇到的冲突是怎么处理的\n4. 切换过程，以及**漏杀旧进程这个问题的原因和以后要注意的地方**\n5. 四层验证的结果：做了哪些、哪些还没做\n6. 待办清单\n7. 回退方法\n\n**同时更新了**\n- [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) 顶部换算表：去掉\"还没有本机部署\"的旧说法，写明代码已经合并到仓库根目录、不再需要部署，并加了\"判断进程归属不能只看命令行\"的提醒。\n- 记忆 `migrated-to-blue-space`：补了一条合并完成的记录。\n- 顺手处理了一个待办：设备会反复覆盖的 `snap.jpg` 等几个图片，已经不再进 git。\n\n**还要你来做的**（文档里也标了\"待处理\"）：\n1. 在管理员窗口里结束残留进程 10712，并给旧目录改名（命令见上一条消息）。\n2. 扫一盒码，确认扫码服务正常。\n3. 在 CRV 上做真机验证：上架 → 出库 → 退苗 → 盘点 → 复位。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1145,"cache_read_input_tokens":530643,"output_tokens":540,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1145,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":540,"cache_read_input_tokens":530643,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1145},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b47a05dd-cd82-4557-b4dd-d36ced7a967f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVo5afxyM668WkGX6aej","requestRef":"03a90e4f-980c-477e-a3c3-e4c34aa0086c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fea5b714-409c-4243-aee2-6b2f3b1c905c","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:10:52.275Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","e