{"parentUuid":"d2984a3b-9b9a-4a00-84a0-a324e60b8dfe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVoKsBYhVUjWnfcSZYLH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第 3 步完成 ✅。**上架（任务 193）全流程正常**，新目录下每个环节都没问题：\n\n- 桌上没盒时，上苗机自动送来一盒（12.6 秒）→ 识别 → 吸取 → 扫码（读到 81002713776212339843）→ CRV 指定放到 A-L9 → 放好 → 回 home，共 53 秒。\n- 读到的路径库、立放账本、尺寸表都是新目录下的。\n- 4 条推送 CRV 都第一次就签收了。\n- 你中途点了停止，设备放完这盒才结束，这是对的。\n\n**第 4 步：真机测出库**\n\n在 CRV 上**出库 1 盒**，哪一盒都行，比如刚放进 A-L9 的这盒。\n\n跑完告诉我\"出库好了\"。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1661,"cache_read_input_tokens":533946,"output_tokens":285,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1661,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":285,"cache_read_input_tokens":533946,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1661},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"edfe113d-07af-421a-af8b-29bf015dfb5a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVoKroU5QiLNM3XiVidD","requestRef":"bd0cbb88-1241-4fdb-b3c3-165ccd82dd68","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a96b59bf-80b1-4960-96a6-b2b19c87bc37","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:14:03.268Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
