{"parentUuid":"89590035-4f9c-4dfd-8b4e-0ffe67f8059b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVoT2PsFf6q9ixmJ7VwJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**出库（任务 194）完成 ✅**：从 A-L9 取出刚上架的那盒 → 去扫码 → 丢回传送带，共 39.6 秒，3 条推送 CRV 都签收了。\n\n**关于为什么去扫码**：现在的默认设置就是**扫码**。这是昨天（10-28）你定的：\"默认是需要扫码，可以设置成跳过扫码。\"当时我们把它改成\"不扫\"测了一次，测完又改回了默认的\"扫码\"。设置在 `config/speed_profile.yaml` 里，现在是 `outbound_scan: true`。\n\n如果你现在想让出库**默认不扫码**，告诉我，我把它改成 `false`，再重启一下工作站服务就生效，前后 1 分钟左右。\n\n**另外有一点要告诉你**：这次出库扫码**没读到码**。机械臂转了四个面，扫码器一个按键都没发过来，但设备照样把盒子送出去了，这是\"只报不判\"的设计。\n- 这不是合并造成的：扫码服务一直在工作，上架时 11:13:21 刚读到过同一盒的码。\n- 更可能的原因是：出库时盒子被吸住的那一面和上架时不同，转的四个面里正好没有条码那面。前天的出库测试也要转到第 4 面才读到。\n- 合并验证完以后，可以单独查一下这个问题，看要不要给出库扫码多加几个角度。\n\n先说一下：出库的默认要不要改成\"不扫码\"？还是保持现在这样，接着测**退苗**？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1004,"cache_read_input_tokens":537232,"output_tokens":767,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":228},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1004,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":537232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1004,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1004},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f9826736-a4db-412a-89d1-f7b0eb879cdb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVoT1zZpBKrzXonke8e6","requestRef":"b7312244-c61c-47b7-b641-facd658fa681","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bddc51aa-b6ca-4fc8-9da4-4e5cc5cb3552","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:15:46.272Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external",