{"parentUuid":"09f05778-088c-4d2b-936f-be4608c233ae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVor2naFK2bVn189S1WF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第 6 步完成 ✅。**盘点（任务 196）A-L9 账实相符**：\n- A-L9 现在只剩横向 -257.6 这一列（另外两列昨天和今天已经退空），**账上 13 盒，实测 13 盒**，队首位置只差 4.1mm，判定\"相符\"。\n- 盘点照片已经写到新目录下的 `data\\stocktake\\`，推送 CRV 也签收了。\n\n这说明从今天上架、出库到退苗，A-L9 的账一直是对的。\n\n**第 7 步（最后一步）：测复位**\n\n在 CRV 上点一次**复位**。臂现在在 home，复位时不会动，这一步主要测 CRV 和设备之间的通信。\n\n点完告诉我\"复位好了\"。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":549583,"output_tokens":381,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":116},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":381,"cache_read_input_tokens":549583,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"296f1f12-5fa4-4a8d-95b2-1f07a4ef9be5","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVor2MXcYTos2SvXUkHR","requestRef":"698ebc08-9d56-4cdc-b2cb-681a352504a2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e1e5a693-45c1-42b5-855d-a00a1aaef124","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:20:53.096Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
