{"parentUuid":"004ca20e-ba37-43a4-bc29-832fccee3900","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVp4jcZmkpqKSU6q89pv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"记得。原计划是：**测试 → 搭建开发环境 → 列出场景清单 → 写一套人和 AI 都能看懂的完整文档 → 迁移对话**。对话迁移被我们提前做了，所以现在该回到**搭建开发环境**。目的是让接手的人在 blue-space 上就能继续开发，不再依赖 AutoDL 和 Mac。\n\n需要搭的主要是两套环境：\n1. **路径规划和仿真**：原来在 AutoDL 上，是 ROS2 + MoveIt + Foxglove。新格口的路径规划、碰撞判卷、仿真回放都靠它。\n2. **视觉训练**：标注药盒照片、训练 YOLO 分割模型。原来在 AutoDL 的 GPU 上训练，标注工具当时还没查清楚。\n\n我先摸一下 blue-space 现在有什么，再看 AutoDL 那边收回来的东西，然后给你一个方案。只读，不装任何东西。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":64,"cache_read_input_tokens":556942,"output_tokens":1262,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":387},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":64,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1262,"cache_read_input_tokens":556942,"cache_creation_input_tokens":64,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":64},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"694b1386-4d51-437b-9bbe-0aef831a2a77","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVp4itRUTNBEhkf7ggRD","requestRef":"3632fdcc-bf62-4c69-97a8-bf3cde28fc93","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"475d855a-05ee-4f75-865d-71d2826e2538","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:23:49.005Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
