{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","id":"b75e9b37-893c-45d0-a524-ec69f7cc1863","timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:37:15.707Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"ec2209c8a67b15f2c9c1fb7cd8de44a6c57d3392bb32c6f9d0af322465a1739e","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"f4e59d1e-7587-4b19-aaef-eefed4b2132c","keep":15,"tail":["c59e2ef043c621c24d68467a8aa340a84f191712feeaf507d911b017defed8bc","812203cd2d0d856ccd2b56203284e8f7ca8a18fd990daabdc1f3ae8643f5d2cd","5151a144e09d460e035fdd281f13de48e50c0ec549ca806834172a4301759a2b"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",17,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"ecbd53397d12266405831dd6737acb7f664dff77871762981084c56d31fcb333"}
{"parentUuid":"d87765b0-b390-49c6-a500-eb60579f1e80","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVzFWgBJCgx8rYKvU9gr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，都包括在里面了。贴码的三处加上手眼，一共四项，在 blue-space 上的情况如下：\n\n| 标定 | 码牌 | 算出什么 | 本机现在能不能用 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **桌子** `calibrate_table` | 桌面 ID5 | 桌子在机械臂坐标系里的位置和朝向 | 计算在本机，只差把脚本本机化 |\n| **货架** `calibrate_shelf` | 货架 ID6 / ID3 / ID2，逐张正对着拍 | 货架的位置和朝向（三个码拟合） | 同上 |\n| **地面（底座高度）** `calibrate_scene floor` | 地面 ID4 | 底座有多高 | 本机现在就能直接跑（`python tools\\calib\\calibrate_scene.py floor`） |\n| **手眼** 六步 | 标定板 | 相机相对手腕的矩阵 | 定板位、试拍、采样求解、落点闭环这几步只差本机化；**生成候选拍摄站 `handeye_grid.py` 要判碰撞，依赖 MoveIt** |\n\n还有一点：前三项标完，只是把数值填进 `config/scene_params.yaml`。要让**仿真场景**跟着更新（`build_scene` → `deploy_scene`，路径判碰撞就用这个场景），得先把 ② 路径规划环境搭起来。换场地重新标定以后，旧路径要放进新场景重新判一遍有没有碰撞，所以这条链也离不开 ②。\n\n所以 ③ 标定本机化分两半：\n- **现在就能做**：把四项标定的脚本改成本机直接调用，不需要装任何东西。\n- **跟着 ② 一起做**：手眼候选站生成，以及标完更新仿真场景。\n\n另外 TCP 标定（四点法、接触偏差）不用码牌，也在 ③ 里。\n\n顺序你定：先做 ① 视觉训练，还是先做 ③ 前半？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1817,"cache_read_input_tokens":133037,"output_tokens":696,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1817,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":696,"cache_read_input_tokens":133037,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1817,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1817},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0934b015-2608-40c1-a9c3-43796beb90d3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVzFWQJmxF86F2TDYRvf","requestRef":"b75e9b37-893c-45d0-a524-ec69f7cc1863","requestedModel":"c