{"parentUuid":"398e2fce-7419-4637-b616-f08bf01c6da8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVzR7a9YPvLJ1Ss1ktYV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"要，但不是标定本身。**TCP 四点标定继续在示教器上做，这一步不变。** 需要本机化的是标定前后配套的三个脚本：\n\n| 脚本 | 做什么 | 要不要 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `tcp_sync` | 示教器标完以后，从控制器读出新的 TCP，写进仿真用的配置 | **要**。不同步的话，仿真里的工具长度还是旧值，判碰撞就不准 |\n| `tcp_contact` | 测**吸盘唇边比 TCP 低多少**（接触偏差）：臂自动去桌面上方，你用示教器降到纸片刚好夹住、再压紧，脚本算差值 | **要**。示教器不管这个数，但吸取、放置的下降高度都靠它；换吸盘或重标 TCP 后必须重测 |\n| `tcp_verify` | 示教四点时逐点记录，独立算一遍 TCP，和控制器的结果互相核对 | 可选。08-20 验过一次，差约 1 mm；平时用不到，排在最后 |\n\n还有一处顺手要改：`tcp_contact` 同步数值时会写三个地方，其中一个还是早已封存的旧库 `robot_code`。本机化时一起改掉。\n\n所以第 1 步的范围是：**桌子、货架、地面、手眼（候选生成除外）、`tcp_sync`、`tcp_contact`**；`tcp_verify` 放最后，有空再做。\n\n可以的话，我就开始逐个看这些脚本，先列出要改的地方给你看。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31,"cache_read_input_tokens":137037,"output_tokens":787,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":243},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":787,"cache_read_input_tokens":137037,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c396dade-04cd-45e1-b3c0-438c0111a397","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgVzR6wSkSBcEbvaN9RRk","requestRef":"a426340a-341e-4d12-b8e2-bea94da8a2f9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"006ef03e-ce3e-4891-8d59-7cd830523059","timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:39:35.657Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entr