{"parentUuid":"9bacdc17-35a8-486d-abd1-53f35269edf3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a443ce54-1eaf-47aa-be14-561c8027e92d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RXe2rw8FwvtHcg3cnHZDxG","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: end-effector-loose\ndescription: 2026-10-23 末端(立放方管+吸盘)松动导致上架压不紧/盒子放歪/盘点报账外物体; 放置异常先查末端紧固\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe\n  modified: 2026-10-23T03:02:04.045Z\n---\n\n2026-10-23 上架一系列异常的根因是**末端松了**(用户现场发现), 不是放置算法: A-L10 第4列(x=30.8)整列比计划长 11mm 压不紧、第5列盒子偏右/歪被盘点报 stray(横向139~163, 深度同队首)、随后机械臂在格口门口急停。当时日志里各列放置动作完全一致(推进量/贴板高/吹开都正常), 盘点 front_diff 才暴露差异。\n\n**Why:** 末端松动时方管/吸盘角度随受力变, 推进不正、松手回弹, 软件侧看不出(控制器报到位)。\n\n**How to apply:** 再遇到\"某列压不紧/盒子放歪/账外物体/盘点队首普遍偏外\", 先让用户检查末端紧固(用户计划加防松垫片), 再查软件。紧固后建议复核: `tcp_sync.sh check`(必要时 tcp_verify 重标)、`handeye_verify2.sh` 落点复核、空列放5盒+盘点核队首。相关: [[stand-tool-design]] [[stocktake-design]]\nplane:\r\n  a: 0.0008708510326355794\r\n  b: 6.665599464525385e-05\r\n  c: -0.999999618587656\r\n  d: 764.6870711947781\r\nroi:\r\n- 390\r\n- 83\r\n- 496\r\n- 277\r\nfit:\r\n  n_total: 137671\r\n  inlier_ratio: 0.911\r\n  frames_avg: 30\r\n  auto: true\r\n  date: 2026-08-26 14:57\r\nfx: 692.0468139648438\r\nfy: 692.408203125\r\ncx: 638.1490478515625\r\ncy: 360.1512145996094\r\nwidth: 1280\r\nheight: 720\r\nSAME_HE\nservices/selftest_offline.py:23:HANDEYE = np.load(os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"calibration\", \"ducocobot\", \"T_wrist2cam.npy\"))\ntools/calib/calibrate_scene.py:58:HANDEYE = os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"calibration\", \"ducocobot\", \"T_wrist2cam.npy\")\ntools/calib/stocktake_probe.py:7:换算链: 像素→相机点(内参) → TCP系(手眼 T_wrist2cam, 已按 v1 TCP 表达) → 基座系(get_tcp_pose_with_tool v1) → 货架系(账本 origin/yaw)\ntools/calib/stocktake_probe.py:27:T_w2c = np.load(os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"calibration\", \"ducocobot\", \"T_wrist2cam.npy\"))\ntools/calib/table_roi.py:31:T_w2c = np.load(os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"calibration\", \"ducocobot\", \"T_wrist2cam.npy\"))\ntools/grasp/pick_one_box.py:28:HANDEYE = np.load(os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"calibration\", \"ducocobot\", \"T_wrist2cam.npy\"))\ntools/grasp/step1_target.py:22:HANDEYE = os.path.join(ROOT, \"config\", \"calibration\", \"ducocobot\", \"T_wrist2cam.npy\")\ntools/handeye/handeye_solve.py:4:用法(blue-space): python tools\\handeye\\handeye_solve.py <数据目录> [对照npy]   (2026-09-10 迁入robot_cell/tools/handeye; 对照npy缺省=本库现役 config/calibration/ducocobot/T_wrist2cam.npy)\ntools/handeye/handeye_solve.py:7:  对照npy(可选): 老算法的T_wrist2cam.npy,给出则逐元素对比\ntools/handeye/handeye_solve.py:21:    \"\"\"TSAI求解 T_wrist2cam(相机在腕系的位姿)\"\"\"","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8717a8ba-8c01-4881-ad15-9cc9de4a440c","timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:49:31.923Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: end-effector-loose\ndescription: 2026-10-23 末端(立放方管+吸盘)松动导致上架压不紧/盒子放歪/盘点报账外物体; 放置异常先查末端紧固\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe\n  modified: 2026-10-23T03:02:04.045Z\n---\n\n2026-10-23 上架一系列异常的根因是**末端松了**(用户现场发现), 不是放置算法: A-L10 第4列(x=30.8)整列比计划长 11mm 压不紧、第5列盒子偏右/歪被盘点报 stray(横向139~163, 深度同队首)、随后机械臂在格口门口急停。当时日志里各列放置动作完全一致(推进量/贴板高/吹开都正常), 盘点 front_diff 才暴露差异。\n\n**Why:** 末端松动时方管/吸盘角度随受力变, 推进不正、松手回弹, 软件侧看不出(控制器报到位)。\n\n**How to apply:** 再遇到\"某列压不紧/盒子放歪/账外物体/盘点队首普遍偏外\", 先让用户检查末端紧固(用户计划加防松垫片), 再查软件。紧固后建议复核: `tcp_sync.sh check`(必要时 tcp_verify 重标)、`handeye_verify2.sh` 落点复核、空列放5盒+盘点核队首。相关: [[stand-tool-design]] [[stocktake-design]]\nplane:\r\n  a: 0.0008708510326355794\r\n  b: 6.665599464525385e-05\r\n  c: -0.999999618587656\r\n  d: 764.6870711947781\r\nroi:\r\n- 390\r\n- 83\r\n- 496\r\n- 277\r\nfit:\r\n  n_total: 137671\r\n  inlier_ratio: 0.911\r\n  frames_avg: 30\r\n  auto: true\r\n  date: 2026-08-26 14:57\r\nfx: 692.0468139648438\r\nfy: 692.408203125\r\ncx: 638.1490478515625\r\ncy: 360.1512145996094\r\nwidth: 1280\r\nheight: 720\r\nSAME_HE\nservices/selftest_offline.py:23:HANDEYE = np.load(os.path.jo