{"parentUuid":"a63816a6-8a74-4b6c-9182-ba4089afb42e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW1hnPKrVDMdPJGgnE19","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KCmsoydLXdHnv7qpMj6g81","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\robot_cell\\docs\\交接整理\\设备工具箱设计.md","old_string":"## 5. 做的顺序","new_string":"## 5. 实现与接通方法（2026-10-29 入口已搭好）\n\n- 代码：`services/toolbox_catalog.py`（目录：每项说明/准备/依赖/底层工具/动作，**加项改说明只改这里**）+ `services/toolbox_gui.py`（窗口与运行器）；控制台右下「工程师工具箱」打开，也可单独 `pythonw services\\toolbox_gui.py`。\n- 条目状态：`ready` 已接通 / `todo` 待接通（只显示说明和底层工具，照着手动操作）/ `env` 需先装环境。入口搭好时只有 d0 和 m_snapshot 是 ready。\n- 运行器：子进程跑设备 Python（-u），输出实时显示，底部输入框把一行送进子进程（兼容\"摆好臂按回车\"的引导式脚本）；`arm=True` 的动作运行前确认；`camera=True` 的动作先经 `POST /services/vision/stop` 停视觉服务、结束后 start（系统账户服务，普通权限杀不动）。\n- 部署进度（未做/通过/跳过/不通过 + 时间）存 `data/toolbox/progress.json`；上游步骤比本步晚做过时提示\"建议重做\"。\n- **每接通一项走四步**：①底层脚本本机化（交互保留原样）→ ②目录里改 ready、配动作（arm/camera/confirm）→ ③用户在设备旁从入口跑一遍，与 `baseline_20261029` 对比，只对比不写入 → ④通过后在下表记一行并提交。\n\n| 条目 | 接通日期 | 验证结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| d0 存档现役参数 | 2026-10-29 | 存/对比/恢复自检 PASS |\n| m_snapshot 快照对比/恢复 | 2026-10-29 | 同上 |\n\n## 6. 做的顺序"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1382,"cache_read_input_tokens":196851,"output_tokens":1162,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":130},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1382,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1162,"cache_read_input_tokens":196851,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1382},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"contex