{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","id":"4e4ef861-a600-40f1-b050-3d993d435bbd","timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:56:38.183Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"ec2209c8a67b15f2c9c1fb7cd8de44a6c57d3392bb32c6f9d0af322465a1739e","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"f8df0856-f55a-461b-9143-55419f7bfc0d","keep":86,"tail":["a96841ff57bf1cd4cad3c2b18bf22dc98214fbded700ad2a9721495575a376d5","1454519fbb04cbd43162be60916fc1450c2bb4fa63e792f2fc02b51f28a41722"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",87,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"3514be928892d1e1de7e1adb0894a299359872617b4f00bb67ed013f71ad5c24"}
{"parentUuid":"89ebcfa1-d3aa-46b6-9edf-10e0bf92f9ab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW1jCrGanTjBjjcXv9nX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"工具箱的入口搭好了：所有条目都在里面，目前能实际运行的是「存档现役参数」和「标定快照：对比 / 恢复」两项。我在后台把每个条目都点开过，也在窗口里跑了一次\"看当前值\"，结果正常；但还没在设备控制台里实际点过按钮打开。已提交（0e0225f）。\n\n**打开方法**：设备控制台右下角新增「工程师工具箱」按钮。控制台现在开着的话，要关掉重开才会出现。\n\n**里面有什么**（截图是\"抓偏 / 吸不住\"那页）\n- **① 部署向导** 9 步：每步可以标为通过 / 不通过 / 跳过，进度会保存。上游某步重做了，下游会提示\"建议重做\"。\n- **② 问题诊断** 10 类现象：每类按顺序列出要检查的项，蓝字点一下就跳到对应步骤。\n- **③ 维护工具** 7 项：快照、视觉训练、路径规划、录入新药盒、盘点工具、速度调整、对接配置。\n- 还没接通的条目会标「待接通」，只显示说明和底层脚本，需要时可以照着手动操作；视觉训练和路径规划标「需先装环境」。\n- 运行区在下方，输出实时滚动。脚本要求按回车时，用底部输入框发送。会动真机的动作运行前要你确认；要用相机的动作会自动停视觉服务，跑完再启动。\n\n**接下来一项一项接通**，每项四步：\n1. 把底层脚本改成本机能直接跑\n2. 在入口里挂上按钮\n3. 你在设备旁从入口跑一遍，结果和基准对比，**只对比、不写入**\n4. 通过后在设计文档里记一行，再提交\n\n顺序：1 硬件体检 → 2 TCP → 3 手眼 → 4 地面 → 5 桌子 → 6 货架 → 8 格口。\n\n你可以先打开工具箱看看，界面或说明哪里不顺眼就告诉我。没问题的话，我就开始接通第 1 步\"硬件体检\"。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":276,"cache_read_input_tokens":199577,"output_tokens":730,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":276,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":199577,"cache_creation_input_tokens":276,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":276},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0178aa00-20df-4c7f-86af-360ec80269a7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW1jCYAUFw1w5LSfhCYi","requestRef":"4e4ef861-a600-40f1-b050-3d993d435bbd","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"99d75bac-83d1-485c-bf09-46663