{"parentUuid":"14a6c2e4-4779-428b-83b2-9021310812ab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW246iCZge5qqsVCiQmU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第 1 步接通了，机械臂那项我刚自己跑过：PASS。\n\n**请先关掉工具箱窗口再重新打开**（从控制台点「工程师工具箱」），新按钮才会出现。\n\n**第 1 步：硬件体检**\n\n左边点「**1 硬件体检**」，右边有 6 个按钮，**从左到右一个一个点**，每个等出现「■ 结束」再点下一个：\n\n| 按钮 | 你要做的 | 通过的样子 |\n|---|---|---|\n| ① 机械臂（只读） | 只看，不用操作 | 最后是 `[PASS]` |\n| ② 相机 | 只看。会自动停视觉服务，跑完再启动；结束后会弹出彩色图和深度图 | `PASS`，图里能看清桌面 |\n| ③ 吸盘（吹1秒） | 点\"是\"后，**听吸盘吹气那一下** | `PASS`，而且听到了气流声 |\n| ④ 真空开关（20秒） | 点\"是\"后 20 秒内，**手拿药盒贴到吸盘上，再拿开**，可以重复两三次 | `PASS` |\n| ⑤ 扫码器（30秒） | 点\"是\"后 30 秒内，**拿药盒，条码面朝扫码口过一下** | `PASS`，并显示扫到的码 |\n| ⑥ 上苗机 | 点\"是\"后皮带会转。盒子到取料台会显示【药盒到达】，这时在底部输入框**直接点「发送」**就会放行下一盒；看完后输入 **q** 再点「发送」退出 | 能看到【药盒到达】 |\n\n全部通过后点「**标为通过**」。哪一项出现 FAIL 或者表现不对，把输出截图发给我。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":526,"cache_read_input_tokens":212033,"output_tokens":613,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":526,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":613,"cache_read_input_tokens":212033,"cache_creation_input_tokens":526,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":526},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f416deba-b404-48bc-8fb0-e3b35f0adbea","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW2467UmAPeydijFKYsD","requestRef":"8ed33858-9ea9-4022-9ea4-793dbf59e6e3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5e7edb05-7836-4de5-8dd5-38e63ee67979","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:01:01.077Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","pe