{"parentUuid":"52e12845-ce7a-47dc-9667-914e13804d50","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW2wQVwNRJZBXtfkzYzr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，你记得没错。我刚去查了代码，也读了控制器，确认是这样的：\n\n**设备运行这一侧：你说的就是全部**\n- 你在示教器上标定后存成的工具名叫 **`v1`**。\n- 设备代码所有运动、读位姿的地方都写着 `tool=\"v1\"`，具体的 TCP 数值由控制器自己算，代码里不存。\n- 所以示教器上标好、代码里写上工具名，**设备这边就完成了**。\n\n**另外两件事，不影响设备运行**\n1. **仿真模型里抄了一份 TCP 数值**。仿真判碰撞要知道工具有多长，这份不同步的话，判碰撞会按旧长度算。只有重标时才需要同步一次，平时用不到。\n2. **接触偏差**：吸盘唇边比 TCP 低多少。这个示教器不管，吸取、放置往下压多深要靠它，只在换吸盘时才需要重测。\n\n**所以第 2 步那个按钮的作用就是\"对账\"**：读出控制器里 v1 的数值，看它和程序、基准是不是同一组数。它防的是两种情况：有人在示教器上重标过 v1 却没说；或者 v1 被改了。\n\n刚才我把它改得更准了一点：以前读的是\"示教器当前选中的工具\"，现在直接按名字读 **v1**，因为设备代码用的就是它。我已经跑过：示教器当前选中的也是 v1，三份数值一致，PASS。\n\n你在工具箱里点一下这个按钮就行（记得先关掉工具箱再重新打开），通过后点「标为通过」。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_read_input_tokens":229168,"output_tokens":560,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":410,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":560,"cache_read_input_tokens":229168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":410},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"482bf86b-4660-4476-9207-6735e46eb30a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW2wQ7sNPNM8Gd2tSMVv","requestRef":"7a34b2b5-e4ba-4726-ae87-6c6ff81df326","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"66649ab4-670c-430e-8c07-206a5ec89cc5","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:12:37.770Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoi