{"parentUuid":"7c139401-7e5d-4dd1-ab9b-abbccb60a2a4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW31r6vd7DxjEA4J9P6S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35,"cache_read_input_tokens":230138,"output_tokens":1551,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":374},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1551,"cache_read_input_tokens":230138,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3962,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"3de58916-b6a5-4dcc-aeb2-d2ae49c6b5ad","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW31qf8vV7SVB5HTAxHP","requestRef":"3d9fc76f-e286-4588-8d2f-f980f929d7d0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d3cb4ec2-c110-4b1c-b84c-b0d131ea19d3","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:13:35.512Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"d3cb4ec2-c110-4b1c-b84c-b0d131ea19d3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW31r6vd7DxjEA4J9P6S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"换末端设计，相当于从第 2 步开始**全部往下重做**。整个流程是这样的：\n\n**一、上机前（电脑上做）**\n1. **出新末端的 3D 模型**：SolidWorks 导出 STL，坐标原点要放在法兰面圆心（`replace_tool` 会自动检查）。\n2. **换进仿真**：`replace_tool` 把新模型装到仿真里的机械臂上，自动生成碰撞盒。新末端变长、变粗，判碰撞就是按它来算。\n3. **路径库重新判碰撞**：141 条旧路径用新工具重判一遍。哪条撞了，就重新规划那一条。\n\n   第 2、3 两项都要用到路径规划环境（ROS）。\n\n**二、装上真机后（按部署向导顺序）**\n\n| 步骤 | 做什么 | 为什么必须重做 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2a 示教器四点标定 | 标新的 TCP，存进 **v1**（覆盖旧值，代码不用改） | 吸盘位置变了 |\n| 2b 负载 | 在示教器 v1 里填新末端的**重量和重心** | 现在填的是 2.29 kg。填错了，控制器的碰撞检测会误报，或者该报的不报 |\n| 2c 同步进仿真 | `tcp_sync` 把新 TCP 抄进配置 | 仿真判碰撞要用 |\n| 2d 接触偏差 | 吸盘唇边比 TCP 低多少 | 吸取和放置往下压多深全靠它 |\n| 3 手眼 | 重新巡拍、求解，跑落点闭环 | 相机装在末端支架上；支架一变，相机相对手腕的位置就变了。即使相机没动，TCP 变了也要用落点闭环验证一遍 |\n| 4～6 地面 / 桌子 / 货架 | **不用重标**，但建议各拍一次只做对比 | 这几项是\"场景在哪\"，和末端无关；不过它们是靠手眼算出来的，顺手就能验证新手眼对不对 |\n| 7 仿真场景 + 旧路径重判 | 同\"上机前\"第 3 项 | |\n| 8 每个格口 | 立放标定（空载左右极限 + 持货推进量 / 层板高度）→ 格内安全筛查 → 干跑体检 | 立放账本是按旧 TCP 记的，换末端后作废；工具长了，格内能到的范围也会变 |\n\n**三、收尾验证**\n- 真机上架、出库、盘点各跑一趟。\n- 存一个新快照，作为新的基准。\n\n**和\"拆装末端\"的区别**\n\n| 情况 | 要做什么 |\n|---|---|\n| 同一个末端拆了再装回 | 只验证：第 2 步对账，第 3 步落点闭环。不过才重标 |\n| 换新设计 | 上面全套，第 2～8 步都要做 |\n\n**现在本机能做到哪一步**：示教器标定、负载、TCP 对账、地面 / 桌子 / 货架对比，现在就能做。仿真换工具、路径重判、手眼候选站、格内筛查都要等路径规划环境装好。所以真要换末端，得先把 ② 路径规划环境搭好。\n\n这套流程我会写进工具箱\"部署向导\"的说明里，单独加一条「换末端设计」的路线。要我现在加上吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35,"cache_read_input_tokens":230138,"output_tokens":1551,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":374},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1551,"cache_read_input_tokens":230138,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3de58916-b6a5-4dcc-aeb2-d2ae49c6b5ad","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW31qf8vV7SVB5HTAxHP","requestRef":"3d9fc76f-e286-4588-8d2f-f980f929d7d0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"71e037fe-6213-4cc6-b1e6-560337012706","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:13:48.552Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
