{"parentUuid":"efb6ce00-b9a1-479a-a112-324c672ac215","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW36Av8SzQicpoqg9dvL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"是的，按**现在的代码**，只能用 v1。设备代码里大约 15 处直接写死了 `tool=\"v1\"`，示教器里如果新建一个叫 v2 的工具，代码不会去用它。\n\n所以现在换末端只有一种做法：**在示教器上把 v1 的数值覆盖掉**。\n\n这样做有个缺点：**旧值一覆盖就没了**。新末端要是出问题想退回旧末端，得重新四点标定，或者照着快照里存的旧数值，手工输回示教器。\n\n**我建议改成：工具名放进配置文件**\n- 在 `config/speed_profile.yaml` 这类配置里加一项，比如 `arm.tool_name: v1`，代码里那 15 处都改成读这一项。\n- 换新末端时，在示教器**新建 v2**，配置改成 v2；旧的 v1 原样保留。\n- 想退回旧末端，把配置改回 v1、重启工作站服务就行，不用重新标定。\n- 快照工具和 TCP 对账也会跟着读配置里的工具名。\n\n改动不大，但牵涉所有运动代码。改完要在控制器仿真里干跑一遍，再上真机跑一趟，确认没有漏改的地方。\n\n现在不急着改，末端已经定型了。要不要先把它记成待办，等哪天真要换末端设计时再做？还是你想现在就改掉？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15,"cache_read_input_tokens":231726,"output_tokens":608,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":131},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":608,"cache_read_input_tokens":231726,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"dbc160eb-08d1-4b3b-9af2-3ad4cdd3187a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW36AMQPgf3BL1Exb1Mw","requestRef":"0dec0155-82ee-43c8-8541-f6f5087ddcfa","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"15723ed1-ff8a-4ce3-b27f-0f0627b42c28","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:14:36.939Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4f