{"parentUuid":"cb03b415-01b1-4151-bbc7-387967d5827f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW3JvPNrGXYDUnKVtTew","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"工具名已经改成配置项了，已提交（b263cd5）。不过**还没在真机上跑过**，需要你跑一趟上架确认。\n\n**改了什么**\n- 配置文件 `config/speed_profile.yaml` 的 `tool` 段新增一项：`name: v1`。\n- 代码里原来写死 `\"v1\"` 的地方共 40 个文件、约 100 处，现在都统一读这一项。读取入口只有一个：`hardware/arm_tool.py`。\n- 第 2 步的 TCP 对账也改成读配置里的工具名。\n\n**以后换末端设计**\n1. 在示教器上**新建 v2**，做四点标定，填上新末端的负载。\n2. 把配置里的 `name` 改成 `v2`。\n3. 重启工作站服务。\n\n旧的 v1 原样留在示教器里。想退回旧末端，把配置改回 `v1`、再重启一次就行。完整流程已经写进设计文档。\n\n**已经验证的**\n- 改过的文件全部能正常编译，动作模块和入库流程都能正常加载，读到的工具名是 `v1`。\n- 工作站服务已重启，状态正常（空闲、自动模式、事件推送正常）。\n- TCP 对账 PASS。\n\n**还需要你验证**：这次改动涉及所有运动代码，请找个方便的时候**在上位机下一趟上架任务**。能正常吸取、扫码、放置，就说明没有漏改。\n\n上架没问题的话，我们回到工具箱，继续第 2 步：点\"验证\"按钮，然后标为通过。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":536,"cache_read_input_tokens":250880,"output_tokens":634,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":92},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":536,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":250880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":536},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cb226a54-c3c8-4ffc-b183-b6e0d7c3693e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW3JuvbafjaqG33dPojQ","requestRef":"3564126f-6991-4a0c-8d4d-a3943c5a760b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1c768611-5055-457c-b5e7-bdbdd7a78570","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:17:29.436Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium"