{"parentUuid":"4326560e-fb69-4af6-9eeb-60212c6d7ea6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW3ZrztjPycJ8Kt81TvT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这一步管的是**末端本身的两个尺寸**，都和\"吸盘到底在哪\"有关。\n\n**① TCP：吸盘中心在哪**\n机械臂只知道自己手腕末端（法兰）在哪，不知道前面装了多长的东西。TCP 就是告诉它：\"吸盘中心在法兰正前方 436.4 mm 处\"。\n有了这个数，程序说\"把吸盘移到盒子正上方\"，臂才知道法兰该停在哪。这个数错了，吸盘就会**偏到旁边**。\n\n**② 接触偏差：吸盘唇边比 TCP 再低多少**\n四点标定时，示教器的尖针戳在吸嘴孔里，所以 TCP 定在**孔底**。但真正碰到盒子的是吸盘的**橡胶唇边**，它比孔底还要往外凸一点，现在测的是 **5.7 mm**。\n程序往下压的时候，要算上这 5.7 mm：少算了，就会压太深、把盒子压坏；多算了，就会悬在半空，吸不住。\n\n打个比方：TCP 是\"笔尖在哪\"，接触偏差是\"笔帽比笔尖还长出一截\"。写字时两个都得知道，才能刚好落在纸上。\n\n**为什么放在同一步**\n这两个数只和**末端本身**有关，和桌子、货架在哪无关；换末端时两个都要重测，同一个末端拆装后两个都不会变。所以放在一起，作为部署的第一个标定步骤。后面的手眼、桌子、货架，都建立在\"吸盘在哪\"这个基础上。\n\n**这次你要做的**只是验证 ①，也就是点按钮对一下账；② 由第 3 步的落点闭环顺带检验。\n\n名字确实不好懂。要不要改成「**2 末端尺寸（吸盘中心 TCP + 唇边压入量）**」？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37,"cache_read_input_tokens":256799,"output_tokens":814,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":162},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":256799,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cfa663e8-8841-430e-9c96-8571124c78ad","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW3ZrYMx5V6rko4WwuLN","requestRef":"84380481-604e-4fe7-a9b2-69d4067b4719","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fc92aa2f-69ef-40b3-9455-a36b68a5f510","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:20:55.878Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
