{"parentUuid":"3a0cfc07-e1b4-4bb5-bb45-bbc36ef19a3a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW3kLJzL1JiR3uL2i9EZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2108,"cache_read_input_tokens":259875,"output_tokens":910,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":369},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2108,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":259875,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2108},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10017,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"b5d06570-f40b-42b4-b719-3d02b9848cc1","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW3kKyQHYba2o8M2eDX6","requestRef":"9a8a599d-f195-43e8-b78e-843fa0e39082","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d8427266-8569-4208-bc3c-4c99c4da18da","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:23:17.923Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"d8427266-8569-4208-bc3c-4c99c4da18da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW3kLJzL1JiR3uL2i9EZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，你理解得没错。这个按钮**只验证了 TCP**：程序用的和机械臂上的是不是同一组数，跟接触偏差没关系。是我把两件事放在一个步骤里，名字起得不准确。\n\n而且我刚去查了代码，发现**接触偏差在生产流程里根本没用到**，前面我说\"吸取、放置往下压多深全靠它\"是**说错了**：\n\n| 动作 | 往下压多深实际由什么决定 |\n|---|---|\n| 吸取 | `speed_profile.yaml` 里的 `pick.press_mm = 9`：TCP 停在盒顶上方 9 mm。这是 09-15 换立放末端时你现场调出来的手感值 |\n| 放置 | 每个格口的立放标定账本：你当时持着货用示教器实际示教出来的，已经包含了唇边 |\n| 接触偏差 5.7 mm | 只在两处用到：①手眼\"落点闭环\"验证工具往下降时；②仿真里吸盘的碰撞模型 |\n\n所以接触偏差只是个**测量和验证用的辅助数**，生产不依赖它。\n\n**建议这样调整**\n- 第 2 步改名「**2 TCP 对账（吸盘中心）**」，只做你刚才那件事。\n- 接触偏差从第 2 步拿掉，放到「换末端设计」路线里，作为一个子项。到时还要一起重调吸取压入量 `pick.press_mm`，它才是真正影响生产的那个数，而且现在完全没写进流程里。\n\n可以这样改吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2108,"cache_read_input_tokens":259875,"output_tokens":910,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":369},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2108,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":259875,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2108},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b5d06570-f40b-42b4-b719-3d02b9848cc1","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW3kKyQHYba2o8M2eDX6","requestRef":"9a8a599d-f195-43e8-b78e-843fa0e39082","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"07ec4500-e84d-4d44-8eb0-6a4480273da6","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:23:17.934Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
