{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","id":"d6f90614-23f1-4287-aba4-bacd3f0e8167","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:33:21.161Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"ec2209c8a67b15f2c9c1fb7cd8de44a6c57d3392bb32c6f9d0af322465a1739e","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"02888e7f-2e88-4bbb-b92a-886129e5f42b","keep":215,"tail":["f34a1b7485379fb0a2cbb9da0f60513487b2bbf39375444081dce3ecb8e40af0","6c9fb1eb6a32801e74cfe7609129ec3d4dd476e84e370f6d499a4edbb8091377"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",216,"content",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"096f6098d86e03856c55f071b18de036daa703037a605a8a25beab87f73e49db"}
{"parentUuid":"bfc9643c-9c78-4a42-b63b-f75a68a5536b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW4Xbb1KdcY9g6MRdDnk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好主意，这一测还真测出一个问题：控制器里没有 v2 这个工具，查询时它会返回一个空值，原来的对账会直接报错退出，不会告诉你原因。现在已经修好，已提交。\n\n**为什么不直接改配置文件**：配置一改成 v2，工作站服务一旦重启（比如崩溃后系统自动拉起），就会按一个不存在的工具去控制真机，有风险。所以我加了一个**只演示、不改配置**的按钮，效果和真改成 v2 一样。\n\n**怎么看**\n1. 关掉工具箱，再重新打开。\n2. 点「2 TCP 对账」，现在有两个按钮。点第二个「**演示：假如工具名写成 v2 会怎样（不改配置）**」。\n\n**你会看到**（我刚跑过）：\n```\n配置要用的工具名: v2(--tool 临时指定, 配置里实际是 v1)\n  ✗ 控制器里没有名为 v2 的工具\nFAIL: 控制器里找不到工具 v2 —— 示教器上还没新建/没保存这个工具, 或配置里名字写错了(区分大小写)。\n      设备若按这个名字运动会出错, 先在示教器上建好并四点标定, 或把配置改回原来的名字\n```\n\n以后真要换 v2：先在示教器上建好 v2、做四点标定，再改配置。到那时同一个对账按钮就会显示 v2 的数值，判 PASS 或 FAIL。\n\n演示看完后，点第一个按钮确认 PASS，再点「标为通过」就行。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":863,"cache_read_input_tokens":275894,"output_tokens":544,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":863,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":544,"cache_read_input_tokens":275894,"cache_creation_input_tokens":863,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":863},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b8405d98-cb6d-425f-bc22-12d874ca26cb","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW4XbCh6a8ochHayuV8d","requestRef":"d6f90614-23f1-4287-aba4-bacd3f0e8167","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bdc8627b-0d46-4a71-b927-54d50dfdadca","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:33:27.266Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"c