{"parentUuid":"d695061f-a1f3-4f76-88c3-7ca4e1db9177","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW4cR7cRJvJRkq3yVp7g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E2dNoSTZigS3kgNaz3tW4Z","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\26293\\.claude\\projects\\D--robot-cell\\memory\\keep-it-simple.md","content":"---\nname: keep-it-simple\ndescription: 用户容易信息过载: 回答只讲当前一步要做什么; 工具/界面不加演示按钮和可选花样; 细节写进文档不在对话里铺开\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\n用户多次说信息过载(2026-08-21 拆解分析、2026-10-29 部署向导第 2 步: TCP/接触偏差/压入量一次讲太多, 又加了\"v2 演示\"按钮)。用户原话: \"我感觉没必要做这么复杂，很容易让人信息过载\"; \"我现在有点信息过载了，因为之前的东西我有点忘了\"。\n\n**Why:** 用户要的是\"一个可靠流程\", 不是全部背景; 很多历史细节用户自己也记不清, 堆出来只会更乱。\n\n**How to apply:** 每次回复先说\"现在只需要做什么\"(一两步), 背景最多一两句; 解释类问题先给结论再给最少的支撑; 工具箱每步尽量只留一个主按钮, 不加演示/可选功能, 健壮性处理放在后台不展示; 细节写进工具箱说明或文档, 告诉用户\"不用记\"。相关: [[stand-tool-design]]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":277326,"output_tokens":786,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":77},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":786,"cache_read_input_tokens":277326,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01E2dNoSTZigS3kgNaz3tW4Z":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\26293\\.claude\\projects\\D--robot-cell\\memory\\keep-it-simple.md","content":"---\nname: keep-it-simple\ndescription: 用户容易信息过载: 回答只讲当前一步要做什么; 工具/界面不加演示按钮和可选花样; 细节写进文档不在对话里铺开\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\n用户多次说信息过载(2026-08-2