{"parentUuid":"44169609-1eb8-49fc-b305-a6c8930b4618","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW4kKgeig5d56AG3ipsZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"结论：**这个条目可以去掉**；设备上的尺寸表还在，但生产已经不靠它了。\n\n**生产上架时设备怎么拿到尺寸**\n现在上位机下任务用的是\"问去处\"模式：设备扫到码后去问上位机，上位机回复放哪个格口、放哪个位置，同时附上**这盒的尺寸和药名**。设备就拿上位机给的尺寸来核对和放置，**不再查自己的尺寸表**。刚才那趟任务 198 就是这样：尺寸 60×38.5×22.4 是上位机给的。\n\n**设备上的尺寸表 `config/sku_dims.yaml` 还在，剩下几处次要用途**\n- 命令行直接跑入库（不经上位机）时，用它核对尺寸\n- 视觉\"量尺回归\"测试，拿它当标准答案\n- 能力表接口里会列出这张表\n- 盘点时显示用的节距\n\n这几处都不是现场日常用的，而且这张表 09-17 以后就没再更新过。\n\n**建议**\n- 工具箱\"维护工具\"里删掉「录入新药盒品种」：品种由上位机管，不让接手的人误以为要在设备上录入。\n- 设备上的尺寸表**先留着、不删**，因为上面那几处还在读它。我在文档里注明\"生产以上位机为准，这里只给测试和回归用\"。\n\n这样可以吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1704,"cache_read_input_tokens":282683,"output_tokens":776,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":292},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1704,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":776,"cache_read_input_tokens":282683,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1704,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1704},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"33ca7fb1-2ac7-4bab-82a4-f9e308e753a3","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW4kKKpQKj2MEwbh54YQ","requestRef":"b63b68a7-618e-4f38-87f9-4dc344065a6e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9b6febd5-24ca-41f2-a9a6-cb59a2036165","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:36:23.184Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-