{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"2c39f06e5f3c63cdd945f312758f4ad40e818d666d5dee961bd63d982ca6c17b","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now a header note in the size table and the capability-table entry in CLAUDE.md:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UCigFXL5uVWhJcD89Speqd","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /d/robot_cell && C:/Users/26293/.conda/envs/robot/python.exe - <<'EOF'\np = r\"config\\sku_dims.yaml\"\nraw = open(p, \"rb\").read(); crlf = b\"\\r\\n\" in raw\ns = raw.decode(\"utf-8\")\nnl = \"\\r\\n\" if crlf else \"\\n\"\nnote = (\"# ⚠ 2026-10-29: 生产上架不再读这张表 —— 上位机\\\"问去处\\\"时随去处给出这盒的尺寸和药名(品种资料在上位机维护, 新品种在上位机录入).\" + nl +\n        \"#   本表只剩次要用途: 命令行直接跑入库(不经上位机)时认脸 / 视觉量尺回归 quiz_lw 的标准答案 / 能力表 skus 列表 / 盘点显示节距 pitch_mm. 不删, 也不必再维护.\" + nl)\nopen(p, \"wb\").write((note + s).encode(\"utf-8\"))\n\np = r\"CLAUDE.md\"\ns = open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\nold = \"| **录入新药盒品种(尺寸表)** | `scripts/sku_add.sh\"\nassert old in s\ns = s.replace(old, \"| **录入新药盒品种(尺寸表)** | ⚠ **2026-10-29 起品种尺寸由上位机维护**(问去处时随去处给尺寸+药名, 生产不读本表; 设备表只留给命令行入库/量尺回归/能力表, 不必再录). 旧做法: `scripts/sku_add.sh\")\nopen(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\").write(s)\nEOF\nC:/Users/26293/.conda/envs/robot/python.exe -c \"import yaml;d=yaml.safe_load(open('config/sku_dims.yaml',encoding='utf-8'));print(len(d),'entries ok')\"; C:/Users/26293/.conda/envs/robot/python.exe -m py_compile services/toolbox_catalog.py && git add config/sku_dims.yaml CLAUDE.md services/toolbox_catalog.py && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nchore: 工具箱删掉「录入新药盒品种」(品种尺寸已由上位机维护, 问去处时随去处给出); 尺寸表与能力目录注明生产不再读、仅剩测试/回归用途\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"尺寸表加说明、更新能力目录并提交"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
