{"parentUuid":"6cd5a35e-46bd-4af5-aeae-f4c6644f03ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW4vLhCpVS5ZQtzeTH32","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"就是说，我刚才在准备**第 3 步：手眼验证**，做到一半被打断了。简单说三句：\n\n1. **这一步要干什么**：让机械臂拍一下桌上的标定板，再把吸盘移到板的正中心、轻轻贴上去。你目测吸盘是不是正好落在中心，就知道相机和机械臂\"看到的位置\"和\"走到的位置\"对不对得上。\n\n2. **我刚才改了什么**：这个验证脚本原来做完后，吸盘就停在板上不动，回原位要靠已经关掉的 AutoDL 服务器。所以我给它加了一个结尾：吸盘**先竖直抬起 10 cm，再自己回到 home**。\n\n3. **现在的状态**：只改了文件，机械臂没动过，也还没放进工具箱。\n\n你如果同意这样做，我就把它放进工具箱第 3 步，然后一步一步带你在真机上跑。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":248,"cache_read_input_tokens":298186,"output_tokens":347,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":248,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":347,"cache_read_input_tokens":298186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":248,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":248},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7d34a0f6-86ad-4942-a0b9-9ee19f8bb79f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW4vLJt1cNxU7gTanDbW","requestRef":"66f2ad19-9e2b-409c-9533-a2e5fac8f7b8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fcbaac10-7619-4018-8fa5-df574453e1e7","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:38:34.689Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
