{"parentUuid":"7b11b19a-359e-4cc5-a7a4-1559fc61bcbf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW4ykLabCYG9JLbxka82","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2052,"cache_read_input_tokens":298824,"output_tokens":781,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":261},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2052,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":781,"cache_read_input_tokens":298824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2052,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2052},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8435,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"d285b639-7eb3-4320-a49e-0bdcd6077cc3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW4yjz1VUwMkMs8Gyrxc","requestRef":"15106f95-4ab7-4493-99fb-67147d35b29b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ee9fb027-f485-4ceb-b93b-e095449cb9d2","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:39:25.244Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"ee9fb027-f485-4ceb-b93b-e095449cb9d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW4ykLabCYG9JLbxka82","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，你确实做过，**2026-08-21 完成了第一次自动手眼标定**。简单说：\n\n**怎么做的**\n1. 标定板放在桌上的胶带框里。\n2. 程序事先算好 **17 个拍摄位置**，从不同距离、不同角度对着板拍。这 17 个位置都判过碰撞，你在真机上也逐个试拍确认过。\n3. 机械臂**自动挨个走过去拍照**，最后算出相机和手腕的关系（手眼矩阵）。\n4. 结果和你 7 月手动标的那次精度持平，当时就采用了这个新矩阵。\n\n**之后还有一次变化（09-15 换立放末端）**\n相机没动，只是吸盘杆变长了，所以**没有重新巡拍**，只把矩阵按新 TCP 换算了一下，再用\"落点闭环\"验证通过。\n\n**对现在的影响**\n- 这次只做**验证**的话，用不到自动巡拍，跑一次\"落点闭环\"就够了，也就是我刚才在准备的那个。\n- 以后要**重标**手眼，可以用自动巡拍。但那 17 个拍摄位置是按**旧末端**判的碰撞，现在杆长了 66 mm，得先用路径规划环境重新判一遍才能放心跑。所以重标要等路径规划环境装好。\n\n所以第 3 步现在只放\"落点闭环验证\"一个按钮；自动巡拍先在说明里写着\"重标时用，待接通\"。可以吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2052,"cache_read_input_tokens":298824,"output_tokens":781,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":261},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2052,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":781,"cache_read_input_tokens":298824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2052,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2052},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d285b639-7eb3-4320-a49e-0bdcd6077cc3","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW4yjz1VUwMkMs8Gyrxc","requestRef":"15106f95-4ab7-4493-99fb-67147d35b29b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"63e4281d-da01-42f9-8aba-10c3ff5e3573","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:39:25.259Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","ses