{"parentUuid":"90ed5746-aaf7-405e-b0b2-fbe6e62c3e28","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW57dSaSbni32eK9JBrY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，重新标一次正好和现在的矩阵对比。不过有一个前提要先说清楚：\n\n**自动巡拍每走一站之前，都要先在仿真里判碰撞**\n那 17 个拍摄位置是 08-21 按旧末端判的。09-15 换立放末端以后，吸盘杆长了 66 mm，杆头更低，有几站可能会碰到桌面或上苗机。而判碰撞用的是原来 AutoDL 上的路径规划环境，现在已经关掉了。所以**重新巡拍之前，必须先把路径规划环境在本机装好**。\n\n**所以有两种顺序**\n\n| | 做法 | 特点 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **A（建议）** | 先装路径规划环境，再回来完整重标手眼 | 安全，重标一步到位；路径规划环境本来就要装 |\n| B | 先用\"落点闭环\"验证现在的手眼，把第 4～6 步（地面、桌子、货架）做完，最后再装环境、回来重标手眼 | 今天能多推进几步，但手眼要做两遍（先验证、后重标） |\n\n我建议 **A**：装好环境以后，手眼重标、第 7 步\"仿真场景\"、以后的路径规划都能用。装环境要你在 Windows 上执行几条命令（安装 WSL 里的 Ubuntu，需要重启电脑），我一条一条给你。\n\n你选哪个？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5089,"cache_read_input_tokens":301687,"output_tokens":914,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":424},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5089,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":914,"cache_read_input_tokens":301687,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5089,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5089},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6c27b0fa-5383-4376-ad8c-7a135ef506df","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW57d5zkvXK921pTLuqE","requestRef":"93329bbd-731e-4642-b34a-ee58b12ac154","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3632469d-92da-4281-9a72-d5d25bb24b3a","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:41:14.444Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535