{"parentUuid":"2f04302c-1cb0-4c68-aeb3-91d52dda4335","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f2b6d3dd-9249-4ae3-9bc3-4b7fd0945170","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0138vfbomTgccB4ESWwiXrAq","type":"tool_result","content":"#!/bin/bash\n# ============================================================\n# 仿真/规划环境重装(在 Ubuntu 22.04 上复现 AutoDL 的环境; 目标: blue-space 的 WSL2)\n# 用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip 路径> [安装根目录=~/sim]\n#   zip 在 blue-space D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件\\ (WSL2 里是 /mnt/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/)\n# 依据: 同目录 env_*.txt/tsv = 2026-10-28 从 AutoDL 导出的环境快照(系统/370 个 ros-humble 包/pip/bashrc)\n# 做什么: ①装 ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control ②装 Python 依赖\n#         ③解压原厂驱动包 + 覆盖本项目改动(../duco_driver_patch) + colcon 编译 ④放好启动件(../stack)\n# ⚠ 2026-10-28 写成, 尚未在 WSL2 上实测; 跑完后按 README 的\"验收\"一节确认\n# ============================================================\nset -eu\nZIP=\"${1:?用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip> [安装根目录]}\"\nROOT=\"${2:-$HOME/sim}\"\nHERE=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/..\" && pwd)\"          # scripts/serverside\nstep(){ echo; echo \"── $*\"; }\n\nstep \"1/5 ROS2 Humble 软件源\"\nsudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y software-properties-common curl unzip\nsudo add-apt-repository -y universe\nsudo curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg\necho \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu $(. /etc/os-release && echo $UBUNTU_CODENAME) main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ros2.list >/dev/null\nsudo apt-get update\n\nstep \"2/5 ROS 包(与 AutoDL 手动安装的一致) + Python 依赖\"\nsudo apt-get install -y ros-humble-desktop ros-humble-moveit ros-humble-foxglove-bridge \\\n  ros-humble-ros2-control ros-humble-ros2-controllers python3-colcon-common-extensions \\\n  python3-numpy python3-scipy python3-yaml\ngrep -q \"/opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\" ~/.bashrc || echo \"source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\" >> ~/.bashrc\n\nstep \"3/5 DUCO 驱动包 + 本项目改动\"\nmkdir -p \"$ROOT\" && cd \"$ROOT\"\n[ -d duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 ] || unzip -q \"$ZIP\"\nWS=\"$ROOT/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver\"\ncp -r \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config\" \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_support\" \"$WS/src/\"\nsource /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\ncd \"$WS\" && colcon build\n\nstep \"4/5 启动件\"\ncp \"$HERE/stack/start_foxglove.sh\" \"$HERE/stack/duco_joint_relay.py\" \"$ROOT/\"\nmkdir -p \"$ROOT/web_serve\"\nsed -i \"s#/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver#$WS#; s#/root/autodl-tmp/web_serve#$ROOT/web_serve#\" \"$ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"\n\nstep \"5/5 完成\"\necho \"安装根目录: $ROOT\"\necho \"下一步: ① 用 build_scene.py + deploy_scene.sh 生成 web_serve(场景 URDF/网格) ② bash $ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"\necho \"⚠ Mac 侧脚本里写死的 /root/autodl-tmp 路径要改成 $ROOT(迁移第 3 步做)\"\n# 仿真/规划环境(原 AutoDL)的重装资料\n\nAutoDL 是云上的 Linux 容器, 不能整体拷走, 只能在新机器上按相同配置重装。本目录是重装所需的全部依据。\n\n| 文件 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| `setup_sim_env.sh` | **重装脚本**(Ubuntu 22.04 / WSL2): ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control → Python 依赖 → 驱动包 + 本项目改动 + 编译 → 启动件。⚠ 尚未实测 |\n| `env_os.txt` | AutoDL 系统: Ubuntu 22.04.5 |\n| `env_apt_manual.txt` | 手动安装的 apt 包(165 个; ROS 相关核心只有 5 个: desktop / moveit / foxglove-bridge / ros2-control / ros2-controllers) |\n| `env_ros_packages.tsv` | 全部 370 个 ros-humble 包及版本(对比排错用) |\n| `env_pip.txt` | 系统 Python 3.10 与 miniconda Python 3.12 的 pip 清单 |\n| `env_bashrc.txt` | .bashrc 里的环境设置(只有 `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash`) |\n| `env_script_imports.txt` | 服务器上脚本用到的模块统计 |\n\n规划/判卷脚本的依赖: ROS 自带的 rclpy / moveit_msgs / geometry_msgs 等 + numpy / scipy / yaml。\n视觉训练另需 GPU + ultralytics 8.4.50, 见 `scripts/vision_train/README.md`。\n\n## 验收(装完后确认)\n\n1. `bash ~/sim/start_foxglove.sh` 后日志出现 `You can start planning now!` 和 `Server listening on port 8765`\n2. Foxglove 桌面版连 `ws://localhost:8765`, 3D 面板 Mesh up axis 设 Z-up, URDF 用 `http://localhost:9090/gcr10_1300.urdf`, 能看到机械臂+场景\n3. 跑一次已知结果的判卷(如某条已入库路径 `replay.sh`), 结论与 AutoDL 上一致","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fc4df00c-8b07-4bd3-8474-532a8bf9fcec","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:42:33.561Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"#!/bin/bash\n# ============================================================\n# 仿真/规划环境重装(在 Ubuntu 22.04 上复现 AutoDL 的环境; 目标: blue-space 的 WSL2)\n# 用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip 路径> [安装根目录=~/sim]\n#   zip 在 blue-space D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件\\ (WSL2 里是 /mnt/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/)\n# 依据: 同目录 env_*.txt/tsv = 2026-10-28 从 AutoDL 导出的环境快照(系统/370 个 ros-humble 包/pip/bashrc)\n# 做什么: ①装 ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control ②装 Python 依赖\n#         ③解压原厂驱动包 + 覆盖本项目改动(../duco_driver_patch) + colcon 编译 ④放好启动件(../stack)\n# ⚠ 2026-10-28 写成, 尚未在 WSL2 上实测; 跑完后按 README 的\"验收\"一节确认\n# ============================================================\nset -eu\nZIP=\"${1:?用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip> [安装根目录]}\"\nROOT=\"${2:-$HOME/sim}\"\nHERE=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/..\" && pwd)\"          # scripts/serverside\nstep(){ echo; echo \"── $*\"; }\n\nstep \"1/5 ROS2 Humble 软件源\"\nsudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y software-properties-common curl unzip\nsudo add-apt-repository -y universe\nsudo curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg\necho \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu $(. /etc/os-release && echo $UBUNTU_CODENAME) main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ros2.list >/dev/null\nsudo apt-get update\n\nstep \"2/5 ROS 包(与 AutoDL 手动安装的一致) + Python 依赖\"\nsudo apt-get install -y ros-humble-desktop ros-humble-moveit ros-humble-foxglove-bridge \\\n  ros-humble-ros2-control ros-humble-ros2-controllers python3-colcon-common-extensions \\\n  python3-numpy python3-scipy python3-yaml\ngrep -q \"/opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\" ~/.bashrc || echo \"source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\" >> ~/.bashrc\n\nstep \"3/5 DUCO 驱动包 + 本项目改动\"\nmkdir -p \"$ROOT\" && cd \"$ROOT\"\n[ -d duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 ] || unzip -q \"$ZIP\"\nWS=\"$ROOT/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver\"\ncp -r \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config\" \"$HERE/duco_driver_patch/duco_support\" \"$WS/src/\"\nsource /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash\ncd \"$WS\" && colcon build\n\nstep \"4/5 启动件\"\ncp \"$HERE/stack/start_foxglove.sh\" \"$HERE/stack/duco_joint_relay.py\" \"$ROOT/\"\nmkdir -p \"$ROOT/web_serve\"\nsed -i \"s#/root/autodl-tmp/duco_ros2_driver/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver#$WS#; s#/root/autodl-tmp/web_serve#$ROOT/web_serve#\" \"$ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"\n\nstep \"5/5 完成\"\necho \"安装根目录: $ROOT\"\necho \"下一步: ① 用 build_scene.py + deploy_scene.sh 生成 web_serve(场景 URDF/网格) ② bash $ROOT/start_foxglove.sh\"\necho \"⚠ Mac 侧脚本里写死的 /root/autodl-tmp 路径要改成 $ROOT(迁移第 3 步做)\"\n# 仿真/规划环境(原 AutoDL)的重装资料\n\nAutoDL 是云上的 Linux 容器, 不能整体拷走, 只能在新机器上按相同配置重装。本目录是重装所需的全部依据。\n\n| 文件 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| `setup_sim_env.sh` | **重装脚本**(Ubuntu 22.04 / WSL2): ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge + ros2_control → Python 依赖 → 驱动包 + 本项目改动 + 编译 → 启动件。⚠ 尚未实测 |\n| `env_os.txt` | AutoDL 系统: Ubuntu 22.04.5 |\n| `env_apt_manual.txt` | 手动安装的 apt 包(165 个; ROS 相关核心只有 5 个: desktop / moveit / foxglove-bridge / ros2-control / ros2-controllers) |\n| `env_ros_packages.tsv` | 全部 370 个 ros-humble 包及版本(对比排错用) |\n| `env_pip.txt` | 系统 Python 3.10 与 miniconda Python 3.12 的 pip 清单 |\n| `env_bashrc.txt` | .bashrc 里的环境设置(只有 `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash`) |\n| `env_script_imports.txt` | 服务器上脚本用到的模块统计 |\n\n规划/判卷脚本的依赖: ROS 自带的 rclpy / moveit_msgs / geometry_msgs 等 + numpy / scipy / yaml。\n视觉训练另需 GPU + ultralytics 8.4.50, 见 `scripts/vision_train/README.md`。\n\n## 验收(装完后确认)\n\n1. `bash ~/sim/start_foxglove.sh` 后日志出现 `You can start planning now!` 和 `Server listening on port 8765`\n2. Foxglove 桌面版连 `ws://localhost:8765`, 3D 面板 Mesh up axis 设 Z-up, URDF 用 `http://localhost:9090/gcr10_1300.urdf`, 能看到机械臂+场景\n3. 跑一次已知结果的判卷(如某条已入库路径 `replay.sh`), 结论与 AutoDL 上一致","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"91fd5d9e-79ea-4825-912b-e004e567dcd3","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/d/robot_cell","root":"/d/robot_cell","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/d/robot_cell","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2f04302c-1cb0-4c68-aeb3-91d52dda4335","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
