{"parentUuid":"f2bb5c4e-4b36-424d-8fab-e50edcec7eb4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW5EeeD18ouhCVXs53b2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好，一步一步来。环境我已经查过了：本机 WSL 已经开好，还没装 Ubuntu；C 盘剩 39 GB，够用；DUCO 机械臂驱动包也在 `D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件\\` 里。\n\n整个安装分 4 步，我每次只给你一步：\n1. 在 WSL 里装 Ubuntu 22.04 ← **现在做这步**\n2. 在 Ubuntu 里装 ROS2 + MoveIt + foxglove_bridge（我准备好脚本，你执行一条命令）\n3. Windows 上装 Foxglove 桌面版（三维可视化）\n4. 我来配置、改脚本，验证判碰撞结果和以前在 AutoDL 上的一致\n\n---\n\n**第 1 步：装 Ubuntu 22.04**\n\n1. 在开始菜单搜「PowerShell」，**右键 → 以管理员身份运行**。\n2. 输入下面这条命令，回车：\n   ```\n   wsl --install -d Ubuntu-22.04\n   ```\n3. 下载要几分钟。装好后会自动打开一个 Ubuntu 窗口，让你设置：\n   - **用户名**：建议填 `robot`（只能小写字母）\n   - **密码**：自己定一个，**记住它**，以后装软件要用。输入时屏幕上不显示字符，这是正常的。\n4. 出现类似 `robot@blue-space:~$` 的提示符，就装好了。\n\n如果提示需要重启电脑就重启，重启后 Ubuntu 窗口会自己弹出来，继续设置用户名和密码。\n\n装好后告诉我，有报错的话截图发我。密码不用告诉我。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":353,"cache_read_input_tokens":311206,"output_tokens":623,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":30},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":353,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":623,"cache_read_input_tokens":311206,"cache_creation_input_tokens":353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":353},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ca5c9f38-f946-438c-98d7-cae2b97c99f9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW5EeKN4dTa5icW5CAAh","requestRef":"b63e4da5-e0cf-47c4-beed-d07281285d1e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e616875d-4e90-4332-b53f-f47847ca5add","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:42:45.122Z",