{"parentUuid":"99ac842f-635b-457b-b4b9-bf3e94a5c7a2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW6DKzcpZA7X2Puyttn7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34,"cache_read_input_tokens":313284,"output_tokens":1108,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":393},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1108,"cache_read_input_tokens":313284,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4208,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"bf2ff4de-2741-4f9a-bd29-0c22b0780fff","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW6DGT3wHmcNwpZH8Sb8","requestRef":"e5d2aa7b-f3b9-498f-be1b-5599c74df558","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"15ed1b6d-549e-4880-b625-dea276ef0399","timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:55:32.064Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"15ed1b6d-549e-4880-b625-dea276ef0399","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW6DKzcpZA7X2Puyttn7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"基本有把握，但还没在这台电脑上实际跑过，装完会逐项验证。依据和风险如下：\n\n**为什么有把握**\n- **算力够**：AutoDL 上规划、判碰撞、Foxglove 一直是在**无显卡模式**下跑的，纯 CPU。这台电脑是 i7-12700H、16 GB 内存，比当时的云服务器只强不弱。\n- **软件是标准组合**：Ubuntu 22.04 + ROS2 Humble + MoveIt2 + foxglove_bridge，和 AutoDL 上的版本一模一样，在 WSL2 里跑这套很常见。\n- **连接更简单了**：以前要 Mac → AutoDL → blue-space → 控制器几头打隧道；现在全在同一台电脑上，WSL 可以直接访问控制器，Foxglove 连 `localhost` 就行。\n\n**可能遇到的问题（我都有应对办法）**\n| 风险 | 应对 |\n|---|---|\n| 国内下载 ROS 软件很慢或失败 | 换成清华等国内镜像源 |\n| 安装脚本是 10-28 写的，还没实测过 | 装的时候我盯着输出，出错当场修 |\n| 占用内存，影响设备运行 | 给 WSL 限制最多用 6 GB 内存；规划都在设备空闲时跑 |\n| WSL 访问控制器网络不通 | 改 WSL 的网络模式 |\n\n**万一实在跑不起来**：一条命令就能把 Ubuntu 整个删掉，不影响设备运行，也不影响 Windows。\n\n**怎么算\"跑起来了\"**（装完逐项验证）：\n1. 启动后日志里出现 `You can start planning now!`\n2. Foxglove 里能看到机械臂和场景\n3. 拿一条已经入库的路径重新判一次碰撞，结论要和当年在 AutoDL 上一致\n\n可以的话，就从第 1 步开始：管理员 PowerShell 里执行 `wsl --install -d Ubuntu-22.04`。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34,"cache_read_input_tokens":313284,"output_tokens":1108,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":393},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1108,"cache_read_input_tokens":313284,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bf2ff4de-2741-4f9a-bd29-0c22b0780fff","apiBlockIndex"