{"parentUuid":"38ff406b-72dd-43bd-9508-b2988a867545","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ef12ed79-9b9f-4af0-88ae-1a2f3aacabac","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uph1AWcgJ5hdrkQjw18NWz","type":"tool_result","content":"README.md\nsrc\ndouble_arm_moveit_config\nduco_arms\nduco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config\nduco_gcr10_2000_moveit_config\nduco_gcr12_1300_moveit_config\nduco_gcr14_1400_moveit_config\nduco_gcr16_2000_moveit_config\nduco_gcr16_960_moveit_config\nduco_gcr20_1100_moveit_config\nduco_gcr20_1400_moveit_config\nduco_gcr25_1800_moveit_config\nduco_gcr30_1100_moveit_config\nduco_gcr3_618_moveit_config\nduco_gcr5_910_moveit_config\nduco_gcr7_910_moveit_config\nduco_msg\nduco_ros_driver\nduco_support\nrobot_control\n203M\t/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver\n# DUCO ROS2 驱动包的本项目改动(2026-10-28 从 AutoDL 收回)\n\n原厂包: `duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip`(blue-space `D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件\\`, AutoDL `/root/autodl-tmp/`)。\n本目录 = 相对原厂包 `duco_ros2_driver/src/` **改过或新增**的文件, 目录结构与 `src/` 一致。\n\n## 重装步骤\n\n1. 解压原厂包, 进入 `duco_ros2_driver/`\n2. 把本目录下两个文件夹覆盖进 `src/`: `cp -r duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config duco_support <...>/duco_ros2_driver/src/`\n3. `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash && colcon build`(装到 `install/`)\n4. 末端网格 `duco_support/meshes/accessories/tool_<hash>.stl` 不在这里: 由 `scripts/replace_tool.sh` 从 `3D_model/` 生成并推送\n\n## 改了什么\n\n| 文件 | 改/增 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/config/gcr10_1300.srdf` | 改 | 碰撞对禁用表等(加末端/场景后调整) |\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/config/initial_positions.yaml` | 改 | 仿真初始关节角 |\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/launch/foxglove_demo.launch.py` | 增 | 起 robot_state_publisher + move_group + ros2_control + foxglove_bridge, `start_foxglove.sh` 调用 |\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/scripts/task_scene.py` | 增 | 早期场景脚本(2026-02) |\n| `duco_support/urdf/duco_gcr10_1300.urdf` | 改 | 接入末端(吸盘)链 |\n| `duco_support/meshes/accessories/shelf.STL`、`suction_cup.STL`, `meshes/GCR10_1300/suction_cup.STL` | 增 | 早期货架/吸盘网格 |\n\n改之前的原文件在服务器上有 `.bak_20260527_085753` 等备份, 未收回(原厂包即原文件)。","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"81985c2d-f9a0-49a1-87f6-9e6c50290740","timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:09:58.008Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"README.md\nsrc\ndouble_arm_moveit_config\nduco_arms\nduco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config\nduco_gcr10_2000_moveit_config\nduco_gcr12_1300_moveit_config\nduco_gcr14_1400_moveit_config\nduco_gcr16_2000_moveit_config\nduco_gcr16_960_moveit_config\nduco_gcr20_1100_moveit_config\nduco_gcr20_1400_moveit_config\nduco_gcr25_1800_moveit_config\nduco_gcr30_1100_moveit_config\nduco_gcr3_618_moveit_config\nduco_gcr5_910_moveit_config\nduco_gcr7_910_moveit_config\nduco_msg\nduco_ros_driver\nduco_support\nrobot_control\n203M\t/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/duco_ros2_driver\n# DUCO ROS2 驱动包的本项目改动(2026-10-28 从 AutoDL 收回)\n\n原厂包: `duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip`(blue-space `D:\\项目资料\\06_DUCO驱动与固件\\`, AutoDL `/root/autodl-tmp/`)。\n本目录 = 相对原厂包 `duco_ros2_driver/src/` **改过或新增**的文件, 目录结构与 `src/` 一致。\n\n## 重装步骤\n\n1. 解压原厂包, 进入 `duco_ros2_driver/`\n2. 把本目录下两个文件夹覆盖进 `src/`: `cp -r duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config duco_support <...>/duco_ros2_driver/src/`\n3. `source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash && colcon build`(装到 `install/`)\n4. 末端网格 `duco_support/meshes/accessories/tool_<hash>.stl` 不在这里: 由 `scripts/replace_tool.sh` 从 `3D_model/` 生成并推送\n\n## 改了什么\n\n| 文件 | 改/增 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/config/gcr10_1300.srdf` | 改 | 碰撞对禁用表等(加末端/场景后调整) |\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/config/initial_positions.yaml` | 改 | 仿真初始关节角 |\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/launch/foxglove_demo.launch.py` | 增 | 起 robot_state_publisher + move_group + ros2_control + foxglove_bridge, `start_foxglove.sh` 调用 |\n| `duco_gcr10_1300_moveit_config/scripts/task_scene.py` | 增 | 早期场景脚本(2026-02) |\n| `duco_support/urdf/duco_gcr10_1300.urdf` | 改 | 接入末端(吸盘)链 |\n| `duco_support/meshes/accessories/shelf.STL`、`suction_cup.STL`, `meshes/GCR10_1300/suction_cup.STL` | 增 | 早期货架/吸盘网格 |\n\n改之前的原文件在服务器上有 `.bak_20260527_085753` 等备份, 未收回(原厂包即原文件)。","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"423947a2-d6d9-480f-92ec-0c5725318c24","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/d/robot_cell","root":"/d/robot_cell","branch":"exp/stand-place","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/d/robot_cell","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"38ff406b-72dd-43bd-9508-b2988a867545","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
