{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","hash":"4603467041c71e166045739642b30ec3781b4751a99b8964bd7a8e05652246ae","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"密码已安全存入本机的 config/wsl_account.local.txt（git 会忽略，不进仓库）。环境检查显示 Ubuntu 22.04.5 可用、能连上机械臂控制器、网络畅通且资源充足；另外发现驱动包是文件夹而非安装脚本要求的 zip，我接下来会修改脚本以支持文件夹并换用国内镜像源加速下载。\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018f1Cjz3SHVA8kLEZFCHuoL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /d/robot_cell && C:/Users/26293/.conda/envs/robot/python.exe - <<'EOF'\np = r\"scripts\\serverside\\env\\setup_sim_env.sh\"\ns = open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\ns = s.replace('''# 用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip 路径> [安装根目录=~/sim]\n#   zip 在 blue-space D:\\\\项目资料\\\\06_DUCO驱动与固件\\\\ (WSL2 里是 /mnt/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/)''',\n'''# 用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <驱动包: duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 文件夹或 .zip> [安装根目录=~/sim]\n#   blue-space 上是解压好的文件夹: /mnt/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0\n#   国内网络: 默认把 Ubuntu 源换阿里云、ROS2 源用清华镜像(MIRROR=0 则用官方源)''')\ns = s.replace('''# ⚠ 2026-10-28 写成, 尚未在 WSL2 上实测; 跑完后按 README 的\"验收\"一节确认''',\n'''# 2026-10-28 写成; 2026-10-29 在 blue-space WSL2 首装时改: 驱动包支持文件夹、国内镜像源; 跑完后按 README 的\"验收\"一节确认''')\ns = s.replace('''ZIP=\"${1:?用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0.zip> [安装根目录]}\"''',\n'''ZIP=\"${1:?用法: bash setup_sim_env.sh <duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 文件夹或 .zip> [安装根目录]}\"\nMIRROR=\"${MIRROR:-1}\"''')\ns = s.replace('''step \"1/5 ROS2 Humble 软件源\"\nsudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y software-properties-common curl unzip''',\n'''step \"1/5 ROS2 Humble 软件源\"\nif [ \"$MIRROR\" = 1 ] && ! grep -q mirrors.aliyun.com /etc/apt/sources.list; then\n  sudo cp /etc/apt/sources.list /etc/apt/sources.list.bak\n  sudo sed -i 's#http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu#https://mirrors.aliyun.com/ubuntu#g; s#http://security.ubuntu.com/ubuntu#https://mirrors.aliyun.com/ubuntu#g' /etc/apt/sources.list\nfi\nsudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y software-properties-common curl unzip''')\ns = s.replace('''echo \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu''',\n'''ROSURL=http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu; [ \"$MIRROR\" = 1 ] && ROSURL=https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ros2/ubuntu\necho \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] $ROSURL''')\ns = s.replace('''[ -d duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 ] || unzip -q \"$ZIP\"''',\n'''if [ ! -d duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 ]; then\n  if [ -d \"$ZIP\" ]; then mkdir -p duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 && cp -r \"$ZIP/duco_ros2_driver\" duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0/   # 解压好的文件夹: 拷进 Linux 盘(编译快)\n  else unzip -q \"$ZIP\"; fi\nfi''')\nopen(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\").write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"MIRROR\\|ROSURL\\|-d \\\"\\$ZIP\\\"\" scripts/serverside/env/setup_sim_env.sh; file scripts/serverside/env/setup_sim_env.sh","description":"安装脚本支持文件夹驱动包和国内镜像"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
