{"parentUuid":"e284b179-91db-4013-a075-5f1b01f3d444","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW7NUaRhZLwEmDnqUxnF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"安装脚本改好了，已提交。可以开始第 2 步：装 ROS2 + MoveIt + foxglove_bridge。\n\n**第 2 步：在 Ubuntu 窗口里执行一条命令**\n\n就是你刚才那个显示 `robot@Blue-Space:...$` 的窗口。把下面整行复制进去，回车：\n\n```\nbash /mnt/d/robot_cell/scripts/serverside/env/setup_sim_env.sh /mnt/d/项目资料/06_DUCO驱动与固件/duco_ros2_driver_V4.2.0 2>&1 | tee ~/setup.log\n```\n\n- 开头会要你输一次密码（`[sudo] password for robot:`），输入后回车。\n- 要下载约 1～2 GB，再编译驱动，**大概 20～40 分钟**。中间不用管，窗口别关。\n- 输出会同时存到日志文件里，我随时能看进度。出错的话我直接看日志，不用你截图。\n- 最后出现 `── 5/5 完成` 就是装好了。\n\n开始后告诉我一声，我会盯着进度。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":611,"cache_read_input_tokens":326140,"output_tokens":383,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":611,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":326140,"cache_creation_input_tokens":611,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":611},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8d70eda5-5850-45b3-ba0d-0ea14c7eb038","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW7NU98fBAyGfCLSwkZ3","requestRef":"e6e05848-71ee-4b71-9b4c-39a51ebb8fba","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"43234225-81b6-4db1-9d84-ef53ef70adcc","timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:10:42.186Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","ve