{"parentUuid":"a6a7e688-e859-499c-a9ea-3c7a041dfa27","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW7XNFvTLDzv9TLYoh1m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"记得，你说的没错。这套流程是\"新格口路径生产流水线\"，一条命令 `plan_smooth.sh` 串起来：\n\n1. **MoveIt 规划竞赛**：一次规划多条候选路径（默认 12 条），按五项打分挑最好的：路程、最急的弯、用时、关节来回反转、转折次数。后两项衡量平不平顺。\n2. **去回摆**：某个关节来回摆的地方抹平，让动作更顺。\n3. **控制器仿真模式实跑**：把路径发给真的控制器，但控制器处在仿真模式，**真机不动**，同时录下控制器实际走出来的每一个点。\n4. **按录制结果判碰撞**：拿控制器实际走的轨迹，放进仿真场景里逐点检查。**只认实跑录制，不认软件插值**，这是你定的铁规，因为插值和真机走法对不上。\n5. **生产速度试飞**：再用正式速度在控制器仿真里跑一遍，检查中途有没有停顿、卡顿。\n6. **达标入库**：通过了才存进路径库，之后才上真机。\n\n不达标就把候选数翻倍重来，最多 3 轮。\n\n**分工**：\n- 第 1、2、4 步在 MoveIt 那边算，原来在 AutoDL 上，现在要装的就是这个。\n- 第 3、5 步用的是控制器本身，一直都在。\n\n所以装好 ROS 环境后，整条流水线就能在本机恢复。我会拿一条已经入库的路径重新跑一遍判碰撞，结论和以前一致，才算通过验收。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57,"cache_read_input_tokens":327134,"output_tokens":753,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":195},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":753,"cache_read_input_tokens":327134,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"89c04893-d1fb-4148-9db8-31aed66b5551","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW7XMUnhsQWBpQ5KpHSZ","requestRef":"93fd285e-13c8-486e-b951-79d0368b97cb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b1ee29f5-3698-424d-bcae-5abdddf09124","timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:12:47.231Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"clau