{"parentUuid":"7c45c62e-6a9c-41a2-827b-e3fa9e7ca919","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW7Z5WQMaxBCxZ3K7FZq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，网络这一段会快很多，不过整条流水线不会快太多。\n\n**会变快的**\n- **以前**：Mac → 走公网连到 AutoDL（广州/北京的云服务器），blue-space 的控制器录制再经隧道传过去；每一步都要 ssh、scp 上传下载文件，一次往返几十到上百毫秒，偶尔还会断。\n- **现在**：MoveIt 在 WSL 里，控制器在局域网，Foxglove 在本机，全部在同一台电脑或同一个局域网里，往返不到 1 毫秒，也不用再传文件、维护隧道。\n- 最明显的是 **Foxglove 看三维画面**：以前隔着公网会卡、会延迟，现在应该很流畅。\n\n**不会变快的**\n- **规划和判碰撞要算多久**，取决于 CPU，和网络无关。这台电脑的 CPU 比当时的云服务器只强不弱，可能略快。\n- **控制器仿真实跑**：控制器是按真实速度跑的，一条路径要 6 秒就得跑 6 秒，这部分时间不变，而且占了流水线的大头。\n\n所以整体会快一些，主要是**更稳定**：不会再因为隧道断开、服务器端口变化（AutoDL 每次重启端口都会变）而卡住。\n\n安装开始了吗？开始了我就去看进度。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26,"cache_read_input_tokens":327946,"output_tokens":728,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":252},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":728,"cache_read_input_tokens":327946,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1228c64a-95f5-48ba-a3ac-ea3a9be1275c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW7Z547wFHGUEovUyTCg","requestRef":"baf4b152-8cda-484b-9c73-d944b901618b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3e61a9c7-6ae7-4c12-81d3-940bf2329575","timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:13:11.714Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d