{"parentUuid":"74174409-ef43-43fd-aba8-61ef5afb8c4c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW7uhSx53a2miWx2TwHo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31,"cache_read_input_tokens":328702,"output_tokens":814,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":192},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":328702,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":2125,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"cd779d70-78b4-45ac-97dd-14d5e0409b27","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgW7ugjYFnYBxWrhvcdzf","requestRef":"7d54c596-1fcd-42f4-b07c-2f3521ea72fe","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9b12f72c-007b-4e2a-8789-f8ad00f2f671","timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:17:44.458Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
{"parentUuid":"9b12f72c-007b-4e2a-8789-f8ad00f2f671","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW7uhSx53a2miWx2TwHo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以，装好以后基本都能放进工具箱。\n\n**怎么接进去**\n工具箱现在运行脚本的方式，是在 Windows 上开一个子进程。ROS 那部分在 WSL 里，工具箱只要改成调用 `wsl -d Ubuntu-22.04 -- <命令>`，输出照样实时显示在工具箱窗口里。你看到的界面和现在一样，看不出差别。\n\n**会加进去的东西**\n\n| 位置 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| 维护工具 → 仿真环境 | 「启动仿真」「停止仿真」「打开 Foxglove」三个按钮，加一个状态灯显示仿真是否在运行 |\n| 维护工具 → 路径规划 | 新格口、重新规划、判碰撞、试飞入库 |\n| 部署向导第 3 步 | 手眼自动巡拍（每站先判碰撞再走） |\n| 部署向导第 7 步 | 更新仿真场景、旧路径重判 |\n| 部署向导第 8 步 | 格内安全筛查 |\n\n**有两点说明**\n1. **Foxglove 是单独的软件**，嵌不进工具箱窗口。工具箱里放一个按钮，点一下就打开它并自动连好。\n2. **主要工作量在改脚本**：原来那些 `.sh` 脚本都是\"Mac 经 ssh 连 AutoDL\"的写法，要逐个改成本机调用。会按我们定的流程一个一个来：接通 → 你在入口里验证 → 记录。\n\n所以顺序是：先装好环境，并用一条旧路径验证判碰撞结果一致 → 把\"启动 / 停止仿真\"接进工具箱 → 再逐个接通规划、手眼巡拍等功能。\n\n安装开始了吗？"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31,"cache_read_input_tokens":328702,"output_tokens":814,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":192},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":328702,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cd779d70-78b4-45ac-97dd-14d5e0409b27","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW7ugjYFnYBxWrhvcdzf","requestRef":"7d54c596-1fcd-42f4-b07c-2f3521ea72fe","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e4afb89d-de27-4a41-a265-18ab6494a06f","timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:17:50.456Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
