{"parentUuid":"53a7468e-784f-4bdd-9c89-3ad9dc32e6d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgW83Gy1vUTyxkVUc61R5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ROS2 是机器人领域最常用的一套**开源软件平台**（全称 Robot Operating System 2）。它不是真正的操作系统，而是装在 Ubuntu 上的一大套工具和程序库。\n\n**在我们项目里，它主要提供三样东西**\n\n| 组件 | 干什么 | 对应我们的哪一步 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **MoveIt2** | 路径规划：给出起点和终点，自动算出一条**不碰撞**的路径 | 路径规划竞赛、手眼候选站判碰撞 |\n| **碰撞检测** | 装着机械臂、末端、货架、桌子、上苗机的三维模型，检查某个姿态会不会撞上 | 判碰撞（按控制器录制逐点检查） |\n| **foxglove_bridge** | 把仿真里的三维画面实时发给 Foxglove | 在 Foxglove 里看机械臂和场景 |\n\n另外，DUCO 官方提供的机械臂模型和驱动，也是按 ROS2 的格式做的，所以要在 ROS2 里用。\n\n**它和设备运行的关系**\n**设备日常运行完全不用 ROS2**：上架、出库、盘点直接通过控制器接口控制真机。ROS2 只在**开发和维护**时用，比如规划新路径、判碰撞、看仿真画面。所以它装在 WSL 里单独运行，不影响设备。\n\n我们装的版本叫 **Humble**，就是 2022 年发布的长期支持版，和原来 AutoDL 上用的一样。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9,"cache_read_input_tokens":329549,"output_tokens":558,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":19},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":558,"cache_read_input_tokens":329549,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5f00f7e3-aa8d-4851-a205-c6816c00da2f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgW83GM4DpQudpjAzVG3V","requestRef":"5e5dbdd4-d0cd-4149-af8c-94dacee0fef7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"eba90d9b-c550-4105-b1ae-fa72ce465f50","timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:19:30.844Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"D:\\robot_cell","sessionId":"9953535e-7aeb-4fd0-b37d-4185895077fe","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"exp/stand-place","slug":"nifty-honking-brook"}
